# AI Translated
msgid "TPU is not supported by AMS."
msgstr "Ní thacaíonn AMS le TPU."

# AI Translated
msgid "AMS does not support 'Bambu Lab PET-CF'."
msgstr "Ní thacaíonn AMS le 'Bambu Lab PET-CF'."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The current filament doesn't support the E3D high-flow nozzle and can't be "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaíonn an filiméad reatha leis an soc ardsreafa E3D agus ní féidir é a "
"úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The current filament doesn't support the TPU high-flow nozzle and can't be "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaíonn an filiméad reatha leis an soc ardsreafa TPU agus ní féidir é a "
"úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Auto dynamic flow calibration is not supported for TPU filament."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaítear le calabrú uathoibríoch an tsreafa dhinimiciúil d'fhiliméad "
"TPU."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Bambu TPU 85A is not supported for printing with 0.4 mm Standard or High "
"Flow nozzles."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaítear le Bambu TPU 85A le haghaidh priontála le soic Chaighdeánacha "
"nó Ardsreafa 0.4 mm."

# AI Translated
msgid "How to feed TPU filament."
msgstr "Conas filiméad TPU a bheathú."

# AI Translated
msgid "How to feed TPU filament on X2D."
msgstr "Conas filiméad TPU a bheathú ar X2D."

# AI Translated
# Needs human review: check term for 'cold pull' (tarraingt fhuar)
msgid ""
"Please cold pull before printing TPU to avoid clogging. You may use cold "
"pull maintenance on the printer."
msgstr ""
"Déan tarraingt fhuar roimh TPU a phriontáil chun calcadh a sheachaint. Is "
"féidir leat cothabháil tarraingthe fuaire a úsáid ar an bprintéir."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Damp PVA will become flexible and get stuck inside AMS, please take care to "
"dry it before use."
msgstr ""
"Éireoidh PVA tais solúbtha agus rachaidh sé i bhfostú taobh istigh den AMS; "
"triomaigh é roimh úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Damp PVA is flexible and may get stuck in extruder. Dry it before use."
msgstr ""
"Tá PVA tais solúbtha agus d'fhéadfadh sé dul i bhfostú san easbhrúiteoir. "
"Triomaigh é roimh úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The rough surface of PLA Glow can accelerate wear on the AMS system, "
"particularly on the internal components of the AMS Lite."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh dromchla garbh PLA Glow caitheamh ar an gcóras AMS a bhrostú, go "
"háirithe ar chomhpháirteanna inmheánacha an AMS Lite."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"PLA Glow may wear the AMS first stage feeder. Use an external spool instead."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh PLA Glow beathaitheoir na chéad chéime den AMS a chaitheamh. "
"Úsáid spól seachtrach ina ionad."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"CF/GF filaments are hard and brittle, it's easy to break or get stuck in "
"AMS, please use with caution."
msgstr ""
"Tá filiméid CF/GF crua agus sobhriste; is furasta dóibh briseadh nó dul i "
"bhfostú san AMS, úsáid go cúramach iad."

# AI Translated
msgid "PPS-CF is brittle and could break in bended PTFE tube above Toolhead."
msgstr ""
"Tá PPS-CF sobhriste agus d'fhéadfadh sé briseadh sa fheadán PTFE lúbtha os "
"cionn an chinn uirlise."

# AI Translated
msgid "PPA-CF is brittle and could break in bended PTFE tube above Toolhead."
msgstr ""
"Tá PPA-CF sobhriste agus d'fhéadfadh sé briseadh sa fheadán PTFE lúbtha os "
"cionn an chinn uirlise."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Default settings may affect print quality. Adjust as needed for best results."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh na socruithe réamhshocraithe dul i bhfeidhm ar cháilíocht na "
"priontála. Coigeartaigh de réir mar is gá chun na torthaí is fearr a fháil."

# AI Translated
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"%s has a risk of nozzle clogging when using 0.4mm high-flow nozzles. Use "
"with caution."
msgstr ""
"Tá baol go gcalcfaidh an soc le %s nuair a úsáidtear soic ardsreafa 0.4mm. "
"Úsáid go cúramach."

# AI Translated
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"%s filaments are hard and brittle and could break in AMS, and there is also "
"a risk of nozzle clogging when using 0.4mm high-flow nozzles. Use with "
"caution."
msgstr ""
"Tá filiméid %s crua agus sobhriste agus d'fhéadfaidís briseadh san AMS, agus "
"tá baol ann freisin go gcalcfaidh an soc nuair a úsáidtear soic ardsreafa "
"0.4mm. Úsáid go cúramach."

# AI Translated
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"%s has a risk of nozzle clogging when using 0.4, 0.6, 0.8mm high-flow "
"nozzles. Use with caution."
msgstr ""
"Tá baol go gcalcfaidh an soc le %s nuair a úsáidtear soic ardsreafa 0.4, "
"0.6, 0.8mm. Úsáid go cúramach."

# AI Translated
