#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"%s may fail to load or unload due to the Filament Track Switch. If you wish "
"to continue."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh lódáil nó díluchtú %s teip mar gheall ar an Lasc Raoin Filiméid. "
"Más mian leat leanúint ar aghaidh."

