# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The AMS will automatically read the filament information when inserting a "
"new Bambu Lab filament spool. This takes about 20 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Léifidh an AMS faisnéis an fhiliméid go huathoibríoch nuair a chuirtear spól "
"filiméid nua Bambu Lab isteach. Tógann sé seo thart ar 20 soicind."

