"When inserting a new filament, the AMS will not automatically read its "
"information, leaving it blank for you to enter manually."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a chuirtear filiméad nua isteach, ní léifidh an AMS a fhaisnéis go "
"huathoibríoch, agus fágfar bán é chun go gcuirfidh tú isteach de láimh í."

# AI Translated
msgid "Update on startup"
msgstr "Nuashonraigh ag an tosú"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The AMS will automatically read the information of inserted filament on "
"start-up. It will take about 1 minute. The reading process will rotate the "
"filament spools."
msgstr ""
"Léifidh an AMS faisnéis an fhiliméid a cuireadh isteach go huathoibríoch ag "
