msgstr ""
"Ní féidir leis an íosteocht mholta a bheith níos airde ná an uasteocht "
"mholta.\n"

# AI Translated
msgid "Please check.\n"
msgstr "Seiceáil é.\n"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The nozzle may become clogged when the temperature is out of the recommended "
