"Please make sure whether to use this temperature to print.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh an soc calcadh nuair a bhíonn an teocht lasmuigh den raon "
"molta.\n"
"Déan cinnte an bhfuil tú chun an teocht seo a úsáid le priontáil.\n"
"\n"

# AI Translated
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"The recommended nozzle temperature for this filament type is [%d, %d] "
"degrees Celsius."
msgstr ""
"Is é [%d, %d] céim Celsius an teocht soic mholta don chineál filiméid seo."

# AI Translated
# Needs human review: check term for 'Pressure Advance' (réamhbhrú)
msgid "Adaptive Pressure Advance model validation failed:\n"
msgstr "Theip ar bhailíochtú mhúnla an Réamhbhrú Oiriúnaithigh:\n"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Too small max volumetric speed.\n"
"Value was reset to 0.5"
msgstr ""
"Uasluas toirtmhéadrach róbheag.\n"
"Athshocraíodh an luach go 0.5"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Ironing spacing too small\n"
"It has been reset to 0.1"
msgstr ""
"Spásáil iarnála róbheag\n"
"Athshocraíodh í go 0.1"

# AI Translated
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"Current chamber temperature is higher than the material's safe temperature; "
"this may result in material softening and nozzle clogs. The maximum safe "
"temperature for the material is %d"
msgstr ""
"Tá teocht reatha an tseomra níos airde ná teocht shábháilte an ábhair; "
"d'fhéadfadh go mbogfadh an t-ábhar agus go gcalcfadh an soc dá bharr. Is é "
"%d an uasteocht shábháilte don ábhar"

# AI Translated
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"The minimal chamber temperature (%d℃) is higher than the target chamber "
"temperature (%d℃). The minimal value is the threshold at which printing "
"starts while the chamber keeps heating toward the target, so it should not "
"exceed it. It will be clamped to the target."
msgstr ""
"Tá teocht íosta an tseomra (%d℃) níos airde ná sprioctheocht an tseomra "
"(%d℃). Is é an t-íosluach an tairseach ag a dtosaíonn an phriontáil fad a "
"leanann an seomra ag téamh i dtreo na sprice, mar sin níor cheart dó í a "
"shárú. Teorannófar é go dtí an sprioc."

# AI Translated
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid "Layer height is too small. It will be set to the minimum (%g mm)."
msgstr "Tá airde na sraithe róbheag. Socrófar í go dtí an t-íosmhéid (%g mm)."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Layer height is outside the limits set in Printer Settings -> Extruder -> "
"Layer height limits, this may cause printing quality issues."
msgstr ""
"Tá airde na sraithe lasmuigh de na teorainneacha atá socraithe i Socruithe "
"an Phrintéara -> Easbhrúiteoir -> Teorainneacha airde sraithe; d'fhéadfadh "
"fadhbanna cáilíochta priontála teacht as seo."

# AI Translated
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid "Adjust it to the limit (%g mm) automatically?"
msgstr "An gcoigeartófar go dtí an teorainn (%g mm) go huathoibríoch?"

# AI Translated
msgid "Adjust"
msgstr "Coigeartaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Raft and draft shield are not available on belt printers.\n"
"They have been disabled."
msgstr ""
"Níl rafta ná sciath dréachta ar fáil ar phrintéirí crios.\n"
"Díchumasaíodh iad."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Layer height too small\n"
"It has been reset to 0.2"
msgstr ""
"Airde sraithe róbheag\n"
"Athshocraíodh í go 0.2"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Zero initial layer height is invalid.\n"
"\n"
"The first layer height will be reset to 0.2."
msgstr ""
"Tá airde nialasach na chéad sraithe neamhbhailí.\n"
"\n"
"Athshocrófar airde na chéad sraithe go 0.2."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This setting is only used for tuning model size by small amounts.\n"
"For example, when the model size has small errors or when tolerances are "
"incorrect. For large adjustments, please use the model scale function.\n"
"\n"
"The value will be reset to 0."
msgstr ""
"Ní úsáidtear an socrú seo ach chun méid na samhla a choigeartú beagán.\n"
"Mar shampla, nuair a bhíonn earráidí beaga i méid na samhla nó nuair a "
"bhíonn lamháltais mícheart. Le haghaidh coigeartuithe móra, úsáid feidhm "
"scála na samhla.\n"
"\n"
"Athshocrófar an luach go 0."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The elephant foot compensation value is too large.\n"
"If there are significant elephant foot issues, please check other settings.\n"
"The bed temperature may be too high, for example.\n"
"\n"
"The value will be reset to 0."
msgstr ""
"Tá luach chúiteamh chos na heilifinte rómhór.\n"
"Má tá fadhbanna suntasacha cos eilifinte ann, seiceáil socruithe eile.\n"
"D'fhéadfadh teocht na leapa a bheith ró-ard, mar shampla.\n"
"\n"
"Athshocrófar an luach go 0."

# AI Translated
# Needs human review: check option names for ensure vertical shell thickness / alternate extra wall
msgid ""
"Alternate extra wall doesn't work well when ensure vertical shell thickness "
"is set to All."
msgstr ""
"Ní oibríonn balla breise ailtéarnach go maith nuair atá 'cinntigh tiús na "
"blaoisce ingearaí' socraithe go Gach."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Change these settings automatically?\n"
"Yes - Change ensure vertical shell thickness to Moderate and enable "
"alternate extra wall\n"
"No  - Don't use alternate extra wall"
msgstr ""
"An athrófar na socruithe seo go huathoibríoch?\n"
"Tá - Athraigh 'cinntigh tiús na blaoisce ingearaí' go Measartha agus "
"cumasaigh balla breise ailtéarnach\n"
"Níl  - Ná húsáid balla breise ailtéarnach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Prime tower does not work when Adaptive Layer Height or Independent Support "
"Layer Height is on.\n"
"Which do you want to keep?\n"
"YES - Keep Prime Tower\n"
"NO  - Keep Adaptive Layer Height and Independent Support Layer Height"
msgstr ""
"Ní oibríonn an túr príomhála nuair atá Airde Sraithe Oiriúnaitheach nó Airde "
"Neamhspleách Sraithe Taca ar siúl.\n"
"Cé acu ar mhaith leat a choinneáil?\n"
"TÁ - Coinnigh an Túr Príomhála\n"
"NÍL  - Coinnigh Airde Sraithe Oiriúnaitheach agus Airde Neamhspleách Sraithe "
"Taca"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Prime tower does not work when Adaptive Layer Height is on.\n"
"Which do you want to keep?\n"
"YES - Keep Prime Tower\n"
"NO  - Keep Adaptive Layer Height"
msgstr ""
"Ní oibríonn an túr príomhála nuair atá Airde Sraithe Oiriúnaitheach ar "
"siúl.\n"
"Cé acu ar mhaith leat a choinneáil?\n"
"TÁ - Coinnigh an Túr Príomhála\n"
"NÍL  - Coinnigh Airde Sraithe Oiriúnaitheach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Prime tower does not work when Independent Support Layer Height is on.\n"
"Which do you want to keep?\n"
"YES - Keep Prime Tower\n"
"NO  - Keep Independent Support Layer Height"
msgstr ""
"Ní oibríonn an túr príomhála nuair atá Airde Neamhspleách Sraithe Taca ar "
"siúl.\n"
"Cé acu ar mhaith leat a choinneáil?\n"
"TÁ - Coinnigh an Túr Príomhála\n"
"NÍL  - Coinnigh Airde Neamhspleách Sraithe Taca"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"seam_slope_start_height needs to be smaller than layer_height.\n"
"Reset to 0."
msgstr ""
"Ní mór do seam_slope_start_height a bheith níos lú ná layer_height.\n"
"Athshocraigh go 0."

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"Lock depth should be smaller than skin depth.\n"
"Reset to 50% of skin depth."
msgstr ""
"Ba cheart don doimhneacht ghlasála a bheith níos lú ná doimhneacht an "
"chraicinn.\n"
"Athshocraigh go 50% de dhoimhneacht an chraicinn."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Both [Extrusion] and [Combined] modes of Fuzzy Skin require the Arachne Wall "
"Generator to be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn Gineadóir Ballaí Arachne cumasaithe ó mhóid [Easbhrú] agus "
"[Comhcheangailte] an Chraicinn Chlúmhaigh araon."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Change these settings automatically?\n"
"Yes - Enable Arachne Wall Generator\n"
"No  - Disable Arachne Wall Generator and set [Displacement] mode of the "
"Fuzzy Skin"
msgstr ""
"An athrófar na socruithe seo go huathoibríoch?\n"
"Tá - Cumasaigh Gineadóir Ballaí Arachne\n"
"Níl  - Díchumasaigh Gineadóir Ballaí Arachne agus socraigh mód [Díláithriú] "
"an Chraicinn Chlúmhaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Set the maximum volumetric extrusion rate slope above zero to use extrusion "
"rate smoothing."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh fána uasráta easbhrúite toirtmhéadraigh os cionn nialais chun mínú "
"ráta easbhrúite a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Arc fitting is unavailable for belt printers and when extrusion rate "
"smoothing is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Níl feistiú stuanna ar fáil do phrintéirí crios ná nuair atá mínú ráta "
"easbhrúite cumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Set wall loops above zero to use this setting."
msgstr "Socraigh lúba balla os cionn nialais chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "This setting is hidden because sparse infill density is zero."
msgstr ""
"Tá an socrú seo folaithe mar go bhfuil dlús an líonta thanaí nialasach."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Infill anchors require nonzero sparse infill density and a pattern other "
"than Concentric or Spiral Inset."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn dlús líonta thanaí neamhnialasach agus patrún seachas Comhlárnach "
"nó Ionsá Bíseach ó ancairí líonta."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable infill combination and use nonzero sparse infill density to show this "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh comhcheangal líonta agus úsáid dlús líonta thanaí neamhnialasach "
"chun an socrú seo a thaispeáint."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Select Gyroid, TPMS-D or TPMS-FK infill with sparse infill density greater "
"than zero and less than 100%."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh líonadh Gyroid, TPMS-D nó TPMS-FK le dlús líonta thanaí níos mó ná "
"nialas agus níos lú ná 100%."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable adaptive density for Gyroid, TPMS-D or TPMS-FK infill with sparse "
"infill density greater than zero and less than 100%."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh dlús oiriúnaitheach do líonadh Gyroid, TPMS-D nó TPMS-FK le dlús "
"líonta thanaí níos mó ná nialas agus níos lú ná 100%."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Select Gyroid infill with nonzero sparse infill density and disable adaptive "
"density to use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh líonadh Gyroid le dlús líonta thanaí neamhnialasach agus "
"díchumasaigh an dlús oiriúnaitheach chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "The selected sparse infill pattern does not support multiline infill."
msgstr "Ní thacaíonn an patrún líonta thanaí roghnaithe le líonadh illíne."

# AI Translated
msgid "The Line infill pattern does not support infill anchors."
msgstr "Ní thacaíonn an patrún líonta Líne le hancairí líonta."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Select an infill pattern other than Line and set the maximum infill anchor "
"length above zero."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh patrún líonta seachas Líne agus socraigh uasfhad ancaire an líonta "
"os cionn nialais."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Select the Cross Zag or Locked Zag sparse infill pattern to use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh an patrún líonta thanaí Sigsag Trasna nó Sigsag Glasáilte chun an "
"socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Select the Locked Zag sparse infill pattern to use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh an patrún líonta thanaí Sigsag Glasáilte chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Select the Zig Zag, Cross Zag or Locked Zag sparse infill pattern to use "
"this setting."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh an patrún líonta thanaí Sigsag, Sigsag Trasna nó Sigsag Glasáilte "
"chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Select 3D Honeycomb infill with nonzero sparse infill density to use this "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh líonadh Cíor Mheala 3T le dlús líonta thanaí neamhnialasach chun "
"an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable spiral vase mode to use this setting."
msgstr "Cumasaigh mód vása bíseach chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable spiral vase mode and spiral smoothing to use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh mód vása bíseach agus mínú bíseach chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This setting requires top shell layers, or more than one bottom shell layer "
"in spiral vase mode."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn sraitheanna blaoisce uachtair, nó níos mó ná sraith blaoisce "
"íochtair amháin i mód vása bíseach, ón socrú seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "This setting requires a top shell with nonzero top surface density."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn blaosc uachtair le dlús dromchla uachtair neamhnialasach ón socrú "
"seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Set bottom shell layers above zero to use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh sraitheanna blaoisce íochtair os cionn nialais chun an socrú seo a "
"úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Use nonzero sparse infill density and an infill pattern and multiline "
"setting that support infill smoothing."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid dlús líonta thanaí neamhnialasach agus patrún líonta agus socrú illíne "
"a thacaíonn le mínú líonta."

# AI Translated
msgid "Set top surface expansion above zero to use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh leathnú an dromchla uachtair os cionn nialais chun an socrú seo a "
"úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Use a top or bottom shell with the Archimedean Chords or Octagram Spiral "
"surface pattern."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid blaosc uachtair nó íochtair leis an bpatrún dromchla Corda "
"Airciméideacha nó Bís Ochtagraim."

# AI Translated
msgid "The selected sparse infill pattern does not support separated infills."
msgstr "Ní thacaíonn an patrún líonta thanaí roghnaithe le líonta scartha."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Use a top shell with nonzero surface density and the Concentric, Spiral "
"Inset, Archimedean Chords or Octagram Spiral surface pattern."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid blaosc uachtair le dlús dromchla neamhnialasach agus an patrún "
"dromchla Comhlárnach, Ionsá Bíseach, Corda Airciméideacha nó Bís Ochtagraim."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Use bottom shell layers and the Concentric, Spiral Inset, Archimedean Chords "
"or Octagram Spiral surface pattern."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid sraitheanna blaoisce íochtair agus an patrún dromchla Comhlárnach, "
"Ionsá Bíseach, Corda Airciméideacha nó Bís Ochtagraim."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Use nonzero sparse infill density or top or bottom shell layers to edit this "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid dlús líonta thanaí neamhnialasach nó sraitheanna blaoisce uachtair nó "
"íochtair chun an socrú seo a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Disable spiral vase mode and set top shell layers above zero to edit top "
"shell thickness."
msgstr ""
"Díchumasaigh mód vása bíseach agus socraigh sraitheanna blaoisce uachtair os "
"cionn nialais chun tiús na blaoisce uachtair a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Disable spiral vase mode and set bottom shell layers above zero to edit "
"bottom shell thickness."
msgstr ""
"Díchumasaigh mód vása bíseach agus socraigh sraitheanna blaoisce íochtair os "
"cionn nialais chun tiús na blaoisce íochtair a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Set default acceleration above zero to edit acceleration for individual "
"extrusion roles."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an luasghéarú réamhshocraithe os cionn nialais chun luasghéarú a "
"chur in eagar do róil easbhrúite aonair."

# AI Translated
msgid "This setting requires the Marlin firmware G-code flavor."
msgstr "Teastaíonn blas G-code dochtearraí Marlin ón socrú seo."

# AI Translated
# Needs human review: check term 'junction deviation'
msgid ""
"Jerk settings are unavailable while the printer uses junction deviation."
msgstr ""
"Níl socruithe turraingthe ar fáil fad a úsáideann an printéir diall acomhail."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Set the printer junction deviation limit above zero with the Marlin firmware "
"G-code flavor to edit this setting."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh teorainn diall acomhail an phrintéara os cionn nialais le blas "
"G-code dochtearraí Marlin chun an socrú seo a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Set default jerk above zero to edit jerk for individual extrusion roles."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an turraing réamhshocraithe os cionn nialais chun turraing a chur "
"in eagar do róil easbhrúite aonair."

# AI Translated
msgid "Use a non-belt printer with skirt loops above zero to use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid printéir nach printéir crios é le lúba sciorta os cionn nialais chun "
"an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Use a non-belt printer with skirt loops above zero and disable the "
"full-height draft shield to edit skirt height."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid printéir nach printéir crios é le lúba sciorta os cionn nialais agus "
"díchumasaigh an sciath dréachta lánairde chun airde an sciorta a chur in "
"eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Skirts are unavailable for belt printers."
msgstr "Níl sciortaí ar fáil do phrintéirí crios."

# AI Translated
msgid "Select a brim type other than No brim to use this setting."
msgstr "Roghnaigh cineál imill seachas Gan imeall chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable a brim on a printer without a tilted belt to use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh imeall ar phrintéir gan crios claonta chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Select a brim type with an editable width, or enable a brim on a tilted belt "
"printer."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh cineál imill le leithead ineagarthóireachta, nó cumasaigh imeall "
"ar phrintéir crios claonta."

# AI Translated
msgid "This setting requires a belt printer with a tilted slicing plane."
msgstr "Teastaíonn printéir crios le plána slisnithe claonta ón socrú seo."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable a brim on a belt printer with a tilted slicing plane to use this "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh imeall ar phrintéir crios le plána slisnithe claonta chun an socrú "
"seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable walls or a brim to select the wall filament."
msgstr "Cumasaigh ballaí nó imeall chun filiméad na mballaí a roghnú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Brim ear radius"
msgstr "Ga chluasa an imill"

# AI Translated
msgid "Brim width"
msgstr "Leithead an imill"

# AI Translated
msgid "Set brim width above zero to edit brim ear detection."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh leithead an imill os cionn nialais chun brath chluasa an imill a "
"chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Use painted brim ears or set brim width above zero to edit this setting."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid cluasa imill péinteáilte nó socraigh leithead an imill os cionn "
"nialais chun an socrú seo a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Select automatic brim ears on a printer without a tilted belt to use this "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh cluasa imill uathoibríocha ar phrintéir gan crios claonta chun an "
"socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Select automatic or painted brim ears on a printer without a tilted belt to "
"use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh cluasa imill uathoibríocha nó péinteáilte ar phrintéir gan crios "
"claonta chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"Enable elephant foot compensation or set elephant foot layer density below "
"100% to use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh cúiteamh chos na heilifinte nó socraigh dlús sraithe chos na "
"heilifinte faoi bhun 100% chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Rafts are unavailable for belt printers."
msgstr "Níl raftaí ar fáil do phrintéirí crios."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable support to edit this setting."
msgstr "Cumasaigh tacaí chun an socrú seo a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable support or add raft layers to edit this setting."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh tacaí nó cuir sraitheanna rafta leis chun an socrú seo a chur in "
"eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Select an automatic support type to edit the threshold angle."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh cineál taca uathoibríoch chun uillinn na tairsí a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Select an automatic support type and set the threshold angle to zero to edit "
"threshold overlap."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh cineál taca uathoibríoch agus socraigh uillinn na tairsí go nialas "
"chun forluí na tairsí a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Threshold overlap is unavailable for tree supports."
msgstr "Níl forluí tairsí ar fáil do thacaí crainn."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable tree supports and select a style other than Organic or Default to "
"show this setting."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh tacaí crainn agus roghnaigh stíl seachas Orgánach nó "
"Réamhshocraithe chun an socrú seo a thaispeáint."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable tree supports with the Organic or Default style to show this setting."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh tacaí crainn leis an stíl Orgánach nó Réamhshocraithe chun an "
"socrú seo a thaispeáint."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Independent support layer height is unavailable for organic tree supports."
msgstr ""
"Níl airde neamhspleách sraithe taca ar fáil do thacaí crainn orgánacha."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable tree supports and turn off automatic brim width to edit the tree "
"support brim width."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh tacaí crainn agus múch leithead uathoibríoch an imill chun "
"leithead imill na dtacaí crainn a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable tree supports to show the maximum bridge length."
msgstr "Cumasaigh tacaí crainn chun uasfhad an droichid a thaispeáint."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Tree supports use maximum bridge length instead of the bridge support "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann tacaí crainn uasfhad droichid in ionad shocrú tacaí droichid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable automatic tree supports to show this setting."
msgstr "Cumasaigh tacaí crainn uathoibríocha chun an socrú seo a thaispeáint."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Set top or bottom support interface layers above zero to edit this setting."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh sraitheanna comhéadain taca uachtair nó íochtair os cionn nialais "
"chun an socrú seo a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable a raft, or enable supports with top interface layers, to use support "
"ironing."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh rafta, nó cumasaigh tacaí le sraitheanna comhéadain uachtair, chun "
"iarnáil tacaí a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable support ironing with a raft or top support interface layers to show "
"this setting."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh iarnáil tacaí le rafta nó le sraitheanna comhéadain taca uachtair "
"chun an socrú seo a thaispeáint."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Set top or bottom support interface layers above zero to edit interface "
"spacing."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh sraitheanna comhéadain taca uachtair nó íochtair os cionn nialais "
"chun spásáil an chomhéadain a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Support ironing requires a solid interface, so interface spacing cannot be "
"edited."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn comhéadan soladach ó iarnáil tacaí, mar sin ní féidir spásáil an "
"chomhéadain a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable walls, a skirt or a brim to edit inner wall line width."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh ballaí, sciorta nó imeall chun leithead líne na mballaí "
"inmheánacha a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable support, a raft, or a skirt to select the support filament."
msgstr "Cumasaigh tacaí, rafta nó sciorta chun filiméad na dtacaí a roghnú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Add raft layers to show raft contact distance."
msgstr "Cuir sraitheanna rafta leis chun fad teagmhála an rafta a thaispeáint."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Raft contact distance is unavailable when the top support Z distance is zero."
msgstr ""
"Níl fad teagmhála an rafta ar fáil nuair atá fad Z na dtacaí uachtair "
"nialasach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Add raft layers to show raft expansion."
msgstr "Cuir sraitheanna rafta leis chun leathnú an rafta a thaispeáint."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Slim, Strong and Hybrid tree supports use first layer expansion instead of "
"raft expansion."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann tacaí crainn Caola, Láidre agus Hibrideacha leathnú na chéad "
"sraithe in ionad leathnú an rafta."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Add a raft or choose a tree support style other than Slim or Strong to edit "
"first layer expansion."
msgstr ""
"Cuir rafta leis nó roghnaigh stíl taca crainn seachas Caol nó Láidir chun "
"leathnú na chéad sraithe a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable ironing to use this setting."
msgstr "Cumasaigh iarnáil chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable ironing with the Rectilinear pattern to edit ironing angles."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh iarnáil leis an bpatrún Dronlíneach chun uillinneacha iarnála a "
"chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable ironing or support ironing to edit ironing speed."
msgstr "Cumasaigh iarnáil nó iarnáil tacaí chun luas iarnála a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable Z contouring to use this setting."
msgstr "Cumasaigh comhrianú Z chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Print order cannot be edited when the print sequence is By object."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir ord priontála a chur in eagar nuair atá seicheamh na priontála "
"socraithe go De réir réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "This setting is unavailable for Bambu Lab printers."
msgstr "Níl an socrú seo ar fáil do phrintéirí Bambu Lab."

# AI Translated
msgid "This setting is unavailable in single extruder multimaterial mode."
msgstr "Níl an socrú seo ar fáil i mód ilábhair aon easbhrúiteora."

# AI Translated
# Needs human review: check term 'ooze prevention'
msgid "Enable ooze prevention to use this setting."
msgstr "Cumasaigh cosc úscadh chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable ooze prevention and use a positive number of preheat steps to show "
"this setting."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh cosc úscadh agus úsáid líon dearfach céimeanna réamhthéimh chun an "
"socrú seo a thaispeáint."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable the belt purge tower in the belt printer settings to use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh túr sruthlaithe an chreasa i socruithe an phrintéara crios chun an "
"socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable the prime tower on a non-belt printer to use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh an túr príomhála ar phrintéir nach printéir crios é chun an socrú "
"seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable the prime tower and tower interface features on a non-belt printer to "
"use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh an túr príomhála agus gnéithe chomhéadan an túir ar phrintéir nach "
"printéir crios é chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable the prime tower and select wipe tower Type 2 on a non-Bambu, non-belt "
"printer."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh an túr príomhála agus roghnaigh túr glanta Cineál 2 ar phrintéir "
"nach printéir Bambu ná printéir crios é."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable the prime tower on a non-belt printer and turn off skipping sparse "
"tower layers to use layer combination."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh an túr príomhála ar phrintéir nach printéir crios é agus múch "
"scipeáil sraitheanna tanaí an túir chun comhcheangal sraitheanna a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable the prime tower with Rib walls on a non-belt printer to use this "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh an túr príomhála le ballaí Easnacha ar phrintéir nach printéir "
"crios é chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable a Type 2 prime tower with Cone walls on a non-Bambu, non-belt printer."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh túr príomhála Cineál 2 le ballaí Cóin ar phrintéir nach printéir "
"Bambu ná printéir crios é."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable the prime tower on a non-belt printer and choose a wall type other "
"than Rib to edit tower width."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh an túr príomhála ar phrintéir nach printéir crios é agus roghnaigh "
"cineál balla seachas Easnach chun leithead an túir a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable a Type 2 prime tower on a non-Bambu, non-belt printer and disable "
"single extruder multimaterial mode."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh túr príomhála Cineál 2 ar phrintéir nach printéir Bambu ná "
"printéir crios é agus díchumasaigh mód ilábhair aon easbhrúiteora."

# AI Translated
msgid "Select Cyclic tool change ordering to use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh ord timthriallach athraithe uirlise chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable the prime tower and either disable purging in the prime tower or "
"disable single extruder multimaterial mode."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh an túr príomhála agus díchumasaigh sruthlú sa túr príomhála nó "
"díchumasaigh mód ilábhair aon easbhrúiteora."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable the prime tower to use this setting."
msgstr "Cumasaigh an túr príomhála chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable avoiding crossing walls to edit the maximum travel detour distance."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh seachaint trasnú ballaí chun uasfhad timpealláin an taistil a chur "
"in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable setting other flow ratios to use this setting."
msgstr "Cumasaigh socrú cóimheasa sreafa eile chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable slowing down for overhangs to use this setting."
msgstr "Cumasaigh moilliú do starráin chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This setting is available in object settings rather than global print "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Tá an socrú seo ar fáil i socruithe an réada seachas i socruithe ginearálta "
"priontála."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Select a specific support interface filament and use the default support "
"filament to show this setting."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh filiméad sonrach do chomhéadan na dtacaí agus úsáid an filiméad "
"taca réamhshocraithe chun an socrú seo a thaispeáint."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable fuzzy skin to use this setting."
msgstr "Cumasaigh craiceann clúmhach chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable fuzzy skin with Ripple noise to use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh craiceann clúmhach le torann Cuilithín chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable fuzzy skin and select a noise type other than Classic or Ripple to "
"edit noise scale."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh craiceann clúmhach agus roghnaigh cineál torainn seachas "
"Clasaiceach nó Cuilithín chun scála an torainn a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable fuzzy skin and select a noise type other than Classic, Voronoi or "
"Ripple to edit noise octaves."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh craiceann clúmhach agus roghnaigh cineál torainn seachas "
"Clasaiceach, Voronoi nó Cuilithín chun ochtáibh an torainn a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable fuzzy skin with Perlin or Billow noise to edit persistence."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh craiceann clúmhach le torann Perlin nó Billow chun an "
"bhuanseasmhacht a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Select the Arachne wall generator to use this setting."
msgstr "Roghnaigh gineadóir ballaí Arachne chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Thin wall detection is unavailable with the Arachne wall generator."
msgstr "Níl brath ballaí tanaí ar fáil le gineadóir ballaí Arachne."

# AI Translated
msgid "Disable role-based wipe speed to edit wipe speed manually."
msgstr ""
"Díchumasaigh luas glanta bunaithe ar ról chun an luas glanta a chur in eagar "
"de láimh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable inward wiping to edit inward wipe distance."
msgstr "Cumasaigh glanadh isteach chun fad an ghlanta isteach a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "This setting requires the Klipper G-code flavor."
msgstr "Teastaíonn blas G-code Klipper ón socrú seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable acceleration to deceleration to edit its factor."
msgstr "Cumasaigh 'luasghéarú go moilliú' chun a fhachtóir a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable excluding objects with the Klipper G-code flavor to edit the outline "
"tolerance."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh eisiamh réad le blas G-code Klipper chun lamháltas na himlíne a "
"chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable making overhangs printable to use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh 'starráin a dhéanamh inphriontáilte' chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable only one wall on top surfaces with top shell layers, or use Arachne "
"with a minimum wall length factor above 0.5."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh balla amháin amháin ar dhromchlaí uachtair le sraitheanna blaoisce "
"uachtair, nó úsáid Arachne le fachtóir íosfhad balla os cionn 0.5."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable converting holes to polyholes to use this setting."
msgstr "Cumasaigh tiontú poll go polapholl chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable overhang wall detection to use this setting."
msgstr "Cumasaigh brath ballaí starráin chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Reverse overhang direction is unavailable in spiral vase mode."
msgstr "Níl treo starráin droim ar ais ar fáil i mód vása bíseach."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Disable spiral vase mode and enable reverse overhang direction to use this "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"Díchumasaigh mód vása bíseach agus cumasaigh treo starráin droim ar ais chun "
"an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable overhang wall detection and reverse overhang direction, disable "
"spiral vase mode, and turn off reversing internal perimeters only."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh brath ballaí starráin agus treo starráin droim ar ais, "
"díchumasaigh mód vása bíseach, agus múch 'imlínte inmheánacha amháin a "
"aisiompú'."

# AI Translated
msgid "This setting requires a Bambu Lab printer."
msgstr "Teastaíonn printéir Bambu Lab ón socrú seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable small area infill flow compensation to edit its model."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh cúiteamh sreafa líonta i limistéir bheaga chun a mhúnla a chur in "
"eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Scarf seams are unavailable in spiral vase mode and for belt printers."
msgstr "Níl uamanna scairfe ar fáil i mód vása bíseach ná do phrintéirí crios."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable scarf seams on a non-belt printer with spiral vase mode disabled to "
"use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh uamanna scairfe ar phrintéir nach printéir crios é agus mód vása "
"bíseach díchumasaithe chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Disable scarfing the entire loop to edit the minimum scarf length."
msgstr ""
"Díchumasaigh scairfeáil na lúibe ar fad chun íosfhad na scairfe a chur in "
"eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable conditional scarf seams on a non-belt printer with spiral vase mode "
"disabled to use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh uamanna scairfe coinníollacha ar phrintéir nach printéir crios é "
"agus mód vása bíseach díchumasaithe chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable beam interlocking to use this setting."
msgstr "Cumasaigh idirghlasáil bhíomaí chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Disable beam interlocking to edit segmented region interlocking depth."
msgstr ""
"Díchumasaigh idirghlasáil bhíomaí chun doimhneacht idirghlasála na réigiún "
"deighilte a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Select the Lateral Lattice sparse infill pattern to use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh an patrún líonta thanaí Laitís Thaobhach chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Select the Lightning sparse infill pattern to use this setting."
msgstr "Roghnaigh an patrún líonta thanaí Tintreach chun an socrú seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Infill rotation templates are unavailable for Adaptive Cubic and Support "
"Cubic infill."
msgstr ""
"Níl teimpléid rothlaithe líonta ar fáil do líonadh Ciúbach Oiriúnaitheach ná "
"Ciúbach Taca."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Clear the sparse infill rotation template and choose a pattern other than "
"Adaptive Cubic or Support Cubic to edit infill direction."
msgstr ""
"Glan teimpléad rothlaithe an líonta thanaí agus roghnaigh patrún seachas "
"Ciúbach Oiriúnaitheach nó Ciúbach Taca chun treo an líonta a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Clear the solid infill rotation template to edit solid infill direction."
msgstr ""
"Glan teimpléad rothlaithe an líonta sholadaigh chun treo an líonta "
"sholadaigh a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Select the Lateral Honeycomb sparse infill pattern to use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh an patrún líonta thanaí Cíor Mheala Thaobhach chun an socrú seo a "
"úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "The selected printer does not support wrapping detection."
msgstr "Ní thacaíonn an printéir roghnaithe le brath fillte."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable the pad to edit this setting."
msgstr "Cumasaigh an ceap chun an socrú seo a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable the pad around the object to edit this setting."
msgstr "Cumasaigh an ceap timpeall an réada chun an socrú seo a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable support and disable the pad around the object to edit object "
"elevation."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh tacaí agus díchumasaigh an ceap timpeall an réada chun ardú an "
"réada a chur in eagar."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Spiral mode only works when wall loops is 1, support is disabled, clumping "
"detection by probing is disabled, top shell layers is 0, sparse infill "
"density is 0 and timelapse type is traditional."
msgstr ""
"Ní oibríonn mód bíseach ach nuair atá lúba balla socraithe go 1, tacaí "
"díchumasaithe, brath cnapánaithe trí thóireadh díchumasaithe, sraitheanna "
"blaoisce uachtair go 0, dlús líonta thanaí go 0 agus an cineál am-mhoille "
"traidisiúnta."

# AI Translated
msgid " But machines with I3 structure will not generate timelapse videos."
msgstr " Ach ní ghinfidh meaisíní le struchtúr I3 físeáin am-mhoille."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Change these settings automatically?\n"
"Yes - Change these settings and enable spiral/vase mode automatically\n"
"No  - Cancel enabling spiral mode"
msgstr ""
"An athrófar na socruithe seo go huathoibríoch?\n"
"Tá - Athraigh na socruithe seo agus cumasaigh mód bíseach/vása go "
"huathoibríoch\n"
"Níl  - Cealaigh cumasú an mhóid bhísigh"

