# AI Translated
msgid ""
"How the mode is labeled in the plate's IDEX/IQEX mode selector. Required — a "
"mode with no name cannot be selected."
msgstr ""
"Conas a lipéadaítear an mód i roghnóir mhód IDEX/IQEX an phláta. Riachtanach "
"— ní féidir mód gan ainm a roghnú."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Which tool heads take part in the mode and what role each one plays. Click a "
"tile to cycle its role."
msgstr ""
"Cé na cinn uirlise a ghlacann páirt sa mhód agus an ról atá ag gach ceann "
"acu. Cliceáil ar thíl chun a ról a rothlú."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"G-code run at print start to put the printer into this mode (for example a "
"Klipper SET_PRINT_MODE call).\n"
"\n"
"The slicer only emits the Primary tool's paths; the firmware drives the "
"others."
msgstr ""
"G-code a ritheann ag tús na priontála chun an printéir a chur sa mhód seo "
"(mar shampla glao Klipper SET_PRINT_MODE).\n"
"\n"
"Ní eisíonn an slisneoir ach conairí na huirlise Príomha; tiomáineann na "
"dochtearraí na cinn eile."

# AI Translated
#. TRN IDEX/IQEX role of a tool head that takes no part in the mode.
msgctxt "IDEX/IQEX role"
msgid "Inactive"
msgstr "Neamhghníomhach"

# AI Translated
#. TRN IDEX/IQEX role: the tool head the slicer generates paths for.
msgctxt "IDEX/IQEX role"
msgid "Primary"
msgstr "Príomha"

# AI Translated
#. TRN IDEX/IQEX role: the tool head prints a copy of the Primary's paths.
msgctxt "IDEX/IQEX role"
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Cóip"

# AI Translated
#. TRN IDEX/IQEX role: the tool head prints a mirror image of the Primary's paths.
msgctxt "IDEX/IQEX role"
msgid "Mirror"
msgstr "Scáthán"

# AI Translated
# Needs human review: check IDEX role 'Span' wording
#. TRN IDEX/IQEX role: multicolor partner of the Primary on the same gantry.
msgctxt "IDEX/IQEX role"
msgid "Span"
msgstr "Réise"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Drives every sliced path. Always tool 0 — use Tool 0 Position above to "
"choose which corner of the bed it occupies. It cannot be moved from the grid."
msgstr ""
"Tiomáineann sé gach conair shlisnithe. Uirlis 0 i gcónaí — úsáid Suíomh "
"Uirlis 0 thuas chun a roghnú cén cúinne den leaba ina mbeidh sí. Ní féidir í "
"a bhogadh ón ngreille."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Follows the Primary at the firmware level, printing the same paths offset "
"into its own zone."
msgstr ""
"Leanann sé an Phríomhuirlis ar leibhéal na ndochtearraí, ag priontáil na "
"gconairí céanna le fritháireamh isteach ina chrios féin."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Follows the Primary at the firmware level, printing the same paths reflected "
"across the boundary between the two zones."
msgstr ""
"Leanann sé an Phríomhuirlis ar leibhéal na ndochtearraí, ag priontáil na "
"gconairí céanna frithchaite trasna na teorann idir an dá chrios."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Marks a tool on the Primary's gantry as its multicolor partner. Required to "
"allow multi-color printing in paired-gantry modes."
msgstr ""
"Marcálann sé uirlis ar ghantra na Príomhuirlise mar a comhpháirtí ildaite. "
"Riachtanach chun priontáil ildaite a cheadú i móid ghantraí péireáilte."

# AI Translated
msgid "Primary"
msgstr "Príomha"

# AI Translated
msgid "Mode name (required)"
msgstr "Ainm an mhóid (riachtanach)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Name of this parallel mode, as it appears in the plate's IDEX/IQEX mode "
"selector. Stored in the project by name, so renaming a mode that plates "
"already use makes them fall back to Primary. Cannot be empty — a blank name "
"is replaced with a generated one."
msgstr ""
"Ainm an mhóid chomhthreomhair seo, mar a fheictear é i roghnóir mhód "
"IDEX/IQEX an phláta. Stóráiltear sa tionscadal é de réir ainm, mar sin má "
"athainmnítear mód atá in úsáid ag plátaí cheana, fillfidh siad ar Príomha. "
"Ní féidir é a fhágáil folamh — cuirtear ainm ginte in ionad ainm bháin."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"G-code emitted once at the start of a print that uses this mode, before the "
"machine start G-code. This is where the printer is put into the matching "
"firmware mode — for example a Klipper SET_PRINT_MODE call or a "
"RepRapFirmware M567 — since the slicer only emits the Primary tool's paths "
"and the firmware drives the Copy / Mirror tools.\n"
"\n"
"Placeholders are supported; use the edit button to browse them. Leave empty "
"if the mode needs no firmware setup."
msgstr ""
"G-code a eisítear uair amháin ag tús priontála a úsáideann an mód seo, roimh "
"G-code tosaithe an mheaisín. Is anseo a chuirtear an printéir sa mhód "
"dochtearraí comhfhreagrach — mar shampla glao Klipper SET_PRINT_MODE nó "
"RepRapFirmware M567 — ós rud é nach n-eisíonn an slisneoir ach conairí na "
"huirlise Príomha agus go dtiomáineann na dochtearraí na huirlisí Cóip / "
"Scáthán.\n"
"\n"
"Tacaítear le háitchoimeádaithe; úsáid an cnaipe eagarthóireachta chun iad a "
"bhrabhsáil. Fág folamh mura bhfuil socrú dochtearraí de dhíth ar an mód."

