#. TRN %s is a URL scheme, for example "prusaslicer".
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid "Associate %s://"
msgstr "Comhcheangail %s://"

# AI Translated
#. TRN The first %s is a URL scheme, for example "prusaslicer"; the second is a website name.
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid "Associate %s:// with OrcaSlicer so that Orca can open models from %s"
msgstr ""
"Comhcheangail %s:// le OrcaSlicer ionas gur féidir le Orca samhlacha a "
"oscailt ó %s"

# AI Translated
msgid "Current Association: "
msgstr "Comhcheangal Reatha: "

# AI Translated
msgid "Current Instance"
msgstr "Cás Reatha an Fheidhmchláir"

# AI Translated
msgid "Current Instance Path: "
msgstr "Conair an Cháis Reatha: "

# AI Translated
msgid "General"
msgstr "Ginearálta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Teanga"

# AI Translated
msgid "Metric"
msgstr "Méadrach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Imperial"
msgstr "Impiriúil"

# AI Translated
msgid "Units"
msgstr "Aonaid"

# AI Translated
msgid "Home"
msgstr "Baile"

# AI Translated
msgid "Default page"
msgstr "Leathanach réamhshocraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Set the page opened on startup."
msgstr "Socraigh an leathanach a osclaítear ag an tosú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable dark Mode"
msgstr "Cumasaigh mód dorcha"

# AI Translated
msgid "Allow only one OrcaSlicer instance"
msgstr "Ná ceadaigh ach cás amháin de OrcaSlicer"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"On OSX there is always only one instance of app running by default. However "
"it is allowed to run multiple instances of same app from the command line. "
"In such case this settings will allow only one instance."
msgstr ""
"Ar OSX ní bhíonn ach cás amháin den aip ag rith i gcónaí de réir "
"réamhshocraithe. Mar sin féin, ceadaítear cásanna iolracha den aip chéanna a "
"rith ón líne ordaithe. Sa chás sin, ní cheadóidh an socrú seo ach cás amháin."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If this is enabled, when starting OrcaSlicer and another instance of the "
"same OrcaSlicer is already running, that instance will be reactivated "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé seo cumasaithe, nuair a thosaítear OrcaSlicer agus cás eile den "
"OrcaSlicer céanna ag rith cheana, athghníomhachtófar an cás sin ina ionad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Show splash screen"
msgstr "Taispeáin an scáileán splaise"

# AI Translated
msgid "Show the splash screen during startup."
msgstr "Taispeáin an scáileán splaise le linn an tosaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Use window buttons on left side"
msgstr "Úsáid cnaipí fuinneoige ar an taobh clé"

# AI Translated
msgid "(Requires restart)"
msgstr "(Teastaíonn atosú)"

# AI Translated
#. TRN "GPU" is the graphics card; the option only matters on computers that have two of them.
msgid "Render on the discrete GPU"
msgstr "Rindreáil ar an GPU scoite"

# AI Translated
#. TRN DRI_PRIME is an environment variable name and must stay as it is.
msgid ""
"On a computer with two GPUs, run OrcaSlicer on the discrete GPU instead of "
"the one that drives the display. Some Wayland systems cannot show frames "
"rendered on the other GPU, or fail to open the window at all. Turn this off "
"if the 3D view stays empty; if OrcaSlicer no longer starts, start it once "
"with DRI_PRIME=0 in the environment to get back here."
msgstr ""
"Ar ríomhaire le dhá GPU, rith OrcaSlicer ar an GPU scoite in ionad an chinn "
"a thiomáineann an taispeáint. Ní féidir le roinnt córas Wayland frámaí a "
"rindreáiltear ar an GPU eile a thaispeáint, nó teipeann orthu an fhuinneog a "
"oscailt ar chor ar bith. Múch é seo má fhanann an t-amharc 3T folamh; mura "
"dtosaíonn OrcaSlicer a thuilleadh, tosaigh é uair amháin le DRI_PRIME=0 sa "
"timpeallacht chun teacht ar ais anseo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Gnéithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Multi device management"
msgstr "Bainistíocht ilghléasanna"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"With this option enabled, you can send a task to multiple devices at the "
"same time and manage multiple devices."
msgstr ""
"Leis an rogha seo cumasaithe, is féidir leat tasc a sheoladh chuig gléasanna "
"iolracha ag an am céanna agus gléasanna iolracha a bhainistiú."

# AI Translated
msgid "CAD feature (experimental)"
msgstr "Gné CAD (turgnamhach)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"With this option enabled, the Design tab is shown, where models can be built "
"and edited parametrically. This feature is experimental and still under "
"development."
msgstr ""
"Leis an rogha seo cumasaithe, taispeántar an cluaisín Dearadh, inar féidir "
"samhlacha a thógáil agus a chur in eagar go paraiméadrach. Is gné "
"thurgnamhach í seo agus tá sí fós á forbairt."

# AI Translated
msgid "Pop up to select filament grouping mode"
msgstr "Preabfhuinneog chun mód grúpála filiméad a roghnú"

# AI Translated
msgid "Clear my choice on..."
msgstr "Glan mo rogha ar..."

# AI Translated
msgid "Unsaved projects"
msgstr "Tionscadail gan sábháil"

# AI Translated
msgid "Clear my choice on the unsaved projects."
msgstr "Glan mo rogha maidir le tionscadail gan sábháil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Unsaved presets"
msgstr "Réamhshocruithe gan sábháil"

# AI Translated
msgid "Clear my choice on the unsaved presets."
msgstr "Glan mo rogha maidir le réamhshocruithe gan sábháil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Synchronizing printer preset"
msgstr "Réamhshocrú an phrintéara á shioncronú"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Clear my choice for synchronizing printer preset after loading the file."
msgstr ""
"Glan mo rogha maidir le sioncronú réamhshocrú an phrintéara tar éis an "
"comhad a lódáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Files"
msgstr "Comhaid"

# AI Translated
msgid "Load All"
msgstr "Lódáil Gach Rud"

# AI Translated
msgid "Ask When Relevant"
msgstr "Fiafraigh Nuair is Ábhartha"

# AI Translated
msgid "Always Ask"
msgstr "Fiafraigh i gCónaí"

# AI Translated
msgid "Load Geometry Only"
msgstr "Lódáil an Chéimseata Amháin"

# AI Translated
msgid "Load behavior"
msgstr "Iompar lódála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Should printer/filament/process settings be loaded when opening a 3MF file?"
msgstr ""
"Ar cheart socruithe printéara/filiméid/próisis a lódáil nuair a osclaítear "
"comhad 3MF?"

# AI Translated
msgid "Auto backup"
msgstr "Cúltaca uathoibríoch"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Backup your project periodically to help with restoring from an occasional "
"crash."
msgstr ""
"Déan cúltaca de do thionscadal go tréimhsiúil chun cabhrú leis an athchóiriú "
"tar éis tuairt ó am go chéile."

# AI Translated
msgid "Store full source file paths in projects"
msgstr "Stóráil conairí iomlána na gcomhad foinse i dtionscadail"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, saved projects store the absolute path to imported source files "
"(STEP/STL/...), so \"Reload from disk\" still works when the source file is "
"kept in a different folder than the project. If disabled, only the filename "
"is stored, which keeps projects portable and avoids embedding absolute paths."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, stórálann tionscadail shábháilte an chonair iomlán "
"chuig comhaid foinse iompórtáilte (STEP/STL/...), ionas go n-oibríonn "
"\"Athlódáil ón diosca\" fós nuair a choinnítear an comhad foinse i "
"bhfillteán eile seachas an tionscadal. Má tá sé díchumasaithe, ní "
"stóráiltear ach ainm an chomhaid, rud a choinníonn tionscadail iniompartha "
"agus a sheachnaíonn conairí iomlána a leabú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum recent files"
msgstr "Uasmhéid comhad le déanaí"

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum count of recent files"
msgstr "Uaslíon na gcomhad le déanaí"

# AI Translated
msgid "Add STL/STEP files to recent files list"
msgstr "Cuir comhaid STL/STEP le liosta na gcomhad le déanaí"

# AI Translated
msgid "Folder paths"
msgstr "Conairí fillteán"

# AI Translated
msgid "Downloads folder"
msgstr "Fillteán íoslódálacha"

# AI Translated
msgid "Target folder for downloaded items"
msgstr "Fillteán sprice do mhíreanna íoslódáilte"

# AI Translated
msgid "File import"
msgstr "Iompórtáil comhad"

# AI Translated
msgid "Ask how to handle unsupported characters in imported names"
msgstr ""
"Fiafraigh conas carachtair nach dtacaítear leo in ainmneacha iompórtáilte a "
"láimhseáil"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Show the removal or replacement choices when original names contain "
"unsupported characters."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin na roghanna bainte nó ionadaithe nuair atá carachtair nach "
"dtacaítear leo sna hainmneacha bunaidh."

# AI Translated
msgid "3MF import"
msgstr "Iompórtáil 3MF"

# AI Translated
msgid "Show options when importing"
msgstr "Taispeáin roghanna le linn iompórtála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Show original-name and sorting options when importing a 3MF without project "
"settings into the current project."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin roghanna ainm bunaidh agus sórtála nuair a iompórtáiltear 3MF gan "
"socruithe tionscadail isteach sa tionscadal reatha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Keep original names"
msgstr "Coinnigh na hainmneacha bunaidh"

# AI Translated
msgid "Use the body names stored in the imported file when it contains them."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid na hainmneacha coirp atá stóráilte sa chomhad iompórtáilte nuair atá "
"siad ann."

# AI Translated
msgid "Don't warn when loading 3MF with modified G-code"
msgstr "Ná tabhair rabhadh nuair a lódáiltear 3MF le G-code mionathraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "STEP import"
msgstr "Iompórtáil STEP"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, a parameter settings dialog will appear during STEP file import."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, taispeánfar dialóg socruithe paraiméadar le linn "
"iompórtáil comhaid STEP."

# AI Translated
msgid "Linear deflection"
msgstr "Sraonadh líneach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Linear deflection used when meshing imported STEP files.\n"
"Smaller values produce higher-quality meshes but increase processing time.\n"
"Used as the default in the import dialog, or directly when the import dialog "
"is disabled.\n"
"Default: 0.003 mm."
msgstr ""
"Sraonadh líneach a úsáidtear nuair a dhéantar mogalra de chomhaid STEP "
"iompórtáilte.\n"
"Táirgeann luachanna níos lú mogalraí ar cháilíocht níos airde ach méadaíonn "
"siad an t-am próiseála.\n"
"Úsáidtear é mar réamhshocrú sa dialóg iompórtála, nó go díreach nuair atá an "
"dialóg iompórtála díchumasaithe.\n"
"Réamhshocrú: 0.003 mm."

# AI Translated
msgid "Angle deflection"
msgstr "Sraonadh uillinne"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Angle deflection used when meshing imported STEP files.\n"
"Smaller values produce higher-quality meshes but increase processing time.\n"
"Used as the default in the import dialog, or directly when the import dialog "
"is disabled.\n"
"Default: 0.5."
msgstr ""
"Sraonadh uillinne a úsáidtear nuair a dhéantar mogalra de chomhaid STEP "
"iompórtáilte.\n"
"Táirgeann luachanna níos lú mogalraí ar cháilíocht níos airde ach méadaíonn "
"siad an t-am próiseála.\n"
"Úsáidtear é mar réamhshocrú sa dialóg iompórtála, nó go díreach nuair atá an "
"dialóg iompórtála díchumasaithe.\n"
"Réamhshocrú: 0.5."

# AI Translated
msgid "Split into multiple objects"
msgstr "Scoilt ina réada iolracha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, compound and compsolid shapes in imported STEP files are split "
"into multiple objects.\n"
"Used as the default in the import dialog, or directly when the import dialog "
"is disabled.\n"
"Default: enabled."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, scoiltear cruthanna cumaisc agus compsolid i gcomhaid "
"STEP iompórtáilte ina réada iolracha.\n"
"Úsáidtear é mar réamhshocrú sa dialóg iompórtála, nó go díreach nuair atá an "
"dialóg iompórtála díchumasaithe.\n"
"Réamhshocrú: cumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "AMF import"
msgstr "Iompórtáil AMF"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Show body grouping, original-name and sorting options when importing "
"geometry into the current project."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin roghanna grúpála coirp, ainm bunaidh agus sórtála nuair a "
"iompórtáiltear céimseata isteach sa tionscadal reatha."

# AI Translated
msgid "DRC export"
msgstr "Easpórtáil DRC"

# AI Translated
msgid "Quality level for Draco export"
msgstr "Leibhéal cáilíochta d'easpórtáil Draco"

# AI Translated
msgid "bits"
msgstr "giotáin"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Controls the quantization bit depth used when compressing the mesh to Draco "
"format.\n"
"0 = lossless compression (geometry is preserved at full precision). Valid "
"lossy values range from 8 to 30.\n"
"Lower values produce smaller files but lose more geometric detail; higher "
"values preserve more detail at the cost of larger files."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn sé doimhneacht ghiotán an chandamaithe a úsáidtear nuair a "
"chomhbhrúitear an mogalra go formáid Draco.\n"
"0 = comhbhrú gan chailliúint (caomhnaítear an chéimseata le beachtas "
"iomlán). Tá luachanna caillteacha bailí idir 8 agus 30.\n"
"Táirgeann luachanna níos ísle comhaid níos lú ach cailltear níos mó "
"mionsonraí céimseatúla; caomhnaíonn luachanna níos airde níos mó mionsonraí "
"ar chostas comhad níos mó."

# AI Translated
msgid "Associate files to OrcaSlicer"
msgstr "Comhcheangail comhaid le OrcaSlicer"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"File associations for the Microsoft Store version are managed by Windows "
"Settings."
msgstr ""
"Bainistítear comhcheangail chomhad don leagan Microsoft Store i Socruithe "
"Windows."

# AI Translated
msgid "Open Windows Default Apps Settings"
msgstr "Oscail Socruithe Aipeanna Réamhshocraithe Windows"

# AI Translated
msgid "Associate 3MF files to OrcaSlicer"
msgstr "Comhcheangail comhaid 3MF le OrcaSlicer"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, this sets OrcaSlicer as the default application to open 3MF "
"files."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, socraíonn sé seo OrcaSlicer mar an feidhmchlár "
"réamhshocraithe chun comhaid 3MF a oscailt."

# AI Translated
msgid "Associate DRC files to OrcaSlicer"
msgstr "Comhcheangail comhaid DRC le OrcaSlicer"

# AI Translated
msgid "If enabled, sets OrcaSlicer as default application to open DRC files."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, socraíonn sé OrcaSlicer mar an feidhmchlár "
"réamhshocraithe chun comhaid DRC a oscailt."

# AI Translated
msgid "Associate STL files to OrcaSlicer"
msgstr "Comhcheangail comhaid STL le OrcaSlicer"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, this sets OrcaSlicer as the default application to open STL "
"files."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, socraíonn sé seo OrcaSlicer mar an feidhmchlár "
"réamhshocraithe chun comhaid STL a oscailt."

# AI Translated
msgid "Associate STEP files to OrcaSlicer"
msgstr "Comhcheangail comhaid STEP le OrcaSlicer"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, this sets OrcaSlicer as the default application to open STEP "
"files."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, socraíonn sé seo OrcaSlicer mar an feidhmchlár "
"réamhshocraithe chun comhaid STEP a oscailt."

# AI Translated
msgid "Associate web links to OrcaSlicer"
msgstr "Comhcheangail naisc ghréasáin le OrcaSlicer"

# AI Translated
msgid "Behaviour"
msgstr "Iompar"

# AI Translated
msgid "Auto flush after changing..."
msgstr "Sruthlú uathoibríoch tar éis athrú..."

# AI Translated
msgid "Auto calculate flushing volumes when selected values changed"
msgstr ""
"Ríomh toirteanna sruthlaithe go huathoibríoch nuair a athraítear na "
"luachanna roghnaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Auto arrange plate after cloning"
msgstr "Socraigh an pláta go huathoibríoch tar éis clónála"

# AI Translated
msgid "Auto slice after changes"
msgstr "Slisnigh go huathoibríoch tar éis athruithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, OrcaSlicer will re-slice automatically whenever slicing-related "
"settings change."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, athshlisneoidh OrcaSlicer go huathoibríoch aon uair a "
"athraíonn socruithe a bhaineann le slisniú."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Delay in seconds before auto slicing starts, allowing multiple edits to be "
"grouped. Use 0 to slice immediately."
msgstr ""
"Moill i soicindí sula dtosaíonn an slisniú uathoibríoch, ionas gur féidir "
"eagarthóireachtaí iolracha a ghrúpáil. Úsáid 0 chun slisniú láithreach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Show options when adding a primitive"
msgstr "Taispeáin roghanna nuair a chuirtear bunchruth leis"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, a dialog asks for the dimensions of a primitive shape before it "
"is added."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, iarrann dialóg toisí bunchrutha sula gcuirtear leis é."

# AI Translated
msgid "Remove mixed temperature restriction"
msgstr "Bain an srian teochta measctha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"With this option enabled, you can print materials with a large temperature "
"difference together."
msgstr ""
"Leis an rogha seo cumasaithe, is féidir leat ábhair le difríocht mhór "
"teochta a phriontáil le chéile."

# AI Translated
msgid "Remember last print action"
msgstr "Cuimhnigh ar an ngníomh priontála deireanach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, OrcaSlicer will remember the last selected option in the print "
"button's dropdown (e.g. Print, Export plate sliced file, Export G-code file) "
"and use it as the default on next startup."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, cuimhneoidh OrcaSlicer ar an rogha dheireanach a "
"roghnaíodh i roghchlár anuas an chnaipe priontála (m.sh. Priontáil, "
"Easpórtáil comhad slisnithe an phláta, Easpórtáil comhad G-code) agus "
"úsáidfidh sé í mar réamhshocrú ag an gcéad tosú eile."

# AI Translated
msgid "Default view type"
msgstr "Cineál amhairc réamhshocraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The color scheme the sliced preview opens with.\n"
"Automatic: Filament for multi material prints, Line Type for single material "
"ones.\n"
"Last used: the view type you selected last.\n"
"Any other value always opens that view type.\n"
"You can still switch the view type in the preview afterwards."
msgstr ""
"An scéim dathanna lena n-osclaítear an réamhamharc slisnithe.\n"
"Uathoibríoch: Filiméad do phriontaí ilábhair, Cineál Líne do chinn aon "
"ábhair.\n"
"Úsáidte go deireanach: an cineál amhairc a roghnaigh tú go deireanach.\n"
"Osclaíonn aon luach eile an cineál amhairc sin i gcónaí.\n"
"Is féidir leat an cineál amhairc a athrú sa réamhamharc ina dhiaidh sin fós."

# AI Translated
msgid "Dim lower layers"
msgstr "Doiléirigh na sraitheanna íochtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When scrubbing the layer slider in the sliced preview, render the layers "
"below the current one darkened so that only the layer being viewed is shown "
"at full brightness."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bhogtar sleamhnán na sraitheanna sa réamhamharc slisnithe, rindreáil "
"na sraitheanna faoin gceann reatha dorchaithe ionas nach dtaispeántar ach an "
"tsraith atá á féachaint ag gile iomlán."

# AI Translated
msgid "Dimmed layer brightness"
msgstr "Gile na sraitheanna doiléirithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"How brightly the dimmed layers are rendered when \"Dim lower layers\" is "
"enabled.\n"
"99% is barely darkened, 0% renders them black. Capped at 99% because 100% "
"would be the same as disabling the option."
msgstr ""
"Cé chomh geal a rindreáiltear na sraitheanna doiléirithe nuair atá "
"\"Doiléirigh na sraitheanna íochtair\" cumasaithe.\n"
"Is ar éigean a dhorchaítear 99%, rindreálann 0% dubh iad. Teorannaithe ag "
"99% mar go mbeadh 100% mar an gcéanna leis an rogha a dhíchumasú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Preset"
msgstr "Réamhshocrú"

# AI Translated
msgid "Remember printer configuration"
msgstr "Cuimhnigh ar chumraíocht an phrintéara"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, Orca will remember and switch filament/process configuration for "
"each printer automatically."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, cuimhneoidh Orca ar chumraíocht filiméid/próisis gach "
"printéara agus athróidh sé go huathoibríoch í."

# AI Translated
msgid "Group user filament presets"
msgstr "Grúpáil réamhshocruithe filiméid úsáideora"

# AI Translated
msgid "Group user filament presets based on selection"
msgstr "Grúpáil réamhshocruithe filiméid úsáideora bunaithe ar an rogha"

# AI Translated
msgid "By type"
msgstr "De réir cineáil"

# AI Translated
msgid "By vendor"
msgstr "De réir díoltóra"

# AI Translated
msgid "Optimize filaments area height for..."
msgstr "Optamaigh airde limistéar na bhfiliméad do..."

# AI Translated
msgid "filaments"
msgstr "filiméid"

# AI Translated
msgid "Optimizes filament area maximum height by chosen filament count."
msgstr ""
"Optamaíonn sé uasairde limistéar na bhfiliméad de réir líon na bhfiliméad "
"roghnaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Show shared profiles notification"
msgstr "Taispeáin fógra faoi phróifílí comhroinnte"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Show a notification with a link to browse shared profiles when the selected "
"printer is changed."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin fógra le nasc chun próifílí comhroinnte a bhrabhsáil nuair a "
"athraítear an printéir roghnaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Visible plugin pages"
msgstr "Leathanaigh bhreiseán infheicthe"

# AI Translated
msgid "pages"
msgstr "leathanaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Number of plugin pages shown as fixed tabs before the remaining pages "
"collapse into a dropdown on the last tab."
msgstr ""
"Líon na leathanach breiseán a thaispeántar mar chluaisíní seasta sula "
"ndéantar na leathanaigh eile a laghdú i roghchlár anuas ar an gcluaisín "
"deireanach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Draw mate connectors as a face"
msgstr "Tarraing nascóirí cúplála mar aghaidh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"In the Design tab, draw a mate connector as a small face instead of the "
"conventional disc with a roll quadrant. A face shows its orientation at a "
"glance, without learning the disc convention. Turn this off for the "
"conventional CAD representation."
msgstr ""
"Sa chluaisín Dearadh, tarraing nascóir cúplála mar aghaidh bheag in ionad an "
"diosca thraidisiúnta le ceathramhán rolla. Taispeánann aghaidh a treoshuíomh "
"d'aon súil, gan coinbhinsiún an diosca a fhoghlaim. Múch é seo don léiriú "
"CAD traidisiúnta."

# AI Translated
msgid "Auto-close sketch loops"
msgstr "Dún lúba sceitse go huathoibríoch"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Treat sketch endpoints within 0.001 mm as one joint and weld the loop shut. "
"Off: only exactly coincident endpoints join, so a loop with a tiny gap is "
"shown as open instead of being closed for you. Saved with each design; "
"applies to designs started after the change."
msgstr ""
"Caith le críochphointí sceitse laistigh de 0.001 mm mar alt amháin agus "
"táthaigh an lúb dúnta. As: ní cheanglaítear ach críochphointí atá "
"comhtharlaitheach go díreach, mar sin taispeántar lúb le bearna bhídeach mar "
"lúb oscailte seachas í a dhúnadh duit. Sábháiltear é le gach dearadh; "
"baineann sé le dearaí a thosaítear tar éis an athraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Speed dial"
msgstr "Diailiú tapa"

# AI Translated
msgid "Open the Speed Dial from the keyboard"
msgstr "Oscail an Diailiú Tapa ón méarchlár"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When enabled, the Speed Dial keyboard shortcut (Space by default) opens the "
"action search from any page."
msgstr ""
"Nuair atá sé cumasaithe, osclaíonn aicearra méarchláir an Diailithe Thapa "
"(Space de réir réamhshocraithe) cuardach na ngníomhartha ó aon leathanach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Recent actions"
msgstr "Gníomhartha le déanaí"

# AI Translated
#. TRN Unit shown after the number of recent actions, as in "5 actions".
msgid "actions"
msgstr "gníomhartha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"How many recently launched actions to show at the top of the Speed Dial. Set "
"to 0 to hide recent actions."
msgstr ""
"Cé mhéad gníomh a seoladh le déanaí le taispeáint ag barr an Diailithe "
"Thapa. Socraigh go 0 chun gníomhartha le déanaí a fholú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "Ceamara"

# AI Translated
msgid "Touchpad"
msgstr "Ceap tadhaill"

# AI Translated
msgid "Camera style"
msgstr "Stíl an cheamara"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Select camera navigation style.\n"
"Default: LMB+move for rotation, RMB/MMB+move for panning.\n"
"Touchpad: Alt+move for rotation, Shift+move for panning."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh stíl nascleanúna an cheamara.\n"
"Réamhshocrú: LMB+bogadh le rothlú, RMB/MMB+bogadh le panú.\n"
"Ceap tadhaill: Alt+bogadh le rothlú, Shift+bogadh le panú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Orbit speed multiplier"
msgstr "Iolraitheoir luas fithise"

# AI Translated
msgid "Multiplies the orbit speed for finer or coarser camera movement."
msgstr ""
"Iolraíonn sé luas na fithise le haghaidh gluaiseacht cheamara níos míne nó "
"níos gairbhe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Zoom to mouse position"
msgstr "Zúmáil go suíomh na luiche"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Zoom in towards the mouse pointer's position in the 3D view, rather than the "
"2D window center."
msgstr ""
"Zúmáil isteach i dtreo shuíomh phointeoir na luiche san amharc 3T, seachas "
"lár na fuinneoige 2T."

# AI Translated
msgid "Use free camera"
msgstr "Úsáid ceamara saor"

# AI Translated
msgid "If enabled, use free camera. If not enabled, use constrained camera."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, úsáid ceamara saor. Mura bhfuil, úsáid ceamara srianta."

# AI Translated
msgid "Reverse mouse zoom"
msgstr "Aisiompaigh zúmáil na luiche"

# AI Translated
msgid "If enabled, reverses the direction of zoom with mouse wheel."
msgstr "Má tá sé cumasaithe, aisiompaíonn sé treo na zúmála le roth na luiche."

# AI Translated
msgid "Pan"
msgstr "Panaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid "Left Mouse Drag"
msgstr "Tarraingt le Cnaipe Clé na Luiche"

# AI Translated
msgid "Set the action that dragging the left mouse button should perform."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an gníomh ba cheart a dhéanamh nuair a tharraingítear cnaipe clé na "
"luiche."

# AI Translated
msgid "Middle Mouse Drag"
msgstr "Tarraingt le Cnaipe Lár na Luiche"

# AI Translated
msgid "Set the action that dragging the middle mouse button should perform."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an gníomh ba cheart a dhéanamh nuair a tharraingítear cnaipe lár na "
"luiche."

# AI Translated
msgid "Right Mouse Drag"
msgstr "Tarraingt le Cnaipe Deas na Luiche"

# AI Translated
msgid "Set the action that dragging the right mouse button should perform."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an gníomh ba cheart a dhéanamh nuair a tharraingítear cnaipe deas "
"na luiche."

# AI Translated
msgid "Keyboard"
msgstr "Méarchlár"

# AI Translated
msgid "Keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "Aicearraí méarchláir"

# AI Translated
msgid "Choose the key for each action."
msgstr "Roghnaigh an eochair do gach gníomh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Graphics"
msgstr "Grafaic"

# AI Translated
msgid "Smooth normals"
msgstr "Normail mhíne"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Applies smooth normals to the model.\n"
"\n"
"Requires manual scene reload to take effect (right-click on 3D view → "
"\"Reload All\")."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann sé normail mhíne i bhfeidhm ar an tsamhail.\n"
"\n"
"Teastaíonn athlódáil láimhe an radhairc chun éifeacht a bheith leis "
"(deaschliceáil ar an amharc 3T → \"Athlódáil Gach Rud\")."

# AI Translated
msgid "Translucent filaments"
msgstr "Filiméid tréshoilseacha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Draw the toolpaths of filaments whose color is partly transparent as "
"see-through, as the 3D view draws their objects. Turn it off to draw every "
"filament opaque."
msgstr ""
"Tarraing conairí uirlise na bhfiliméad a bhfuil a ndath trédhearcach go "
"páirteach mar conairí tréshoilseacha, mar a tharraingíonn an t-amharc 3T a "
"réada. Múch é chun gach filiméad a tharraingt teimhneach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Phong shading"
msgstr "Scáthú Phong"

# AI Translated
msgid "Uses Phong shading inside realistic view."
msgstr "Úsáideann sé scáthú Phong san amharc réalaíoch."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable in Preview"
msgstr "Cumasaigh i Réamhamharc"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Also applies realistic view to the Preview canvas, not just Prepare.\n"
"Preview draws the full toolpath geometry, so shadows and SSAO cost "
"considerably more there than on a plain model."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann sé an t-amharc réalaíoch i bhfeidhm ar chanbhás an Réamhamhairc "
"freisin, ní hamháin ar Ullmhaigh.\n"
"Tarraingíonn Réamhamharc céimseata iomlán na gconairí uirlise, mar sin is mó "
"go mór costas na scáthanna agus SSAO ansin ná ar ghnáthshamhail."

# AI Translated
msgid "SSAO ambient occlusion"
msgstr "Iamh comhthimpeallach SSAO"

# AI Translated
msgid "Applies SSAO in realistic view."
msgstr "Cuireann sé SSAO i bhfeidhm san amharc réalaíoch."

# AI Translated
#. TRN Realistic-view shadow mode: the light stays fixed in the scene.
msgid "Static"
msgstr "Statach"

# AI Translated
#. TRN Realistic-view shadow mode: the light turns with the camera.
msgid "Orbit"
msgstr "Fithis"

# AI Translated
msgid "Shadows"
msgstr "Scáthanna"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Renders cast shadows on the plate, other objects, and each object onto "
"itself in realistic view.\n"
"Static: the light stays fixed in the world, so the shadows are only "
"recomputed when the scene changes.\n"
"Orbit: the light turns with the camera, recomputing the shadows every frame "
"the camera moves."
msgstr ""
"Rindreálann sé scáthanna teilgthe ar an bpláta, ar réada eile, agus gach "
"réad air féin san amharc réalaíoch.\n"
"Statach: fanann an solas socraithe sa domhan, mar sin ní athríomhtar na "
"scáthanna ach nuair a athraíonn an radharc.\n"
"Fithis: casann an solas leis an gceamara, ag athríomh na scáthanna i ngach "
"fráma a mbogann an ceamara."

# AI Translated
msgid "Glossy toolpaths"
msgstr "Conairí uirlise snasta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Highlights the toolpaths in Preview as glossy plastic in realistic view.\n"
"Off, a translucent filament is matte and an opaque one keeps the highlight "
"of the plain view."
msgstr ""
"Aibhsíonn sé na conairí uirlise sa Réamhamharc mar phlaisteach snasta san "
"amharc réalaíoch.\n"
"As, bíonn filiméad tréshoilseach neamhshnasta agus coinníonn ceann "
"teimhneach aibhsiú an ghnáthamhairc."

# AI Translated
msgid "Anti-aliasing"
msgstr "Frith-ailiasáil"

# AI Translated
msgid "MSAA Multiplier"
msgstr "Iolraitheoir MSAA"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Set the Multi-Sample Anti-Aliasing level.\n"
"Higher values result in smoother edges, but the impact on performance is "
"exponential.\n"
"Lower values improve performance, at the cost of jagged edges.\n"
"If disabled, its recommended to enable FXAA to reduce jagged edges with "
"minimal performance impact.\n"
"\n"
"Requires application restart."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh leibhéal na Frith-ailiasála Ilsampla.\n"
"Mar thoradh ar luachanna níos airde bíonn imill níos míne, ach tá an "
"tionchar ar fheidhmíocht easpónantúil.\n"
"Feabhsaíonn luachanna níos ísle an fheidhmíocht, ar chostas imill gharbha.\n"
"Má tá sé díchumasaithe, moltar FXAA a chumasú chun imill gharbha a laghdú "
"gan mórán tionchair ar fheidhmíocht.\n"
"\n"
"Teastaíonn atosú an fheidhmchláir."

# AI Translated
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Díchumasaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "FXAA post-processing"
msgstr "Iarphróiseáil FXAA"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Applies Fast Approximate Anti-Aliasing as a screen-space pass.\n"
"Useful for disabling or reducing the MSAA setting to improve performance.\n"
"\n"
"Takes effect immediately."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann sé Frith-ailiasáil Mhear Chomhfhogasach i bhfeidhm mar phas spás "
"scáileáin.\n"
"Úsáideach chun socrú MSAA a dhíchumasú nó a laghdú chun feidhmíocht a "
"fheabhsú.\n"
"\n"
"Tagann sé i bhfeidhm láithreach."

# AI Translated
msgid "FPS"
msgstr "FPS"

# AI Translated
msgid "FPS cap"
msgstr "Teorainn FPS"

# AI Translated
msgid "(0 = unlimited)"
msgstr "(0 = gan teorainn)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Limits viewport frame rate to reduce GPU load and power usage.\n"
"Set to 0 for unlimited frame rate."
msgstr ""
"Teorannaíonn sé ráta frámaí an amharcphoirt chun ualach an GPU agus úsáid "
"cumhachta a laghdú.\n"
"Socraigh go 0 le haghaidh ráta frámaí gan teorainn."

# AI Translated
msgid "Reuse the 3D scene while idle"
msgstr "Athúsáid an radharc 3T agus é díomhaoin"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Skips redrawing the 3D scene when only the mouse cursor moves over the "
"viewport, and reuses the previous frame's scene instead. Reduces GPU load.\n"
"Disable it if the viewport shows stale or missing contents.\n"
"\n"
"Takes effect immediately."
msgstr ""
"Scipeálann sé atarraingt an radhairc 3T nuair nach mbogann ach cúrsóir na "
"luiche thar an amharcphort, agus athúsáideann sé radharc an fhráma roimhe "
"sin ina ionad. Laghdaíonn sé ualach an GPU.\n"
"Díchumasaigh é má thaispeánann an t-amharcphort ábhar seanchaite nó ar "
"iarraidh.\n"
"\n"
"Tagann sé i bhfeidhm láithreach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Skip unchanged frames"
msgstr "Scipeáil frámaí gan athrú"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Skips drawing a frame altogether when it would be identical to the one "
"already on screen.\n"
"Only applies to frames that reuse the 3D scene, so it needs Reuse the 3D "
"scene while idle.\n"
"Disable it if a hover highlight, tooltip or animation stops updating.\n"
"\n"
"Takes effect immediately."
msgstr ""
"Scipeálann sé tarraingt fráma ar fad nuair a bheadh sé comhionann leis an "
"gceann atá ar an scáileán cheana.\n"
"Ní bhaineann sé ach le frámaí a athúsáideann an radharc 3T, mar sin "
"teastaíonn 'Athúsáid an radharc 3T agus é díomhaoin' uaidh.\n"
"Díchumasaigh é má stopann aibhsiú ainlithe, leid uirlise nó beochan ag "
"nuashonrú.\n"
"\n"
"Tagann sé i bhfeidhm láithreach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Show FPS overlay"
msgstr "Taispeáin forleagan FPS"

# AI Translated
msgid "Displays rendering counts in the top-right corner of the viewport."
msgstr ""
"Taispeánann sé comhaireamh rindreála i gcúinne uachtair ar dheis an "
"amharcphoirt."

# AI Translated
msgid "FPS: frames presented to the screen per second."
msgstr ""
"FPS: frámaí a chuirtear i láthair ar an scáileán in aghaidh an tsoicind."

# AI Translated
msgid "3D: frames per second that redrew the 3D scene."
msgstr "3T: frámaí in aghaidh an tsoicind a d'atarraing an radharc 3T."

# AI Translated
msgid "Show render timings"
msgstr "Taispeáin amanna rindreála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Displays how many milliseconds each part of a frame that redraws the 3D "
"scene takes, in the top-right corner of the viewport."
msgstr ""
"Taispeánann sé cé mhéad milleasoicind a thógann gach cuid d'fhráma a "
"atarraingíonn an radharc 3T, i gcúinne uachtair ar dheis an amharcphoirt."

# AI Translated
msgid "CPU: time spent issuing the drawing commands."
msgstr "CPU: an t-am a chaitear ag eisiúint na n-orduithe tarraingthe."

# AI Translated
msgid "GPU: time the graphics card spent running them."
msgstr "GPU: an t-am a chaith an cárta grafaicí á rith."

# AI Translated
msgid "Adds a small overhead to each frame while enabled."
msgstr "Cuireann sé forchostas beag le gach fráma fad atá sé cumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "3D scene benchmark"
msgstr "Tagarmharc an radhairc 3T"

# AI Translated
msgid "Run"
msgstr "Rith"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Replaces the current project with the OrcaSliced Combo, then measures the "
"frame rate and render timings while the camera turns around it in Prepare "
"and Preview, and while the layer slider moves through the sliced layers."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann sé an OrcaSliced Combo in ionad an tionscadail reatha, ansin "
"tomhaiseann sé an ráta frámaí agus na hamanna rindreála fad a chasann an "
"ceamara timpeall air in Ullmhaigh agus i Réamhamharc, agus fad a bhogann "
"sleamhnán na sraitheanna trí na sraitheanna slisnithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Login region"
msgstr "Réigiún logála isteach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Stealth mode"
msgstr "Mód folaitheach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This disables all cloud features, including Orca Cloud profile syncing. "
"Users who prefer to work entirely offline can enable this option.\n"
"\n"
"Note: When Stealth Mode is enabled, your user profiles will not be backed up "
"to Orca Cloud."
msgstr ""
"Díchumasaíonn sé seo gach gné néil, sioncronú próifílí Orca Cloud san "
"áireamh. Is féidir le húsáideoirí ar fearr leo oibriú as líne go hiomlán an "
"rogha seo a chumasú.\n"
"\n"
"Nóta: Nuair atá an Mód Folaitheach cumasaithe, ní dhéanfar cúltaca de do "
"phróifílí úsáideora in Orca Cloud."

# AI Translated
msgid "Hide login side panel"
msgstr "Folaigh an painéal taoibh logála isteach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Hide the login side panel on the home page."
msgstr "Folaigh an painéal taoibh logála isteach ar an leathanach baile."

# AI Translated
msgid "Network test"
msgstr "Tástáil líonra"

# AI Translated
msgid "Test"
msgstr "Tástáil"

# AI Translated
msgid "Cloud Providers"
msgstr "Soláthraithe Néil"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable Bambu Cloud"
msgstr "Cumasaigh Bambu Cloud"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Allow logging into Bambu Cloud alongside Orca Cloud. When enabled, a Bambu "
"login section appears on the homepage."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaigh logáil isteach i mBambu Cloud in éineacht le Orca Cloud. Nuair atá "
"sé cumasaithe, taispeántar rannán logála isteach Bambu ar an leathanach "
"baile."

# AI Translated
msgid "Update & sync"
msgstr "Nuashonrú agus sioncronú"

# AI Translated
msgid "Check for stable updates only"
msgstr "Seiceáil le haghaidh nuashonruithe cobhsaí amháin"

# AI Translated
msgid "Auto sync user presets (Printer/Filament/Process)"
msgstr ""
"Sioncronaigh réamhshocruithe úsáideora go huathoibríoch "
"(Printéir/Filiméad/Próiseas)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament sync mode"
msgstr "Mód sioncronaithe filiméid"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Choose whether sync updates both filament preset and color, or only color."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh an ndéanann an sioncronú réamhshocrú agus dath an fhiliméid araon "
"a nuashonrú, nó an dath amháin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament & Color"
msgstr "Filiméad agus Dath"

# AI Translated
msgid "Color only"
msgstr "Dath amháin"

# AI Translated
msgid "Update built-in presets automatically."
msgstr "Nuashonraigh réamhshocruithe ionsuite go huathoibríoch."

# AI Translated
msgid "Use encrypted file for token storage"
msgstr "Úsáid comhad criptithe chun comharthaí a stóráil"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Store authentication tokens in an encrypted file instead of the system "
"keychain. (Requires restart)"
msgstr ""
"Stóráil comharthaí fíordheimhnithe i gcomhad criptithe in ionad fháinne "
"eochracha an chórais. (Teastaíonn atosú)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Bambu network plug-in"
msgstr "Breiseán líonra Bambu"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable Bambu network plug-in"
msgstr "Cumasaigh breiseán líonra Bambu"

# AI Translated
msgid "Network plug-in version"
msgstr "Leagan an bhreiseáin líonra"

# AI Translated
msgid "Select the network plug-in version to use"
msgstr "Roghnaigh leagan an bhreiseáin líonra le húsáid"

# AI Translated
msgid "Developer"
msgstr "Forbróir"

# AI Translated
msgid "Skip AMS blacklist check"
msgstr "Scipeáil seiceáil dhubhliosta AMS"

# AI Translated
msgid "Show unsupported presets"
msgstr "Taispeáin réamhshocruithe nach dtacaítear leo"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Show incompatible/unsupported presets in the printer and filament dropdown "
"lists. These presets cannot be selected."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin réamhshocruithe neamh-chomhoiriúnacha/nach dtacaítear leo i "
"liostaí anuas an phrintéara agus an fhiliméid. Ní féidir na réamhshocruithe "
"seo a roghnú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Export statistics with G-code"
msgstr "Easpórtáil staitisticí le G-code"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, exporting a G-code file also writes its statistics as JSON next "
"to it, as <name>.statistics.json, and an exported sliced 3MF file holds them "
"inside: print time, filament and feature totals, and the same per layer and "
"per object."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, nuair a easpórtáiltear comhad G-code scríobhtar a "
"staitisticí mar JSON lena thaobh freisin, mar <name>.statistics.json, agus "
"coinníonn comhad 3MF slisnithe easpórtáilte iad istigh: am priontála, "
"iomláin filiméid agus gnéithe, agus an rud céanna in aghaidh na sraithe agus "
"in aghaidh an réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Experimental Features"
msgstr "Gnéithe Turgnamhacha"

# AI Translated
msgid "Keep painted feature after mesh change"
msgstr "Coinnigh an ghné phéinteáilte tar éis athrú mogalra"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Attempt to keep painted features (color/seam/support/fuzzy etc.) after "
"changing the object mesh (such as cut/reload from disk/simplify/fix etc.)\n"
"Highly experimental! Slow and may create artifact."
msgstr ""
"Déan iarracht gnéithe péinteáilte (dath/uaim/taca/clúmhach srl.) a "
"choinneáil tar éis mogalra an réada a athrú (mar ghearradh/athlódáil ón "
"diosca/simpliú/deisiú srl.)\n"
"An-turgnamhach! Mall agus d'fhéadfadh déantáin a chruthú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Use printer agents instead of print hosts"
msgstr "Úsáid gníomhairí printéara in ionad óstach priontála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Route print jobs for non-Bambu printers through printer plug-in agents "
"instead of the classic print-host upload flow.\n"
"When disabled, OrcaSlicer uses the legacy print-host behavior."
msgstr ""
"Ródaigh jabanna priontála do phrintéirí nach printéirí Bambu iad trí "
"ghníomhairí breiseáin printéara in ionad an tsreafa uaslódála clasaicigh trí "
"óstach priontála.\n"
"Nuair atá sé díchumasaithe, úsáideann OrcaSlicer an t-iompar oidhreachta "
"óstaigh priontála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Allow Abnormal Storage"
msgstr "Ceadaigh Stóras Neamhghnách"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This allows the use of Storage that is marked as abnormal by the Printer.\n"
"Use at your own risk, can cause issues!"
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn sé seo Stóras atá marcáilte mar neamhghnách ag an bPrintéir a "
"úsáid.\n"
"Úsáid ar do phriacal féin, d'fhéadfadh fadhbanna a chruthú!"

# AI Translated
msgid "Log Level"
msgstr "Leibhéal Logála"

# AI Translated
msgid "fatal"
msgstr "marfach"

# AI Translated
msgid "error"
msgstr "earráid"

# AI Translated
msgid "warning"
msgstr "rabhadh"

# AI Translated
msgid "debug"
msgstr "dífhabhtú"

# AI Translated
msgid "trace"
msgstr "rianú"

# AI Translated
msgid "Debug"
msgstr "Dífhabhtú"

# AI Translated
msgid "Sync settings"
msgstr "Socruithe sioncronaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "User sync"
msgstr "Sioncronú úsáideora"

# AI Translated
msgid "Preset sync"
msgstr "Sioncronú réamhshocruithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Preferences sync"
msgstr "Sioncronú sainroghanna"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable SSL(MQTT)"
msgstr "Cumasaigh SSL(MQTT)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable SSL(FTP)"
