# AI Translated
# Needs human review: check term 'ramming'
msgid ""
"Ramming denotes the rapid extrusion just before a tool change in a "
"single-extruder MM printer. Its purpose is to properly shape the end of the "
"unloaded filament so it does not prevent insertion of the new filament and "
"can itself be reinserted later. This phase is important and different "
"materials can require different extrusion speeds to get the good shape. For "
"this reason, the extrusion rates during ramming are adjustable.\n"
"\n"
"This is an expert-level setting, incorrect adjustment will likely lead to "
"jams, extruder wheel grinding into filament etc."
msgstr ""
"Is éard is ramáil ann an t-easbhrú tapa díreach roimh athrú uirlise i "
"bprintéir MM aon easbhrúiteora. Is é a chuspóir deireadh an fhiliméid "
"díluchtaithe a mhúnlú i gceart ionas nach gcuireann sé bac ar chur isteach "
"an fhiliméid nua agus gur féidir é féin a athchur isteach níos déanaí. Tá an "
"chéim seo tábhachtach agus d'fhéadfadh luasanna easbhrúite éagsúla a bheith "
"de dhíth ar ábhair éagsúla chun an cruth maith a fháil. Ar an gcúis seo, is "
"féidir na rátaí easbhrúite le linn ramála a choigeartú.\n"
"\n"
"Is socrú do shaineolaithe é seo; is dócha go dtiocfaidh calcanna, roth an "
"easbhrúiteora ag meilt isteach san fhiliméad srl. as coigeartú mícheart."

