# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Multi-color prints in IDEX/IQEX parallel modes require each filament to have "
"its own dedicated physical extruder. Two or more of the active filaments are "
"routed to the same physical head via the printer's physical extruder map (an "
"MMU/AFC manifold), which the slaved gantry cannot follow."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn easbhrúiteoir fisiceach dá chuid féin ó gach filiméad do "
"phriontaí ildaite i móid chomhthreomhara IDEX/IQEX. Tá dhá cheann nó níos mó "
"de na filiméid ghníomhacha ródaithe chuig an gceann fisiceach céanna trí "
"mhapa easbhrúiteoirí fisiceacha an phrintéara (iomadúil MMU/AFC), rud nach "
"féidir leis an ngantra sclábhaithe a leanúint."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The active IDEX/IQEX mode does not define a primary tool, so multi-color "
"printing cannot be scheduled. Open the printer settings IDEX/IQEX Modes "
"editor and assign a Primary role to one tool."
msgstr ""
"Ní shainmhíníonn an mód gníomhach IDEX/IQEX príomhuirlis, mar sin ní féidir "
"priontáil ildaite a sceidealú. Oscail eagarthóir Móid IDEX/IQEX i socruithe "
"an phrintéara agus sann ról Príomha d'uirlis amháin."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Multi-color in this mode isn't a parallel-print scenario — all of the active "
"tools sit on a single gantry, so there's no second gantry being copied or "
"mirrored to. Switch the plate to Primary mode for multi-color printing on a "
"single gantry, or define an IDEX/IQEX mode that includes tools on a second "
"gantry."
msgstr ""
"Ní cás priontála comhthreomhaire é ildaite sa mhód seo — tá na huirlisí "
"gníomhacha go léir ar ghantra amháin, mar sin níl aon dara gantra á "
"chóipeáil ná á scáthánú. Athraigh an pláta go mód Príomha le haghaidh "
"priontáil ildaite ar ghantra amháin, nó sainmhínigh mód IDEX/IQEX a "
"chuimsíonn uirlisí ar dhara gantra."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Multi-color prints in IDEX/IQEX parallel modes require a Span tool on the "
"primary's gantry — without one, the mode doesn't declare a within-gantry "
"multicolor partner. Either reduce the print to a single filament, switch to "
"Primary mode, or open the printer settings IDEX/IQEX Modes editor and mark a "
"tool on the primary's gantry as Span."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn uirlis Réise ar ghantra na príomhuirlise do phriontaí ildaite i "
"móid chomhthreomhara IDEX/IQEX — gan ceann, ní fhógraíonn an mód comhpháirtí "
"ildaite laistigh den ghantra. Laghdaigh an phriontáil go filiméad amháin, "
"athraigh go mód Príomha, nó oscail eagarthóir Móid IDEX/IQEX i socruithe an "
"phrintéara agus marcáil uirlis ar ghantra na príomhuirlise mar Réise."

# AI Translated
#. TRN %1% is a list of tools such as "T0/T1", %2% a filament number.
#, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"In this Span mode, colors are printed only by %1%, but filament %2% isn't "
"routed to any tool. Use filaments routed to %1%, or switch this plate to "
"Primary mode."
msgstr ""
"Sa mhód Réise seo, ní phriontálann ach %1% dathanna, ach níl filiméad %2% "
"ródaithe chuig aon uirlis. Úsáid filiméid atá ródaithe chuig %1%, nó "
"athraigh an pláta seo go mód Príomha."

# AI Translated
#. TRN %1% is a list of tools such as "T0/T1", %2% a filament number, %3% a tool number.
#, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"In this Span mode, colors are printed only by %1%, but filament %2% is "
"routed to T%3%. Use filaments routed to %1%, or switch this plate to Primary "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"Sa mhód Réise seo, ní phriontálann ach %1% dathanna, ach tá filiméad %2% "
"ródaithe chuig T%3%. Úsáid filiméid atá ródaithe chuig %1%, nó athraigh an "
"pláta seo go mód Príomha."

