# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Selected nozzle temperatures are incompatible. Each filament's nozzle "
"temperature must fall within the recommended nozzle temperature range of the "
"other filaments. Otherwise, nozzle clogging or printer damage may occur."
msgstr ""
"Níl na teochtaí soic roghnaithe comhoiriúnach. Caithfidh teocht soic gach "
"filiméid a bheith laistigh de raon molta teochta soic na bhfiliméad eile. "
"Seachas sin, d'fhéadfadh an soc calcadh nó damáiste a dhéanamh don phrintéir."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Invalid recommended nozzle temperature range. The lower bound must be lower "
"than the upper bound."
msgstr ""
"Raon molta teochta soic neamhbhailí. Caithfidh an teorainn íochtair a bheith "
"níos ísle ná an teorainn uachtair."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If you still want to print, you can enable the option in Preferences / "
"Control / Slicing / Remove mixed temperature restriction."
msgstr ""
"Más mian leat priontáil fós, is féidir leat an rogha a chumasú i "
"Sainroghanna / Rialú / Slisniú / Bain an srian teochta measctha."

# AI Translated
msgid "No extrusions under current settings."
msgstr "Níl aon easbhruthanna faoi na socruithe reatha."

# AI Translated
#. TRN %1% is the filament number as shown in the filament list, starting from 1.
#, possible-boost-format
msgid "The flow ratio of filament %1% must be greater than 0."
msgstr "Caithfidh cóimheas sreafa fhiliméad %1% a bheith níos mó ná 0."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Mixed filaments are not supported in IDEX/IQEX parallel modes. Switch this "
"plate to Primary mode."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaítear le filiméid mheasctha i móid chomhthreomhara IDEX/IQEX. "
"Athraigh an pláta seo go mód Príomha."

# AI Translated
#. TRN %1% is the IDEX/IQEX mode name, %2% the tool number.
#, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"IDEX/IQEX mode \"%1%\" prints with T%2%, but none of this plate's filaments "
"are on a configured tool. Assign a filament loaded on T%2%, or switch this "
"plate to Primary mode."
msgstr ""
"Priontálann mód IDEX/IQEX \"%1%\" le T%2%, ach níl aon cheann d'fhiliméid an "
"phláta seo ar uirlis chumraithe. Sann filiméad atá lódáilte ar T%2%, nó "
"athraigh an pláta seo go mód Príomha."

# AI Translated
#. TRN %1% is the IDEX/IQEX mode name, %2% the tool number, %3% a list of tools such as "T1, T2".
#, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"IDEX/IQEX mode \"%1%\" prints with T%2%, but this plate's filaments are on "
"%3%. Assign a filament loaded on T%2%, or switch this plate to Primary mode."
msgstr ""
"Priontálann mód IDEX/IQEX \"%1%\" le T%2%, ach tá filiméid an phláta seo ar "
"%3%. Sann filiméad atá lódáilte ar T%2%, nó athraigh an pláta seo go mód "
"Príomha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Raft is not compatible with belt printer mode."
msgstr "Níl rafta comhoiriúnach le mód printéara crios."

# AI Translated
msgid "Draft shield is not compatible with belt printer mode."
msgstr "Níl sciath dréachta comhoiriúnach le mód printéara crios."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Brim is not compatible with spiral vase mode on a belt printer. Disable one "
"of them."
msgstr ""
"Níl imeall comhoiriúnach le mód vása bíseach ar phrintéir crios. "
"Díchumasaigh ceann acu."

# AI Translated
msgid "The belt is too steep for a brim, so no brim will be generated."
msgstr "Tá an crios ró-ghéar d'imeall, mar sin ní ghinfear aon imeall."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"A brim is only generated when the belt is tilted. Set a belt tilt angle, or "
"remove the brim setting."
msgstr ""
"Ní ghintear imeall ach nuair atá an crios claonta. Socraigh uillinn chlaonta "
"an chreasa, nó bain socrú an imill."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Belt printers support outer and inner brim only. Auto, Mouse ear and Painted "
"brim are printed as Outer brim only, using Brim width."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaíonn printéirí crios ach le himeall seachtrach agus inmheánach. "
"Priontáiltear imill Uathoibríoch, Cluas luiche agus Péinteáilte mar Imeall "
"seachtrach amháin, ag úsáid Leithead an imill."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Brim-object gap separates the leading brim from the object's leading edge, "
"which is the edge it is meant to anchor. Set the gap to 0 when using leading "
"brim length."
msgstr ""
"Scarann bearna imeall-réada an t-imeall tosaigh ó imeall tosaigh an réada, "
"arb é an t-imeall atá i gceist leis a ancaireú. Socraigh an bhearna go 0 "
"nuair a úsáidtear fad imill tosaigh."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Leading brim length extends ahead of each object along the belt, and Arrange "
"does not reserve that space. Leave room between objects."
msgstr ""
"Síneann fad an imill tosaigh roimh gach réad feadh an chreasa, agus ní "
"chuireann Socraigh an spás sin in áirithe. Fág spás idir réada."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"\"Leading edge only\" brim applies to belt printers. On this printer it is "
"printed as an ordinary outer brim."
msgstr ""
"Baineann imeall \"Imeall tosaigh amháin\" le printéirí crios. Ar an "
"bprintéir seo priontáiltear é mar ghnáthimeall seachtrach."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"A gradient mixed filament is used, but 'Mixed color sublayer' is disabled. "
"The gradient will not be printed."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear filiméad measctha grádáin, ach tá 'Fo-shraith dathanna measctha' "
"díchumasaithe. Ní phriontálfar an grádán."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Smooth mode of timelapse is not supported when \"by object\" sequence is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaítear le mód mín na am-mhoille nuair atá seicheamh \"de réir réada\" "
"cumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Clumping detection is not supported when \"by object\" sequence is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaítear le brath cnapánaithe nuair atá seicheamh \"de réir réada\" "
"cumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The belt purge tower is not generated in \"By object\" print sequence; "
"filament changes will not be purged."
msgstr ""
"Ní ghintear túr sruthlaithe an chreasa i seicheamh priontála \"De réir "
"réada\"; ní shruthlófar athruithe filiméid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The belt purge tower is enabled but the project has no purge tower object; "
"filament changes will not be purged. Open the project in the application to "
"generate the tower."
msgstr ""
"Tá túr sruthlaithe an chreasa cumasaithe ach níl aon réad túir shruthlaithe "
"sa tionscadal; ní shruthlófar athruithe filiméid. Oscail an tionscadal san "
"fheidhmchlár chun an túr a ghiniúint."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The project contains multiple managed belt purge towers. Reload the plate or "
"toggle the belt purge tower off and on to regenerate it."
msgstr ""
"Tá túir shruthlaithe chreasa bhainistithe iolracha sa tionscadal. Athlódáil "
"an pláta nó múch agus cas air túr sruthlaithe an chreasa chun é a "
"athghiniúint."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enabling both precise Z height and the prime tower may cause slicing errors."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh earráidí slisnithe teacht as airde bheacht Z agus an túr "
"príomhála a chumasú araon."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"A prime tower is required for clumping detection; otherwise, there may be "
"flaws on the model."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn túr príomhála do bhrath cnapánaithe; seachas sin, d'fhéadfadh "
"lochtanna a bheith ar an tsamhail."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Please select \"By object\" print sequence to print multiple objects in "
"spiral vase mode."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh seicheamh priontála \"De réir réada\" chun réada iolracha a "
"phriontáil i mód vása bíseach."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Spiral (vase) mode does not work when an object contains more than one "
"material."
msgstr ""
"Ní oibríonn mód bíseach (vása) nuair atá níos mó ná ábhar amháin i réad."

# AI Translated
#. TRN %1% is the object name.
#, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"Spiral vase mode needs no sparse infill, one wall loop and no top shell "
"layers, but the object %1% uses other values, so it will not print as a "
"continuous spiral."
msgstr ""
"Ní theastaíonn líonadh tanaí, teastaíonn lúb balla amháin agus ní "
"theastaíonn sraitheanna blaoisce uachtair ó mhód vása bíseach, ach úsáideann "
"an réad %1% luachanna eile, mar sin ní phriontálfar é mar bhís leanúnach."

# AI Translated
#, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"While the object %1% itself fits the build volume, it exceeds the maximum "
"build volume height because of material shrinkage compensation."
msgstr ""
"Cé go n-oireann an réad %1% féin do thoirt na tógála, sáraíonn sé uasairde "
"thoirt na tógála mar gheall ar chúiteamh crapadh an ábhair."

# AI Translated
#, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"While the object %1% itself fits the build volume, its last layer exceeds "
"the maximum build volume height."
msgstr ""
"Cé go n-oireann an réad %1% féin do thoirt na tógála, sáraíonn a shraith "
"dheireanach uasairde thoirt na tógála."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"You might want to reduce the size of your model or change current print "
"settings and retry."
msgstr ""
"B'fhéidir gur mhaith leat méid do shamhla a laghdú nó na socruithe priontála "
"reatha a athrú agus triail eile a bhaint as."

# AI Translated
#, possible-boost-format
msgid "The object %1% exceeds the maximum build volume height."
msgstr "Sáraíonn an réad %1% uasairde thoirt na tógála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Variable layer height is not supported with Organic supports."
msgstr "Ní thacaítear le hairde sraithe athraitheach le tacaí Orgánacha."

# AI Translated
msgid "The wipe tower filament cannot be a mixed filament."
msgstr "Ní féidir le filiméad an túir ghlanta a bheith ina fhiliméad measctha."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Different nozzle diameters and different filament diameters may not work "
"well when the prime tower is enabled. It's very experimental, so please "
"proceed with caution."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh nach n-oibreodh trastomhais éagsúla soic agus trastomhais "
"éagsúla filiméid go maith nuair atá an túr príomhála cumasaithe. Tá sé "
"an-turgnamhach, mar sin lean ar aghaidh go cúramach."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower is currently only supported with the relative extruder "
"addressing (use_relative_e_distances=1)."
msgstr ""
"Faoi láthair ní thacaítear leis an Túr Glanta ach le seoladh coibhneasta an "
"easbhrúiteora (use_relative_e_distances=1)."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Ooze prevention is only supported with the wipe tower when "
"'single_extruder_multi_material' is off."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaítear le cosc úscadh leis an túr glanta ach nuair atá "
"'single_extruder_multi_material' múchta."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The prime tower is currently only supported for the Marlin, RepRap/Sprinter, "
"RepRapFirmware and Repetier G-code flavors."
msgstr ""
"Faoi láthair ní thacaítear leis an túr príomhála ach do bhlasanna G-code "
"Marlin, RepRap/Sprinter, RepRapFirmware agus Repetier."

# AI Translated
msgid "A prime tower is not supported in “By object” print."
msgstr "Ní thacaítear le túr príomhála i bpriontáil “De réir réada”."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"A prime tower is not supported when adaptive layer height is on. It requires "
"that all objects have the same layer height."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaítear le túr príomhála nuair atá airde sraithe oiriúnaitheach ar "
"siúl. Teastaíonn an airde sraithe chéanna ó gach réad."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"A prime tower requires any “support gap” to be a multiple of layer height."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn ó thúr príomhála gur iolraí d'airde na sraithe aon “bhearna taca”."

# AI Translated
msgid "A prime tower requires that all objects have the same layer height."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn ó thúr príomhála go mbeadh an airde sraithe chéanna ag gach réad."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"A prime tower requires that all objects are printed over the same number of "
"raft layers."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn ó thúr príomhála go bpriontálfaí gach réad thar an líon céanna "
"sraitheanna rafta."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The prime tower is only supported for multiple objects if they are printed "
"with the same support_top_z_distance."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaítear leis an túr príomhála do réada iolracha ach má phriontáiltear "
"iad leis an support_top_z_distance céanna."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"A prime tower requires that all objects are sliced with the same layer "
"height."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn ó thúr príomhála go slisneofaí gach réad leis an airde sraithe "
"chéanna."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The prime tower is only supported if all objects have the same variable "
"layer height."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaítear leis an túr príomhála ach má tá an airde sraithe athraitheach "
"chéanna ag gach réad."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"One or more object were assigned an extruder that the printer does not have."
msgstr ""
"Sannadh easbhrúiteoir do réad amháin nó níos mó nach bhfuil ag an bprintéir."

# AI Translated
msgid "Line width too small"
msgstr "Leithead líne róbheag"

# AI Translated
msgid "Line width too large"
msgstr "Leithead líne rómhór"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Printing with multiple extruders of differing nozzle diameters. If support "
"is to be printed with the current filament (support_filament == 0 or "
"support_interface_filament == 0), all nozzles have to be of the same "
"diameter."
msgstr ""
"Priontáil le heasbhrúiteoirí iolracha a bhfuil trastomhais soic éagsúla acu. "
"Má tá tacaí le priontáil leis an bhfiliméad reatha (support_filament == 0 nó "
"support_interface_filament == 0), caithfidh an trastomhas céanna a bheith ag "
"gach soc."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"A prime tower requires that support has the same layer height as the object."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn ó thúr príomhála go mbeadh an airde sraithe chéanna ag na tacaí "
"agus ag an réad."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"For Organic supports, two walls are supported only with the Hollow/Default "
"base pattern."
msgstr ""
"Le haghaidh tacaí Orgánacha, ní thacaítear le dhá bhalla ach leis an bpatrún "
"bonn Cuasach/Réamhshocraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The Lightning base pattern is not supported by this support type; "
"Rectilinear will be used instead."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaíonn an cineál taca seo leis an bpatrún bonn Tintreach; úsáidfear "
"Dronlíneach ina ionad."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Organic support tree tip diameter must not be smaller than support material "
"extrusion width."
msgstr ""
"Níor cheart do thrastomhas bharr an chrainn i dtacaí Orgánacha a bheith níos "
"lú ná leithead easbhrúite an ábhair taca."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Organic support branch diameter must not be smaller than 2x support material "
"extrusion width."
msgstr ""
"Níor cheart do thrastomhas na craoibhe i dtacaí Orgánacha a bheith níos lú "
"ná 2x leithead easbhrúite an ábhair taca."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Organic support branch diameter must not be smaller than support tree tip "
"diameter."
msgstr ""
"Níor cheart do thrastomhas na craoibhe i dtacaí Orgánacha a bheith níos lú "
"ná trastomhas bharr an chrainn taca."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The Hollow base pattern is not supported by this support type; Rectilinear "
"will be used instead."
msgstr ""
"Ní thacaíonn an cineál taca seo leis an bpatrún bonn Cuasach; úsáidfear "
"Dronlíneach ina ionad."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Support enforcers are used but support is not enabled. Please enable support."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear forfheidhmitheoirí taca ach níl tacaí cumasaithe. Cumasaigh tacaí."

# AI Translated
msgid "Layer height cannot exceed nozzle diameter."
msgstr "Ní féidir le hairde na sraithe trastomhas an tsoic a shárú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bridge line width must not exceed nozzle diameter"
msgstr "Níor cheart do leithead líne an droichid trastomhas an tsoic a shárú"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"\"G92 E0\" was found in before_layer_change_gcode, but the G or E are not "
"uppercase. Please change them to the exact uppercase \"G92 E0\"."
msgstr ""
"Aimsíodh \"G92 E0\" in before_layer_change_gcode, ach níl an G nó an E i "
"gceannlitreacha. Athraigh iad go \"G92 E0\" i gceannlitreacha go díreach."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"\"G92 E0\" was found in layer_change_gcode, but the G or E are not "
"uppercase. Please change them to the exact uppercase \"G92 E0\"."
msgstr ""
"Aimsíodh \"G92 E0\" in layer_change_gcode, ach níl an G nó an E i "
"gceannlitreacha. Athraigh iad go \"G92 E0\" i gceannlitreacha go díreach."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Relative extruder addressing requires resetting the extruder position at "
"each layer to prevent loss of floating point accuracy. Add \"G92 E0\" to "
"layer_gcode."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn athshocrú shuíomh an easbhrúiteora ag gach sraith ó sheoladh "
"coibhneasta an easbhrúiteora chun cailliúint chruinneas an snámhphointe a "
"chosc. Cuir \"G92 E0\" le layer_gcode."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"\"G92 E0\" was found in before_layer_change_gcode, which is incompatible "
"with absolute extruder addressing."
msgstr ""
"Aimsíodh \"G92 E0\" in before_layer_change_gcode, rud nach bhfuil "
"comhoiriúnach le seoladh iomlán an easbhrúiteora."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"\"G92 E0\" was found in layer_change_gcode, which is incompatible with "
"absolute extruder addressing."
msgstr ""
"Aimsíodh \"G92 E0\" in layer_change_gcode, rud nach bhfuil comhoiriúnach le "
"seoladh iomlán an easbhrúiteora."

# AI Translated
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid "Plate %d: %s does not support filament %s"
msgstr "Pláta %d: ní thacaíonn %s le filiméad %s"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Setting the jerk speed too low could lead to artifacts on curved surfaces"
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh déantáin a theacht ar dhromchlaí cuartha má shocraítear luas na "
"turraingthe ró-íseal"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The jerk setting exceeds the printer's maximum jerk "
"(machine_max_jerk_x/machine_max_jerk_y).\n"
"Orca will automatically cap the jerk speed to ensure it doesn't surpass the "
"printer's capabilities.\n"
"You can adjust the maximum jerk setting in your printer's configuration to "
"get higher speeds."
msgstr ""
"Sáraíonn socrú na turraingthe uasturraing an phrintéara "
"(machine_max_jerk_x/machine_max_jerk_y).\n"
"Cuirfidh Orca teorainn le luas na turraingthe go huathoibríoch ionas nach "
"sáróidh sé cumais an phrintéara.\n"
"Is féidir leat socrú na huasturraingthe a choigeartú i gcumraíocht do "
"phrintéara chun luasanna níos airde a fháil."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Junction deviation setting exceeds the printer's maximum value "
"(machine_max_junction_deviation).\n"
"Orca will automatically cap the junction deviation to ensure it doesn't "
"surpass the printer's capabilities.\n"
"You can adjust the machine_max_junction_deviation value in your printer's "
"configuration to get higher limits."
msgstr ""
"Sáraíonn socrú an diall acomhail uasluach an phrintéara "
"(machine_max_junction_deviation).\n"
"Cuirfidh Orca teorainn leis an diall acomhail go huathoibríoch ionas nach "
"sáróidh sé cumais an phrintéara.\n"
"Is féidir leat luach machine_max_junction_deviation a choigeartú i "
"gcumraíocht do phrintéara chun teorainneacha níos airde a fháil."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The acceleration setting exceeds the printer's maximum acceleration "
"(machine_max_acceleration_extruding).\n"
"Orca will automatically cap the acceleration speed to ensure it doesn't "
"surpass the printer's capabilities.\n"
"You can adjust the machine_max_acceleration_extruding value in your "
"printer's configuration to get higher speeds."
msgstr ""
"Sáraíonn socrú an luasghéaraithe uasluasghéarú an phrintéara "
"(machine_max_acceleration_extruding).\n"
"Cuirfidh Orca teorainn leis an luasghéarú go huathoibríoch ionas nach "
"sáróidh sé cumais an phrintéara.\n"
"Is féidir leat luach machine_max_acceleration_extruding a choigeartú i "
"gcumraíocht do phrintéara chun luasanna níos airde a fháil."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The travel acceleration setting exceeds the printer's maximum travel "
"acceleration (machine_max_acceleration_travel).\n"
"Orca will automatically cap the travel acceleration speed to ensure it "
"doesn't surpass the printer's capabilities.\n"
"You can adjust the machine_max_acceleration_travel value in your printer's "
"configuration to get higher speeds."
msgstr ""
"Sáraíonn socrú luasghéarú an taistil uasluasghéarú taistil an phrintéara "
"(machine_max_acceleration_travel).\n"
"Cuirfidh Orca teorainn le luasghéarú an taistil go huathoibríoch ionas nach "
"sáróidh sé cumais an phrintéara.\n"
"Is féidir leat luach machine_max_acceleration_travel a choigeartú i "
"gcumraíocht do phrintéara chun luasanna níos airde a fháil."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The precise wall option will be ignored for outer-inner or inner-outer-inner "
"wall sequences."
msgstr ""
"Déanfar neamhaird den rogha balla beacht do sheichimh bhallaí "
"seachtrach-inmheánach nó inmheánach-seachtrach-inmheánach."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Adaptive pressure advance is enabled for one or more extruders, but no "
"measurements have been entered in their Adaptive Pressure Advance model."
msgstr ""
"Tá réamhbhrú oiriúnaitheach cumasaithe d'easbhrúiteoir amháin nó níos mó, "
"ach níor cuireadh aon tomhais isteach ina múnla Réamhbhrú Oiriúnaitheach."

# AI Translated
#. TRN %1% is the filament number as shown in the filament list, starting from 1; %2% names the invalid line.
#. one warning per filament, the notifications stack
#, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"The Adaptive Pressure Advance model of filament %1% contains invalid "
"values.\n"
"%2%"
msgstr ""
"Tá luachanna neamhbhailí i múnla Réamhbhrú Oiriúnaitheach fhiliméad %1%.\n"
"%2%"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Filament shrinkage will not be used because filament shrinkage for the used "
"filaments does not match."
msgstr ""
"Ní úsáidfear crapadh filiméid mar nach dtagann crapadh na bhfiliméad a "
"úsáidtear le chéile."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The print is empty. The model is not printable with current print settings."
msgstr ""
"Tá an phriontáil folamh. Níl an tsamhail inphriontáilte leis na socruithe "
"priontála reatha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Generating skirt & brim"
msgstr "Sciorta agus imeall á nginiúint"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Per-object skirts cannot fit between the objects in By object print "
"sequence.\n"
"\n"
"Move the objects farther apart, reduce brim/skirt size, switch Skirt type to "
"Combined, or switch Print sequence to By layer."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir sciortaí in aghaidh an réada a chur idir na réada i seicheamh "
"priontála De réir réada.\n"
"\n"
"Bog na réada níos faide óna chéile, laghdaigh méid an imill/an sciorta, "
"athraigh cineál an Sciorta go Comhcheangailte, nó athraigh seicheamh na "
"Priontála go De réir sraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Exporting G-code"
msgstr "G-code á easpórtáil"

# AI Translated
msgid "Generating G-code"
msgstr "G-code á ghiniúint"

# AI Translated
#. TRN %1% is a file path.
#, possible-boost-format
msgid "Failed to process the G-code file %1% from the previous 3MF file."
msgstr "Theip ar phróiseáil an chomhaid G-code %1% ón gcomhad 3MF roimhe seo."

# AI Translated
#, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"The belt purge tower cannot absorb the full purge volume: %1% mm³ in total "
"could not be purged (worst layer: %2% mm³ at height %3%). The print may show "
"color bleeding. Increase the belt purge tower width, or reduce flushing "
"volumes."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir le túr sruthlaithe an chreasa an toirt sruthlaithe iomlán a ionsú: "
"níorbh fhéidir %1% mm³ san iomlán a shruthlú (an tsraith is measa: %2% mm³ "
"ag airde %3%). D'fhéadfadh fuiliú dathanna a bheith le feiceáil sa "
"phriontáil. Méadaigh leithead thúr sruthlaithe an chreasa, nó laghdaigh na "
"toirteanna sruthlaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Processing of the filename_format template failed."
msgstr "Theip ar phróiseáil an teimpléid filename_format."

# AI Translated
msgid "Printer technology"
msgstr "Teicneolaíocht an phrintéara"

# AI Translated
msgid "Printable area"
msgstr "Limistéar inphriontáilte"

# AI Translated
msgid "Extruder printable area"
msgstr "Limistéar inphriontáilte an easbhrúiteora"

# AI Translated
msgid "Support parallel printheads"
msgstr "Tacaigh le cinn phriontála chomhthreomhara"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable printer settings for machines that can use multiple printheads in "
"parallel."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh socruithe printéara do mheaisíní ar féidir leo cinn phriontála "
"iolracha a úsáid go comhthreomhar."

# AI Translated
msgid "Parallel printheads count"
msgstr "Líon na gceann priontála comhthreomhar"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Set the number of parallel printheads for machines like OrangeStorm Giga "
"printer."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh líon na gceann priontála comhthreomhar do mheaisíní ar nós an "
"phrintéara OrangeStorm Giga."

# AI Translated
msgid "Parallel printheads bed exclude areas"
msgstr "Limistéir eisiata leapa do chinn phriontála chomhthreomhara"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Ordered list of bed exclude areas by parallel printhead count. Item 1 "
"applies to one printhead, item 2 to two printheads, and so on. Leave an item "
"empty for no excluded area."
msgstr ""
"Liosta ordaithe de limistéir eisiata leapa de réir líon na gceann priontála "
"comhthreomhar. Baineann mír 1 le ceann priontála amháin, mír 2 le dhá cheann "
"priontála, agus mar sin de. Fág mír folamh chun gan limistéar eisiata a "
"bheith ann."

# AI Translated
msgid "Excluded bed area"
msgstr "Limistéar eisiata leapa"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Unprintable area in XY plane. For example, X1 Series printers use the front "
"left corner to cut filament during filament change. The area is expressed as "
"a polygon in the format \"XxY, XxY, ...\". It constrains material and model "
"placement, but allows machine travel. Configure toolhead collision volumes "
"separately for G-code checking and travel avoidance."
msgstr ""
"Limistéar neamhinphriontáilte sa phlána XY. Mar shampla, úsáideann printéirí "
"Sraith X1 an cúinne tosaigh clé chun filiméad a ghearradh le linn athrú "
"filiméid. Léirítear an limistéar mar pholagán san fhormáid \"XxY, XxY, "
"...\". Srianann sé suíomh ábhair agus samhlacha, ach ceadaíonn sé taisteal "
"meaisín. Cumraigh toirteanna imbhuailte an chinn uirlise ar leithligh le "
"haghaidh seiceáil G-code agus seachaint taistil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Toolhead collision volumes"
msgstr "Toirteanna imbhuailte an chinn uirlise"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Collision volumes used for model and generated-material exclusion, G-code "
"checking, and travel avoidance. Use \"XxY, XxY, ...\" for a full-height "
"polygon or \"ZMIN..ZMAX;XxY, XxY, ...\" for a Z-limited volume. Separate "
"multiple volumes with \"|\". These volumes are additional to the excluded "
"bed area. Automatic arrangement conservatively uses the bounding box of a "
"non-convex volume."
msgstr ""
"Toirteanna imbhuailte a úsáidtear chun samhlacha agus ábhar ginte a eisiamh, "
"G-code a sheiceáil, agus taisteal a sheachaint. Úsáid \"XxY, XxY, ...\" do "
"pholagán lánairde nó \"ZMIN..ZMAX;XxY, XxY, ...\" do thoirt teorannaithe ag "
"Z. Scar toirteanna iolracha le \"|\". Is breise iad na toirteanna seo leis "
"an limistéar eisiata leapa. Úsáideann socrú uathoibríoch bosca teorann "
"toirte neamhdhronnaigh go coimeádach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Collision volume behavior"
msgstr "Iompar na dtoirteanna imbhuailte"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Choose whether all nozzles use the same collision volumes, derive "
"toolhead-relative volumes from each nozzle's XY offset, or configure "
"independent volumes for every extruder. In individual mode, select each "
"extruder on the Extruder page to configure its volumes."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh an úsáideann gach soc na toirteanna imbhuailte céanna, an "
"ndíorthaítear toirteanna i gcoibhneas leis an gceann uirlise ó fhritháireamh "
"XY gach soic, nó an gcumraítear toirteanna neamhspleácha do gach "
"easbhrúiteoir. Sa mhód aonair, roghnaigh gach easbhrúiteoir ar an leathanach "
"Easbhrúiteoir chun a thoirteanna a chumrú."

# AI Translated
#. TRN Collision volume modes: one set for all nozzles, one set moved by each nozzle's XY offset, or one set per extruder.
msgid "Shared by all nozzles"
msgstr "Comhroinnte ag gach soc"

# AI Translated
msgid "Toolhead-relative (nozzle offsets)"
msgstr "I gcoibhneas leis an gceann uirlise (fritháirimh soic)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Individual per extruder"
msgstr "Aonair in aghaidh an easbhrúiteora"

# AI Translated
msgid "Extruder collision volumes"
msgstr "Toirteanna imbhuailte an easbhrúiteora"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Collision volumes used only by this extruder in individual mode. Use the "
"same polygon and optional Z-range format as the shared collision volumes. "
"Leave empty for no collision volumes on this extruder. Automatic arrangement "
"conservatively uses the bounding box of a non-convex volume."
msgstr ""
"Toirteanna imbhuailte nach n-úsáideann ach an t-easbhrúiteoir seo sa mhód "
"aonair. Úsáid an fhormáid pholagáin chéanna agus raon Z roghnach leis na "
"toirteanna imbhuailte comhroinnte. Fág folamh chun gan toirteanna imbhuailte "
"a bheith ar an easbhrúiteoir seo. Úsáideann socrú uathoibríoch bosca teorann "
"toirte neamhdhronnaigh go coimeádach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bed custom texture"
msgstr "Uigeacht shaincheaptha na leapa"

# AI Translated
msgid "Bed custom model"
msgstr "Samhail shaincheaptha na leapa"

# AI Translated
msgid "Elephant foot compensation"
msgstr "Cúiteamh chos na heilifinte"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This shrinks the first layer on the build plate to compensate for elephant "
"foot effect."
msgstr ""
"Laghdaíonn sé seo an chéad sraith ar an bpláta tógála chun éifeacht chos na "
"heilifinte a chúiteamh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Elephant foot compensation layers"
msgstr "Sraitheanna chúiteamh chos na heilifinte"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The number of layers on which the elephant foot compensation will be active. "
"The first layer will be shrunk by the elephant foot compensation value, then "
"the next layers will be linearly shrunk less, up to the layer indicated by "
"this value."
msgstr ""
"Líon na sraitheanna ar a mbeidh cúiteamh chos na heilifinte gníomhach. "
"Laghdófar an chéad sraith de réir luach chúiteamh chos na heilifinte, ansin "
"laghdófar na sraitheanna ina dhiaidh go líneach níos lú, suas go dtí an "
"tsraith a léiríonn an luach seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Elephant foot layers density"
msgstr "Dlús sraitheanna chos na heilifinte"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Density of internal solid infill for Elephant foot layers compensation.\n"
"The initial value for the second layer is set.\n"
"Subsequent layers become linearly denser by the height specified in "
"elefant_foot_compensation_layers."
msgstr ""
"Dlús an líonta sholadaigh inmheánaigh do chúiteamh sraitheanna chos na "
"heilifinte.\n"
"Socraítear an luach tosaigh don dara sraith.\n"
"Éiríonn na sraitheanna ina dhiaidh níos dlúithe go líneach de réir na hairde "
"atá sonraithe in elefant_foot_compensation_layers."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the height for each layer. Smaller layer heights give greater "
"accuracy but longer printing time."
msgstr ""
"Seo í an airde do gach sraith. Tugann airdí sraithe níos lú cruinneas níos "
"mó ach am priontála níos faide."

# AI Translated
msgid "Printable height"
msgstr "Airde inphriontáilte"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the maximum printable height which is limited by the height of the "
"build area."
msgstr ""
"Seo í an uasairde inphriontáilte atá teorannaithe ag airde an limistéir "
"tógála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Extruder printable height"
msgstr "Airde inphriontáilte an easbhrúiteora"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Maximum printable height of this extruder which is limited by mechanism of "
"printer."
msgstr ""
"Uasairde inphriontáilte an easbhrúiteora seo atá teorannaithe ag meicníocht "
"an phrintéara."

# AI Translated
msgid "Preferred orientation"
msgstr "Treoshuíomh roghnaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Automatically orient STL files on the Z axis upon initial import."
msgstr ""
"Treoshuigh comhaid STL ar ais Z go huathoibríoch ar an gcéad iompórtáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Printer preset names"
msgstr "Ainmneacha réamhshocruithe an phrintéara"

# AI Translated
msgid "Use 3rd-party print host"
msgstr "Úsáid óstach priontála tríú páirtí"

# AI Translated
msgid "Allow controlling BambuLab's printer through 3rd party print hosts."
msgstr "Ceadaigh printéir BambuLab a rialú trí óstaigh phriontála tríú páirtí."

# AI Translated
msgid "Use 3MF instead of G-code"
msgstr "Úsáid 3MF in ionad G-code"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable this if the printer accepts a 3MF file as the print job. When "
"enabled, Orca Slicer sends the sliced file as a .gcode.3mf, instead of a "
"plain .gcode file."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh é seo má ghlacann an printéir le comhad 3MF mar an jab priontála. "
"Nuair atá sé cumasaithe, seolann Orca Slicer an comhad slisnithe mar "
".gcode.3mf, in ionad gnáthchomhad .gcode."

# AI Translated
msgid "Printer Agent"
msgstr "Gníomhaire Printéara"

# AI Translated
msgid "Select the network agent implementation for printer communication."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh cur i bhfeidhm an ghníomhaire líonra do chumarsáid leis an "
"bprintéir."

# AI Translated
msgid "Hostname, IP or URL"
msgstr "Óstainm, IP nó URL"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Orca Slicer can upload G-code files to a printer host. This field should "
"contain the hostname, IP address or URL of the printer host instance. Print "
"host behind HAProxy with basic auth enabled can be accessed by putting the "
"user name and password into the URL in the following format: "
"https://username:password@your-octopi-address/"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le Orca Slicer comhaid G-code a uaslódáil chuig óstach printéara. "
"Ba cheart óstainm, seoladh IP nó URL chás óstach an phrintéara a bheith sa "
"réimse seo. Is féidir rochtain a fháil ar óstach priontála taobh thiar de "
"HAProxy le fíordheimhniú bunúsach cumasaithe tríd an ainm úsáideora agus an "
"pasfhocal a chur sa URL san fhormáid seo a leanas: "
"https://username:password@your-octopi-address/"

# AI Translated
msgid "Device UI"
msgstr "Comhéadan an Ghléis"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Specify the URL of your device user interface if it's not same as print_host."
msgstr ""
"Sonraigh URL chomhéadan úsáideora do ghléis mura bhfuil sé mar an gcéanna le "
"print_host."

# AI Translated
msgid "API Key / Password"
msgstr "Eochair API / Pasfhocal"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Orca Slicer can upload G-code files to a printer host. This field should "
"contain the API Key or the password required for authentication."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le Orca Slicer comhaid G-code a uaslódáil chuig óstach printéara. "
"Ba cheart an Eochair API nó an pasfhocal a theastaíonn le haghaidh "
"fíordheimhnithe a bheith sa réimse seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Serial Number"
msgstr "Sraithuimhir"

# AI Translated
msgid "Flashforge local API requires the printer serial number."
msgstr "Teastaíonn sraithuimhir an phrintéara ó API áitiúil Flashforge."

# AI Translated
msgid "Name of the printer."
msgstr "Ainm an phrintéara."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Custom CA certificate file can be specified for HTTPS OctoPrint connections, "
"in crt/pem format. If left blank, the default OS CA certificate repository "
"is used."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir comhad teastais CA saincheaptha a shonrú do cheangail HTTPS "
"OctoPrint, i bhformáid crt/pem. Má fhágtar bán é, úsáidtear stór "
"réamhshocraithe teastas CA an chórais oibriúcháin."

# AI Translated
msgid "User"
msgstr "Úsáideoir"

# AI Translated
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Pasfhocal"

# AI Translated
msgid "Ignore HTTPS certificate revocation checks"
msgstr "Déan neamhaird de sheiceálacha cúlghairme teastais HTTPS"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Ignore HTTPS certificate revocation checks in the case of missing or offline "
"distribution points. One may want to enable this option for self signed "
"certificates if connection fails."
msgstr ""
"Déan neamhaird de sheiceálacha cúlghairme teastais HTTPS i gcás pointí "
"dáileacháin ar iarraidh nó as líne. B'fhéidir gur mhaith le duine an rogha "
"seo a chumasú do theastais fhéinsínithe má theipeann ar an gceangal."

# AI Translated
msgid "Names of presets related to the physical printer."
msgstr ""
"Ainmneacha na réamhshocruithe a bhaineann leis an bprintéir fhisiciúil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Authorization Type"
msgstr "Cineál Údaraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "API key"
msgstr "Eochair API"

# AI Translated
msgid "HTTP digest"
msgstr "Achoimre HTTP"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Configuration for the plugin capabilities this preset uses, overriding the "
"global Capabilities configuration. Stored as a raw JSON array and edited "
"through the dialog behind the button, never typed in directly."
msgstr ""
"Cumraíocht do chumais bhreiseáin a úsáideann an réamhshocrú seo, a sháraíonn "
"an chumraíocht Chumas chomhchoiteann. Stóráilte mar eagar JSON amh agus "
"curtha in eagar tríd an dialóg taobh thiar den chnaipe, gan é a chlóscríobh "
"go díreach riamh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Avoid crossing walls"
msgstr "Seachain trasnú ballaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This detours to avoid traveling across walls, which may cause blobs on the "
"surface."
msgstr ""
"Téann sé seo timpeall chun taisteal trasna ballaí a sheachaint, rud a "
"d'fhéadfadh dabanna a chruthú ar an dromchla."

# AI Translated
msgid "Avoid crossing walls - Max detour length"
msgstr "Seachain trasnú ballaí - Uasfhad timpealláin"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Maximum detour distance for avoiding crossing wall: The printer won't detour "
"if the detour distance is larger than this value. Detour length could be "
"specified either as an absolute value or as percentage (for example 50%) of "
"a direct travel path. A value of 0 will disable this."
msgstr ""
"Uasfhad timpealláin chun trasnú balla a sheachaint: Ní rachaidh an printéir "
"timpeall má tá fad an timpealláin níos mó ná an luach seo. Is féidir fad an "
"timpealláin a shonrú mar luach iomlán nó mar chéatadán (mar shampla 50%) de "
"chonair thaistil dhíreach. Díchumasaíonn luach 0 é seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "mm or %"
msgstr "mm nó %"

# AI Translated
msgid "Other layers"
msgstr "Sraitheanna eile"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the bed temperature for layers except for the first one. A value of "
"0 means the filament does not support printing on the Cool Plate SuperTack."
msgstr ""
"Seo é teocht na leapa do na sraitheanna seachas an chéad cheann. Ciallaíonn "
"luach 0 nach dtacaíonn an filiméad le priontáil ar an Cool Plate SuperTack."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
