# AI Translated
msgid "Plate types supported by the printer"
msgstr "Cineálacha pláta a dtacaíonn an printéir leo"

# AI Translated
msgid "Default bed type"
msgstr "Cineál leapa réamhshocraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Default bed type for the printer (supports both numeric and string format)."
msgstr ""
"Cineál leapa réamhshocraithe an phrintéara (tacaíonn sé le formáid uimhriúil "
"agus teaghráin araon)."

# AI Translated
msgid "First layer print sequence"
msgstr "Seicheamh priontála na chéad sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Other layers print sequence"
msgstr "Seicheamh priontála na sraitheanna eile"

# AI Translated
msgid "The number of other layers print sequence"
msgstr "Líon sheicheamh priontála na sraitheanna eile"

# AI Translated
msgid "Other layers filament sequence"
msgstr "Seicheamh filiméad na sraitheanna eile"

# AI Translated
msgid "This G-code is inserted at every layer change before the Z lift."
msgstr "Cuirtear an G-code seo isteach ag gach athrú sraithe roimh ardú Z."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bottom shell layers"
msgstr "Sraitheanna blaoisce íochtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the number of solid layers of bottom shell, including the bottom "
"surface layer. When the thickness calculated by this value is thinner than "
"bottom shell thickness, the bottom shell layers will be increased."
msgstr ""
"Seo é líon na sraitheanna soladacha sa bhlaosc íochtair, an tsraith dromchla "
"íochtair san áireamh. Nuair a bhíonn an tiús a ríomhtar ón luach seo níos "
"tanaí ná tiús na blaoisce íochtair, méadófar sraitheanna na blaoisce "
"íochtair."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bottom shell thickness"
msgstr "Tiús na blaoisce íochtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The number of bottom solid layers is increased when slicing if the thickness "
"calculated by bottom shell layers is thinner than this value. This can avoid "
"having too thin a shell when layer height is small. 0 means that this "
"setting is disabled and the thickness of the bottom shell is determined "
"simply by the number of bottom shell layers."
msgstr ""
"Méadaítear líon na sraitheanna soladacha íochtair le linn slisnithe má "
"bhíonn an tiús a ríomhtar ó shraitheanna na blaoisce íochtair níos tanaí ná "
"an luach seo. Is féidir leis seo blaosc ró-thanaí a sheachaint nuair a "
"bhíonn airde na sraithe beag. Ciallaíonn 0 go bhfuil an socrú seo "
"díchumasaithe agus nach gcinntear tiús na blaoisce íochtair ach le líon "
"shraitheanna na blaoisce íochtair."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bottom paint penetration layers"
msgstr "Sraitheanna treá péinte íochtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The number of layers, including the bottom surface layer, that take the "
"color painted on a bottom surface. Set to 0 to use the bottom shell layers. "
"A value larger than the bottom shell also colors the sparse infill above the "
"painted area."
msgstr ""
"Líon na sraitheanna, an tsraith dromchla íochtair san áireamh, a ghlacann an "
"dath a péinteáladh ar dhromchla íochtair. Socraigh go 0 chun sraitheanna na "
"blaoisce íochtair a úsáid. Datháil luach níos mó ná an bhlaosc íochtair an "
"líonadh tanaí os cionn an limistéir phéinteáilte freisin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Apply gap fill"
msgstr "Cuir líonadh bearnaí i bhfeidhm"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enables gap fill for the selected solid surfaces. The minimum gap length "
"that will be filled can be controlled from the filter out tiny gaps option "
"below.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"1. Everywhere: Applies gap fill to top, bottom and internal solid surfaces "
"for maximum strength\n"
"2. Top and Bottom surfaces: Applies gap fill to top and bottom surfaces "
"only, balancing print speed, reducing potential over extrusion in the solid "
"infill and making sure the top and bottom surfaces have no pinhole gaps\n"
"3. Nowhere: Disables gap fill for all solid infill areas\n"
"\n"
"Note that if using the classic perimeter generator, gap fill may also be "
"generated between perimeters, if a full width line cannot fit between them. "
"That perimeter gap fill is not controlled by this setting.\n"
"\n"
"If you would like all gap fill, including the classic perimeter generated "
"one, removed, set the filter out tiny gaps value to a large number, like "
"999999.\n"
"\n"
"However this is not advised, as gap fill between perimeters is contributing "
"to the model's strength. For models where excessive gap fill is generated "
"between perimeters, a better option would be to switch to the arachne wall "
"generator and use this option to control whether the cosmetic top and bottom "
"surface gap fill is generated."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaíonn sé líonadh bearnaí do na dromchlaí soladacha roghnaithe. Is "
"féidir an t-íosfhad bearna a líonfar a rialú ón rogha 'scag amach bearnaí "
"bídeacha' thíos.\n"
"\n"
"Roghanna:\n"
"1. Gach áit: Cuireann sé líonadh bearnaí i bhfeidhm ar dhromchlaí soladacha "
"uachtair, íochtair agus inmheánacha don neart is mó\n"
"2. Dromchlaí uachtair agus íochtair: Ní chuireann sé líonadh bearnaí i "
"bhfeidhm ach ar dhromchlaí uachtair agus íochtair, ag cothromú luas "
"priontála, ag laghdú ró-easbhrú féideartha sa líonadh soladach agus ag "
"cinntiú nach bhfuil bearnaí pionphoill sna dromchlaí uachtair agus íochtair\n"
"3. Áit ar bith: Díchumasaíonn sé líonadh bearnaí do gach limistéar líonta "
"sholadaigh\n"
"\n"
"Tabhair faoi deara má úsáidtear an gineadóir imlíne clasaiceach, go "
"bhféadfaí líonadh bearnaí a ghiniúint idir imlínte freisin, mura féidir líne "
"lánleithid a chur eatarthu. Ní rialaíonn an socrú seo an líonadh bearnaí "
"imlíne sin.\n"
"\n"
"Más mian leat gach líonadh bearnaí a bhaint, an ceann a ghineann an "
"gineadóir imlíne clasaiceach san áireamh, socraigh luach 'scag amach bearnaí "
"bídeacha' go huimhir mhór, mar 999999.\n"
"\n"
"Mar sin féin ní mholtar é seo, mar go gcuireann líonadh bearnaí idir imlínte "
"le neart na samhla. I gcás samhlacha ina ngintear an iomarca líonadh bearnaí "
"idir imlínte, rogha níos fearr a bheadh athrú go gineadóir ballaí arachne "
"agus an rogha seo a úsáid chun a rialú an ngintear líonadh bearnaí "
"cosmaideach na ndromchlaí uachtair agus íochtair."

# AI Translated
msgid "Everywhere"
msgstr "Gach áit"

# AI Translated
msgid "Top and bottom surfaces"
msgstr "Dromchlaí uachtair agus íochtair"

# AI Translated
msgid "Nowhere"
msgstr "Áit ar bith"

# AI Translated
msgid "Force cooling for overhangs and bridges"
msgstr "Fuarú éigeantach do starráin agus do dhroichid"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable this option to allow adjustment of the part cooling fan speed for "
"specifically for overhangs, internal and external bridges. Setting the fan "
"speed specifically for these features can improve overall print quality and "
"reduce warping."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh an rogha seo chun ligean luas an ghaothráin fuaraithe páirte a "
"choigeartú go sonrach do starráin, do dhroichid inmheánacha agus "
"sheachtracha. Is féidir le luas an ghaothráin a shocrú go sonrach do na "
"gnéithe seo cáilíocht fhoriomlán na priontála a fheabhsú agus stangadh a "
"laghdú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Overhangs and external bridges fan speed"
msgstr "Luas gaothráin do starráin agus do dhroichid sheachtracha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Use this part cooling fan speed when printing bridges or overhang walls with "
"an overhang threshold that exceeds the value set in the 'Overhangs cooling "
"threshold' parameter above. Increasing the cooling specifically for "
"overhangs and bridges can improve the overall print quality of these "
"features.\n"
"\n"
"Please note, this fan speed is clamped on the lower end by the minimum fan "
"speed threshold set above. It is also adjusted upwards up to the maximum fan "
"speed threshold when the minimum layer time threshold is not met."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid an luas gaothráin fuaraithe páirte seo agus droichid nó ballaí "
"starráin á bpriontáil le tairseach starráin a sháraíonn an luach atá "
"socraithe sa pharaiméadar 'Tairseach fuaraithe starrán' thuas. Is féidir le "
"méadú an fhuaraithe go sonrach do starráin agus do dhroichid cáilíocht "
"fhoriomlán na ngnéithe seo a fheabhsú.\n"
"\n"
"Tabhair faoi deara go dteorannaítear an luas gaothráin seo ag an mbun ag "
"tairseach íosluas an ghaothráin atá socraithe thuas. Coigeartaítear aníos é "
"freisin suas go tairseach uasluas an ghaothráin nuair nach gcomhlíontar "
"tairseach íosama na sraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Overhang cooling activation threshold"
msgstr "Tairseach ghníomhachtaithe fuaraithe starrán"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"When the overhang exceeds this specified threshold, force the cooling fan to "
"run at the 'Overhang Fan Speed' set below. This threshold is expressed as a "
"percentage, indicating the portion of each line's width that is unsupported "
"by the layer beneath it. Setting this value to 0% forces the cooling fan to "
"run for all outer walls, regardless of the overhang degree."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a sháraíonn an starrán an tairseach shonraithe seo, cuir iallach ar an "
"ngaothrán fuaraithe rith ag an 'Luas Gaothráin Starráin' atá socraithe "
"thíos. Léirítear an tairseach seo mar chéatadán, a thaispeánann an chuid de "
"leithead gach líne nach bhfuil tacaithe ag an tsraith faoi. Má shocraítear "
"an luach seo go 0%, cuirtear iallach ar an ngaothrán fuaraithe rith do gach "
"balla seachtrach, beag beann ar chéim an starráin."

# AI Translated
msgid "External bridge infill direction"
msgstr "Treo líonta droichead seachtrach"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"External Bridging angle override.\n"
"If left to zero, the bridging angle will be calculated automatically for "
"each specific bridge.\n"
"Otherwise the provided angle will be used according to:\n"
" - The absolute coordinates\n"
" - The absolute coordinates + Model rotation: If Align directions to model "
"is enabled\n"
" - The optimal automatic angle + this value: If 'Relative Bridge Angle' is "
"enabled\n"
"\n"
"Use 180° for zero absolute angle."
msgstr ""
"Sárú uillinn droichead seachtrach.\n"
"Má fhágtar ag nialas é, ríomhfar uillinn an droichid go huathoibríoch do "
"gach droichead ar leith.\n"
"Seachas sin úsáidfear an uillinn a tugadh de réir:\n"
" - Na gcomhordanáidí iomlána\n"
" - Na gcomhordanáidí iomlána + rothlú na samhla: Má tá 'Ailínigh treonna "
"leis an tsamhail' cumasaithe\n"
" - An uillinn uathoibríoch is fearr + an luach seo: Má tá 'Uillinn "
"Choibhneasta Droichid' cumasaithe\n"
"\n"
"Úsáid 180° d'uillinn iomlán nialasach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Internal bridge infill direction"
msgstr "Treo líonta droichead inmheánach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Internal Bridging angle override.\n"
"If left to zero, the bridging angle will be calculated automatically for "
"each specific bridge.\n"
"Otherwise the provided angle will be used according to:\n"
" - The absolute coordinates\n"
" - The absolute coordinates + Model rotation: If Align directions to model "
"is enabled\n"
" - The optimal automatic angle + this value: If 'Relative Bridge Angle' is "
"enabled\n"
"\n"
"Use 180° for zero absolute angle."
msgstr ""
"Sárú uillinn droichead inmheánach.\n"
"Má fhágtar ag nialas é, ríomhfar uillinn an droichid go huathoibríoch do "
"gach droichead ar leith.\n"
"Seachas sin úsáidfear an uillinn a tugadh de réir:\n"
" - Na gcomhordanáidí iomlána\n"
" - Na gcomhordanáidí iomlána + rothlú na samhla: Má tá 'Ailínigh treonna "
"leis an tsamhail' cumasaithe\n"
" - An uillinn uathoibríoch is fearr + an luach seo: Má tá 'Uillinn "
"Choibhneasta Droichid' cumasaithe\n"
"\n"
"Úsáid 180° d'uillinn iomlán nialasach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Relative bridge angle"
msgstr "Uillinn choibhneasta droichid"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When enabled, the bridge angle values are added to the automatically "
"calculated bridge direction instead of overriding it."
msgstr ""
"Nuair atá sé cumasaithe, cuirtear luachanna uillinn an droichid le treo an "
"droichid a ríomhtar go huathoibríoch in ionad é a shárú."

# AI Translated
msgid "External bridge density"
msgstr "Dlús droichead seachtrach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Controls the density (spacing) of external bridge lines.\n"
"Theoretically, 100% means a solid bridge, but due to the tendency of bridge "
"extrusions to sag, 100% may not be sufficient.\n"
"\n"
"- Higher than 100% density (Recommended Max 125%):\n"
"  - Pros: Produces smoother bridge surfaces, as overlapping lines provide "
"additional support during printing.\n"
"  - Cons: Can cause overextrusion, which may reduce lower and upper surface "
"quality and increase the risk of warping.\n"
"\n"
"- Lower than 100% density (Min 10%):\n"
"  - Pros: Can create a string-like first layer. Faster and with better "
"cooling because there is more space for air to circulate around the extruded "
"bridge.\n"
"  - Cons: May lead to sagging and poorer surface finish."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn sé dlús (spásáil) na línte droichead seachtrach.\n"
"Go teoiriciúil, ciallaíonn 100% droichead soladach, ach mar gheall ar an "
"gclaonadh atá ag easbhruthanna droichid titim, b'fhéidir nach leor 100%.\n"
"\n"
"- Dlús níos airde ná 100% (Uasmhéid Molta 125%):\n"
"  - Buntáistí: Táirgeann sé dromchlaí droichid níos míne, mar go "
"soláthraíonn línte forluiteacha taca breise le linn priontála.\n"
"  - Míbhuntáistí: D'fhéadfadh ró-easbhrú a chruthú, rud a d'fhéadfadh "
"cáilíocht na ndromchlaí íochtair agus uachtair a laghdú agus an baol "
"stangtha a mhéadú.\n"
"\n"
"- Dlús níos ísle ná 100% (Íosmhéid 10%):\n"
"  - Buntáistí: Is féidir leis céad sraith cosúil le sreangán a chruthú. Níos "
"tapa agus le fuarú níos fearr mar go bhfuil níos mó spáis ann don aer "
"scaipeadh timpeall an droichid easbhrúite.\n"
"  - Míbhuntáistí: D'fhéadfadh titim agus bailchríoch dromchla níos measa "
"teacht as."

# AI Translated
msgid "Internal bridge density"
msgstr "Dlús droichead inmheánach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Controls the density (spacing) of internal bridge lines.\n"
"Internal bridges act as intermediate support between sparse infill and top "
"solid infill and can strongly affect top surface quality.\n"
"\n"
"- Higher than 100% density (Recommended Max 125%):\n"
"  - Pros: Improves internal bridge strength and support under top layers, "
"reducing sagging and improving top-surface finish.\n"
"  - Cons: Increases material use and print time; excessive density may cause "
"overextrusion and internal stresses.\n"
"\n"
"- Lower than 100% density (Min 10%):\n"
"  - Pros: Can reduce pillowing and improve cooling (more airflow through the "
"bridge), and may speed up printing.\n"
"  - Cons: May reduce internal support, increasing the risk of sagging and "
"top surface defects.\n"
"\n"
"This option works particularly well when combined with the second internal "
"bridge over infill option to improve bridging further before solid infill is "
"extruded."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn sé dlús (spásáil) na línte droichead inmheánach.\n"
"Feidhmíonn droichid inmheánacha mar thaca idirmheánach idir líonadh tanaí "
"agus líonadh soladach uachtair agus is féidir leo dul i bhfeidhm go mór ar "
"cháilíocht an dromchla uachtair.\n"
"\n"
"- Dlús níos airde ná 100% (Uasmhéid Molta 125%):\n"
"  - Buntáistí: Feabhsaíonn sé neart na ndroichead inmheánach agus an taca "
"faoi na sraitheanna uachtair, ag laghdú titime agus ag feabhsú bhailchríoch "
"an dromchla uachtair.\n"
"  - Míbhuntáistí: Méadaíonn sé úsáid ábhair agus am priontála; d'fhéadfadh "
"an iomarca dlúis ró-easbhrú agus strus inmheánach a chruthú.\n"
"\n"
"- Dlús níos ísle ná 100% (Íosmhéid 10%):\n"
"  - Buntáistí: Is féidir leis piliúrú a laghdú agus fuarú a fheabhsú (níos "
"mó aersreafa tríd an droichead), agus d'fhéadfadh sé an phriontáil a "
"bhrostú.\n"
"  - Míbhuntáistí: D'fhéadfadh sé an taca inmheánach a laghdú, ag méadú an "
"bhaoil titime agus lochtanna sa dromchla uachtair.\n"
"\n"
"Oibríonn an rogha seo go háirithe go maith in éineacht leis an rogha 'dara "
"droichead inmheánach thar líonadh' chun an droicheadú a fheabhsú tuilleadh "
"sula n-easbhrúitear líonadh soladach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bridge flow ratio"
msgstr "Cóimheas sreafa droichid"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This value governs the thickness of the external (visible) bridge layer.\n"
"Values above 1.0: Increase the amount of material while maintaining line "
"spacing. This can improve line contact and strength.\n"
"Values below 1.0: Reduce the amount of material while adjusting line spacing "
"to maintain contact. This can improve sagging.\n"
"\n"
"The actual bridge flow used is calculated by multiplying this value with the "
"filament flow ratio, and if set, the object's flow ratio."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn an luach seo tiús na sraithe droichid sheachtraigh (infheicthe).\n"
"Luachanna os cionn 1.0: Méadaigh méid an ábhair agus spásáil na línte á "
"coinneáil. Is féidir leis seo teagmháil agus neart na línte a fheabhsú.\n"
"Luachanna faoi bhun 1.0: Laghdaigh méid an ábhair agus spásáil na línte á "
"coigeartú chun teagmháil a choinneáil. Is féidir leis seo titim a fheabhsú.\n"
"\n"
"Ríomhtar an sreabhadh droichid iarbhír a úsáidtear tríd an luach seo a iolrú "
"faoi chóimheas sreafa an fhiliméid, agus má tá sé socraithe, faoi chóimheas "
"sreafa an réada."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Line width of the Bridge. If expressed as a %, it will be computed over the "
"nozzle diameter.\n"
"Recommended to use with a higher Bridge density or Bridge flow ratio.\n"
"\n"
"The maximum value is 100% or the nozzle diameter.\n"
"If set to 0, the line width will match the Internal solid infill width, or "
"the nozzle diameter for thick bridges."
msgstr ""
"Leithead líne an Droichid. Má léirítear é mar %, ríomhfar é i gcoibhneas le "
"trastomhas an tsoic.\n"
"Moltar é a úsáid le dlús Droichid nó cóimheas sreafa Droichid níos airde.\n"
"\n"
"Is é 100% nó trastomhas an tsoic an t-uasluach.\n"
"Má shocraítear go 0 é, meaitseálfaidh leithead na líne leithead an líonta "
"sholadaigh Inmheánaigh, nó trastomhas an tsoic do dhroichid tiubha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Internal bridge flow ratio"
msgstr "Cóimheas sreafa droichid inmheánaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This value governs the thickness of the internal bridge layer. This is the "
"first layer over sparse infill so increasing it may increase strength and "
"upper layer quality.\n"
"Values above 1.0: Increase the amount of material while maintaining line "
"spacing. This can improve line contact and strength.\n"
"Values below 1.0: Reduce the amount of material while adjusting line spacing "
"to maintain contact. This can improve sagging.\n"
"\n"
"The actual bridge flow used is calculated by multiplying this value with the "
"filament flow ratio, and if set, the object's flow ratio."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn an luach seo tiús na sraithe droichid inmheánaigh. Is í seo an "
"chéad sraith thar líonadh tanaí, mar sin d'fhéadfadh a mhéadú neart agus "
"cáilíocht na sraitheanna uachtair a mhéadú.\n"
"Luachanna os cionn 1.0: Méadaigh méid an ábhair agus spásáil na línte á "
"coinneáil. Is féidir leis seo teagmháil agus neart na línte a fheabhsú.\n"
"Luachanna faoi bhun 1.0: Laghdaigh méid an ábhair agus spásáil na línte á "
"coigeartú chun teagmháil a choinneáil. Is féidir leis seo titim a fheabhsú.\n"
"\n"
"Ríomhtar an sreabhadh droichid iarbhír a úsáidtear tríd an luach seo a iolrú "
"faoi chóimheas sreafa an fhiliméid, agus má tá sé socraithe, faoi chóimheas "
"sreafa an réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Top surface flow ratio"
msgstr "Cóimheas sreafa an dromchla uachtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This factor affects the amount of material for top solid infill. You can "
"decrease it slightly to have smooth surface finish.\n"
"\n"
"The actual top surface flow used is calculated by multiplying this value "
"with the filament flow ratio, and if set, the object's flow ratio."
msgstr ""
"Téann an fachtóir seo i bhfeidhm ar mhéid an ábhair don líonadh soladach "
"uachtair. Is féidir leat é a laghdú beagán chun bailchríoch dromchla mín a "
"fháil.\n"
"\n"
"Ríomhtar sreabhadh iarbhír an dromchla uachtair tríd an luach seo a iolrú "
"faoi chóimheas sreafa an fhiliméid, agus má tá sé socraithe, faoi chóimheas "
"sreafa an réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bottom surface flow ratio"
msgstr "Cóimheas sreafa an dromchla íochtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This factor affects the amount of material for bottom solid infill.\n"
"\n"
"The actual bottom solid infill flow used is calculated by multiplying this "
"value with the filament flow ratio, and if set, the object's flow ratio."
msgstr ""
"Téann an fachtóir seo i bhfeidhm ar mhéid an ábhair don líonadh soladach "
"íochtair.\n"
"\n"
"Ríomhtar sreabhadh iarbhír an líonta sholadaigh íochtair tríd an luach seo a "
"iolrú faoi chóimheas sreafa an fhiliméid, agus má tá sé socraithe, faoi "
"chóimheas sreafa an réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Set other flow ratios"
msgstr "Socraigh cóimheasa sreafa eile"

# AI Translated
msgid "Change flow ratios for other extrusion path types."
msgstr "Athraigh cóimheasa sreafa do chineálacha eile conairí easbhrúite."

# AI Translated
msgid "First layer flow ratio"
msgstr "Cóimheas sreafa na chéad sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This factor affects the amount of material on the first layer for the "
"extrusion path roles listed in this section.\n"
"\n"
"For the first layer, the actual flow ratio for each path role (does not "
"affect brims and skirts) will be multiplied by this value."
msgstr ""
"Téann an fachtóir seo i bhfeidhm ar mhéid an ábhair ar an gcéad sraith do na "
"róil chonair easbhrúite atá liostaithe sa rannán seo.\n"
"\n"
"Don chéad sraith, iolrófar an cóimheas sreafa iarbhír do gach ról conaire "
"(ní théann sé i bhfeidhm ar imill ná ar sciortaí) faoin luach seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Outer wall flow ratio"
msgstr "Cóimheas sreafa an bhalla sheachtraigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This factor affects the amount of material for outer walls.\n"
"\n"
"The actual outer wall flow used is calculated by multiplying this value by "
"the filament flow ratio, and if set, the object's flow ratio."
msgstr ""
"Téann an fachtóir seo i bhfeidhm ar mhéid an ábhair do bhallaí seachtracha.\n"
"\n"
"Ríomhtar sreabhadh iarbhír an bhalla sheachtraigh tríd an luach seo a iolrú "
"faoi chóimheas sreafa an fhiliméid, agus má tá sé socraithe, faoi chóimheas "
"sreafa an réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Inner wall flow ratio"
msgstr "Cóimheas sreafa an bhalla inmheánaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This factor affects the amount of material for inner walls.\n"
"\n"
"The actual inner wall flow used is calculated by multiplying this value by "
"the filament flow ratio, and if set, the object's flow ratio."
msgstr ""
"Téann an fachtóir seo i bhfeidhm ar mhéid an ábhair do bhallaí inmheánacha.\n"
"\n"
"Ríomhtar sreabhadh iarbhír an bhalla inmheánaigh tríd an luach seo a iolrú "
"faoi chóimheas sreafa an fhiliméid, agus má tá sé socraithe, faoi chóimheas "
"sreafa an réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Overhang flow ratio"
msgstr "Cóimheas sreafa starráin"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This factor affects the amount of material for overhangs.\n"
"\n"
"The actual overhang flow used is calculated by multiplying this value by the "
"filament flow ratio, and if set, the object's flow ratio."
msgstr ""
"Téann an fachtóir seo i bhfeidhm ar mhéid an ábhair do starráin.\n"
"\n"
"Ríomhtar sreabhadh iarbhír an starráin tríd an luach seo a iolrú faoi "
"chóimheas sreafa an fhiliméid, agus má tá sé socraithe, faoi chóimheas "
"sreafa an réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Sparse infill flow ratio"
msgstr "Cóimheas sreafa an líonta thanaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This factor affects the amount of material for sparse infill.\n"
"\n"
"The actual sparse infill flow used is calculated by multiplying this value "
"by the filament flow ratio, and if set, the object's flow ratio."
msgstr ""
"Téann an fachtóir seo i bhfeidhm ar mhéid an ábhair do líonadh tanaí.\n"
"\n"
"Ríomhtar sreabhadh iarbhír an líonta thanaí tríd an luach seo a iolrú faoi "
"chóimheas sreafa an fhiliméid, agus má tá sé socraithe, faoi chóimheas "
"sreafa an réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Internal solid infill flow ratio"
msgstr "Cóimheas sreafa an líonta sholadaigh inmheánaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This factor affects the amount of material for internal solid infill.\n"
"\n"
"The actual internal solid infill flow used is calculated by multiplying this "
"value by the filament flow ratio, and if set, the object's flow ratio."
msgstr ""
"Téann an fachtóir seo i bhfeidhm ar mhéid an ábhair do líonadh soladach "
"inmheánach.\n"
"\n"
"Ríomhtar sreabhadh iarbhír an líonta sholadaigh inmheánaigh tríd an luach "
"seo a iolrú faoi chóimheas sreafa an fhiliméid, agus má tá sé socraithe, "
"faoi chóimheas sreafa an réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Gap fill flow ratio"
msgstr "Cóimheas sreafa an líonta bearnaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This factor affects the amount of material for filling the gaps.\n"
"\n"
"The actual gap filling flow used is calculated by multiplying this value by "
"the filament flow ratio, and if set, the object's flow ratio."
msgstr ""
"Téann an fachtóir seo i bhfeidhm ar mhéid an ábhair chun na bearnaí a "
"líonadh.\n"
"\n"
"Ríomhtar sreabhadh iarbhír líonadh na mbearnaí tríd an luach seo a iolrú "
"faoi chóimheas sreafa an fhiliméid, agus má tá sé socraithe, faoi chóimheas "
"sreafa an réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Support flow ratio"
msgstr "Cóimheas sreafa na dtacaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This factor affects the amount of material for support.\n"
"\n"
"The actual support flow used is calculated by multiplying this value by the "
"filament flow ratio, and if set, the object's flow ratio."
msgstr ""
"Téann an fachtóir seo i bhfeidhm ar mhéid an ábhair do thacaí.\n"
"\n"
"Ríomhtar sreabhadh iarbhír na dtacaí tríd an luach seo a iolrú faoi "
"chóimheas sreafa an fhiliméid, agus má tá sé socraithe, faoi chóimheas "
"sreafa an réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Support interface flow ratio"
msgstr "Cóimheas sreafa chomhéadan na dtacaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This factor affects the amount of material for the support interface.\n"
"\n"
"The actual support interface flow used is calculated by multiplying this "
"value by the filament flow ratio, and if set, the object's flow ratio."
msgstr ""
"Téann an fachtóir seo i bhfeidhm ar mhéid an ábhair do chomhéadan na "
"dtacaí.\n"
"\n"
"Ríomhtar sreabhadh iarbhír chomhéadan na dtacaí tríd an luach seo a iolrú "
"faoi chóimheas sreafa an fhiliméid, agus má tá sé socraithe, faoi chóimheas "
"sreafa an réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Precise wall"
msgstr "Balla beacht"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Improve shell precision by adjusting outer wall spacing. This also improves "
"layer consistency.\n"
"\n"
"Note: This option will be ignored for outer-inner or inner-outer-inner wall "
"sequences."
msgstr ""
"Feabhsaigh beachtas na blaoisce trí spásáil an bhalla sheachtraigh a "
"choigeartú. Feabhsaíonn sé seo comhsheasmhacht na sraitheanna freisin.\n"
"\n"
"Nóta: Déanfar neamhaird den rogha seo do sheichimh bhallaí "
"seachtrach-inmheánach nó inmheánach-seachtrach-inmheánach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Only one wall on top surfaces"
msgstr "Balla amháin amháin ar dhromchlaí uachtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Use only one wall on flat top surfaces, to give more space to the top infill "
"pattern."
msgstr ""
"Ná húsáid ach balla amháin ar dhromchlaí uachtair cothroma, chun níos mó "
"spáis a thabhairt do phatrún an líonta uachtair."

# AI Translated
msgid "One wall threshold"
msgstr "Tairseach balla amháin"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"If a top surface has to be printed and it's partially covered by another "
"layer, it won't be considered at a top layer where its width is below this "
"value. This can be useful to not let the 'one perimeter on top' trigger on "
"surface that should be covered only by perimeters. This value can be a mm or "
"a % of the perimeter extrusion width.\n"
"\n"
"Warning: If enabled, artifacts can be created if you have some thin features "
"on the next layer, like letters. Set this setting to 0 to remove these "
"artifacts."
msgstr ""
"Má chaithfear dromchla uachtair a phriontáil agus é clúdaithe go páirteach "
"ag sraith eile, ní mheasfar é mar shraith uachtair san áit a bhfuil a "
"leithead faoi bhun an luacha seo. Is féidir leis seo a bheith úsáideach chun "
"gan ligean don 'imlíne amháin ar an mbarr' tosú ar dhromchla nár cheart a "
"chlúdach ach le himlínte. Is féidir leis an luach seo a bheith ina mm nó ina "
"% de leithead easbhrúite na himlíne.\n"
"\n"
"Rabhadh: Má tá sé cumasaithe, d'fhéadfaí déantáin a chruthú má tá gnéithe "
"tanaí ar an gcéad sraith eile, mar litreacha. Socraigh an socrú seo go 0 "
"chun na déantáin seo a bhaint."

# AI Translated
msgid "Only one wall on first layer"
msgstr "Balla amháin amháin ar an gcéad sraith"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Use only one wall on first layer, to give more space to the bottom infill "
"pattern."
msgstr ""
"Ná húsáid ach balla amháin ar an gcéad sraith, chun níos mó spáis a "
"thabhairt do phatrún an líonta íochtair."

# AI Translated
msgid "Extra perimeters on overhangs"
msgstr "Imlínte breise ar starráin"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Create additional perimeter paths over steep overhangs and areas where "
"bridges cannot be anchored."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaigh conairí imlíne breise thar starráin ghéara agus limistéir nach "
"féidir droichid a ancaireú iontu."

# AI Translated
msgid "Reverse on even"
msgstr "Aisiompaigh ar shraitheanna réidhe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Overhang reversal"
msgstr "Aisiompú starrán"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Extrude perimeters that have a part over an overhang in the reverse "
"direction on even layers. This alternating pattern can drastically improve "
"steep overhangs.\n"
"\n"
"This setting can also help reduce part warping due to the reduction of "
"stresses in the part walls."
msgstr ""
"Easbhrúigh imlínte a bhfuil cuid díobh thar starrán sa treo droim ar ais ar "
"shraitheanna réidhe. Is féidir leis an bpatrún ailtéarnach seo starráin "
"ghéara a fheabhsú go mór.\n"
"\n"
"Is féidir leis an socrú seo cabhrú freisin le stangadh páirte a laghdú mar "
"gheall ar an laghdú ar strus i mballaí na páirte."

# AI Translated
msgid "Reverse only internal perimeters"
msgstr "Ná haisiompaigh ach imlínte inmheánacha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Apply the reverse perimeters logic only on internal perimeters.\n"
"\n"
"This setting greatly reduces part stresses as they are now distributed in "
"alternating directions. This should reduce part warping while also "
"maintaining external wall quality. This feature can be very useful for warp "
"prone material, like ABS/ASA, and also for elastic filaments, like TPU and "
"Silk PLA. It can also help reduce warping on floating regions over "
"supports.\n"
"\n"
"For this setting to be the most effective, it is recommended to set the "
"Reverse Threshold to 0 so that all internal walls print in alternating "
"directions on even layers irrespective of their overhang degree."
msgstr ""
"Ná cuir loighic na n-imlínte aisiompaithe i bhfeidhm ach ar imlínte "
"inmheánacha.\n"
"\n"
"Laghdaíonn an socrú seo strus na páirte go mór mar go ndáiltear é anois i "
"dtreonna ailtéarnacha. Ba cheart go laghdódh sé seo stangadh na páirte agus "
"cáilíocht an bhalla sheachtraigh á coinneáil freisin. Is féidir leis an ngné "
"seo a bheith an-úsáideach d'ábhar atá tugtha do stangadh, mar ABS/ASA, agus "
"freisin d'fhiliméid leaisteacha, mar TPU agus Silk PLA. Is féidir leis "
"cabhrú freisin le stangadh a laghdú ar réigiúin ar snámh thar thacaí.\n"
"\n"
"Chun go mbeidh an socrú seo is éifeachtaí, moltar an Tairseach Aisiompaithe "
"a shocrú go 0 ionas go bpriontálfaidh gach balla inmheánach i dtreonna "
"ailtéarnacha ar shraitheanna réidhe beag beann ar a gcéim starráin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bridge counterbore holes"
msgstr "Droichid do phoill chuntarbhoir"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This option creates bridges for counterbore holes, allowing them to be "
"printed without support. Available modes include:\n"
"1. None: No bridge is created\n"
"2. Partially Bridged: Only a part of the unsupported area will be bridged\n"
"3. Sacrificial Layer: A full sacrificial bridge layer is created"
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn an rogha seo droichid do phoill chuntarbhoir, rud a ligeann iad a "
"phriontáil gan tacaí. I measc na móid atá ar fáil tá:\n"
"1. Dada: Ní chruthaítear droichead\n"
"2. Droichead Páirteach: Ní dhéanfar droichead ach de chuid den limistéar gan "
"taca\n"
"3. Sraith Íobartha: Cruthaítear sraith droichid íobartha iomlán"

# AI Translated
msgid "Partially bridged"
msgstr "Droichead páirteach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Sacrificial layer"
msgstr "Sraith íobartha"

# AI Translated
msgid "Reverse threshold"
msgstr "Tairseach aisiompaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Overhang reversal threshold"
msgstr "Tairseach aisiompaithe starrán"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"Number of mm the overhang need to be for the reversal to be considered "
"useful. Can be a % of the perimeter width.\n"
"Value 0 enables reversal on every even layers regardless.\n"
"When Detect overhang wall is not enabled, this option is ignored and "
"reversal happens on every even layers regardless."
msgstr ""
"An líon mm a chaithfidh an starrán a bheith chun go measfar an t-aisiompú "
"úsáideach. Is féidir leis a bheith ina % de leithead na himlíne.\n"
"Cumasaíonn luach 0 aisiompú ar gach sraith réidh beag beann.\n"
"Nuair nach bhfuil 'Braith balla starráin' cumasaithe, déantar neamhaird den "
"rogha seo agus tarlaíonn aisiompú ar gach sraith réidh beag beann."

# AI Translated
msgid "Slow down for overhangs"
msgstr "Moilligh do starráin"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable this option to slow down when printing overhangs. The speeds for "
"different overhang percentages are set below."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh an rogha seo chun moilliú agus starráin á bpriontáil. Socraítear "
"na luasanna do chéatadáin éagsúla starráin thíos."

# AI Translated
msgid "Slow down for curled perimeters"
msgstr "Moilligh d'imlínte coirníneacha"

# AI Translated
# Needs human review: check term 'curled perimeters' (coirníneach)
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"Enable this option to slow down printing in areas where perimeters may have "
"curled upwards.\n"
"For example, additional slowdown will be applied when printing overhangs on "
"sharp corners like the front of the Benchy hull, reducing curling which "
"compounds over multiple layers.\n"
"\n"
"It is generally recommended to have this option switched on unless your "
"printer cooling is powerful enough or the print speed is slow enough that "
"perimeter curling does not happen.\n"
"If printing with a high external perimeter speed, this parameter may "
"introduce wall artifacts when slowing down, due to the potentially large "
"variance in print speeds causing the extruder to be unable to keep up with "
"the requested flow change.\n"
"Root cause of these artifacts is most likely PA tuning being slightly off, "
"especially when combined with a high PA smooth time.\n"
"\n"
"Recommendations when enabling this option:\n"
"1. Reduce Pressure Advance smooth time to 0.015 - 0.02 so the extruder "
"reacts quickly to the speed changes.\n"
"2. Increase the minimum print speeds to limit the magnitude of the slowdown "
"and reduce the variance between fast and slow segments.\n"
"3. If artifacts still appear, enable Extrusion Rate Smoothing (ERS) to "
"further smooth the flow transitions.\n"
"\n"
"Note: When this option is enabled, overhang perimeters are treated like "
"overhangs, meaning the overhang speed is applied even if the overhanging "
"perimeter is part of a bridge.\n"
"For example, when the perimeters are 100% overhanging, with no wall "
"supporting them from underneath, the 75% overhang speed will be applied, "
"limited by the bridge speed."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh an rogha seo chun an phriontáil a mhoilliú i limistéir inar féidir "
"le himlínte a bheith coirníneach aníos.\n"
"Mar shampla, cuirfear moilliú breise i bhfeidhm agus starráin á bpriontáil "
"ar choirnéil ghéara mar thosach chabhail an Benchy, ag laghdú an choirníní a "
"mhéadaíonn thar shraitheanna iolracha.\n"
"\n"
"Moltar go ginearálta an rogha seo a bheith ar siúl mura bhfuil fuarú do "
"phrintéara cumhachtach go leor nó mura bhfuil an luas priontála mall go leor "
"nach dtarlaíonn coirníniú imlínte.\n"
"Má phriontáiltear le luas ard imlíne sheachtraigh, d'fhéadfadh an "
"paraiméadar seo déantáin bhalla a thabhairt isteach le linn moillithe, mar "
"gheall ar an athraitheas mór féideartha i luasanna priontála a fhágann nach "
"féidir leis an easbhrúiteoir coinneáil suas leis an athrú sreafa a iarradh.\n"
"Is dócha gurb é bunchúis na ndéantán seo tiúnadh PA atá beagán as, go "
"háirithe in éineacht le ham mínithe PA ard.\n"
"\n"
"Moltaí nuair a chumasaítear an rogha seo:\n"
"1. Laghdaigh am mínithe an Réamhbhrú go 0.015 - 0.02 ionas go bhfreagraíonn "
"an t-easbhrúiteoir go tapa d'athruithe luais.\n"
"2. Méadaigh na híosluasanna priontála chun méid an mhoillithe a theorannú "
"agus an t-athraitheas idir míreanna tapa agus mall a laghdú.\n"
"3. Má bhíonn déantáin le feiceáil fós, cumasaigh Mínú Ráta Easbhrúite (ERS) "
"chun na trasdulta sreafa a mhíniú tuilleadh.\n"
"\n"
"Nóta: Nuair atá an rogha seo cumasaithe, caitear le himlínte starráin cosúil "
"le starráin, rud a chiallaíonn go gcuirtear luas starráin i bhfeidhm fiú más "
"cuid de dhroichead an imlíne starráin.\n"
"Mar shampla, nuair a bhíonn na himlínte 100% ag starrú, gan aon bhalla á "
"dtacú ó bhun, cuirfear an luas starráin 75% i bhfeidhm, teorannaithe ag luas "
"an droichid."

# AI Translated
msgid "mm/s or %"
msgstr "mm/s nó %"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Speed of the externally visible bridge extrusions.\n"
"\n"
"In addition, if Slow down for curled perimeters is disabled, it will be the "
"print speed of overhang walls that are supported by less than 13%, whether "
"they are part of a bridge or an overhang."
msgstr ""
"Luas na n-easbhruthanna droichid atá infheicthe ón taobh amuigh.\n"
"\n"
"Chomh maith leis sin, má tá 'Moilligh d'imlínte coirníneacha' díchumasaithe, "
"beidh sé mar luas priontála na mballaí starráin a bhfuil níos lú ná 13% de "
"thaca acu, cibé acu is cuid de dhroichead nó de starrán iad."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Speed of internal bridges. If the value is expressed as a percentage, it "
"will be calculated based on the bridge_speed. Default value is 150%."
msgstr ""
"Luas na ndroichead inmheánach. Má léirítear an luach mar chéatadán, ríomhfar "
"é bunaithe ar bridge_speed. Is é 150% an luach réamhshocraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the distance from the model to the outermost brim line."
msgstr "Seo é an fad ón tsamhail go dtí an líne imill is faide amach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Leading brim length"
msgstr "Fad an imill tosaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Belt printers only. Extends the brim AHEAD of the object along the belt, on "
"every downhill-facing edge of its contact area - both the object's first "
"contact with the belt and any island that lands later. This apron is laid "
"onto the belt before the object reaches it, so the leading edge has "
"something already stuck down to hold on to.\n"
"\n"
"Measured on the belt surface, and added on top of Brim width: the brim "
"reaches Brim-object gap + Leading brim length + Brim width ahead of the "
"object. Set Brim-object gap to 0, or the apron will not touch the object it "
"is meant to anchor.\n"
"\n"
"On a tilted belt each layer lays one strip of the brim, so the thickness of "
"the resulting brim sheet is set by flow rather than by layer height. Use "
"Brim flow ratio to tune it.\n"
"\n"
"Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Printéirí crios amháin. Síneann sé an t-imeall ROIMH an réad feadh an "
"chreasa, ar gach imeall a bhfuil a aghaidh le fána dá limistéar teagmhála - "
"an chéad teagmháil a dhéanann an réad leis an gcrios agus aon oileán a "
"thuirlingíonn níos déanaí. Leagtar an naprún seo ar an gcrios sula "
"sroicheann an réad é, ionas go mbeidh rud éigin greamaithe síos cheana ag an "
"imeall tosaigh le greim a choinneáil air.\n"
"\n"
"Tomhaiste ar dhromchla an chreasa, agus curtha le Leithead an imill: "
"sroicheann an t-imeall Bearna imeall-réada + Fad an imill tosaigh + Leithead "
"an imill roimh an réad. Socraigh Bearna imeall-réada go 0, nó ní bheidh an "
"naprún i dteagmháil leis an réad atá i gceist leis a ancaireú.\n"
"\n"
"Ar chrios claonta leagann gach sraith stiall amháin den imeall, mar sin is é "
"an sreabhadh seachas airde na sraithe a shocraíonn tiús na bileoige imill a "
"thagann as. Úsáid Cóimheas sreafa an imill chun é a thiúnadh.\n"
"\n"
"Socraigh go 0 chun é a dhíchumasú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Extra brim width"
msgstr "Leithead breise an imill"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Belt printers only. Widens the brim SIDEWAYS, across the belt, without "
"extending it further ahead of or behind the object. Use it when a part needs "
"more grip along its length than Brim width alone gives.\n"
"\n"
"Measured on the belt surface, and added on top of Brim width: the brim "
"reaches Brim-object gap + Brim width + Extra brim width to either side of "
"the object. To extend the brim ahead of the object instead, use Leading brim "
"length.\n"
"\n"
"Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Printéirí crios amháin. Leathnaíonn sé an t-imeall I LEATAOBH, trasna an "
"chreasa, gan é a shíneadh níos faide roimh an réad ná taobh thiar de. Úsáid "
"é nuair a theastaíonn níos mó greama ó pháirt feadh a faid ná mar a thugann "
"Leithead an imill amháin.\n"
"\n"
"Tomhaiste ar dhromchla an chreasa, agus curtha le Leithead an imill: "
"sroicheann an t-imeall Bearna imeall-réada + Leithead an imill + Leithead "
"breise an imill ar gach taobh den réad. Chun an t-imeall a shíneadh roimh an "
"réad ina ionad, úsáid Fad an imill tosaigh.\n"
"\n"
"Socraigh go 0 chun é a dhíchumasú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Brim type"
msgstr "Cineál imill"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This controls the generation of the brim at outer and/or inner side of "
"models. Auto means the brim width is analyzed and calculated automatically."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn sé seo giniúint an imill ar an taobh amuigh agus/nó istigh de "
"shamhlacha. Ciallaíonn Uathoibríoch go ndéantar leithead an imill a "
"anailísiú agus a ríomh go huathoibríoch."

# AI Translated
msgid "Leading edge only"
msgstr "Imeall tosaigh amháin"

# AI Translated
msgid "Brim-object gap"
msgstr "Bearna imeall-réada"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This creates a gap between the innermost brim line and the object and can "
"make the brim easier to remove."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaíonn sé seo bearna idir an líne imill is faide istigh agus an réad "
"agus is féidir leis an t-imeall a dhéanamh níos éasca le baint."

# AI Translated
msgid "Brim flow ratio"
msgstr "Cóimheas sreafa an imill"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This factor affects the amount of material for brims.\n"
"\n"
"The actual brim flow used is calculated by multiplying this value by the "
"filament flow ratio, and if set, the object's flow ratio.\n"
"\n"
"Note: The resulting value will not be affected by the first-layer flow ratio."
msgstr ""
"Téann an fachtóir seo i bhfeidhm ar mhéid an ábhair d'imill.\n"
"\n"
"Ríomhtar sreabhadh iarbhír an imill tríd an luach seo a iolrú faoi chóimheas "
"sreafa an fhiliméid, agus má tá sé socraithe, faoi chóimheas sreafa an "
"réada.\n"
"\n"
"Nóta: Ní rachaidh cóimheas sreafa na chéad sraithe i bhfeidhm ar an luach a "
"thagann as."

# AI Translated
msgid "Brim follows compensated outline"
msgstr "Leanann an t-imeall an imlíne chúitithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When enabled, the brim is aligned with the first-layer perimeter geometry "
"after Elephant Foot Compensation is applied.\n"
"This option is intended for cases where Elephant Foot Compensation "
"significantly alters the first-layer footprint.\n"
"\n"
"If your current setup already works well, enabling it may be unnecessary and "
"can cause the brim to fuse with upper layers."
msgstr ""
"Nuair atá sé cumasaithe, ailínítear an t-imeall le céimseata imlíne na chéad "
"sraithe tar éis Cúiteamh Chos na hEilifinte a chur i bhfeidhm.\n"
"Tá an rogha seo beartaithe do chásanna ina n-athraíonn Cúiteamh Chos na "
"hEilifinte lorg na chéad sraithe go suntasach.\n"
"\n"
"Má oibríonn do shocrú reatha go maith cheana, b'fhéidir nach bhfuil gá é a "
"chumasú agus d'fhéadfadh sé go gcomhleáfadh an t-imeall le sraitheanna "
"uachtair."

# AI Translated
msgid "Combine brims"
msgstr "Comhcheangail imill"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Combine multiple brims into one when they are close to each other. This can "
"improve brim adhesion."
msgstr ""
"Comhcheangail imill iolracha ina gceann amháin nuair a bhíonn siad gar dá "
"chéile. Is féidir leis seo greamaitheacht an imill a fheabhsú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Brim ears"
msgstr "Cluasa imill"

# AI Translated
msgid "Only draw brim over the sharp edges of the model."
msgstr "Ná tarraing imeall ach thar imill ghéara na samhla."

# AI Translated
msgid "Brim ear max angle"
msgstr "Uasuillinn chluas an imill"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Maximum angle to let a brim ear appear.\n"
"If set to 0, no brim will be created.\n"
"If set to ~180, brim will be created on everything but straight sections."
msgstr ""
"Uasuillinn chun ligean do chluas imill a bheith ann.\n"
"Má shocraítear go 0 é, ní chruthófar aon imeall.\n"
"Má shocraítear go ~180 é, cruthófar imeall ar gach rud seachas codanna "
"díreacha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Brim ear detection radius"
msgstr "Ga braite chluasa an imill"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The geometry will be decimated before detecting sharp angles. This parameter "
"indicates the minimum length of the deviation for the decimation.\n"
"0 to deactivate."
msgstr ""
"Laghdófar an chéimseata sula mbraitear uillinneacha géara. Léiríonn an "
"paraiméadar seo íosfhad an diallta don laghdú.\n"
"0 chun é a dhíghníomhachtú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Brim ears outer only"
msgstr "Cluasa imill ar an taobh amuigh amháin"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Generate mouse ears only on the outer contour of the model, excluding holes "
"and enclosed sections."
msgstr ""
"Gin cluasa luiche ar chomhrian seachtrach na samhla amháin, gan poill agus "
"codanna iata."

# AI Translated
msgid "upward compatible machine"
msgstr "meaisín comhoiriúnach aníos"

# AI Translated
msgid "Condition"
msgstr "Coinníoll"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"A Boolean expression using the configuration values of an active printer "
"profile. If this expression evaluates to true, this profile is considered "
"compatible with the active printer profile."
msgstr ""
"Slonn Boole a úsáideann luachanna cumraíochta próifíle printéara "
"ghníomhaigh. Má fhaightear fíor don slonn seo, meastar go bhfuil an phróifíl "
"seo comhoiriúnach leis an bpróifíl printéara ghníomhach."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"A Boolean expression using the configuration values of an active print "
"profile. If this expression evaluates to true, this profile is considered "
"compatible with the active print profile."
msgstr ""
"Slonn Boole a úsáideann luachanna cumraíochta próifíle priontála gníomhaí. "
"Má fhaightear fíor don slonn seo, meastar go bhfuil an phróifíl seo "
"comhoiriúnach leis an bpróifíl phriontála ghníomhach."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This determines the print sequence, allowing you to print layer-by-layer or "
"object-by-object."
msgstr ""
"Cinneann sé seo seicheamh na priontála, rud a ligeann duit priontáil sraith "
"ar shraith nó réad ar réad."

# AI Translated
msgid "By layer"
msgstr "De réir sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "By object"
msgstr "De réir réada"

# AI Translated
msgid "Intra-layer order"
msgstr "Ord laistigh den tsraith"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Order in which object instances are visited within a single layer, which "
"controls how much travel is spent moving between them.\n"
"\n"
"Default: nearest-neighbor chaining, refined with 2-opt and crossing removal. "
"A good general choice.\n"
"As object list: instances are printed in the same order as the object list, "
"without any path optimization. Use it when you need a predictable, manually "
"controlled order.\n"
"Best of all (shortest path): every strategy is evaluated and the shortest "
"one is used. The object instance order is decided once for the whole print, "
"while the ordering of individual islands is decided per layer, so different "
"layers may end up using different strategies. Slightly slower to slice.\n"
"Snake: serpentine row-by-row traversal, refined with 2-opt. Well suited to "
"regular grids of many small parts.\n"
"\n"
"With multiple filaments or tools in the same layer, minimizing tool changes "
"takes priority: objects are grouped by filament first and this setting only "
"orders the instances within each filament group, so the overall sequence may "
"not look like the shortest path across the plate."
msgstr ""
"An t-ord ina dtugtar cuairt ar chásanna réad laistigh de shraith aonair, rud "
"a rialaíonn an méid taistil a chaitear ag bogadh eatarthu.\n"
"\n"
"Réamhshocrú: slabhrú an chomharsa is gaire, mionchoigeartaithe le 2-opt agus "
"baint trasnuithe. Rogha ghinearálta mhaith.\n"
"Mar liosta na réad: priontáiltear cásanna san ord céanna le liosta na réad, "
"gan aon optamú conaire. Úsáid é nuair a theastaíonn ord intuartha a "
"rialaítear de láimh uait.\n"
"An ceann is fearr díobh go léir (an chonair is giorra): meastar gach "
"straitéis agus úsáidtear an ceann is giorra. Socraítear ord chásanna na réad "
"uair amháin don phriontáil ar fad, agus socraítear ord na n-oileán aonair in "
"aghaidh na sraithe, mar sin d'fhéadfadh sraitheanna éagsúla straitéisí "
"éagsúla a úsáid. Beagán níos moille le slisniú.\n"
"Nathair: trasnú sraoilleach ró ar ró, mionchoigeartaithe le 2-opt. Oiriúnach "
"go maith do ghreillí rialta de go leor páirteanna beaga.\n"
"\n"
"Le filiméid nó uirlisí iolracha sa tsraith chéanna, tá tosaíocht ag "
"íoslaghdú athruithe uirlise: grúpáiltear réada de réir filiméid ar dtús agus "
"ní ordaíonn an socrú seo ach na cásanna laistigh de gach grúpa filiméid, mar "
"sin b'fhéidir nach mbeidh cuma na conaire is giorra trasna an phláta ar an "
"seicheamh foriomlán."

# AI Translated
msgid "As object list"
msgstr "Mar liosta na réad"

# AI Translated
msgid "Best of all (shortest path)"
msgstr "An ceann is fearr díobh go léir (an chonair is giorra)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Snake"
msgstr "Nathair"

# AI Translated
msgid "Slow printing down for better layer cooling"
msgstr "Moilligh an phriontáil le haghaidh fuarú níos fearr sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable this option to slow printing speed down to ensure that the final "
"layer time is not shorter than the layer time threshold in \"Max fan speed "
"threshold\", so that the layer can be cooled for a longer time. This can "
"improve the quality for small details."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh an rogha seo chun luas na priontála a mhoilliú lena chinntiú nach "
"bhfuil am na sraithe deiridh níos giorra ná tairseach am na sraithe in "
"\"Tairseach uasluas an ghaothráin\", ionas gur féidir an tsraith a fhuarú ar "
"feadh tréimhse níos faide. Is féidir leis seo cáilíocht mionsonraí beaga a "
"fheabhsú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Normal printing"
msgstr "Gnáthphriontáil"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the default acceleration for both normal printing and travel after "
"the first layer."
msgstr ""
"Seo é an luasghéarú réamhshocraithe don ghnáthphriontáil agus don taisteal "
"tar éis na chéad sraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Acceleration of travel moves."
msgstr "Luasghéarú na ngluaiseachtaí taistil."

# AI Translated
msgid "First layer travel"
msgstr "Taisteal na chéad sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Travel acceleration of first layer.\n"
"The percentage value is relative to Travel Acceleration."
msgstr ""
"Luasghéarú taistil na chéad sraithe.\n"
"Tá an luach céatadáin coibhneasta le Luasghéarú an Taistil."

# AI Translated
msgid "mm/s² or %"
msgstr "mm/s² nó %"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Acceleration of bridges. If the value is expressed as a percentage (e.g. "
"50%), it will be calculated based on the outer wall acceleration."
msgstr ""
"Luasghéarú na ndroichead. Má léirítear an luach mar chéatadán (m.sh. 50%), "
"ríomhfar é bunaithe ar luasghéarú an bhalla sheachtraigh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Default filament profile"
msgstr "Próifíl fhiliméid réamhshocraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Default filament profile when switching to this machine profile."
msgstr ""
"Próifíl fhiliméid réamhshocraithe nuair a athraítear go dtí próifíl an "
"mheaisín seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Default process profile"
msgstr "Próifíl phróisis réamhshocraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Default process profile when switching to this machine profile."
msgstr ""
"Próifíl phróisis réamhshocraithe nuair a athraítear go dtí próifíl an "
"mheaisín seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Activate air filtration"
msgstr "Gníomhachtaigh scagadh aeir"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Activate for better air filtration.\n"
"G-code command: M106 P3 S(0-255)"
msgstr ""
"Gníomhachtaigh le haghaidh scagadh aeir níos fearr.\n"
"Ordú G-code: M106 P3 S(0-255)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable this to override the fan speed set in custom G-code during print."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh é seo chun luas an ghaothráin atá socraithe i G-code saincheaptha "
"a shárú le linn priontála."

# AI Translated
msgid "On completion"
msgstr "Ag an gcríoch"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable this to override the fan speed set in custom G-code after print "
"completion."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh é seo chun luas an ghaothráin atá socraithe i G-code saincheaptha "
"a shárú tar éis don phriontáil críochnú."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Speed of exhaust fan during printing. This speed will override the speed in "
"filament custom G-code."
msgstr ""
"Luas an ghaothráin sceite le linn priontála. Sáróidh an luas seo an luas i "
"G-code saincheaptha an fhiliméid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Speed of exhaust fan after printing completes."
msgstr "Luas an ghaothráin sceite tar éis don phriontáil críochnú."

# AI Translated
msgid "No cooling for the first"
msgstr "Gan fuarú don chéad"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Turn off all cooling fans for the first few layers. This can be used to "
"improve build plate adhesion."
msgstr ""
"Múch gach gaothrán fuaraithe don chéad chúpla sraith. Is féidir é seo a "
"úsáid chun greamaitheacht leis an bpláta tógála a fheabhsú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Don't support bridges"
msgstr "Ná cuir tacaí faoi dhroichid"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This disables supporting bridges, which decreases the amount of support "
"required. Bridges can usually be printed directly without support over a "
"reasonable distance."
msgstr ""
"Díchumasaíonn sé seo tacaí faoi dhroichid, rud a laghdaíonn méid na dtacaí "
"atá de dhíth. De ghnáth is féidir droichid a phriontáil go díreach gan tacaí "
"thar fhad réasúnta."

# AI Translated
msgid "Thick external bridges"
msgstr "Droichid sheachtracha tiubha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, bridge extrusion uses a line height equal to the nozzle "
"diameter.\n"
"This increases bridge strength and reliability, allowing longer spans, but "
"may worsen appearance.\n"
"If disabled, bridges may look better but are generally reliable only for "
"shorter spans."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, úsáideann easbhrú droichid airde líne atá cothrom le "
"trastomhas an tsoic.\n"
"Méadaíonn sé seo neart agus iontaofacht an droichid, rud a cheadaíonn réisí "
"níos faide, ach d'fhéadfadh sé an chuma a dhéanamh níos measa.\n"
"Má tá sé díchumasaithe, d'fhéadfadh cuma níos fearr a bheith ar dhroichid "
"ach go ginearálta ní bhíonn siad iontaofa ach do réisí níos giorra."

# AI Translated
msgid "Thick internal bridges"
msgstr "Droichid inmheánacha tiubha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, internal bridge extrusion uses a line height equal to the nozzle "
"diameter.\n"
"This increases internal bridge strength and reliability when printed over "
"sparse infill, but may worsen appearance.\n"
"If disabled, internal bridges may look better but can be less reliable over "
"sparse infill."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, úsáideann easbhrú droichead inmheánach airde líne atá "
"cothrom le trastomhas an tsoic.\n"
"Méadaíonn sé seo neart agus iontaofacht an droichid inmheánaigh nuair a "
"phriontáiltear thar líonadh tanaí é, ach d'fhéadfadh sé an chuma a dhéanamh "
"níos measa.\n"
"Má tá sé díchumasaithe, d'fhéadfadh cuma níos fearr a bheith ar dhroichid "
"inmheánacha ach d'fhéadfaidís a bheith níos lú iontaofa thar líonadh tanaí."

# AI Translated
msgid "Extra bridge layers (beta)"
msgstr "Sraitheanna droichid breise (béite)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This option enables the generation of an extra bridge layer over internal "
"and/or external bridges.\n"
"\n"
"Extra bridge layers help improve bridge appearance and reliability, as the "
"solid infill is better supported. This is especially useful in fast "
"printers, where the bridge and solid infill speeds vary greatly. The extra "
"bridge layer results in reduced pillowing on top surfaces, as well as "
"reduced separation of the external bridge layer from its surrounding "
"perimeters.\n"
"\n"
"It is generally recommended to set this to at least 'External bridge only', "
"unless specific issues with the sliced model are found.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"1. Disabled - does not generate second bridge layers. This is the default "
"and is set for compatibility purposes\n"
"2. External bridge only - generates second bridge layers for external-facing "
"bridges only. Please note that small bridges that are shorter or narrower "
"than the set number of perimeters will be skipped as they would not benefit "
"from a second bridge layer. If generated, the second bridge layer will be "
"extruded parallel to the first bridge layer to reinforce the bridge "
"strength\n"
"3. Internal bridge only - generates second bridge layers for internal "
"bridges over sparse infill only. Please note that the internal bridges count "
"towards the top shell layer count of your model. The second internal bridge "
"layer will be extruded as close to perpendicular to the first as possible. "
"If multiple regions in the same island, with varying bridge angles are "
"present, the last region of that island will be selected as the angle "
"reference\n"
"4. Apply to all - generates second bridge layers for both internal and "
"external-facing bridges\n"
msgstr ""
"Cumasaíonn an rogha seo giniúint sraithe droichid breise thar dhroichid "
"inmheánacha agus/nó sheachtracha.\n"
"\n"
"Cabhraíonn sraitheanna droichid breise le cuma agus iontaofacht na "
"ndroichead a fheabhsú, mar go bhfuil taca níos fearr faoin líonadh soladach. "
"Tá sé seo úsáideach go háirithe i bprintéirí tapa, ina n-athraíonn luasanna "
"an droichid agus an líonta sholadaigh go mór. Laghdaíonn an tsraith droichid "
"bhreise piliúrú ar dhromchlaí uachtair, chomh maith le scaradh na sraithe "
"droichid sheachtraigh óna himlínte máguaird.\n"
"\n"
"Moltar go ginearálta é seo a shocrú go 'Droichead seachtrach amháin' ar a "
"laghad, mura n-aimsítear fadhbanna sonracha leis an tsamhail shlisnithe.\n"
"\n"
"Roghanna:\n"
"1. Díchumasaithe - ní ghineann sé dara sraitheanna droichid. Is é seo an "
"réamhshocrú agus socraítear é ar mhaithe le comhoiriúnacht\n"
"2. Droichead seachtrach amháin - gineann sé dara sraitheanna droichid do "
"dhroichid a bhfuil a n-aghaidh amach amháin. Tabhair faoi deara go "
"scipeálfar droichid bheaga atá níos giorra nó níos cúinge ná an líon imlínte "
"socraithe mar nach mbainfidís leas as dara sraith droichid. Má ghintear í, "
"easbhrúfar an dara sraith droichid comhthreomhar leis an gcéad sraith "
"droichid chun neart an droichid a threisiú\n"
"3. Droichead inmheánach amháin - gineann sé dara sraitheanna droichid do "
"dhroichid inmheánacha thar líonadh tanaí amháin. Tabhair faoi deara go "
"gcuirtear na droichid inmheánacha san áireamh i líon shraitheanna blaoisce "
"uachtair do shamhla. Easbhrúfar an dara sraith droichid inmheánaigh chomh "
"gar do ingearach leis an gcéad cheann agus is féidir. Má tá réigiúin "
"iolracha san oileán céanna le huillinneacha droichid éagsúla, roghnófar "
"réigiún deireanach an oileáin sin mar thagairt uillinne\n"
"4. Cuir i bhfeidhm ar gach ceann - gineann sé dara sraitheanna droichid do "
"dhroichid inmheánacha agus do dhroichid a bhfuil a n-aghaidh amach araon\n"

# AI Translated
msgid "External bridge only"
msgstr "Droichead seachtrach amháin"

# AI Translated
msgid "Internal bridge only"
msgstr "Droichead inmheánach amháin"

# AI Translated
msgid "Apply to all"
msgstr "Cuir i bhfeidhm ar gach ceann"

# AI Translated
msgid "Filter out small internal bridges"
msgstr "Scag amach droichid inmheánacha bheaga"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This option can help reduce pillowing on top surfaces in heavily slanted or "
"curved models.\n"
"By default, small internal bridges are filtered out and the internal solid "
"infill is printed directly over the sparse infill. This works well in most "
"cases, speeding up printing without too much compromise on top surface "
"quality.\n"
"However, in heavily slanted or curved models, especially where too low a "
"sparse infill density is used, this may result in curling of the unsupported "
"solid infill, causing pillowing.\n"
"Enabling limited filtering or no filtering will print internal bridge layer "
"over slightly unsupported internal solid infill. The options below control "
"the sensitivity of the filtering, i.e. they control where internal bridges "
"are created:\n"
"1. Filter - enables this option. This is the default behavior and works well "
"in most cases\n"
"2. Limited filtering - creates internal bridges on heavily slanted surfaces "
"while avoiding unnecessary bridges. This works well for most difficult "
"models\n"
"3. No filtering - creates internal bridges on every potential internal "
"overhang. This option is useful for heavily slanted top surface models; "
"however, in most cases, it creates too many unnecessary bridges."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leis an rogha seo cabhrú le piliúrú a laghdú ar dhromchlaí "
"uachtair i samhlacha an-chlaonta nó cuartha.\n"
"De réir réamhshocraithe, scagtar amach droichid inmheánacha bheaga agus "
"priontáiltear an líonadh soladach inmheánach go díreach thar an líonadh "
"tanaí. Oibríonn sé seo go maith i bhformhór na gcásanna, ag brostú na "
"priontála gan mórán cailliúna ar cháilíocht an dromchla uachtair.\n"
"Mar sin féin, i samhlacha an-chlaonta nó cuartha, go háirithe nuair a "
"úsáidtear dlús líonta thanaí ró-íseal, d'fhéadfadh coirníniú an líonta "
"sholadaigh gan taca teacht as seo, rud a chruthaíonn piliúrú.\n"
"Má chumasaítear scagadh teoranta nó gan scagadh, priontálfar sraith droichid "
"inmheánaigh thar líonadh soladach inmheánach atá beagán gan taca. Rialaíonn "
"na roghanna thíos íogaireacht an scagtha, i.e. rialaíonn siad cá "
"gcruthaítear droichid inmheánacha:\n"
"1. Scag - cumasaíonn sé an rogha seo. Is é seo an t-iompar réamhshocraithe "
"agus oibríonn sé go maith i bhformhór na gcásanna\n"
"2. Scagadh teoranta - cruthaíonn sé droichid inmheánacha ar dhromchlaí "
"an-chlaonta agus seachnaíonn sé droichid nach bhfuil gá leo. Oibríonn sé seo "
"go maith d'fhormhór na samhlacha deacra\n"
"3. Gan scagadh - cruthaíonn sé droichid inmheánacha ar gach starrán "
"inmheánach féideartha. Tá an rogha seo úsáideach do shamhlacha le dromchlaí "
"uachtair an-chlaonta; ach i bhformhór na gcásanna, cruthaíonn sé an iomarca "
"droichead nach bhfuil gá leo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Filter"
msgstr "Scag"

# AI Translated
msgid "Limited filtering"
msgstr "Scagadh teoranta"

# AI Translated
msgid "No filtering"
msgstr "Gan scagadh"

# AI Translated
msgid "Max bridge length"
msgstr "Uasfhad droichid"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the maximum length of bridges that don't need support. Set it to 0 "
"if you want all bridges to be supported, and set it to a very large value if "
"you don't want any bridges to be supported."
msgstr ""
"Seo é uasfhad na ndroichead nach bhfuil tacaí de dhíth orthu. Socraigh go 0 "
"é más mian leat tacaí faoi gach droichead, agus socraigh go luach an-mhór é "
"mura dteastaíonn tacaí faoi aon droichead uait."

# AI Translated
msgid "End G-code"
msgstr "G-code deiridh"

# AI Translated
msgid "Add end G-code when finishing the entire print."
msgstr "Cuir G-code deiridh leis nuair a chríochnaítear an phriontáil ar fad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Between Object G-code"
msgstr "G-code idir Réada"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Insert G-code between objects. This parameter will only come into effect "
"when you print your models object by object."
msgstr ""
"Cuir G-code isteach idir réada. Ní bheidh éifeacht ag an bparaiméadar seo "
"ach nuair a phriontálann tú do shamhlacha réad ar réad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Add end G-code when finishing the printing of this filament."
msgstr ""
"Cuir G-code deiridh leis nuair a chríochnaítear priontáil an fhiliméid seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Ensure vertical shell thickness"
msgstr "Cinntigh tiús na blaoisce ingearaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Add solid infill near sloping surfaces to guarantee the vertical shell "
"thickness (top+bottom solid layers)\n"
"None: No solid infill will be added anywhere. Caution: Use this option "
"carefully if your model has sloped surfaces\n"
"Critical Only: Avoid adding solid infill for walls\n"
"Moderate: Add solid infill for heavily sloping surfaces only\n"
"All: Add solid infill for all suitable sloping surfaces\n"
"Default value is All."
msgstr ""
"Cuir líonadh soladach leis in aice le dromchlaí fánacha chun tiús na "
"blaoisce ingearaí a ráthú (sraitheanna soladacha uachtair+íochtair)\n"
"Dada: Ní chuirfear líonadh soladach leis áit ar bith. Aire: Úsáid an rogha "
"seo go cúramach má tá dromchlaí fánacha ar do shamhail\n"
"Criticiúil Amháin: Seachain líonadh soladach a chur leis do bhallaí\n"
"Measartha: Cuir líonadh soladach leis do dhromchlaí an-fhánacha amháin\n"
"Gach: Cuir líonadh soladach leis do gach dromchla fánach oiriúnach\n"
"Is é Gach an luach réamhshocraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Critical Only"
msgstr "Criticiúil Amháin"

# AI Translated
msgid "Moderate"
msgstr "Measartha"

# AI Translated
msgid "Top surface pattern"
msgstr "Patrún an dromchla uachtair"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the line pattern for top surface infill."
msgstr "Seo é patrún líne líonadh an dromchla uachtair."

# AI Translated
msgid "Monotonic"
msgstr "Monatónach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Monotonic line"
msgstr "Líne mhonatónach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Rectilinear"
msgstr "Dronlíneach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Aligned Rectilinear"
msgstr "Dronlíneach Ailínithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Concentric"
msgstr "Comhlárnach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Spiral Inset"
msgstr "Ionsá Bíseach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Hilbert Curve"
msgstr "Cuar Hilbert"

# AI Translated
msgid "Archimedean Chords"
msgstr "Corda Airciméideacha"

# AI Translated
msgid "Octagram Spiral"
msgstr "Bís Ochtagraim"

# AI Translated
msgid "Top surface density"
msgstr "Dlús an dromchla uachtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Density of top surface layer. A value of 100% creates a fully solid, smooth "
"top layer. Reducing this value results in a textured top surface, according "
"to the chosen top surface pattern. A value of 0% will result in only the "
"walls on the top layer being created. Intended for aesthetic or functional "
"purposes, not to fix issues such as over-extrusion."
msgstr ""
"Dlús shraith an dromchla uachtair. Cruthaíonn luach 100% sraith uachtair go "
"hiomlán soladach agus mín. Má laghdaítear an luach seo, gheofar dromchla "
"uachtair uigeachta, de réir an phatrúin dromchla uachtair roghnaithe. Mar "
"thoradh ar luach 0% ní chruthófar ach na ballaí ar an tsraith uachtair. "
"Beartaithe chun críocha aeistéitiúla nó feidhmiúla, ní chun fadhbanna mar "
"ró-easbhrú a réiteach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Top surface expansion"
msgstr "Leathnú an dromchla uachtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Expands the top surfaces by this distance to connect distinct top surfaces "
"and fill gaps.\n"
"Useful for cases where the top surface is interrupted by a raised feature, "
"such as text on a plane. Expanding it removes the holes beneath these "
"features and creates a continuous path with a better finish for printing on "
"top. The expansion is applied to the original top surface, before any other "
"processing such as bridging or overhang detection."
msgstr ""
"Leathnaíonn sé na dromchlaí uachtair faoin bhfad seo chun dromchlaí uachtair "
"ar leith a nascadh agus bearnaí a líonadh.\n"
"Úsáideach i gcásanna ina gcuireann gné ardaithe isteach ar an dromchla "
"uachtair, mar théacs ar phlána. Baineann an leathnú na poill faoi na gnéithe "
"seo agus cruthaíonn sé conair leanúnach le bailchríoch níos fearr le "
"priontáil uirthi. Cuirtear an leathnú i bhfeidhm ar an dromchla uachtair "
"bunaidh, roimh aon phróiseáil eile ar nós brath droichead nó starrán."

# AI Translated
msgid "Top expansion wall margin"
msgstr "Imeall balla an leathnaithe uachtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Using “Top surface expansion” may cause a surface that did not previously "
"touch the model's outer walls to now do so.\n"
"This can cause contraction marks (such as the hull line) on the outer "
"walls.\n"
"By adding a small margin, this contraction will not occur directly on the "
"walls, thereby preventing a visible mark."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh “Leathnú an dromchla uachtair” a chur faoi deara go dtagann "
"dromchla nach raibh i dteagmháil le ballaí seachtracha na samhla roimhe seo "
"i dteagmháil leo anois.\n"
"D'fhéadfadh sé seo marcanna crapaidh (mar líne na cabhlach) a chruthú ar na "
"ballaí seachtracha.\n"
"Trí imeall beag a chur leis, ní tharlóidh an crapadh seo go díreach ar na "
"ballaí, rud a chuireann cosc ar mharc infheicthe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Top expansion direction"
msgstr "Treo an leathnaithe uachtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Direction in which the top surface expansion grows.\n"
" - Inward grows into the holes and gaps left by features rising from the "
"middle of a top surface.\n"
" - Outward grows the outer edge of the surface, connecting surfaces "
"separated by features that can divide a surface, such as a lattice pattern.\n"
" - Inward and Outward does both."
msgstr ""
"An treo ina bhfásann leathnú an dromchla uachtair.\n"
" - Fásann Isteach isteach sna poill agus sna bearnaí a fhágann gnéithe a "
"éiríonn as lár dromchla uachtair.\n"
" - Fásann Amach imeall seachtrach an dromchla, ag nascadh dromchlaí atá "
"scartha ag gnéithe ar féidir leo dromchla a roinnt, mar phatrún laitíse.\n"
" - Déanann Isteach agus Amach an dá rud."

# AI Translated
msgid "Inward and Outward"
msgstr "Isteach agus Amach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Inward"
msgstr "Isteach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Outward"
msgstr "Amach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Bottom surface pattern"
msgstr "Patrún an dromchla íochtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the line pattern of bottom surface infill, not including bridge "
"infill."
msgstr ""
"Seo é patrún líne líonadh an dromchla íochtair, gan líonadh droichid san "
"áireamh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bottom surface density"
msgstr "Dlús an dromchla íochtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Density of the bottom surface layer. Intended for aesthetic or functional "
"purposes, not to fix issues such as over-extrusion.\n"
"WARNING: Lowering this value may negatively affect bed adhesion."
msgstr ""
"Dlús shraith an dromchla íochtair. Beartaithe chun críocha aeistéitiúla nó "
"feidhmiúla, ní chun fadhbanna mar ró-easbhrú a réiteach.\n"
"RABHADH: D'fhéadfadh laghdú an luacha seo dochar a dhéanamh do "
"ghreamaitheacht na leapa."

# AI Translated
msgid "Top surface fill order"
msgstr "Ord líonta an dromchla uachtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Direction in which top surfaces are filled when using a center-based pattern "
"(Concentric, Spiral Inset, Archimedean Chords, Octagram Spiral).\n"
"Outward starts at the center of the surface, so any excess material is "
"pushed towards the edge where it is least visible. Inward starts at the edge "
"and ends with the tight curves at the center.\n"
"Default uses shortest-path ordering, which may run in either direction."
msgstr ""
"An treo ina líontar dromchlaí uachtair nuair a úsáidtear patrún "
"láir-bhunaithe (Comhlárnach, Ionsá Bíseach, Corda Airciméideacha, Bís "
"Ochtagraim).\n"
"Tosaíonn Amach i lár an dromchla, mar sin brúitear aon ábhar breise i dtreo "
"an imill áit is lú a fheictear é. Tosaíonn Isteach ag an imeall agus "
"críochnaíonn sé leis na cuair dhiana sa lár.\n"
"Úsáideann Réamhshocrú ordú na conaire is giorra, a d'fhéadfadh rith i dtreo "
"ar bith."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bottom surface fill order"
msgstr "Ord líonta an dromchla íochtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Direction in which bottom surfaces are filled when using a center-based "
"pattern (Concentric, Spiral Inset, Archimedean Chords, Octagram Spiral).\n"
"Inward starts each surface with the wider outer curves, which improves first "
"layer adhesion on build plates where the tight curves at the center may not "
"stick. Outward starts at the center, pushing any excess material towards the "
"edge.\n"
"Default uses shortest-path ordering, which may run in either direction."
msgstr ""
"An treo ina líontar dromchlaí íochtair nuair a úsáidtear patrún "
"láir-bhunaithe (Comhlárnach, Ionsá Bíseach, Corda Airciméideacha, Bís "
"Ochtagraim).\n"
"Tosaíonn Isteach gach dromchla leis na cuair sheachtracha níos leithne, rud "
"a fheabhsaíonn greamaitheacht na chéad sraithe ar phlátaí tógála nach "
"ngreamódh na cuair dhiana sa lár dóibh b'fhéidir. Tosaíonn Amach sa lár, ag "
"brú aon ábhar breise i dtreo an imill.\n"
"Úsáideann Réamhshocrú ordú na conaire is giorra, a d'fhéadfadh rith i dtreo "
"ar bith."

# AI Translated
msgid "Internal solid infill pattern"
msgstr "Patrún an líonta sholadaigh inmheánaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Line pattern of internal solid infill. if the detect narrow internal solid "
"infill be enabled, the concentric pattern will be used for the small area."
msgstr ""
"Patrún líne an líonta sholadaigh inmheánaigh. Má tá 'braith líonadh soladach "
"inmheánach cúng' cumasaithe, úsáidfear an patrún comhlárnach don limistéar "
"beag."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Line width of outer wall. If expressed as a %, it will be computed over the "
"nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"Leithead líne an bhalla sheachtraigh. Má léirítear é mar %, ríomhfar é i "
"gcoibhneas le trastomhas an tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the printing speed for the outer walls of parts. These are generally "
"printed slower than inner walls for higher quality."
msgstr ""
"Seo é luas priontála bhallaí seachtracha na bpáirteanna. De ghnáth "
"priontáiltear iad seo níos moille ná ballaí inmheánacha le haghaidh "
"cáilíocht níos airde."

# AI Translated
msgid "Small perimeters"
msgstr "Imlínte beaga"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This separate setting will affect the speed of perimeters having radius <= "
"small_perimeter_threshold (usually holes). If expressed as percentage (for "
"example: 80%) it will be calculated on the outer wall speed setting above."
msgstr ""
"Rachaidh an socrú ar leith seo i bhfeidhm ar luas na n-imlínte a bhfuil ga "
"<= small_perimeter_threshold acu (poill de ghnáth). Má léirítear é mar "
"chéatadán (mar shampla: 80%) ríomhfar é ar shocrú luas an bhalla "
"sheachtraigh thuas."

# AI Translated
msgid "Small perimeters threshold"
msgstr "Tairseach imlínte beaga"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This sets the threshold for small perimeter length. Default threshold is 0mm."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn sé seo an tairseach d'fhad imlíne bheag. Is é 0mm an tairseach "
"réamhshocraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Small support perimeters"
msgstr "Imlínte taca beaga"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Same as \"Small perimeters\", but for supports. This separate setting will "
"affect the speed of support for areas <= "
"`small_support_perimeter_threshold`. If expressed as a percentage (for "
"example: 80%), it will be calculated on the support or support interface "
"speed setting above."
msgstr ""
"Mar an gcéanna le \"Imlínte beaga\", ach do thacaí. Rachaidh an socrú ar "
"leith seo i bhfeidhm ar luas na dtacaí do limistéir <= "
"`small_support_perimeter_threshold`. Má léirítear é mar chéatadán (mar "
"shampla: 80%), ríomhfar é ar shocrú luas na dtacaí nó chomhéadan na dtacaí "
"thuas."

# AI Translated
msgid "Small support perimeters threshold"
msgstr "Tairseach imlínte taca beaga"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This sets the threshold for small support perimeter length. The default "
"threshold is 0mm."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn sé seo an tairseach d'fhad imlíne taca bheag. Is é 0mm an "
"tairseach réamhshocraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Walls printing order"
msgstr "Ord priontála na mballaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Print sequence of the internal (inner) and external (outer) walls.\n"
"\n"
"Use Inner/Outer for best overhangs. This is because the overhanging walls "
"can adhere to a neighbouring perimeter while printing. However, this option "
"results in slightly reduced surface quality as the external perimeter is "
"deformed by being squashed to the internal perimeter.\n"
"\n"
"Use Inner/Outer/Inner for the best external surface finish and dimensional "
"accuracy as the external wall is printed undisturbed from an internal "
"perimeter. However, overhang performance will reduce as there is no internal "
"perimeter to print the external wall against. This option requires a minimum "
"of 3 walls to be effective as it prints the internal walls from the 3rd "
"perimeter onwards first, then the external perimeter and, finally, the first "
"internal perimeter. This option is recommended over the Outer/Inner option "
"in most cases.\n"
"\n"
"Use Outer/Inner for the same external wall quality and dimensional accuracy "
"benefits of Inner/Outer/Inner option. However, the Z seams will appear less "
"consistent as the first extrusion of a new layer starts on a visible surface."
msgstr ""
"Seicheamh priontála na mballaí inmheánacha agus seachtracha.\n"
"\n"
"Úsáid Inmheánach/Seachtrach do na starráin is fearr. Tá sé seo amhlaidh mar "
"gur féidir leis na ballaí starráin greamú d'imlíne in aice láimhe le linn "
"priontála. Mar sin féin, bíonn cáilíocht dromchla beagán níos ísle mar "
"thoradh ar an rogha seo mar go ndéantar an imlíne sheachtrach a dhífhoirmiú "
"trína brú i gcoinne na himlíne inmheánaí.\n"
"\n"
"Úsáid Inmheánach/Seachtrach/Inmheánach don bhailchríoch dromchla seachtrach "
"agus don chruinneas toiseach is fearr mar go bpriontáiltear an balla "
"seachtrach gan cur isteach ó imlíne inmheánach. Mar sin féin, laghdóidh "
"feidhmíocht na starrán mar nach bhfuil aon imlíne inmheánach ann leis an "
"mballa seachtrach a phriontáil ina coinne. Teastaíonn 3 bhalla ar a laghad "
"ón rogha seo chun a bheith éifeachtach mar go bpriontálann sí na ballaí "
"inmheánacha ón 3ú himlíne ar aghaidh ar dtús, ansin an imlíne sheachtrach "
"agus, ar deireadh, an chéad imlíne inmheánach. Moltar an rogha seo thar an "
"rogha Seachtrach/Inmheánach i bhformhór na gcásanna.\n"
"\n"
"Úsáid Seachtrach/Inmheánach chun na buntáistí céanna maidir le cáilíocht an "
"bhalla sheachtraigh agus cruinneas toiseach a fháil leis an rogha "
"Inmheánach/Seachtrach/Inmheánach. Mar sin féin, beidh cuma níos lú "
"comhsheasmhach ar na huamanna Z mar go dtosaíonn an chéad easbhrú de shraith "
"nua ar dhromchla infheicthe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Inner/Outer"
msgstr "Inmheánach/Seachtrach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Outer/Inner"
msgstr "Seachtrach/Inmheánach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Inner/Outer/Inner"
msgstr "Inmheánach/Seachtrach/Inmheánach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Print infill first"
msgstr "Priontáil an líonadh ar dtús"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Order of wall/infill. When the tickbox is unchecked the walls are printed "
"first, which works best in most cases.\n"
"\n"
"Printing infill first may help with extreme overhangs as the walls have the "
"neighbouring infill to adhere to. However, the infill will slightly push out "
"the printed walls where it is attached to them, resulting in a worse "
"external surface finish. It can also cause the infill to shine through the "
"external surfaces of the part."
msgstr ""
"Ord balla/líonta. Nuair nach bhfuil an ticbhosca roghnaithe priontáiltear na "
"ballaí ar dtús, rud is fearr a oibríonn i bhformhór na gcásanna.\n"
"\n"
"D'fhéadfadh priontáil an líonta ar dtús cabhrú le starráin an-mhóra mar go "
"mbíonn an líonadh in aice láimhe ag na ballaí le greamú dó. Mar sin féin, "
"brúfaidh an líonadh na ballaí priontáilte amach beagán san áit a bhfuil sé "
"ceangailte leo, rud a fhágann bailchríoch dromchla seachtrach níos measa. "
"Féadann sé freisin go dtaitneodh an líonadh trí dhromchlaí seachtracha na "
"páirte."

# AI Translated
msgid "Wall loop direction"
msgstr "Treo lúb na mballaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The direction which the contour wall loops are extruded when looking down "
"from the top.\n"
"Holes are printed in the opposite direction to the contour to maintain "
"alignment with layers whose contour polygons are incomplete and change "
"direction, also partially forming the contour of a hole.\n"
"\n"
"This option will be disabled if spiral vase mode is enabled."
msgstr ""
"An treo ina n-easbhrúitear lúba balla an chomhrian agus tú ag féachaint "
"anuas ón mbarr.\n"
"Priontáiltear poill sa treo eile ón gcomhrian chun ailíniú a choinneáil le "
"sraitheanna a bhfuil a bpolagáin chomhrian neamhiomlán agus a athraíonn "
"treo, ag cruthú comhrian poill go páirteach freisin.\n"
"\n"
"Díchumasófar an rogha seo má tá mód vása bíseach cumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Counter clockwise"
msgstr "Tuathal"

# AI Translated
msgid "Clockwise"
msgstr "Deiseal"

# AI Translated
msgid "Distance to rod"
msgstr "Fad go dtí an tslat"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Horizontal distance of the nozzle tip to the rod's farther edge. Used for "
"collision avoidance in by-object printing."
msgstr ""
"Fad cothrománach bharr an tsoic go dtí imeall is faide na slaite. Úsáidtear "
"é chun imbhuailtí a sheachaint i bpriontáil de réir réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Height to rod"
msgstr "Airde go dtí an tslat"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Distance from the nozzle tip to the lower rod. Used for collision avoidance "
"in by-object printing."
msgstr ""
"Fad ó bharr an tsoic go dtí an tslat íochtair. Úsáidtear é chun imbhuailtí a "
"sheachaint i bpriontáil de réir réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Height to lid"
msgstr "Airde go dtí an clúdach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Distance from the nozzle tip to the lid. Used for collision avoidance in "
"by-object printing."
msgstr ""
"Fad ó bharr an tsoic go dtí an clúdach. Úsáidtear é chun imbhuailtí a "
"sheachaint i bpriontáil de réir réada."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Clearance radius around extruder: used for collision avoidance in by-object "
"printing."
msgstr ""
"Ga imréitigh timpeall an easbhrúiteora: úsáidtear é chun imbhuailtí a "
"sheachaint i bpriontáil de réir réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Nozzle height"
msgstr "Airde an tsoic"

# AI Translated
msgid "The height of nozzle tip."
msgstr "Airde bharr an tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bed mesh min"
msgstr "Íosmhéid mhogalra na leapa"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This option sets the min point for the allowed bed mesh area. Due to the "
"probe's XY offset, most printers are unable to probe the entire bed. To "
"ensure the probe point does not go outside the bed area, the minimum and "
"maximum points of the bed mesh should be set appropriately. OrcaSlicer "
"ensures that adaptive_bed_mesh_min/adaptive_bed_mesh_max values do not "
"exceed these min/max points. This information can usually be obtained from "
"your printer manufacturer.\n"
"\n"
"The default setting is (-99999, -99999), which means there are no limits, "
"thus allowing probing across the entire bed."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn an rogha seo íosphointe limistéar ceadaithe mhogalra na leapa. Mar "
"gheall ar fhritháireamh XY an tóireadóra, ní féidir le formhór na bprintéirí "
"an leaba ar fad a thóireadh. Chun a chinntiú nach dtéann pointe an "
"tóireadóra lasmuigh de limistéar na leapa, ba cheart íosphointe agus "
"uasphointe mhogalra na leapa a shocrú go cuí. Cinntíonn OrcaSlicer nach "
"sáraíonn luachanna adaptive_bed_mesh_min/adaptive_bed_mesh_max na "
"híos/uasphointí seo. De ghnáth is féidir an fhaisnéis seo a fháil ó "
"mhonaróir do phrintéara.\n"
"\n"
"Is é (-99999, -99999) an socrú réamhshocraithe, rud a chiallaíonn nach "
"bhfuil aon teorainneacha ann, agus ceadaítear tóireadh ar fud na leapa ar "
"fad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bed mesh max"
msgstr "Uasmhéid mhogalra na leapa"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This option sets the max point for the allowed bed mesh area. Due to the "
"probe's XY offset, most printers are unable to probe the entire bed. To "
"ensure the probe point does not go outside the bed area, the minimum and "
"maximum points of the bed mesh should be set appropriately. OrcaSlicer "
"ensures that adaptive_bed_mesh_min/adaptive_bed_mesh_max values do not "
"exceed these min/max points. This information can usually be obtained from "
"your printer manufacturer.\n"
"\n"
"The default setting is (99999, 99999), which means there are no limits, thus "
"allowing probing across the entire bed."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn an rogha seo uasphointe limistéar ceadaithe mhogalra na leapa. Mar "
"gheall ar fhritháireamh XY an tóireadóra, ní féidir le formhór na bprintéirí "
"an leaba ar fad a thóireadh. Chun a chinntiú nach dtéann pointe an "
"tóireadóra lasmuigh de limistéar na leapa, ba cheart íosphointe agus "
"uasphointe mhogalra na leapa a shocrú go cuí. Cinntíonn OrcaSlicer nach "
"sáraíonn luachanna adaptive_bed_mesh_min/adaptive_bed_mesh_max na "
"híos/uasphointí seo. De ghnáth is féidir an fhaisnéis seo a fháil ó "
"mhonaróir do phrintéara.\n"
"\n"
"Is é (99999, 99999) an socrú réamhshocraithe, rud a chiallaíonn nach bhfuil "
"aon teorainneacha ann, agus ceadaítear tóireadh ar fud na leapa ar fad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Probe point distance"
msgstr "Fad idir pointí tóireadh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This option sets the preferred distance between probe points (grid size) for "
"the X and Y directions, with the default being 50mm for both X and Y."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn an rogha seo an fad is fearr idir pointí tóireadh (méid na "
"greille) do threonna X agus Y, agus is é 50mm an réamhshocrú do X agus Y "
"araon."

# AI Translated
msgid "Mesh margin"
msgstr "Imeall an mhogalra"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This option determines the additional distance by which the adaptive bed "
"mesh area should be expanded in the XY directions."
msgstr ""
"Cinneann an rogha seo an fad breise ar cheart limistéar mhogalra "
"oiriúnaitheach na leapa a leathnú sna treonna XY."

# AI Translated
msgid "Grab length"
msgstr "Fad greama"

# AI Translated
msgid "Extruder Color"
msgstr "Dath an Easbhrúiteora"

# AI Translated
msgid "Only used as a visual help on UI."
msgstr "Ní úsáidtear é ach mar chabhair amhairc sa chomhéadan."

# AI Translated
msgid "Extruder offset"
msgstr "Fritháireamh an easbhrúiteora"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The material may have volumetric change after switching between molten and "
"crystalline states. This setting changes all extrusion flow of this filament "
"in G-code proportionally. The recommended value range is between 0.95 and "
"1.05. You may be able to tune this value to get a nice flat surface if there "
"is slight overflow or underflow."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh athrú toirte a bheith ar an ábhar tar éis aistriú idir staid "
"leáite agus staid chriostalach. Athraíonn an socrú seo sreabhadh easbhrúite "
"uile an fhiliméid seo sa G-code go comhréireach. Tá an raon luacha molta "
"idir 0.95 agus 1.05. B'fhéidir go mbeifeá in ann an luach seo a thiúnadh "
"chun dromchla deas cothrom a fháil má tá ró-shreabhadh nó tearc-shreabhadh "
"beag ann."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The material may have volumetric change after switching between molten and "
"crystalline states. This setting changes all extrusion flow of this filament "
"in G-code proportionally. The recommended value range is between 0.95 and "
"1.05. You may be able to tune this value to get a nice flat surface if there "
"is slight overflow or underflow.\n"
"\n"
"The final object flow ratio is this value multiplied by the filament flow "
"ratio."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh athrú toirte a bheith ar an ábhar tar éis aistriú idir staid "
"leáite agus staid chriostalach. Athraíonn an socrú seo sreabhadh easbhrúite "
"uile an fhiliméid seo sa G-code go comhréireach. Tá an raon luacha molta "
"idir 0.95 agus 1.05. B'fhéidir go mbeifeá in ann an luach seo a thiúnadh "
"chun dromchla deas cothrom a fháil má tá ró-shreabhadh nó tearc-shreabhadh "
"beag ann.\n"
"\n"
"Is é cóimheas sreafa deiridh an réada an luach seo iolraithe faoi chóimheas "
"sreafa an fhiliméid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable pressure advance"
msgstr "Cumasaigh réamhbhrú"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable pressure advance, auto calibration result will be overwritten once "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh réamhbhrú; forscríobhfar toradh an uathchalabraithe nuair a "
"chumasófar é."

# AI Translated
msgid "Pressure advance (Klipper) AKA Linear advance factor (Marlin)."
msgstr "Réamhbhrú (Klipper) nó fachtóir Linear advance (Marlin)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable adaptive pressure advance (beta)"
msgstr "Cumasaigh réamhbhrú oiriúnaitheach (béite)"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"With increasing print speeds (and hence increasing volumetric flow through "
"the nozzle) and increasing accelerations, it has been observed that the "
"effective PA value typically decreases. This means that a single PA value is "
"not always 100% optimal for all features and a compromise value is usually "
"used that does not cause too much bulging on features with lower flow speed "
"and accelerations while also not causing gaps on faster features.\n"
"\n"
"This feature aims to address this limitation by modeling the response of "
"your printer's extrusion system depending on the volumetric flow speed and "
"acceleration it is printing at. Internally, it generates a fitted model that "
"can extrapolate the needed pressure advance for any given volumetric flow "
"speed and acceleration, which is then emitted to the printer depending on "
"the current print conditions.\n"
"\n"
"When enabled, the pressure advance value above is overridden. However, a "
"reasonable default value above is strongly recommended to act as a fallback "
"and for when tool changing.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Le luasanna priontála ag méadú (agus mar sin sreabhadh toirtmhéadrach ag "
"méadú tríd an soc) agus luasghéaruithe ag méadú, tugadh faoi deara go "
"laghdaíonn an luach PA éifeachtach de ghnáth. Ciallaíonn sé seo nach mbíonn "
"luach PA aonair 100% barrmhaith i gcónaí do gach gné agus úsáidtear luach "
"comhréitigh de ghnáth nach gcruthaíonn an iomarca bolgaithe ar ghnéithe le "
"luas sreafa agus luasghéarú níos ísle agus nach gcruthaíonn bearnaí ar "
"ghnéithe níos tapa ach an oiread.\n"
"\n"
"Tá sé mar aidhm ag an ngné seo dul i ngleic leis an teorainn seo trí "
"fhreagairt chóras easbhrúite do phrintéara a mhúnlú de réir an luais sreafa "
"toirtmhéadraigh agus an luasghéaraithe ag a bhfuil sé ag priontáil. Go "
"hinmheánach, gineann sé múnla feistithe ar féidir leis an réamhbhrú "
"riachtanach a eachtarshuí d'aon luas sreafa toirtmhéadrach agus luasghéarú, "
"a eisítear chuig an bprintéir ansin de réir na gcoinníollacha priontála "
"reatha.\n"
"\n"
"Nuair atá sé cumasaithe, sáraítear an luach réamhbhrú thuas. Mar sin féin, "
"moltar go láidir luach réamhshocraithe réasúnta thuas chun feidhmiú mar "
"chúltaca agus le linn athrú uirlise.\n"
"\n"

# AI Translated
msgid "Adaptive pressure advance measurements (beta)"
msgstr "Tomhais réamhbhrú oiriúnaithigh (béite)"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"Add sets of pressure advance (PA) values, the volumetric flow speeds and "
"accelerations they were measured at, separated by a comma. One set of values "
"per line. For example\n"
"0.04,3.96,3000\n"
"0.033,3.96,10000\n"
"0.029,7.91,3000\n"
"0.026,7.91,10000\n"
"\n"
"How to calibrate:\n"
"1. Run the pressure advance test for at least 3 speeds per acceleration "
"value. It is recommended that the test is run for at least the speed of the "
"external perimeters, the speed of the internal perimeters and the fastest "
"feature print speed in your profile (usually its the sparse or solid "
"infill). Then run them for the same speeds for the slowest and fastest print "
"accelerations, and no faster than the recommended maximum acceleration as "
"given by the Klipper input shaper\n"
"2. Take note of the optimal PA value for each volumetric flow speed and "
"acceleration. You can find the flow number by selecting flow from the color "
"scheme drop down and move the horizontal slider over the PA pattern lines. "
"The number should be visible at the bottom of the page. The ideal PA value "
"should be decreasing the higher the volumetric flow is. If it is not, "
"confirm that your extruder is functioning correctly. The slower and with "
"less acceleration you print, the larger the range of acceptable PA values. "
"If no difference is visible, use the PA value from the faster test\n"
"3. Enter the triplets of PA values, Flow and Accelerations in the text box "
"here and save your filament profile."
msgstr ""
"Cuir tacair de luachanna réamhbhrú (PA) leis, na luasanna sreafa "
"toirtmhéadracha agus na luasghéaruithe ag ar tomhaiseadh iad, scartha le "
"camóg. Tacar luachanna amháin in aghaidh na líne. Mar shampla\n"
"0.04,3.96,3000\n"
"0.033,3.96,10000\n"
"0.029,7.91,3000\n"
"0.026,7.91,10000\n"
"\n"
"Conas calabrú:\n"
"1. Rith an tástáil réamhbhrú do 3 luas ar a laghad in aghaidh an luacha "
"luasghéaraithe. Moltar an tástáil a rith ar a laghad do luas na n-imlínte "
"seachtracha, luas na n-imlínte inmheánacha agus an luas priontála gné is "
"tapa i do phróifíl (de ghnáth an líonadh tanaí nó soladach). Ansin rith iad "
"do na luasanna céanna don luasghéarú priontála is moille agus is tapa, agus "
"gan a bheith níos tapa ná an t-uasluasghéarú molta a thugann múnlóir "
"ionchuir Klipper\n"
"2. Tabhair faoi deara an luach PA is fearr do gach luas sreafa "
"toirtmhéadrach agus luasghéarú. Is féidir leat uimhir an tsreafa a fháil trí "
"sreabhadh a roghnú ón roghchlár anuas scéim dathanna agus an sleamhnán "
"cothrománach a bhogadh thar línte phatrún PA. Ba cheart go mbeadh an uimhir "
"le feiceáil ag bun an leathanaigh. Ba cheart don luach PA idéalach a bheith "
"ag laghdú dá airde an sreabhadh toirtmhéadrach. Mura bhfuil, deimhnigh go "
"bhfuil d'easbhrúiteoir ag feidhmiú i gceart. Dá moille agus dá lú "
"luasghéaraithe a phriontálann tú, is ea is mó an raon luachanna PA "
"inghlactha. Mura bhfeictear aon difríocht, úsáid an luach PA ón tástáil níos "
"tapa\n"
"3. Cuir isteach na trírí luachanna PA, Sreafa agus Luasghéaraithe sa bhosca "
"téacs anseo agus sábháil do phróifíl fhiliméid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable adaptive pressure advance within features (beta)"
msgstr "Cumasaigh réamhbhrú oiriúnaitheach laistigh de ghnéithe (béite)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable adaptive PA whenever there are flow changes in a feature, such as "
"line width changes in a corner or overhangs.\n"
"\n"
"Not compatible with Prusa printers as they pause to process PA changes, "
"which causes delays and defects.\n"
"\n"
"This is an experimental option, as if the PA profile is not set accurately, "
"it will cause uniformity issues."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh PA oiriúnaitheach aon uair a bhíonn athruithe sreafa i ngné, mar "
"athruithe ar leithead líne i gcoirnéal nó i starráin.\n"
"\n"
"Níl sé comhoiriúnach le printéirí Prusa mar go stopann siad chun athruithe "
"PA a phróiseáil, rud a chruthaíonn moilleanna agus lochtanna.\n"
"\n"
"Is rogha thurgnamhach í seo, mar mura bhfuil an phróifíl PA socraithe go "
"cruinn, cruthóidh sé fadhbanna aonfhoirmeachta."

# AI Translated
msgid "Static pressure advance for bridges"
msgstr "Réamhbhrú statach do dhroichid"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Static pressure advance value for bridges. Set to 0 to apply the same "
"pressure advance as equivalent walls (using adaptive settings if enabled).\n"
"\n"
"A lower PA value when printing bridges helps reduce the appearance of slight "
"under-extrusion immediately after bridges. This is caused by the pressure "
"drop in the nozzle when printing in the air and a lower PA helps counteract "
"this."
msgstr ""
"Luach réamhbhrú statach do dhroichid. Socraigh go 0 chun an réamhbhrú céanna "
"le ballaí coibhéiseacha a chur i bhfeidhm (ag úsáid socruithe "
"oiriúnaitheacha má tá siad cumasaithe).\n"
"\n"
"Cabhraíonn luach PA níos ísle agus droichid á bpriontáil le cuma "
"tearc-easbhrú beag díreach tar éis droichead a laghdú. Tarlaíonn sé seo mar "
"gheall ar an titim bhrú sa soc agus é ag priontáil san aer agus cabhraíonn "
"PA níos ísle leis seo a fhrithchur."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Default line width if other line widths are set to 0. If expressed as a %, "
"it will be computed over the nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"Leithead líne réamhshocraithe má tá leithid líne eile socraithe go 0. Má "
"léirítear é mar %, ríomhfar é i gcoibhneas le trastomhas an tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid "Keep fan always on"
msgstr "Coinnigh an gaothrán ar siúl i gcónaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enabling this setting means that part cooling fan will never stop entirely "
"and will instead run at least at minimum speed to reduce the frequency of "
"starting and stopping."
msgstr ""
"Má chumasaítear an socrú seo, ní stopfaidh an gaothrán fuaraithe páirte go "
"hiomlán riamh agus rithfidh sé ag íosluas ar a laghad ina ionad chun "
"minicíocht a thosaithe agus a stoptha a laghdú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Don't slow down outer walls"
msgstr "Ná moilligh ballaí seachtracha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, this setting will ensure external perimeters are not slowed down "
"to meet the minimum layer time. This is particularly helpful in the below "
"scenarios:\n"
"1. To avoid changes in shine when printing glossy filaments\n"
"2. To avoid changes in external wall speed which may create slight wall "
"artifacts that appear like Z banding\n"
"3. To avoid printing at speeds which cause VFAs (fine artifacts) on the "
"external walls"
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, cinnteoidh an socrú seo nach moillítear imlínte "
"seachtracha chun íosam na sraithe a chomhlíonadh. Tá sé seo cabhrach go "
"háirithe sna cásanna thíos:\n"
"1. Chun athruithe snasa a sheachaint agus filiméid shnasta á bpriontáil\n"
"2. Chun athruithe i luas an bhalla sheachtraigh a sheachaint a d'fhéadfadh "
"déantáin bheaga balla a chruthú cosúil le bandáil Z\n"
"3. Chun priontáil ag luasanna a chruthaíonn VFAanna (déantáin mhíne) ar na "
"ballaí seachtracha a sheachaint"

# AI Translated
msgid "Layer time"
msgstr "Am sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The part cooling fan will be enabled for layers where the estimated time is "
"shorter than this value. Fan speed is interpolated between the minimum and "
"maximum fan speeds according to layer printing time."
msgstr ""
"Cumasófar an gaothrán fuaraithe páirte do shraitheanna ina bhfuil an t-am "
"measta níos giorra ná an luach seo. Idirshuitear luas an ghaothráin idir "
"íosluas agus uasluas an ghaothráin de réir am priontála na sraithe."

# AI Translated
msgctxt "second"
msgid "s"
msgstr "s"

# AI Translated
msgid "Default color"
msgstr "Dath réamhshocraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Default filament color.\n"
"Right click to reset value to system default."
msgstr ""
"Dath réamhshocraithe an fhiliméid.\n"
"Deaschliceáil chun an luach a athshocrú go réamhshocrú an chórais."

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament notes"
msgstr "Nótaí an fhiliméid"

# AI Translated
msgid "You can put your notes regarding the filament here."
msgstr "Is féidir leat do nótaí faoin bhfiliméad a chur anseo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Required nozzle HRC"
msgstr "HRC soic riachtanach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Minimum HRC of nozzle required to print the filament. A value of 0 means no "
"checking of the nozzle's HRC."
msgstr ""
"Íos-HRC an tsoic atá de dhíth chun an filiméad a phriontáil. Ciallaíonn "
"luach 0 nach ndéantar seiceáil ar HRC an tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament map to extruder"
msgstr "Mapáil filiméid go easbhrúiteoir"

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament map to extruder."
msgstr "Mapáil filiméid go easbhrúiteoir."

# AI Translated
msgid "Auto For Flush"
msgstr "Uath le haghaidh Sruthlaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Auto For Match"
msgstr "Uath le haghaidh Meaitseála"

# AI Translated
msgid "Nozzle Manual"
msgstr "Soc de Láimh"

# AI Translated
msgid "Flush temperature"
msgstr "Teocht sruthlaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Temperature when flushing filament. 0 indicates the upper bound of the "
"recommended nozzle temperature range."
msgstr ""
"Teocht agus filiméad á shruthlú. Léiríonn 0 teorainn uachtair raon molta "
"teochta an tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid "Flush temperature used in fast purge mode."
msgstr "Teocht sruthlaithe a úsáidtear i mód sruthlaithe tapa."

# AI Translated
msgid "Flush volumetric speed"
msgstr "Luas toirtmhéadrach sruthlaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Volumetric speed when flushing filament. 0 indicates the max volumetric "
"speed."
msgstr ""
"Luas toirtmhéadrach agus filiméad á shruthlú. Léiríonn 0 an t-uasluas "
"toirtmhéadrach."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This setting is the volume of filament that can be melted and extruded per "
"second. Printing speed is limited by max volumetric speed, in case of too "
"high and unreasonable speed setting. This value cannot be zero."
msgstr ""
"Is é an socrú seo toirt an fhiliméid is féidir a leá agus a easbhrú in "
"aghaidh an tsoicind. Tá luas priontála teorannaithe ag an uasluas "
"toirtmhéadrach, i gcás socrú luais ró-ard agus míréasúnta. Ní féidir leis an "
"luach seo a bheith nialasach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament load time"
msgstr "Am lódála an fhiliméid"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Time to load new filament when switch filament. It's usually applicable for "
"single-extruder multi-material machines. For tool changers or multi-tool "
"machines, it's typically 0. For statistics only."
msgstr ""
"Am chun filiméad nua a lódáil nuair a athraítear filiméad. Baineann sé de "
"ghnáth le meaisíní ilábhair aon easbhrúiteora. Do mhalartóirí uirlisí nó do "
"mheaisíní iluirlise, is 0 é de ghnáth. Le haghaidh staitisticí amháin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament unload time"
msgstr "Am díluchtaithe an fhiliméid"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Time to unload old filament when switch filament. It's usually applicable "
"for single-extruder multi-material machines. For tool changers or multi-tool "
"machines, it's typically 0. For statistics only."
msgstr ""
"Am chun an seanfhiliméad a dhíluchtú nuair a athraítear filiméad. Baineann "
"sé de ghnáth le meaisíní ilábhair aon easbhrúiteora. Do mhalartóirí uirlisí "
"nó do mheaisíní iluirlise, is 0 é de ghnáth. Le haghaidh staitisticí amháin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Tool change time"
msgstr "Am athraithe uirlise"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Time taken to switch tools. It's usually applicable for tool changers or "
"multi-tool machines. For single-extruder multi-material machines, it's "
"typically 0. For statistics only."
msgstr ""
"An t-am a thógann sé uirlisí a athrú. Baineann sé de ghnáth le malartóirí "
"uirlisí nó le meaisíní iluirlise. Do mheaisíní ilábhair aon easbhrúiteora, "
"is 0 é de ghnáth. Le haghaidh staitisticí amháin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bed temperature type"
msgstr "Cineál teocht na leapa"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This option determines how the bed temperature is set during slicing: based "
"on the temperature of the first filament or the highest temperature of the "
"printed filaments."
msgstr ""
"Cinneann an rogha seo conas a shocraítear teocht na leapa le linn slisnithe: "
"bunaithe ar theocht an chéad fhiliméid nó ar an teocht is airde de na "
"filiméid phriontáilte."

# AI Translated
msgid "By First filament"
msgstr "De réir an Chéad fhiliméid"

# AI Translated
msgid "By Highest Temp"
msgstr "De réir na Teochta is Airde"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Filament diameter is used to calculate extrusion variables in G-code, so it "
"is important that this is accurate and precise."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear trastomhas an fhiliméid chun athróga easbhrúite a ríomh sa G-code, "
"mar sin tá sé tábhachtach go bhfuil sé cruinn agus beacht."

# AI Translated
msgid "Pellet flow coefficient"
msgstr "Comhéifeacht sreafa millíní"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Pellet flow coefficient is empirically derived and allows for volume "
"calculation for pellet printers.\n"
"\n"
"Internally it is converted to filament_diameter. All other volume "
"calculations remain the same.\n"
"\n"
"filament_diameter = sqrt( (4 * pellet_flow_coefficient) / PI )"
msgstr ""
"Díorthaítear comhéifeacht sreafa na millíní go heimpíreach agus ceadaíonn sí "
"ríomh toirte do phrintéirí millíní.\n"
"\n"
"Go hinmheánach tiontaítear go filament_diameter í. Fanann gach ríomh toirte "
"eile mar an gcéanna.\n"
"\n"
"filament_diameter = sqrt( (4 * pellet_flow_coefficient) / PI )"

# AI Translated
msgid "Adaptive volumetric speed"
msgstr "Luas toirtmhéadrach oiriúnaitheach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When enabled, the extrusion flow is limited by the smaller of the fitted "
"value (calculated from line width and layer height) and the user-defined "
"maximum flow. When disabled, only the user-defined maximum flow is applied.\n"
"\n"
"Note: Experimental and incomplete feature imported from BBS. Functional for "
"some profiles that already have the variable saved."
msgstr ""
"Nuair atá sé cumasaithe, teorannaítear an sreabhadh easbhrúite ag an gceann "
"is lú den luach feistithe (ríofa ó leithead líne agus airde sraithe) agus "
"den uasráta sreafa sainithe ag an úsáideoir. Nuair atá sé díchumasaithe, ní "
"chuirtear i bhfeidhm ach an t-uasráta sreafa sainithe ag an úsáideoir.\n"
"\n"
"Nóta: Gné thurgnamhach neamhiomlán a iompórtáladh ó BBS. Feidhmiúil do "
"roinnt próifílí a bhfuil an athróg sábháilte iontu cheana."

# AI Translated
msgid "Max volumetric speed multinomial coefficients"
msgstr "Comhéifeachtaí ilnómacha an uasluais toirtmhéadraigh"

# AI Translated
msgid "Shrinkage (XY)"
msgstr "Crapadh (XY)"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"Enter the shrinkage percentage that the filament will get after cooling (94% "
"if you measure 94mm instead of 100mm). The part will be scaled in XY to "
"compensate. For multi-material prints, ensure filament shrinkage matches "
"across all used filaments.\n"
"Be sure to allow enough space between objects, as this compensation is done "
"after the checks."
msgstr ""
"Cuir isteach an céatadán crapadh a bheidh ar an bhfiliméad tar éis fuaraithe "
"(94% má thomhaiseann tú 94mm in ionad 100mm). Scálófar an pháirt in XY chun "
"é a chúiteamh. Do phriontaí ilábhair, cinntigh go bhfuil crapadh na "
"bhfiliméad mar an gcéanna ar fud na bhfiliméad go léir a úsáidtear.\n"
"Déan cinnte go bhfágann tú go leor spáis idir réada, mar go ndéantar an "
"cúiteamh seo tar éis na seiceálacha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Shrinkage (Z)"
msgstr "Crapadh (Z)"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"Enter the shrinkage percentage that the filament will get after cooling (94% "
"if you measure 94mm instead of 100mm). The part will be scaled in Z to "
"compensate."
msgstr ""
"Cuir isteach an céatadán crapadh a bheidh ar an bhfiliméad tar éis fuaraithe "
"(94% má thomhaiseann tú 94mm in ionad 100mm). Scálófar an pháirt in Z chun é "
"a chúiteamh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Adhesiveness Category"
msgstr "Catagóir Ghreamaitheachta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament category."
msgstr "Catagóir an fhiliméid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Loading speed"
msgstr "Luas lódála"

# AI Translated
msgid "Speed used for loading the filament on the wipe tower."
msgstr "Luas a úsáidtear chun an filiméad a lódáil ar an túr glanta."

# AI Translated
msgid "Loading speed at the start"
msgstr "Luas lódála ag an tús"

# AI Translated
msgid "Speed used at the very beginning of loading phase."
msgstr "Luas a úsáidtear ag tús na céime lódála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Unloading speed"
msgstr "Luas díluchtaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Speed used for unloading the filament on the wipe tower (does not affect "
"initial part of unloading just after ramming)."
msgstr ""
"Luas a úsáidtear chun an filiméad a dhíluchtú ar an túr glanta (ní théann sé "
"i bhfeidhm ar an gcéad chuid den díluchtú díreach tar éis ramála)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Unloading speed at the start"
msgstr "Luas díluchtaithe ag an tús"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Speed used for unloading the tip of the filament immediately after ramming."
msgstr ""
"Luas a úsáidtear chun barr an fhiliméid a dhíluchtú díreach tar éis ramála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Delay after unloading"
msgstr "Moill tar éis díluchtaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Time to wait after the filament is unloaded. May help to get reliable tool "
"changes with flexible materials that may need more time to shrink to "
"original dimensions."
msgstr ""
"Am le fanacht tar éis an filiméad a dhíluchtú. D'fhéadfadh sé cabhrú le "
"hathruithe uirlise iontaofa a fháil le hábhair sholúbtha a d'fhéadfadh níos "
"mó ama a bheith de dhíth orthu chun crapadh go dtí a dtoisí bunaidh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Number of cooling moves"
msgstr "Líon na ngluaiseachtaí fuaraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Filament is cooled by being moved back and forth in the cooling tubes. "
"Specify desired number of these moves."
msgstr ""
"Fuaraítear an filiméad trína bhogadh anonn is anall sna feadáin fhuaraithe. "
"Sonraigh an líon gluaiseachtaí den sórt sin atá uait."

# AI Translated
msgid "Stamping loading speed"
msgstr "Luas lódála stampála"

# AI Translated
msgid "Speed used for stamping."
msgstr "Luas a úsáidtear le haghaidh stampála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Stamping distance measured from the center of the cooling tube"
msgstr "Fad stampála tomhaiste ó lár an fheadáin fhuaraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If set to non-zero value, filament is moved toward the nozzle between the "
"individual cooling moves (\"stamping\"). This option configures how long "
"this movement should be before the filament is retracted again."
msgstr ""
"Má shocraítear é go luach neamhnialasach, bogtar an filiméad i dtreo an "
"tsoic idir na gluaiseachtaí fuaraithe aonair (\"stampáil\"). Cumraíonn an "
"rogha seo cé chomh fada is ba cheart don ghluaiseacht seo a bheith sula "
"n-aistarraingítear an filiméad arís."

# AI Translated
msgid "Speed of the first cooling move"
msgstr "Luas na chéad ghluaiseachta fuaraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Cooling moves are gradually accelerating beginning at this speed."
msgstr ""
"Luasghéaraíonn gluaiseachtaí fuaraithe de réir a chéile ag tosú ag an luas "
"seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Minimal purge on wipe tower"
msgstr "Sruthlú íosta ar an túr glanta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"After a tool change, the exact position of the newly loaded filament inside "
"the nozzle may not be known, and the filament pressure is likely not yet "
"stable. Before purging the print head into an infill or a sacrificial "
"object, Orca Slicer will always prime this amount of material into the wipe "
"tower to produce successive infill or sacrificial object extrusions reliably."
msgstr ""
"Tar éis athrú uirlise, b'fhéidir nach mbeidh suíomh cruinn an fhiliméid "
"nuaodáilte taobh istigh den soc ar eolas, agus is dócha nach bhfuil brú an "
"fhiliméid cobhsaí fós. Sula sruthlaítear an ceann priontála isteach i "
"líonadh nó i réad íobartha, príomhfaidh Orca Slicer an méid seo ábhair "
"isteach sa túr glanta i gcónaí chun easbhruthanna líonta nó réada íobartha "
"ina dhiaidh sin a tháirgeadh go hiontaofa."

# AI Translated
msgid "Wipe tower cooling"
msgstr "Fuarú an túir ghlanta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Temperature drop before entering the wipe tower."
msgstr "Titim teochta sula dtéitear isteach sa túr glanta."

# AI Translated
msgid "Interface layer pre-extrusion distance"
msgstr "Fad réamh-easbhrú shraith an chomhéadain"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Pre-extrusion distance for prime tower interface layer (where different "
"materials meet)."
msgstr ""
"Fad réamh-easbhrú do shraith chomhéadain an túir phríomhála (áit a dtagann "
"ábhair éagsúla le chéile)."

# AI Translated
# Needs human review: distance vs length: check distinction with previous entry
msgid "Interface layer pre-extrusion length"
msgstr "Fad líne réamh-easbhrú shraith an chomhéadain"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Pre-extrusion length for prime tower interface layer (where different "
"materials meet)."
msgstr ""
"Fad líne réamh-easbhrú do shraith chomhéadain an túir phríomhála (áit a "
"dtagann ábhair éagsúla le chéile)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Tower ironing area"
msgstr "Limistéar iarnála an túir"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Ironing area for prime tower interface layer (where different materials "
"meet)."
msgstr ""
"Limistéar iarnála do shraith chomhéadain an túir phríomhála (áit a dtagann "
"ábhair éagsúla le chéile)."

# AI Translated
msgid "mm²"
msgstr "mm²"

# AI Translated
msgid "Interface layer purge length"
msgstr "Fad sruthlaithe shraith an chomhéadain"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Purge length for prime tower interface layer (where different materials "
"meet)."
msgstr ""
"Fad sruthlaithe do shraith chomhéadain an túir phríomhála (áit a dtagann "
"ábhair éagsúla le chéile)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Interface layer print temperature"
msgstr "Teocht phriontála shraith an chomhéadain"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Print temperature for prime tower interface layer (where different materials "
"meet). If set to -1, use max recommended nozzle temperature."
msgstr ""
"Teocht phriontála do shraith chomhéadain an túir phríomhála (áit a dtagann "
"ábhair éagsúla le chéile). Má shocraítear go -1 é, úsáid an uasteocht soic "
"mholta."

# AI Translated
msgid "Speed of the last cooling move"
msgstr "Luas na gluaiseachta fuaraithe deireanaí"

# AI Translated
msgid "Cooling moves are gradually accelerating towards this speed."
msgstr ""
"Luasghéaraíonn gluaiseachtaí fuaraithe de réir a chéile i dtreo an luais seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Ramming parameters"
msgstr "Paraiméadair ramála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This string is edited by RammingDialog and contains ramming specific "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann RammingDialog an teaghrán seo in eagar agus tá paraiméadair a "
"bhaineann go sonrach le ramáil ann."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable ramming for multi-tool setups"
msgstr "Cumasaigh ramáil do shocruithe iluirlise"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Perform ramming when using multi-tool printer (i.e. when the 'Single "
"Extruder Multimaterial' in Printer Settings is unchecked). When checked, a "
"small amount of filament is rapidly extruded on the wipe tower just before "
"the tool change. This option is only used when the wipe tower is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Déan ramáil agus printéir iluirlise á úsáid (i.e. nuair nach bhfuil 'Ilábhar "
"Aon Easbhrúiteora' i Socruithe an Phrintéara roghnaithe). Nuair atá sé "
"roghnaithe, easbhrúitear méid beag filiméid go tapa ar an túr glanta díreach "
"roimh an athrú uirlise. Ní úsáidtear an rogha seo ach nuair atá an túr "
"glanta cumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Multi-tool ramming volume"
msgstr "Toirt ramála iluirlise"

# AI Translated
msgid "The volume to be rammed before the tool change."
msgstr "An toirt le ramáil roimh an athrú uirlise."

# AI Translated
msgid "Multi-tool ramming flow"
msgstr "Sreabhadh ramála iluirlise"

# AI Translated
msgid "Flow used for ramming the filament before the tool change."
msgstr ""
"Sreabhadh a úsáidtear chun an filiméad a ramáil roimh an athrú uirlise."

# AI Translated
msgid "Density"
msgstr "Dlús"

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament density, for statistical purposes only."
msgstr "Dlús an fhiliméid, chun críocha staitistiúla amháin."

# AI Translated
msgid "g/cm³"
msgstr "g/cm³"

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament material type"
msgstr "Cineál ábhair an fhiliméid"

# AI Translated
msgid "Soluble material"
msgstr "Ábhar intuaslagtha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Soluble material is commonly used to print supports and support interfaces."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear ábhar intuaslagtha go coitianta chun tacaí agus comhéadain tacaí a "
"phriontáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament ramming length"
msgstr "Fad ramála an fhiliméid"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When changing the extruder, it is recommended to extrude a certain length of "
"filament from the original extruder. This helps minimize nozzle oozing."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a athraítear an t-easbhrúiteoir, moltar fad áirithe filiméid a easbhrú "
"ón easbhrúiteoir bunaidh. Cabhraíonn sé seo le húscadh an tsoic a íoslaghdú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Support material"
msgstr "Ábhar taca"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Support material is commonly used to print supports and support interfaces."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear ábhar taca go coitianta chun tacaí agus comhéadain tacaí a "
"phriontáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Is mixed filament"
msgstr "Is filiméad measctha é"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Whether this filament slot is a mixed filament composed of multiple physical "
"filaments"
msgstr ""
"Cé acu an filiméad measctha é sliotán an fhiliméid seo atá comhdhéanta "
"d'fhiliméid fhisiceacha iolracha"

# AI Translated
msgid "Mixed filament components"
msgstr "Comhpháirteanna an fhiliméid mheasctha"

# AI Translated
msgid "Comma-separated 1-based indices of component filaments, e.g. \"1,3\""
msgstr ""
"Innéacsanna 1-bhunaithe na bhfiliméad comhpháirte scartha le camóga, m.sh. "
"\"1,3\""

# AI Translated
msgid "Mixed filament sublayer ratios"
msgstr "Cóimheasa fo-shraitheanna an fhiliméid mheasctha"

# AI Translated
msgid "Comma-separated ratio values summing to 1.0, e.g. \"0.7,0.3\""
msgstr ""
"Luachanna cóimheasa scartha le camóga a shuimíonn go 1.0, m.sh. \"0.7,0.3\""

# AI Translated
msgid "Mixed filament gradient"
msgstr "Grádán an fhiliméid mheasctha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable Z-direction gradient mode for mixed filament sub-layers. When "
"enabled, the sub-layer ratios vary linearly across layers."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh mód grádáin i dtreo Z d'fho-shraitheanna an fhiliméid mheasctha. "
"Nuair atá sé cumasaithe, athraíonn cóimheasa na bhfo-shraitheanna go líneach "
"thar na sraitheanna."

# AI Translated
msgid "Mixed filament gradient range"
msgstr "Raon grádáin an fhiliméid mheasctha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Start and end ratios for the first component in gradient mode. "
"Comma-separated pair, e.g. \"0.10,0.90\" means 10% to 90%."
msgstr ""
"Cóimheasa tosaigh agus deiridh don chéad chomhpháirt i mód grádáin. Péire "
"scartha le camóg, m.sh. ciallaíonn \"0.10,0.90\" 10% go 90%."

# AI Translated
msgid "Mixed filament gradient curve"
msgstr "Cuar grádáin an fhiliméid mheasctha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Optional Photoshop-style custom curve mapping Z progress to the first "
"component ratio. Encoded as pipe-separated control points, either \"x,y\" "
"(legacy) or \"x,y,m_in,m_out\" when a tangent override is needed (empty "
"token or \"nan\" means use PCHIP default). x in [0,1]; y is clamped to the "
"configured ratio range, e.g. \"0,0.15|0.5,0.50|1,0.85\". When empty, the "
"linear gradient_range is used instead."
msgstr ""
"Cuar saincheaptha roghnach i stíl Photoshop a mhapálann dul chun cinn Z go "
"cóimheas na chéad chomhpháirte. Ionchódaithe mar phointí rialaithe scartha "
"le píopaí, \"x,y\" (oidhreacht) nó \"x,y,m_in,m_out\" nuair a theastaíonn "
"sárú tadhlaí (ciallaíonn comhartha folamh nó \"nan\" réamhshocrú PCHIP a "
"úsáid). x in [0,1]; teorannaítear y go dtí an raon cóimheasa cumraithe, "
"m.sh. \"0,0.15|0.5,0.50|1,0.85\". Nuair atá sé folamh, úsáidtear an "
"gradient_range líneach ina ionad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Mixed filament per-part gradient"
msgstr "Grádán in aghaidh na páirte don fhiliméad measctha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When gradient mode is enabled, apply the gradient to each part of an "
"assembly independently rather than treating the whole assembly as one Z "
"range."
msgstr ""
"Nuair atá mód grádáin cumasaithe, cuir an grádán i bhfeidhm ar gach páirt de "
"chóimeáil go neamhspleách seachas caitheamh leis an gcóimeáil ar fad mar "
"raon Z amháin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament printable"
msgstr "Filiméad inphriontáilte"

# AI Translated
msgid "The filament is printable in extruder."
msgstr "Tá an filiméad inphriontáilte san easbhrúiteoir."

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament-extruder compatibility"
msgstr "Comhoiriúnacht filiméid-easbhrúiteora"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"A single 32-bit int encoding the compatibility level of a filament across "
"all extruders (up to 10). Every 3 bits represent one extruder (bits [3*i, "
"3*i+2] for extruder i). 0: printable, 1: error, 2: critical warning, 3: "
"warning, 4-7: reserved."
msgstr ""
"Slánuimhir 32-giotán amháin a ionchódaíonn leibhéal comhoiriúnachta filiméid "
"thar gach easbhrúiteoir (suas le 10). Léiríonn gach 3 ghiotán easbhrúiteoir "
"amháin (giotáin [3*i, 3*i+2] d'easbhrúiteoir i). 0: inphriontáilte, 1: "
"earráid, 2: rabhadh criticiúil, 3: rabhadh, 4-7: in áirithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Softening temperature"
msgstr "Teocht bhogtha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The material softens at this temperature, so when the bed temperature is "
"equal to or greater than this, it's highly recommended to open the front "
"door and/or remove the upper glass to avoid clogs."
msgstr ""
"Bogann an t-ábhar ag an teocht seo, mar sin nuair a bhíonn teocht na leapa "
"cothrom leis nó níos airde, moltar go láidir an doras tosaigh a oscailt "
"agus/nó an ghloine uachtair a bhaint chun calcanna a sheachaint."

# AI Translated
msgid "Price"
msgstr "Praghas"

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament price, for statistical purposes only."
msgstr "Praghas an fhiliméid, chun críocha staitistiúla amháin."

# AI Translated
msgid "money/kg"
msgstr "airgead/kg"

# AI Translated
msgid "Vendor of filament. For show only."
msgstr "Díoltóir an fhiliméid. Le taispeáint amháin."

# AI Translated
msgid "(Undefined)"
msgstr "(Gan sainiú)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Sparse infill direction"
msgstr "Treo an líonta thanaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the angle for sparse infill pattern, which controls the start or "
"main direction of lines."
msgstr ""
"Seo í uillinn phatrún an líonta thanaí, a rialaíonn treo tosaigh nó "
"príomhthreo na línte."

# AI Translated
msgid "Solid infill direction"
msgstr "Treo an líonta sholadaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Angle for solid infill pattern, which controls the start or main direction "
"of line."
msgstr ""
"Uillinn phatrún an líonta sholadaigh, a rialaíonn treo tosaigh nó "
"príomhthreo na líne."

# AI Translated
msgid "Top layer direction"
msgstr "Treo na sraithe uachtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Fixed angle for the top solid infill and ironing lines.\n"
"Set to -1 to follow the default solid infill direction."
msgstr ""
"Uillinn sheasta don líonadh soladach uachtair agus do na línte iarnála.\n"
"Socraigh go -1 chun treo réamhshocraithe an líonta sholadaigh a leanúint."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bottom layer direction"
msgstr "Treo na sraithe íochtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Fixed angle for the bottom solid infill lines.\n"
"Set to -1 to follow the default solid infill direction."
msgstr ""
"Uillinn sheasta do línte an líonta sholadaigh íochtair.\n"
"Socraigh go -1 chun treo réamhshocraithe an líonta sholadaigh a leanúint."

# AI Translated
msgid "Sparse infill density"
msgstr "Dlús an líonta thanaí"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"Density of internal sparse infill, 100% turns all sparse infill into solid "
"infill and internal solid infill pattern will be used."
msgstr ""
"Dlús an líonta thanaí inmheánaigh; déanann 100% líonadh soladach den líonadh "
"tanaí ar fad agus úsáidfear patrún an líonta sholadaigh inmheánaigh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Align directions to model"
msgstr "Ailínigh treonna leis an tsamhail"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Aligns infill, bridge, ironing, and top/bottom surface directions to follow "
"the model's orientation on the build plate.\n"
"When enabled, these directions rotate together with the model so the printed "
"features keep their intended orientation relative to the part, preserving "
"optimal strength and surface characteristics regardless of how the model is "
"placed."
msgstr ""
"Ailíníonn sé treonna an líonta, na ndroichead, na hiarnála agus na "
"ndromchlaí uachtair/íochtair chun treoshuíomh na samhla ar an bpláta tógála "
"a leanúint.\n"
"Nuair atá sé cumasaithe, rothlaíonn na treonna seo in éineacht leis an "
"tsamhail ionas go gcoinníonn na gnéithe priontáilte a dtreoshuíomh "
"beartaithe i gcoibhneas leis an bpáirt, ag caomhnú an neart agus na "
"saintréithe dromchla is fearr is cuma cén chaoi a gcuirtear an tsamhail."

# AI Translated
msgid "Insert solid layers"
msgstr "Cuir sraitheanna soladacha isteach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Insert solid infill at specific layers. Use N to insert every Nth layer, N#K "
"to insert K consecutive solid layers every N layers (K is optional, e.g. "
"'5#' equals '5#1'), or a comma-separated list (e.g. 1,7,9) to insert at "
"explicit layers. Layers are 1-based."
msgstr ""
"Cuir líonadh soladach isteach ag sraitheanna sonracha. Úsáid N chun é a chur "
"isteach gach Nú sraith, N#K chun K sraith sholadacha i ndiaidh a chéile a "
"chur isteach gach N sraith (tá K roghnach, m.sh. is ionann '5#' agus '5#1'), "
"nó liosta scartha le camóga (m.sh. 1,7,9) chun é a chur isteach ag "
"sraitheanna sainráite. Tá na sraitheanna 1-bhunaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Fill Multiline"
msgstr "Líonadh Illíne"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Using multiple lines for the infill pattern, if supported by infill pattern."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid línte iolracha don phatrún líonta, má thacaíonn an patrún líonta leis."

# AI Translated
msgid "Adaptive density (experimental)"
msgstr "Dlús oiriúnaitheach (turgnamhach)"

# AI Translated
# Needs human review: check terms for adaptive density modes
msgid ""
"Grades the Gyroid and TPMS infill inside the object: its cells grow from the "
"surface of the object towards its center. The sparse infill density is used "
"at the surface and the interior density at the center.\n"
"Distance warp, Smooth blend and Stepped shells follow the distance to the "
"nearest surface, including the top and bottom, with the interior density at "
"the point farthest from it:\n"
" - Distance warp: one continuous pattern, stretched and sheared where the "
"distance changes across directions, as in plates and long parts.\n"
" - Smooth blend: the patterns of neighbouring densities blended into each "
"other, with small loops where they meet.\n"
" - Stepped shells: shells of the regular pattern at densities about 1.5 "
"times apart, their lines joined along the shell boundaries.\n"
" - Lobes: follows the 3D shape of the object, including its top and bottom. "
"Every lobe, a part joined to the rest by a narrower neck, is graded towards "
"its own center.\n"
" - Normal Z, Y or X: follows the sections of the object normal to that axis, "
"so the density does not change along it."
msgstr ""
"Grádaíonn sé an líonadh Gyroid agus TPMS taobh istigh den réad: fásann a "
"chealla ó dhromchla an réada i dtreo a láir. Úsáidtear dlús an líonta thanaí "
"ag an dromchla agus an dlús inmheánach sa lár.\n"
"Leanann Stangadh fad, Cumasc mín agus Blaoscanna céimnithe an fad go dtí an "
"dromchla is gaire, an barr agus an bun san áireamh, leis an dlús inmheánach "
"ag an bpointe is faide uaidh:\n"
" - Stangadh fad: patrún leanúnach amháin, sínte agus lomtha san áit a "
"n-athraíonn an fad thar threonna, mar i bplátaí agus i bpáirteanna fada.\n"
" - Cumasc mín: patrúin dlúis chomharsanacha cumaiscthe ina chéile, le lúba "
"beaga san áit a dtagann siad le chéile.\n"
" - Blaoscanna céimnithe: blaoscanna den ghnáthphatrún ag dlúis thart ar 1.5 "
"oiread óna chéile, a línte ceangailte feadh theorainneacha na mblaoscanna.\n"
" - Maothána: leanann sé cruth 3T an réada, a bharr agus a bhun san áireamh. "
"Grádaítear gach maothán, páirt atá ceangailte leis an gcuid eile le muineál "
"níos cúinge, i dtreo a láir féin.\n"
" - Normal Z, Y nó X: leanann sé ailt an réada atá normalach don ais sin, mar "
"sin ní athraíonn an dlús feadh na haise sin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Distance warp"
msgstr "Stangadh fad"

# AI Translated
msgid "Smooth blend"
msgstr "Cumasc mín"

# AI Translated
msgid "Stepped shells"
msgstr "Blaoscanna céimnithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Lobes"
msgstr "Maothána"

# AI Translated
msgid "Normal Z"
msgstr "Normal Z"

# AI Translated
msgid "Normal Y"
msgstr "Normal Y"

# AI Translated
msgid "Normal X"
msgstr "Normal X"

# AI Translated
msgid "Interior density"
msgstr "Dlús inmheánach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Density of the adaptive infill at the center of the object."
msgstr "Dlús an líonta oiriúnaithigh i lár an réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Adaptive gradient"
msgstr "Grádán oiriúnaitheach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"How the density changes from the surface to the center of the object.\n"
"Linear: the density changes at a constant rate.\n"
"Quadratic: the density stays close to the sparse infill density near the "
"surface and changes faster towards the center.\n"
"Exponential: the density changes quickly just below the surface and levels "
"off towards the center."
msgstr ""
"Conas a athraíonn an dlús ó dhromchla go lár an réada.\n"
"Líneach: athraíonn an dlús ag ráta tairiseach.\n"
"Cearnach: fanann an dlús gar do dhlús an líonta thanaí in aice leis an "
"dromchla agus athraíonn sé níos tapa i dtreo an láir.\n"
"Easpónantúil: athraíonn an dlús go tapa díreach faoin dromchla agus éiríonn "
"sé cothrom i dtreo an láir."

# AI Translated
msgid "Linear"
msgstr "Líneach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Quadratic"
msgstr "Cearnach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Exponential"
msgstr "Easpónantúil"

# AI Translated
msgid "Z-buckling bias optimization (experimental)"
msgstr "Optamú claonta lúbtha Z (turgnamhach)"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"Tightens the gyroid wave along the Z (vertical) axis at low infill density "
"to shorten the effective vertical column length and improve Z-axis "
"compression buckling resistance. Filament use is preserved. No effect at "
"~30% sparse infill density and above. Only applies when Sparse infill "
"pattern is set to Gyroid."
msgstr ""
"Teannann sé tonn an gyroid feadh ais Z (ingearach) ag dlús líonta íseal chun "
"fad éifeachtach an cholúin ingearaigh a ghiorrú agus friotaíocht in aghaidh "
"lúbadh comhbhrúite ais Z a fheabhsú. Caomhnaítear úsáid filiméid. Gan "
"éifeacht ag dlús líonta thanaí ~30% agus níos airde. Ní bhaineann sé ach "
"nuair atá patrún an líonta thanaí socraithe go Gyroid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Sparse infill pattern"
msgstr "Patrún an líonta thanaí"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the line pattern for internal sparse infill."
msgstr "Seo é patrún líne an líonta thanaí inmheánaigh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Zig Zag"
msgstr "Sigsag"

# AI Translated
msgid "Cross Zag"
msgstr "Sigsag Trasna"

# AI Translated
msgid "Locked Zag"
msgstr "Sigsag Glasáilte"

# AI Translated
msgid "Line"
msgstr "Líne"

# AI Translated
msgid "Grid"
msgstr "Greille"

# AI Translated
msgid "Tri-hexagon"
msgstr "Trí-heicseagán"

# AI Translated
msgid "Cubic"
msgstr "Ciúbach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Adaptive Cubic"
msgstr "Ciúbach Oiriúnaitheach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Quarter Cubic"
msgstr "Ceathrú Ciúbach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Support Cubic"
msgstr "Ciúbach Taca"

# AI Translated
msgid "Lightning"
msgstr "Tintreach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Honeycomb"
msgstr "Cíor Mheala"

# AI Translated
msgid "3D Honeycomb"
msgstr "Cíor Mheala 3T"

# AI Translated
msgid "Lateral Honeycomb"
msgstr "Cíor Mheala Thaobhach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Lateral Lattice"
msgstr "Laitís Thaobhach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Cross Hatch"
msgstr "Tras-shaothar"

# AI Translated
msgid "TPMS-D"
msgstr "TPMS-D"

# AI Translated
msgid "TPMS-FK"
msgstr "TPMS-FK"

# AI Translated
msgid "Gyroid"
msgstr "Gyroid"

# AI Translated
msgid "Sparse infill smooth factor"
msgstr "Fachtóir mínithe an líonta thanaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Controls how strongly sparse infill corners are rounded. 0% keeps the "
"original sharp path, while 100% produces the largest possible curves between "
"adjacent infill lines."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn sé cé chomh láidir a dhéantar coirnéil an líonta thanaí a "
"chruinniú. Coinníonn 0% an bhunchonair ghéar, agus táirgeann 100% na cuair "
"is mó is féidir idir línte líonta comharsanacha."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration of top surface infill. Using a lower value may "
"improve top surface quality."
msgstr ""
"Seo é luasghéarú líonadh an dromchla uachtair. D'fhéadfadh luach níos ísle "
"cáilíocht an dromchla uachtair a fheabhsú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Acceleration of outer wall: using a lower value can improve quality."
msgstr ""
"Luasghéarú an bhalla sheachtraigh: is féidir le luach níos ísle an "
"cháilíocht a fheabhsú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Acceleration of inner walls."
msgstr "Luasghéarú na mballaí inmheánacha."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Acceleration of sparse infill. If the value is expressed as a percentage "
"(e.g. 100%), it will be calculated based on the default acceleration."
msgstr ""
"Luasghéarú an líonta thanaí. Má léirítear an luach mar chéatadán (m.sh. "
"100%), ríomhfar é bunaithe ar an luasghéarú réamhshocraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Acceleration of internal solid infill. If the value is expressed as a "
"percentage (e.g. 100%), it will be calculated based on the default "
"acceleration."
msgstr ""
"Luasghéarú an líonta sholadaigh inmheánaigh. Má léirítear an luach mar "
"chéatadán (m.sh. 100%), ríomhfar é bunaithe ar an luasghéarú réamhshocraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the printing acceleration for the first layer. Using limited "
"acceleration can improve build plate adhesion."
msgstr ""
"Seo é luasghéarú na priontála don chéad sraith. Is féidir le luasghéarú "
"teoranta greamaitheacht leis an bpláta tógála a fheabhsú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable accel_to_decel"
msgstr "Cumasaigh accel_to_decel"

# AI Translated
msgid "Klipper's max_accel_to_decel will be adjusted automatically."
msgstr "Coigeartófar max_accel_to_decel Klipper go huathoibríoch."

# AI Translated
msgid "accel_to_decel"
msgstr "accel_to_decel"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"Klipper's max_accel_to_decel will be adjusted to this % of acceleration."
msgstr ""
"Coigeartófar max_accel_to_decel Klipper go dtí an % seo den luasghéarú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Default jerk."
msgstr "Turraing réamhshocraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Marlin Firmware Junction Deviation (replaces the traditional XY Jerk "
"setting)."
msgstr ""
"Diall Acomhail dhochtearraí Marlin (cuirtear é in ionad an ghnáthshocraithe "
"Turraing XY)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Jerk of outer walls."
msgstr "Turraing na mballaí seachtracha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Jerk of inner walls."
msgstr "Turraing na mballaí inmheánacha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Jerk for top surface."
msgstr "Turraing don dromchla uachtair."

# AI Translated
msgid "Jerk for infill."
msgstr "Turraing don líonadh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Jerk for the first layer."
msgstr "Turraing don chéad sraith."

# AI Translated
msgid "Jerk for travel."
msgstr "Turraing don taisteal."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Travel jerk of first layer.\n"
"The percentage value is relative to Travel Jerk."
msgstr ""
"Turraing taistil na chéad sraithe.\n"
"Tá an luach céatadáin coibhneasta le Turraing an Taistil."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Line width of the first layer. If expressed as a %, it will be computed over "
"the nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"Leithead líne na chéad sraithe. Má léirítear é mar %, ríomhfar é i "
"gcoibhneas le trastomhas an tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid "First layer height"
msgstr "Airde na chéad sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Height of the first layer. Making the first layer height thicker can improve "
"build plate adhesion."
msgstr ""
"Airde na chéad sraithe. Is féidir le céad sraith níos tiubha greamaitheacht "
"leis an bpláta tógála a fheabhsú."

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the speed for the walls and brim of the first layer."
msgstr "Seo é an luas do bhallaí agus d'imeall na chéad sraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "First layer infill"
msgstr "Líonadh na chéad sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the speed for the first layer except for walls and brim, such as "
"infill, gap fill and support."
msgstr ""
"Seo é an luas don chéad sraith seachas ballaí agus imeall, mar líonadh, "
"líonadh bearnaí agus tacaí."

# AI Translated
msgid "First layer travel speed"
msgstr "Luas taistil na chéad sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Travel speed of the first layer."
msgstr "Luas taistil na chéad sraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Number of slow layers"
msgstr "Líon na sraitheanna malla"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The first few layers are printed slower than normal. The speed is gradually "
"increased in a linear fashion over the specified number of layers."
msgstr ""
"Priontáiltear an chéad chúpla sraith níos moille ná mar is gnách. Méadaítear "
"an luas de réir a chéile ar bhealach líneach thar an líon sraitheanna "
"sonraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "First layer nozzle temperature"
msgstr "Teocht soic na chéad sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Nozzle temperature for printing the first layer with this filament"
msgstr ""
"Teocht an tsoic chun an chéad sraith a phriontáil leis an bhfiliméad seo"

# AI Translated
msgid "Full fan speed at layer"
msgstr "Luas iomlán an ghaothráin ag sraith"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Fan speed will be ramped up linearly from zero at layer "
"\"close_fan_the_first_x_layers\" to maximum at layer "
"\"full_fan_speed_layer\". \"full_fan_speed_layer\" will be ignored if lower "
"than \"close_fan_the_first_x_layers\", in which case the fan will be running "
"at maximum allowed speed at layer \"close_fan_the_first_x_layers\" + 1."
msgstr ""
"Ardófar luas an ghaothráin go líneach ó nialas ag sraith "
"\"close_fan_the_first_x_layers\" go dtí an t-uasmhéid ag sraith "
"\"full_fan_speed_layer\". Déanfar neamhaird de \"full_fan_speed_layer\" má "
"tá sé níos ísle ná \"close_fan_the_first_x_layers\", agus sa chás sin beidh "
"an gaothrán ag rith ag an uasluas ceadaithe ag sraith "
"\"close_fan_the_first_x_layers\" + 1."

# AI Translated
msgid "layer"
msgstr "sraith"

# AI Translated
msgid "First layer fan speed"
msgstr "Luas gaothráin na chéad sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Sets an exact fan speed for the first layer, overriding all other cooling "
"settings. Useful for protecting 3D-printed toolhead parts (e.g. Voron-style "
"ABS/ASA ducts) from a hot bed. A small amount of airflow cools the ducts "
"down, without using full cooling that may in certain conditions hurt "
"first-layer adhesion.\n"
"From the second layer onwards, normal cooling resumes.\n"
"If \"Full fan speed at layer\" is also set, the fan ramps smoothly from this "
"value on the first layer up to your target by the chosen layer.\n"
"Only available when \"No cooling for the first\" is 0.\n"
"Set to -1 to disable it."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn sé luas gaothráin cruinn don chéad sraith, ag sárú gach socrú "
"fuaraithe eile. Úsáideach chun páirteanna ceann uirlise priontáilte 3T "
"(m.sh. dúchtanna ABS/ASA i stíl Voron) a chosaint ar leaba the. Fuaraíonn "
"méid beag aersreafa na dúchtanna, gan fuarú iomlán a úsáid a d'fhéadfadh "
"dochar a dhéanamh do ghreamaitheacht na chéad sraithe i gcoinníollacha "
"áirithe.\n"
"Ón dara sraith ar aghaidh, leanann an gnáthfhuarú.\n"
"Má tá \"Luas iomlán an ghaothráin ag sraith\" socraithe freisin, ardaíonn an "
"gaothrán go réidh ón luach seo ar an gcéad sraith go dtí do sprioc faoin "
"tsraith roghnaithe.\n"
"Níl sé ar fáil ach nuair atá \"Gan fuarú don chéad\" socraithe go 0.\n"
"Socraigh go -1 chun é a dhíchumasú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Support interface fan speed"
msgstr "Luas gaothráin chomhéadan na dtacaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This part cooling fan speed is applied when printing support interfaces. "
"Setting this parameter to a higher than regular speed reduces the layer "
"binding strength between supports and the supported part, making them easier "
"to separate.\n"
"Set to -1 to disable it.\n"
"This setting is overridden by disable_fan_first_layers."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear an luas gaothráin fuaraithe páirte seo i bhfeidhm agus comhéadain "
"tacaí á bpriontáil. Má shocraítear an paraiméadar seo go luas níos airde ná "
"an gnáthluas, laghdaítear neart an cheangail sraithe idir tacaí agus an "
"pháirt thacaithe, rud a fhágann go bhfuil siad níos éasca le scaradh.\n"
"Socraigh go -1 chun é a dhíchumasú.\n"
"Sáraíonn disable_fan_first_layers an socrú seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Internal bridges fan speed"
msgstr "Luas gaothráin na ndroichead inmheánach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The part cooling fan speed used for all internal bridges. Set to -1 to use "
"the overhang fan speed settings instead.\n"
"\n"
"Reducing the internal bridges fan speed, compared to your regular fan speed, "
"can help reduce part warping due to excessive cooling applied over a large "
"surface for a prolonged period of time."
msgstr ""
"An luas gaothráin fuaraithe páirte a úsáidtear do gach droichead inmheánach. "
"Socraigh go -1 chun socruithe luas gaothráin na starrán a úsáid ina ionad.\n"
"\n"
"Is féidir le laghdú luas gaothráin na ndroichead inmheánach, i gcomparáid le "
"do ghnáthluas gaothráin, cabhrú le stangadh páirte a laghdú de bharr "
"fuaraithe iomarcach a chuirtear i bhfeidhm ar dhromchla mór ar feadh "
"tréimhse fhada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Ironing fan speed"
msgstr "Luas gaothráin iarnála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This part cooling fan speed is applied when ironing. Setting this parameter "
"to a lower than regular speed reduces possible nozzle clogging due to the "
"low volumetric flow rate, making the interface smoother.\n"
"Set to -1 to disable it."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear an luas gaothráin fuaraithe páirte seo i bhfeidhm le linn iarnála. "
"Má shocraítear an paraiméadar seo go luas níos ísle ná an gnáthluas, "
"laghdaítear calcadh féideartha an tsoic de bharr an ráta sreafa "
"toirtmhéadraigh íseal, rud a fhágann an comhéadan níos míne.\n"
"Socraigh go -1 chun é a dhíchumasú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Ironing flow"
msgstr "Sreabhadh iarnála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Filament-specific override for ironing flow. This allows you to customize "
"the ironing flow for each filament type. Too high value results in "
"overextrusion on the surface."
msgstr ""
"Sárú sonrach don fhiliméad ar shreabhadh na hiarnála. Ligeann sé seo duit "
"sreabhadh na hiarnála a shaincheapadh do gach cineál filiméid. Má bhíonn an "
"luach ró-ard, beidh ró-easbhrú ar an dromchla."

# AI Translated
msgid "Ironing line spacing"
msgstr "Spásáil línte iarnála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Filament-specific override for ironing line spacing. This allows you to "
"customize the spacing between ironing lines for each filament type."
msgstr ""
"Sárú sonrach don fhiliméad ar spásáil na línte iarnála. Ligeann sé seo duit "
"an spásáil idir línte iarnála a shaincheapadh do gach cineál filiméid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Ironing inset"
msgstr "Ionsá iarnála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Filament-specific override for ironing inset. This allows you to customize "
"the distance to keep from the edges when ironing for each filament type."
msgstr ""
"Sárú sonrach don fhiliméad ar ionsá na hiarnála. Ligeann sé seo duit an fad "
"le coinneáil ó na himill le linn iarnála a shaincheapadh do gach cineál "
"filiméid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Ironing speed"
msgstr "Luas iarnála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Filament-specific override for ironing speed. This allows you to customize "
"the print speed of ironing lines for each filament type."
msgstr ""
"Sárú sonrach don fhiliméad ar luas na hiarnála. Ligeann sé seo duit luas "
"priontála na línte iarnála a shaincheapadh do gach cineál filiméid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This setting makes the toolhead randomly jitter while printing walls so that "
"the surface has a rough textured look. This setting controls the fuzzy "
"position."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann an socrú seo creathán randamach ar an gceann uirlise agus ballaí á "
"bpriontáil ionas go mbíonn cuma gharbh uigeachta ar an dromchla. Rialaíonn "
"an socrú seo suíomh an chraicinn chlúmhaigh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Painted only"
msgstr "Péinteáilte amháin"

# AI Translated
msgid "Contour"
msgstr "Comhrian"

# AI Translated
msgid "Hole"
msgstr "Poll"

# AI Translated
msgid "Contour and hole"
msgstr "Comhrian agus poll"

# AI Translated
msgid "All walls"
msgstr "Gach balla"

# AI Translated
msgid "Fuzzy skin thickness"
msgstr "Tiús an chraicinn chlúmhaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The width of jittering: it’s recommended to keep this lower than the outer "
"wall line width."
msgstr ""
"Leithead an chreatháin: moltar é seo a choinneáil níos ísle ná leithead líne "
"an bhalla sheachtraigh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Fuzzy skin point distance"
msgstr "Fad pointí an chraicinn chlúmhaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The average distance between the random points introduced on each line "
"segment."
msgstr ""
"An meánfhad idir na pointí randamacha a chuirtear isteach ar gach mír líne."

# AI Translated
msgid "Apply fuzzy skin to first layer"
msgstr "Cuir craiceann clúmhach i bhfeidhm ar an gcéad sraith"

# AI Translated
msgid "Whether to apply fuzzy skin on the first layer."
msgstr ""
"Cé acu ar cheart craiceann clúmhach a chur i bhfeidhm ar an gcéad sraith."

# AI Translated
msgid "Fuzzy skin generator mode"
msgstr "Mód gineadóra an chraicinn chlúmhaigh"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"Fuzzy skin generation mode. Works only with Arachne!\n"
"Displacement: Сlassic mode when the pattern is formed by shifting the nozzle "
"sideways from the original path.\n"
"Extrusion: The mode when the pattern formed by the amount of extruded "
"plastic. This is the fast and straight algorithm without unnecessary nozzle "
"shake that gives a smooth pattern. But it is more useful for forming loose "
"walls in the entire they array.\n"
"Combined: Joint mode [Displacement] + [Extrusion]. The appearance of the "
"walls is similar to [Displacement] Mode, but it leaves no pores between the "
"perimeters.\n"
"\n"
"Attention! The [Extrusion] and [Combined] modes works only the "
"fuzzy_skin_thickness parameter not more than the thickness of printed loop. "
"At the same time, the width of the extrusion for a particular layer should "
"also not be below a certain level. It is usually equal 15-25% of a layer "
"height. Therefore, the maximum fuzzy skin thickness with a perimeter width "
"of 0.4 mm and a layer height of 0.2 mm will be 0.4-(0.2*0.25)=±0.35mm! If "
"you enter a higher parameter than this, the error Flow::spacing() will "
"displayed, and the model will not be sliced. You can choose this number "
"until this error is repeated."
msgstr ""
"Mód giniúna an chraicinn chlúmhaigh. Ní oibríonn sé ach le Arachne!\n"
"Díláithriú: Mód clasaiceach nuair a chruthaítear an patrún tríd an soc a "
"bhogadh i leataobh ón mbunchonair.\n"
"Easbhrú: An mód nuair a chruthaítear an patrún de réir mhéid an phlaisteach "
"easbhrúite. Is é seo an t-algartam tapa díreach gan croitheadh soic gan ghá "
"a thugann patrún mín. Ach is úsáidí é chun ballaí scaoilte a chruthú san "
"eagar ar fad.\n"
"Comhcheangailte: Mód comhpháirteach [Díláithriú] + [Easbhrú]. Tá cuma na "
"mballaí cosúil le mód [Díláithriú], ach ní fhágann sé aon phóir idir na "
"himlínte.\n"
"\n"
"Aire! Ní oibríonn na móid [Easbhrú] agus [Comhcheangailte] ach má tá an "
"paraiméadar fuzzy_skin_thickness gan a bheith níos mó ná tiús na lúibe "
"priontáilte. Ag an am céanna, níor cheart do leithead an easbhrúite do "
"shraith ar leith a bheith faoi bhun leibhéal áirithe ach an oiread. De "
"ghnáth is ionann é agus 15-25% d'airde na sraithe. Dá bhrí sin, is é an "
"t-uastiús craicinn chlúmhaigh le leithead imlíne 0.4 mm agus airde sraithe "
"0.2 mm ná 0.4-(0.2*0.25)=±0.35mm! Má chuireann tú paraiméadar níos airde ná "
"seo isteach, taispeánfar an earráid Flow::spacing(), agus ní shlisneofar an "
"tsamhail. Is féidir leat an uimhir seo a roghnú go dtí go dtarlaíonn an "
"earráid seo arís."

# AI Translated
msgid "Displacement"
msgstr "Díláithriú"

# AI Translated
msgid "Extrusion"
msgstr "Easbhrú"

# AI Translated
msgid "Combined"
msgstr "Comhcheangailte"

# AI Translated
msgid "Fuzzy skin noise type"
msgstr "Cineál torainn an chraicinn chlúmhaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Noise type to use for fuzzy skin generation:\n"
"Classic: Classic uniform random noise.\n"
"Perlin: Perlin noise, which gives a more consistent texture.\n"
"Billow: Similar to perlin noise, but clumpier.\n"
"Ridged Multifractal: Ridged noise with sharp, jagged features. Creates "
"marble-like textures.\n"
"Voronoi: Divides the surface into voronoi cells, and displaces each one by a "
"random amount. Creates a patchwork texture.\n"
"Ripple: Uniform ripple pattern that ripples left and right of the original "
"path. Repeating pattern, woven appearance."
msgstr ""
"Cineál torainn le húsáid chun craiceann clúmhach a ghiniúint:\n"
"Clasaiceach: Torann randamach aonfhoirmeach clasaiceach.\n"
"Perlin: Torann Perlin, a thugann uigeacht níos comhsheasmhaí.\n"
"Billow: Cosúil le torann perlin, ach níos cnapánaí.\n"
"Ilfhractal Iomaireach: Torann iomaireach le gnéithe géara mantacha. "
"Cruthaíonn sé uigeachtaí cosúil le marmar.\n"
"Voronoi: Roinneann sé an dromchla i gcealla voronoi, agus díláithríonn sé "
"gach ceann acu faoi mhéid randamach. Cruthaíonn sé uigeacht phaistí.\n"
"Cuilithín: Patrún cuilithíní aonfhoirmeach a chuilithíníonn ar chlé agus ar "
"dheis den bhunchonair. Patrún athchleachtach, cuma fhite."

# AI Translated
msgid "Classic"
msgstr "Clasaiceach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Perlin"
msgstr "Perlin"

# AI Translated
msgid "Billow"
msgstr "Billow"

# AI Translated
msgid "Ridged Multifractal"
msgstr "Ilfhractal Iomaireach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Voronoi"
msgstr "Voronoi"

# AI Translated
msgid "Ripple"
msgstr "Cuilithín"

# AI Translated
msgid "Fuzzy skin feature size"
msgstr "Méid ghnéithe an chraicinn chlúmhaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The base size of the coherent noise features, in mm. Higher values will "
"result in larger features."
msgstr ""
"Bunmhéid ghnéithe an torainn chomhleanúnaigh, i mm. Beidh gnéithe níos mó "
"mar thoradh ar luachanna níos airde."

# AI Translated
msgid "Fuzzy Skin Noise Octaves"
msgstr "Ochtáibh Torainn an Chraicinn Chlúmhaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The number of octaves of coherent noise to use. Higher values increase the "
"detail of the noise, but also increase computation time."
msgstr ""
"Líon na n-ochtáibh torainn chomhleanúnaigh le húsáid. Méadaíonn luachanna "
"níos airde mionsonraí an torainn, ach méadaíonn siad an t-am ríomhaireachta "
"freisin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Fuzzy skin noise persistence"
msgstr "Buanseasmhacht torainn an chraicinn chlúmhaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The decay rate for higher octaves of the coherent noise. Lower values will "
"result in smoother noise."
msgstr ""
"Ráta meatha na n-ochtáibh níos airde den torann comhleanúnach. Beidh torann "
"níos míne mar thoradh ar luachanna níos ísle."

# AI Translated
msgid "Number of ripples per layer"
msgstr "Líon na gcuilithíní in aghaidh na sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Controls how many full cycles of ripples will be added per layer."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn sé cé mhéad timthriall iomlán cuilithíní a chuirfear leis in "
"aghaidh na sraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Ripple offset"
msgstr "Fritháireamh na gcuilithíní"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Shifts the ripple phase forward along the print path by the specified "
"percentage of a wavelength each layer period.\n"
"- 0% keeps every layer identical.\n"
"- 50% shifts the pattern by half a wavelength, effectively inverting the "
"phase.\n"
"- 100% shifts the pattern by a full wavelength, returning to the original "
"phase.\n"
"\n"
"The shift is applied once every number of layers set by Layers between "
"ripple offset, so layers within the same group are printed identically."
msgstr ""
"Bogann sé pas na gcuilithíní ar aghaidh feadh chonair na priontála faoin "
"gcéatadán sonraithe de thonnfhad gach tréimhse sraithe.\n"
"- Coinníonn 0% gach sraith comhionann.\n"
"- Bogann 50% an patrún leath tonnfhaid, ag inbhéartú an phasa go "
"héifeachtach.\n"
"- Bogann 100% an patrún tonnfhad iomlán, ag filleadh ar an bpas bunaidh.\n"
"\n"
"Cuirtear an bogadh i bhfeidhm uair amháin gach líon sraitheanna atá "
"socraithe ag 'Sraitheanna idir fritháireamh cuilithíní', mar sin "
"priontáiltear sraitheanna laistigh den ghrúpa céanna go comhionann."

# AI Translated
msgid "Layers between ripple offset"
msgstr "Sraitheanna idir fritháireamh cuilithíní"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Specifies how many consecutive layers share the same ripple phase before the "
"offset is applied.\n"
"For example:\n"
"- 1 = Layer 1 is printed with the base ripple pattern, then layer 2 is "
"shifted by the configured offset, then layer 3 returns to the base pattern, "
"and so on.\n"
"- 3 = Layers 1 to 3 are printed with the base ripple pattern, then layers 4 "
"to 6 are shifted by the configured offset, then layers 7 to 9 return to the "
"base pattern, etc."
msgstr ""
"Sonraíonn sé cé mhéad sraith i ndiaidh a chéile a roinneann an pas "
"cuilithíní céanna sula gcuirtear an fritháireamh i bhfeidhm.\n"
"Mar shampla:\n"
"- 1 = Priontáiltear sraith 1 leis an mbunphatrún cuilithíní, ansin bogtar "
"sraith 2 faoin bhfritháireamh cumraithe, ansin filleann sraith 3 ar an "
"mbunphatrún, agus mar sin de.\n"
"- 3 = Priontáiltear sraitheanna 1 go 3 leis an mbunphatrún cuilithíní, ansin "
"bogtar sraitheanna 4 go 6 faoin bhfritháireamh cumraithe, ansin filleann "
"sraitheanna 7 go 9 ar an mbunphatrún, srl."

# AI Translated
msgid "Filter out tiny gaps"
msgstr "Scag amach bearnaí bídeacha"

# AI Translated
msgid "Layers and Perimeters"
msgstr "Sraitheanna agus Imlínte"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Don't print gap fill with a length is smaller than the threshold specified "
"(in mm). This setting applies to top, bottom and solid infill and, if using "
"the classic perimeter generator, to wall gap fill."
msgstr ""
"Ná priontáil líonadh bearnaí a bhfuil a fhad níos lú ná an tairseach "
"shonraithe (i mm). Baineann an socrú seo le líonadh uachtair, íochtair agus "
"soladach agus, má úsáidtear an gineadóir imlíne clasaiceach, le líonadh "
"bearnaí na mballaí."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the speed for gap infill. Gaps usually have irregular line width and "
"should be printed more slowly."
msgstr ""
"Seo é an luas do líonadh bearnaí. De ghnáth bíonn leithead líne neamhrialta "
"ag bearnaí agus ba cheart iad a phriontáil níos moille."

# AI Translated
msgid "Precise Z height"
msgstr "Airde bheacht Z"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable this to get precise Z height of object after slicing. It will get the "
"precise object height by fine-tuning the layer heights of the last few "
"layers. Note that this is an experimental parameter."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh é seo chun airde bheacht Z an réada a fháil tar éis slisnithe. "
"Gheobhaidh sé airde bheacht an réada trí airdí sraithe na gcúpla sraith "
"dheireanach a mhionchoigeartú. Tabhair faoi deara gur paraiméadar "
"turgnamhach é seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Arc fitting"
msgstr "Feistiú stuanna"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Fit G2 and G3 arc moves to the toolpaths. Walls and surfaces are fitted "
"within the resolution, while sparse infill, supports and the wipe tower use "
"fixed tolerances.\n"
" - Disabled: only straight G1 moves are used.\n"
" - Enabled: arcs are fitted to all toolpaths.\n"
" - Sparse infill only: arcs are fitted to the sparse infill only, which "
"shortens the G-code of curved infill patterns without affecting the walls "
"and surfaces.\n"
"\n"
"Note: For Klipper machines, Disabled is recommended. Klipper splits arcs "
"back into line segments, which lowers the surface quality and can increase "
"the print time."
msgstr ""
"Feistigh gluaiseachtaí stua G2 agus G3 do na conairí uirlise. Feistítear "
"ballaí agus dromchlaí laistigh den taifeach, agus úsáideann líonadh tanaí, "
"tacaí agus an túr glanta lamháltais sheasta.\n"
" - Díchumasaithe: ní úsáidtear ach gluaiseachtaí díreacha G1.\n"
" - Cumasaithe: feistítear stuanna do gach conair uirlise.\n"
" - Líonadh tanaí amháin: ní fheistítear stuanna ach don líonadh tanaí, rud a "
"ghiorraíonn G-code na bpatrún líonta cuartha gan dul i bhfeidhm ar na ballaí "
"agus na dromchlaí.\n"
"\n"
"Nóta: Do mheaisíní Klipper, moltar Díchumasaithe. Scoilteann Klipper stuanna "
"ar ais ina míreanna líne, rud a laghdaíonn cáilíocht an dromchla agus a "
"d'fhéadfadh an t-am priontála a mhéadú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Cumasaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Sparse infill only"
msgstr "Líonadh tanaí amháin"

# AI Translated
msgid "Add line number"
msgstr "Cuir uimhir líne leis"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable this to add line number(Nx) at the beginning of each G-code line."
msgstr "Cumasaigh é seo chun uimhir líne (Nx) a chur ag tús gach líne G-code."

# AI Translated
msgid "Scan first layer"
msgstr "Scan an chéad sraith"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable this to allow the camera on the printer to check the quality of the "
"first layer."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh é seo chun ligean don cheamara ar an bprintéir cáilíocht na chéad "
"sraithe a sheiceáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Power Loss Recovery"
msgstr "Athshlánú ó Chailliúint Cumhachta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Choose how to control power loss recovery. When set to Printer "
"configuration, the slicer will not emit power loss recovery G-code and will "
"leave the printer's configuration unchanged. Applicable to Bambu Lab or "
"Marlin 2 firmware based printers."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh conas athshlánú ó chailliúint cumhachta a rialú. Nuair atá sé "
"socraithe go Cumraíocht an phrintéara, ní eiseoidh an slisneoir G-code "
"athshlánaithe ó chailliúint cumhachta agus fágfaidh sé cumraíocht an "
"phrintéara gan athrú. Baineann sé le printéirí bunaithe ar dhochtearraí "
"Bambu Lab nó Marlin 2."

# AI Translated
msgid "Printer configuration"
msgstr "Cumraíocht an phrintéara"

# AI Translated
msgid "Nozzle type"
msgstr "Cineál soic"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The metallic material of the nozzle: This determines the abrasive resistance "
"of the nozzle and what kind of filament can be printed."
msgstr ""
"Ábhar miotalach an tsoic: Cinneann sé seo friotaíocht scríobach an tsoic "
"agus cén cineál filiméid is féidir a phriontáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Hardened steel"
msgstr "Cruach chruaite"

# AI Translated
msgid "Stainless steel"
msgstr "Cruach dhosmálta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Tungsten carbide"
msgstr "Carbíd tungstain"

# AI Translated
msgid "Nozzle HRC"
msgstr "HRC an tsoic"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The nozzle's hardness. Zero means no checking for nozzle hardness during "
"slicing."
msgstr ""
"Cruas an tsoic. Ciallaíonn nialas nach seiceáiltear cruas an tsoic le linn "
"slisnithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "HRC"
msgstr "HRC"

# AI Translated
msgid "Printer structure"
msgstr "Struchtúr an phrintéara"

# AI Translated
msgid "The physical arrangement and components of a printing device."
msgstr "Socrú fisiceach agus comhpháirteanna gléis phriontála."

# AI Translated
msgid "CoreXY"
msgstr "CoreXY"

# AI Translated
msgid "I3"
msgstr "I3"

# AI Translated
msgid "Hbot"
msgstr "Hbot"

# AI Translated
msgid "Delta"
msgstr "Delta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Best object position"
msgstr "An suíomh réada is fearr"

# AI Translated
msgid "Best auto arranging position in range [0,1] w.r.t. bed shape."
msgstr ""
"An suíomh uathshocraithe is fearr sa raon [0,1] i gcoibhneas le cruth na "
"leapa."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable this option if machine has auxiliary part cooling fan.\n"
"G-code command: M106 P2 S(0-255)."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh an rogha seo má tá gaothrán cúnta fuaraithe páirte ag an meaisín.\n"
"Ordú G-code: M106 P2 S(0-255)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Fan direction"
msgstr "Treo an ghaothráin"

# AI Translated
msgid "Cooling fan direction of the printer"
msgstr "Treo ghaothrán fuaraithe an phrintéara"

# AI Translated
msgid "Both"
msgstr "An dá cheann"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Start the fan this number of seconds earlier than its target start time (you "
"can use fractional seconds). It assumes infinite acceleration for this time "
"estimation, and will only take into account G1 and G0 moves (arc fitting is "
"unsupported).\n"
"It won't move fan commands from custom G-code (they act as a sort of "
"'barrier').\n"
"It won't move fan commands into the start G-code if the 'only custom start "
"G-code' is activated.\n"
"Use 0 to deactivate."
msgstr ""
"Tosaigh an gaothrán an líon soicindí seo níos luaithe ná a am tosaithe "
"sprice (is féidir leat codáin de shoicindí a úsáid). Glacann sé le "
"luasghéarú gan teorainn don mheastachán ama seo, agus ní chuirfidh sé san "
"áireamh ach gluaiseachtaí G1 agus G0 (ní thacaítear le feistiú stuanna).\n"
"Ní bhogfaidh sé orduithe gaothráin ó G-code saincheaptha (feidhmíonn siad "
"mar shórt 'bacainne').\n"
"Ní bhogfaidh sé orduithe gaothráin isteach sa G-code tosaithe má tá 'G-code "
"tosaithe saincheaptha amháin' gníomhachtaithe.\n"
"Úsáid 0 chun é a dhíghníomhachtú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Only overhangs"
msgstr "Starráin amháin"

# AI Translated
msgid "Will only take into account the delay for the cooling of overhangs."
msgstr "Ní chuirfidh sé san áireamh ach an mhoill d'fhuarú starrán."

# AI Translated
msgid "Fan kick-start time"
msgstr "Am tosaithe preab an ghaothráin"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Emit a max fan speed command for this amount of seconds before reducing to "
"target speed to kick-start the cooling fan.\n"
"This is useful for fans where a low PWM/power may be insufficient to get the "
"fan started spinning from a stop, or to get the fan up to speed faster.\n"
"Set to 0 to deactivate."
msgstr ""
"Eisigh ordú uasluas gaothráin ar feadh an líon soicindí seo sula laghdaítear "
"go dtí an luas sprice é chun an gaothrán fuaraithe a thosú le preab.\n"
"Tá sé seo úsáideach do ghaothráin nach leor PWM/cumhacht íseal dóibh chun an "
"gaothrán a chur ag casadh ó stad, nó chun an gaothrán a thabhairt suas chun "
"luais níos tapa.\n"
"Socraigh go 0 chun é a dhíghníomhachtú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Minimum non-zero part cooling fan speed"
msgstr "Íosluas neamhnialasach an ghaothráin fuaraithe páirte"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Some part-cooling fans cannot start spinning when commanded below a certain "
"PWM duty cycle. When set above 0, any non-zero part-cooling fan command will "
"be raised to at least this percentage so the fan reliably starts. A fan "
"command of 0 (fan off) is always honoured exactly. This clamp is applied "
"after every other fan calculation (first-layer ramp, layer-time "
"interpolation, overhang/bridge/support-interface/ironing overrides), so "
"scaling still operates within the range [this value, 100%].\n"
"If your firmware already disables the fan below a threshold (for example "
"Klipper's [fan] off_below: 0.10 shuts the fan off whenever the commanded "
"duty cycle is below 10%), this option and the firmware threshold should "
"ideally be set to the same value. Matching them (e.g. off_below: 0.10 in "
"Klipper and 10% here) guarantees the slicer never emits a non-zero value "
"that the firmware would silently drop, and the fan never receives a value "
"below the one you know it can actually spool at.\n"
"Set to 0 to deactivate."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir le roinnt gaothrán fuaraithe páirte tosú ag casadh nuair a "
"ordaítear iad faoi bhun timthriall dualgais PWM áirithe. Nuair a shocraítear "
"os cionn 0 é, ardófar aon ordú neamhnialasach don ghaothrán fuaraithe páirte "
"go dtí an céatadán seo ar a laghad ionas go dtosaíonn an gaothrán go "
"hiontaofa. Comhlíontar ordú gaothráin 0 (gaothrán as) go cruinn i gcónaí. "
"Cuirtear an teorannú seo i bhfeidhm tar éis gach ríomh gaothráin eile (ardú "
"na chéad sraithe, idirshuíomh am sraithe, sáruithe "
"starráin/droichid/chomhéadan taca/iarnála), mar sin oibríonn an scálú fós "
"laistigh den raon [an luach seo, 100%].\n"
"Má dhíchumasaíonn do dhochtearraí an gaothrán faoi bhun tairsí cheana (mar "
"shampla múchann [fan] off_below: 0.10 Klipper an gaothrán aon uair a bhíonn "
"an timthriall dualgais ordaithe faoi bhun 10%), ba cheart an rogha seo agus "
"tairseach na ndochtearraí a shocrú go dtí an luach céanna. Má mheaitseálann "
"tú iad (m.sh. off_below: 0.10 i Klipper agus 10% anseo) ráthaítear nach "
"n-eiseoidh an slisneoir riamh luach neamhnialasach a chaithfeadh na "
"dochtearraí uathu go ciúin, agus nach bhfaigheann an gaothrán luach riamh "
"faoi bhun an chinn a bhfuil a fhios agat gur féidir leis casadh air.\n"
"Socraigh go 0 chun é a dhíghníomhachtú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Time cost"
msgstr "Costas ama"

# AI Translated
msgid "The printer cost per hour."
msgstr "Costas an phrintéara in aghaidh na huaire."

# AI Translated
msgid "money/h"
msgstr "airgead/u"

# AI Translated
msgid "Support controlling chamber temperature"
msgstr "Tacaíocht do rialú teocht an tseomra"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This option is enabled if the machine supports controlling the chamber "
"temperature\n"
"G-code command: M141 S(0-255)"
msgstr ""
"Cumasaítear an rogha seo má thacaíonn an meaisín le rialú teocht an tseomra\n"
"Ordú G-code: M141 S(0-255)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Support air filtration"
msgstr "Tacaíocht do scagadh aeir"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable this if the printer supports air filtration\n"
"G-code command: M106 P3 S(0-255)"
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh é seo má thacaíonn an printéir le scagadh aeir\n"
"Ordú G-code: M106 P3 S(0-255)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Use cooling filter"
msgstr "Úsáid scagaire fuaraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable this if the printer supports a cooling filter"
msgstr "Cumasaigh é seo má thacaíonn an printéir le scagaire fuaraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "G-code flavor"
msgstr "Blas G-code"

# AI Translated
msgid "What kind of G-code the printer is compatible with."
msgstr "An cineál G-code a bhfuil an printéir comhoiriúnach leis."

# AI Translated
msgid "Marlin (legacy)"
msgstr "Marlin (oidhreacht)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Klipper"
msgstr "Klipper"

# AI Translated
msgid "Skip G-code config block"
msgstr "Scipeáil bloc cumraíochta G-code"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Do not write the CONFIG_BLOCK (slicer configuration key/value pairs) into "
"the G-code file. This can help with printers whose firmware crashes when "
"parsing these comment lines (e.g. Anycubic go-klipper).\n"
"\n"
"Note: the G-code file will no longer contain slicer settings, so importing "
"it back into OrcaSlicer will not restore the configuration."
msgstr ""
"Ná scríobh an CONFIG_BLOCK (péirí eochrach/luacha cumraíochta an slisneora) "
"isteach sa chomhad G-code. Is féidir leis seo cabhrú le printéirí a "
"dtuairteann a ndochtearraí agus na línte tráchta seo á bparsáil (m.sh. "
"Anycubic go-klipper).\n"
"\n"
"Nóta: ní bheidh socruithe an slisneora sa chomhad G-code a thuilleadh, mar "
"sin ní athchóireofar an chumraíocht má iompórtáiltear ar ais isteach in "
"OrcaSlicer é."

# AI Translated
msgid "Pellet Modded Printer"
msgstr "Printéir Modhnaithe do Mhillíní"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable this option if your printer uses pellets instead of filaments."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh an rogha seo má úsáideann do phrintéir millíní in ionad filiméad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Support multi bed types"
msgstr "Tacaíocht do chineálacha iolracha leapa"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable this option if you want to use multiple bed types."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh an rogha seo más mian leat cineálacha iolracha leapa a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Label objects"
msgstr "Lipéadaigh réada"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable this to add comments into the G-code labeling print moves with what "
"object they belong to, which is useful for the Octoprint CancelObject "
"plug-in.\n"
"\n"
"This setting is NOT compatible with Single Extruder Multi Material setup and "
"Wipe into Object / Wipe into Infill."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh é seo chun tráchtanna a chur isteach sa G-code a lipéadaíonn "
"gluaiseachtaí priontála leis an réad lena mbaineann siad, rud atá úsáideach "
"don bhreiseán Octoprint CancelObject.\n"
"\n"
"Níl an socrú seo comhoiriúnach le socrú Ilábhar Aon Easbhrúiteora ná le "
"Glanadh isteach sa Réad / Glanadh isteach sa Líonadh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Exclude objects"
msgstr "Eisiaigh réada"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable this option to add EXCLUDE OBJECT command in G-code."
msgstr "Cumasaigh an rogha seo chun ordú EXCLUDE OBJECT a chur sa G-code."

# AI Translated
msgid "Outline tolerance"
msgstr "Lamháltas na himlíne"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Maximum deviation of the object outline written to EXCLUDE_OBJECT_DEFINE "
"from the original outline. Larger values give fewer points, which helps "
"firmware that stalls while parsing G-code with many objects. 0 keeps every "
"point."
msgstr ""
"Uasdiall imlíne an réada a scríobhtar chuig EXCLUDE_OBJECT_DEFINE ón imlíne "
"bhunaidh. Tugann luachanna níos mó níos lú pointí, rud a chabhraíonn le "
"dochtearraí a stopann agus G-code le go leor réad á pharsáil. Coinníonn 0 "
"gach pointe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Verbose G-code"
msgstr "G-code briathrach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable this to get a commented G-code file, with each line explained by a "
"descriptive text.\n"
"\n"
"If you print from SD card, the additional weight of the file could make your "
"firmware slow down."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh é seo chun comhad G-code le tráchtanna a fháil, le gach líne "
"mínithe ag téacs tuairisciúil.\n"
"\n"
"Má phriontálann tú ó chárta SD, d'fhéadfadh meáchan breise an chomhaid do "
"dhochtearraí a mhoilliú."

# AI Translated
msgid "High precision G-code (experimental)"
msgstr "G-code ardbheachtais (turgnamhach)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Write X, Y, Z, I and J with 4 decimal places instead of 3, and E with 6 "
"instead of 5, to reduce rounding errors in the G-code. With relative E "
"distances, the rounding error of each move is also carried over to the next "
"one. Supports are removed after printing, so they keep the standard "
"precision. This may help stabilize extrusion with small nozzles (e.g. 0.2 "
"mm) and thin layers (e.g. 0.08 mm or less), where each move extrudes so "
"little material that rounding errors matter most. The effect depends "
"strongly on how well the rest of the settings are tuned and may be hard to "
"notice unless the print profile is well calibrated.\n"
"\n"
"The G-code file becomes about 10 percent larger, which may slow down "
"printers that parse G-code slowly."
msgstr ""
"Scríobh X, Y, Z, I agus J le 4 ionad deachúlach in ionad 3, agus E le 6 in "
"ionad 5, chun earráidí slánaithe sa G-code a laghdú. Le faid choibhneasta E, "
"iompraítear earráid shlánaithe gach gluaiseachta ar aghaidh go dtí an chéad "
"cheann eile freisin. Baintear tacaí tar éis priontála, mar sin coinníonn "
"siad an gnáthbheachtas. D'fhéadfadh sé seo cabhrú le heasbhrú a chobhsú le "
"soic bheaga (m.sh. 0.2 mm) agus sraitheanna tanaí (m.sh. 0.08 mm nó níos "
"lú), áit a n-easbhrúnn gach gluaiseacht chomh beag sin ábhair gur mó a "
"bhíonn tábhacht le hearráidí slánaithe. Braitheann an éifeacht go mór ar "
"chomh maith agus atá an chuid eile de na socruithe tiúnáilte agus "
"d'fhéadfadh sé a bheith deacair a thabhairt faoi deara mura bhfuil an "
"phróifíl phriontála calabraithe go maith.\n"
"\n"
"Éiríonn an comhad G-code thart ar 10 faoin gcéad níos mó, rud a d'fhéadfadh "
"printéirí a pharsálann G-code go mall a mhoilliú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Infill combination"
msgstr "Comhcheangal líonta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Automatically combine sparse infill of several layers to print together in "
"order to reduce time. Walls are still printed with original layer height."
msgstr ""
"Comhcheangail líonadh tanaí roinnt sraitheanna go huathoibríoch le priontáil "
"le chéile chun am a laghdú. Priontáiltear ballaí fós leis an airde sraithe "
"bhunaidh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Infill shift step"
msgstr "Céim aistrithe an líonta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This parameter adds a slight displacement to each layer of infill to create "
"a cross texture."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann an paraiméadar seo díláithriú beag le gach sraith líonta chun "
"uigeacht chrosach a chruthú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Sparse infill rotation template"
msgstr "Teimpléad rothlaithe an líonta thanaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Rotate the sparse infill direction per layer using a template of angles. "
"Enter comma-separated degrees (e.g., '0,30,60,90'). Angles are applied in "
"order by layer and repeat when the list ends.\n"
"\n"
"Advanced syntax is supported: '+5' rotates +5° every layer; '+5#5' rotates "
"+5° every 5 layers. See the Wiki for details.\n"
"\n"
"When a template is set, the standard infill direction setting is ignored.\n"
"\n"
"Note: some infill patterns (e.g., Gyroid) control rotation themselves; use "
"with care."
msgstr ""
"Rothlaigh treo an líonta thanaí in aghaidh na sraithe ag úsáid teimpléid "
"uillinneacha. Cuir isteach céimeanna scartha le camóga (m.sh., "
"'0,30,60,90'). Cuirtear uillinneacha i bhfeidhm in ord de réir sraithe agus "
"athdhéantar iad nuair a chríochnaíonn an liosta.\n"
"\n"
"Tacaítear le comhréir chasta: rothlaíonn '+5' +5° gach sraith; rothlaíonn "
"'+5#5' +5° gach 5 shraith. Féach ar an Vicí le haghaidh sonraí.\n"
"\n"
"Nuair a shocraítear teimpléad, déantar neamhaird de ghnáthshocrú threo an "
"líonta.\n"
"\n"
"Nóta: rialaíonn roinnt patrún líonta (m.sh., Gyroid) an rothlú iad féin; "
"úsáid go cúramach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Solid infill rotation template"
msgstr "Teimpléad rothlaithe an líonta sholadaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This parameter adds a rotation of solid infill direction to each layer "
"according to the specified template. The template is a comma-separated list "
"of angles in degrees, e.g. '0,90'. The first angle is applied to the first "
"layer, the second angle to the second layer, and so on. If there are more "
"layers than angles, the angles will be repeated.\n"
"\n"
"Note that not all solid infill patterns support rotation."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann an paraiméadar seo rothlú ar threo an líonta sholadaigh le gach "
"sraith de réir an teimpléid shonraithe. Is liosta uillinneacha i gcéimeanna "
"scartha le camóga é an teimpléad, m.sh. '0,90'. Cuirtear an chéad uillinn i "
"bhfeidhm ar an gcéad sraith, an dara huillinn ar an dara sraith, agus mar "
"sin de. Má tá níos mó sraitheanna ná uillinneacha ann, athdhéanfar na "
"huillinneacha.\n"
"\n"
"Tabhair faoi deara nach dtacaíonn gach patrún líonta sholadaigh le rothlú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Skeleton infill density"
msgstr "Dlús líonta an chreatlaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The remaining part of the model contour after removing a certain depth from "
"the surface is called the skeleton. This parameter is used to adjust the "
"density of this section. When two regions have the same sparse infill "
"settings but different skeleton densities, their skeleton areas will develop "
"overlapping sections. Default is as same as infill density."
msgstr ""
"Tugtar an creatlach ar an gcuid de chomhrian na samhla atá fágtha tar éis "
"doimhneacht áirithe a bhaint ón dromchla. Úsáidtear an paraiméadar seo chun "
"dlús na coda seo a choigeartú. Nuair a bhíonn na socruithe líonta thanaí "
"céanna ag dhá réigiún ach dlúis chreatlaigh éagsúla, beidh codanna "
"forluiteacha ag a limistéir chreatlaigh. Is ionann an réamhshocrú agus dlús "
"an líonta."

# AI Translated
msgid "Skin infill density"
msgstr "Dlús líonta an chraicinn"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The portion of the model's outer surface within a certain depth range is "
"called the skin. This parameter is used to adjust the density of this "
"section. When two regions have the same sparse infill settings but different "
"skin densities, this area will not be split into two separate regions. "
"Default is as same as infill density."
msgstr ""
"Tugtar an craiceann ar an gcuid de dhromchla seachtrach na samhla laistigh "
"de raon doimhneachta áirithe. Úsáidtear an paraiméadar seo chun dlús na coda "
"seo a choigeartú. Nuair a bhíonn na socruithe líonta thanaí céanna ag dhá "
"réigiún ach dlúis chraicinn éagsúla, ní roinnfear an limistéar seo ina dhá "
"réigiún ar leith. Is ionann an réamhshocrú agus dlús an líonta."

# AI Translated
msgid "Skin infill depth"
msgstr "Doimhneacht líonta an chraicinn"

# AI Translated
msgid "The parameter sets the depth of skin."
msgstr "Socraíonn an paraiméadar doimhneacht an chraicinn."

# AI Translated
msgid "Infill lock depth"
msgstr "Doimhneacht ghlasála an líonta"

# AI Translated
msgid "The parameter sets the overlapping depth between the interior and skin."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn an paraiméadar an doimhneacht fhorluiteach idir an taobh istigh "
"agus an craiceann."

# AI Translated
msgid "Skin line width"
msgstr "Leithead líne an chraicinn"

# AI Translated
msgid "Adjust the line width of the selected skin paths."
msgstr "Coigeartaigh leithead líne na gconairí craicinn roghnaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Skeleton line width"
msgstr "Leithead líne an chreatlaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid "Adjust the line width of the selected skeleton paths."
msgstr "Coigeartaigh leithead líne na gconairí creatlaigh roghnaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Symmetric infill Y axis"
msgstr "Líonadh siméadrach ais Y"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If the model has two parts that are symmetric about the Y axis, and you want "
"these parts to have symmetric textures, please click this option on one of "
"the parts."
msgstr ""
"Má tá dhá pháirt ag an tsamhail atá siméadrach faoi ais Y, agus más mian "
"leat uigeachtaí siméadracha a bheith ag na páirteanna seo, cliceáil ar an "
"rogha seo ar cheann de na páirteanna."

# AI Translated
msgid "Fill pattern tops"
msgstr "Líon bairr an phatrúin"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Choose this option if you want to completely fill in the tops of the infill "
"pattern"
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh an rogha seo más mian leat bairr phatrún an líonta a líonadh go "
"hiomlán"

# AI Translated
msgid "Infill combination - Max layer height"
msgstr "Comhcheangal líonta - Uasairde sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Maximum layer height for the combined sparse infill.\n"
"\n"
"Set it to 0 or 100% to use the nozzle diameter (for maximum reduction in "
"print time) or a value of ~80% to maximize sparse infill strength.\n"
"\n"
"The number of layers over which infill is combined is derived by dividing "
"this value with the layer height and rounded down to the nearest decimal.\n"
"\n"
"Use either absolute mm values (eg. 0.32mm for a 0.4mm nozzle) or % values "
"(eg 80%). This value must not be larger than the nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"Uasairde sraithe don líonadh tanaí comhcheangailte.\n"
"\n"
"Socraigh go 0 nó 100% é chun trastomhas an tsoic a úsáid (don laghdú is mó "
"ar am priontála) nó luach ~80% chun neart an líonta thanaí a uasmhéadú.\n"
"\n"
"Díorthaítear líon na sraitheanna a gcomhcheanglaítear líonadh thar a chéile "
"tríd an luach seo a roinnt ar airde na sraithe agus é a shlánú síos go dtí "
"an deachúil is gaire.\n"
"\n"
"Úsáid luachanna iomlána mm (m.sh. 0.32mm do shoc 0.4mm) nó luachanna % "
"(m.sh. 80%). Níor cheart don luach seo a bheith níos mó ná trastomhas an "
"tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable clumping detection"
msgstr "Cumasaigh brath cnapánaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Clumping detection layers"
msgstr "Sraitheanna braite cnapánaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Clumping detection layers."
msgstr "Sraitheanna braite cnapánaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Probing exclude area of clumping"
msgstr "Limistéar eisiata tóireadh cnapánaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Probing exclude area of clumping."
msgstr "Limistéar eisiata tóireadh cnapánaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Lateral lattice angle 1"
msgstr "Uillinn laitíse thaobhaigh 1"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The angle of the first set of Lateral lattice elements in the Z direction. "
"Zero is vertical."
msgstr ""
"Uillinn an chéad tacair d'eilimintí laitíse taobhaí i dtreo Z. Is ingearach "
"é nialas."

# AI Translated
msgid "Lateral lattice angle 2"
msgstr "Uillinn laitíse thaobhaigh 2"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The angle of the second set of Lateral lattice elements in the Z direction. "
"Zero is vertical."
msgstr ""
"Uillinn an dara tacar d'eilimintí laitíse taobhaí i dtreo Z. Is ingearach é "
"nialas."

# AI Translated
msgid "Infill overhang angle"
msgstr "Uillinn starráin an líonta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The angle of the infill angled lines. 60° will result in a pure honeycomb."
msgstr ""
"Uillinn línte uillinneacha an líonta. Tabharfaidh 60° cíor mheala ghlan."

# AI Translated
msgid "Lightning overhang angle"
msgstr "Uillinn starráin na Tintrí"

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum overhang angle for Lightning infill support propagation."
msgstr "Uasuillinn starráin do leathadh tacaíochta an líonta Tintrí."

# AI Translated
msgid "Prune angle"
msgstr "Uillinn bhearrtha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Controls how aggressively short or unsupported Lightning branches are "
"pruned.\n"
"This angle is converted internally to a per-layer distance."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn sé cé chomh hionsaitheach a bhearrtar craobhacha gearra nó gan "
"taca den Tintreach.\n"
"Tiontaítear an uillinn seo go hinmheánach go fad in aghaidh na sraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Straightening angle"
msgstr "Uillinn dhírithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum straightening angle used to simplify Lightning branches."
msgstr "Uasuillinn dhírithe a úsáidtear chun craobhacha Tintrí a shimpliú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Sparse infill anchor length"
msgstr "Fad ancaire an líonta thanaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Connect an infill line to an internal perimeter with a short segment of an "
"additional perimeter. If expressed as percentage (example: 15%) it is "
"calculated over infill extrusion width. Orca Slicer tries to connect two "
"close infill lines to a short perimeter segment. If no such perimeter "
"segment shorter than infill_anchor_max is found, the infill line is "
"connected to a perimeter segment at just one side and the length of the "
"perimeter segment taken is limited to this parameter, but no longer than "
"anchor_length_max.\n"
"Set this parameter to zero to disable anchoring perimeters connected to a "
"single infill line."
msgstr ""
"Ceangail líne líonta le himlíne inmheánach le mír ghearr d'imlíne bhreise. "
"Má léirítear é mar chéatadán (mar shampla: 15%) ríomhtar é ar leithead "
"easbhrúite an líonta. Déanann Orca Slicer iarracht dhá líne líonta atá gar "
"dá chéile a cheangal le mír imlíne ghearr. Mura n-aimsítear aon mhír imlíne "
"den sórt sin níos giorra ná infill_anchor_max, ceanglaítear an líne líonta "
"le mír imlíne ar thaobh amháin amháin agus teorannaítear fad na míre imlíne "
"a ghlactar don pharaiméadar seo, ach gan a bheith níos faide ná "
"anchor_length_max.\n"
"Socraigh an paraiméadar seo go nialas chun imlínte ancaireachta atá "
"ceangailte le líne líonta aonair a dhíchumasú."

# AI Translated
msgid "0 (no open anchors)"
msgstr "0 (gan ancairí oscailte)"

# AI Translated
msgid "1000 (unlimited)"
msgstr "1000 (gan teorainn)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum length of the infill anchor"
msgstr "Uasfhad ancaire an líonta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Connect an infill line to an internal perimeter with a short segment of an "
"additional perimeter. If expressed as percentage (example: 15%) it is "
"calculated over infill extrusion width. Orca Slicer tries to connect two "
"close infill lines to a short perimeter segment. If no such perimeter "
"segment shorter than this parameter is found, the infill line is connected "
"to a perimeter segment at just one side and the length of the perimeter "
"segment taken is limited to infill_anchor, but no longer than this "
"parameter.\n"
"If set to 0, the old algorithm for infill connection will be used, it should "
"create the same result as with 1000 & 0."
msgstr ""
"Ceangail líne líonta le himlíne inmheánach le mír ghearr d'imlíne bhreise. "
"Má léirítear é mar chéatadán (mar shampla: 15%) ríomhtar é ar leithead "
"easbhrúite an líonta. Déanann Orca Slicer iarracht dhá líne líonta atá gar "
"dá chéile a cheangal le mír imlíne ghearr. Mura n-aimsítear aon mhír imlíne "
"den sórt sin níos giorra ná an paraiméadar seo, ceanglaítear an líne líonta "
"le mír imlíne ar thaobh amháin amháin agus teorannaítear fad na míre imlíne "
"a ghlactar do infill_anchor, ach gan a bheith níos faide ná an paraiméadar "
"seo.\n"
"Má shocraítear go 0 é, úsáidfear an sean-algartam do cheangal líonta, ba "
"cheart go gcruthódh sé an toradh céanna le 1000 & 0."

# AI Translated
msgid "0 (Simple connect)"
msgstr "0 (Ceangal simplí)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Filament to print internal sparse infill.\n"
"\"Default\" uses the active object/part filament."
msgstr ""
"Filiméad chun an líonadh tanaí inmheánach a phriontáil.\n"
"Úsáideann \"Réamhshocrú\" filiméad gníomhach an réada/na páirte."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Line width of internal sparse infill. If expressed as a %, it will be "
"computed over the nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"Leithead líne an líonta thanaí inmheánaigh. Má léirítear é mar %, ríomhfar é "
"i gcoibhneas le trastomhas an tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid "Infill/wall overlap"
msgstr "Forluí líonta/balla"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"This allows the infill area to be enlarged slightly to overlap with walls "
"for better bonding. The percentage value is relative to the inner wall line "
"width. Set this value to ~10-15% to minimize potential over extrusion and "
"accumulation of material resulting in rough top surfaces."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann sé seo limistéar an líonta a mhéadú beagán chun forluí le ballaí le "
"haghaidh nascadh níos fearr. Tá an luach céatadáin coibhneasta le leithead "
"líne an bhalla inmheánaigh. Socraigh an luach seo go ~10-15% chun ró-easbhrú "
"féideartha agus carnadh ábhair a íoslaghdú, rud a fhágann dromchlaí uachtair "
"garbha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Top/Bottom solid infill/wall overlap"
msgstr "Forluí líonta sholadaigh uachtair/íochtair agus balla"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"Top solid infill area is enlarged slightly to overlap with wall for better "
"bonding and to minimize the appearance of pinholes where the top infill "
"meets the walls. A value of 25-30% is a good starting point, minimizing the "
"appearance of pinholes. The percentage value is relative to the inner wall "
"line width."
msgstr ""
"Méadaítear limistéar an líonta sholadaigh uachtair beagán chun forluí leis "
"an mballa le haghaidh nascadh níos fearr agus chun cuma pionphoill a "
"íoslaghdú san áit a dtagann an líonadh uachtair leis na ballaí. Is pointe "
"tosaigh maith é luach 25-30%, ag íoslaghdú cuma na bpionpholl. Tá an luach "
"céatadáin coibhneasta le leithead líne an bhalla inmheánaigh."

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the speed for internal sparse infill."
msgstr "Seo é an luas don líonadh tanaí inmheánach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Inherits profile"
msgstr "Faigheann oidhreacht ó phróifíl"

# AI Translated
msgid "Name of parent profile."
msgstr "Ainm na próifíle tuismitheora."

# AI Translated
msgid "Interface shells"
msgstr "Blaoscanna comhéadain"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Force the generation of solid shells between adjacent materials/volumes. "
"Useful for multi-extruder prints with translucent materials or manual "
"soluble support material."
msgstr ""
"Cuir iallach blaoscanna soladacha a ghiniúint idir ábhair/toirteanna "
"cóngaracha. Úsáideach do phriontaí ilsheasbhrúiteora le hábhair "
"thréshoilseacha nó le hábhar taca intuaslagtha láimhe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum width of a segmented region"
msgstr "Uasleithead réigiúin dheighilte"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Maximum width of a segmented region. A value of 0 disables this feature."
msgstr "Uasleithead réigiúin dheighilte. Díchumasaíonn luach 0 an ghné seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Interlocking depth of a segmented region"
msgstr "Doimhneacht idirghlasála réigiúin dheighilte"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Interlocking depth of a segmented region. On every other layer, the "
"segmented region is limited to this depth. It will be ignored if "
"\"interlocking_beam\" is enabled. Zero disables this feature."
msgstr ""
"Doimhneacht idirghlasála réigiúin dheighilte. Ar gach dara sraith, "
"teorannaítear an réigiún deighilte go dtí an doimhneacht seo. Déanfar "
"neamhaird de má tá \"interlocking_beam\" cumasaithe. Díchumasaíonn nialas an "
"ghné seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Use beam interlocking"
msgstr "Úsáid idirghlasáil bhíomaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Generate interlocking beam structure at the locations where different "
"filaments touch. This improves the adhesion between filaments, especially "
"models printed in different materials."
msgstr ""
"Gin struchtúr bíomaí idirghlasála ag na háiteanna a dtéann filiméid éagsúla "
"i dteagmháil lena chéile. Feabhsaíonn sé seo an ghreamaitheacht idir "
"filiméid, go háirithe samhlacha a phriontáiltear in ábhair éagsúla."

# AI Translated
msgid "Interlocking beam width"
msgstr "Leithead bhíomaí na hidirghlasála"

# AI Translated
msgid "The width of the interlocking structure beams."
msgstr "Leithead bhíomaí an struchtúir idirghlasála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Interlocking direction"
msgstr "Treo na hidirghlasála"

# AI Translated
msgid "Orientation of interlock beams."
msgstr "Treoshuíomh na mbíomaí idirghlasála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Interlocking beam layers"
msgstr "Sraitheanna bhíomaí na hidirghlasála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The height of the beams of the interlocking structure, measured in number of "
"layers. Less layers is stronger, but more prone to defects."
msgstr ""
"Airde bhíomaí an struchtúir idirghlasála, tomhaiste i líon sraitheanna. Is "
"láidre níos lú sraitheanna, ach is mó an seans lochtanna."

# AI Translated
msgid "Interlocking depth"
msgstr "Doimhneacht na hidirghlasála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The distance from the boundary between filaments to generate interlocking "
"structure, measured in cells. Too few cells will result in poor adhesion."
msgstr ""
"An fad ón teorainn idir filiméid chun struchtúr idirghlasála a ghiniúint, "
"tomhaiste i gcealla. Beidh droch-ghreamaitheacht mar thoradh ar ró-bheagán "
"ceall."

# AI Translated
msgid "Interlocking boundary avoidance"
msgstr "Seachaint teorann na hidirghlasála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The distance from the outside of a model where interlocking structures will "
"not be generated, measured in cells."
msgstr ""
"An fad ón taobh amuigh de shamhail nach ngintear struchtúir idirghlasála "
"ann, tomhaiste i gcealla."

# AI Translated
msgid "Ironing type"
msgstr "Cineál iarnála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Ironing uses a small flow to print at the same height of a surface to make "
"flat surfaces smoother. This setting controls which layers are being ironed."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann iarnáil sreabhadh beag chun priontáil ag an airde chéanna le "
"dromchla chun dromchlaí cothroma a dhéanamh níos míne. Rialaíonn an socrú "
"seo cé na sraitheanna a iarnáiltear."

# AI Translated
msgid "No ironing"
msgstr "Gan iarnáil"

# AI Translated
msgid "All top surfaces"
msgstr "Gach dromchla uachtair"

# AI Translated
msgid "Topmost surface only"
msgstr "An dromchla is airde amháin"

# AI Translated
msgid "All solid layers"
msgstr "Gach sraith sholadach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Ironing Pattern"
msgstr "Patrún Iarnála"

# AI Translated
msgid "The pattern that will be used when ironing."
msgstr "An patrún a úsáidfear le linn iarnála."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the amount of material to be extruded during ironing. It is relative "
"to the flow of normal layer height. Too high a value will result in "
"overextrusion on the surface."
msgstr ""
"Seo é méid an ábhair le heasbhrú le linn iarnála. Tá sé coibhneasta le "
"sreabhadh ghnáth-airde na sraithe. Má bhíonn an luach ró-ard, beidh "
"ró-easbhrú ar an dromchla."

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the distance between the lines used for ironing."
msgstr "Seo é an fad idir na línte a úsáidtear le haghaidh iarnála."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The distance to keep from the edges. A value of 0 sets this to half of the "
"nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"An fad le coinneáil ó na himill. Socraíonn luach 0 é seo go leath de "
"thrastomhas an tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the print speed for ironing lines."
msgstr "Seo é luas priontála na línte iarnála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Ironing angle offset"
msgstr "Fritháireamh uillinn na hiarnála"

# AI Translated
msgid "The angle of ironing lines offset from the top surface."
msgstr "Fritháireamh uillinn na línte iarnála ón dromchla uachtair."

# AI Translated
msgid "Fixed ironing angle"
msgstr "Uillinn sheasta iarnála"

# AI Translated
msgid "Use a fixed absolute angle for ironing."
msgstr "Úsáid uillinn iomlán sheasta don iarnáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Ironing expansion"
msgstr "Leathnú na hiarnála"

# AI Translated
msgid "Expand or contract the ironing area."
msgstr "Leathnaigh nó crap limistéar na hiarnála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Z contouring enabled"
msgstr "Comhrianú Z cumasaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable Z-layer contouring (aka Z-layer anti-aliasing)."
msgstr "Cumasaigh comhrianú sraithe Z (frith-ailiasáil sraithe Z)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Minimize wall height angle"
msgstr "Uillinn íoslaghdaithe airde balla"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Reduce the height of top-surface perimeters to match the model edge height.\n"
"Affects perimeters with a slope greater than this angle (degrees).\n"
"A reasonable value is 35. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Laghdaigh airde na n-imlínte dromchla uachtair chun teacht le hairde imeall "
"na samhla.\n"
"Téann sé i bhfeidhm ar imlínte a bhfuil fána níos mó ná an uillinn seo "
"(céimeanna) acu.\n"
"Is luach réasúnta é 35. Socraigh go 0 chun é a dhíchumasú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Don't alternate fill direction"
msgstr "Ná hailtéarnaigh treo an líonta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Disable alternating fill direction when using Z contouring."
msgstr "Díchumasaigh treo líonta ailtéarnach nuair a úsáidtear comhrianú Z."

# AI Translated
msgid "Minimum Z height"
msgstr "Íosairde Z"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Minimum Z-layer height.\n"
"Also controls the slicing plane."
msgstr ""
"Íosairde sraithe Z.\n"
"Rialaíonn sé an plána slisnithe freisin."

# AI Translated
msgid "This G-code is inserted at every layer change after the Z lift."
msgstr "Cuirtear an G-code seo isteach ag gach athrú sraithe tar éis ardú Z."

# AI Translated
msgid "Clumping detection G-code"
msgstr "G-code braite cnapánaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Emit limits to G-code"
msgstr "Eisigh teorainneacha chuig G-code"

# AI Translated
msgid "Machine limits"
msgstr "Teorainneacha an mheaisín"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, the machine limits will be emitted to G-code file.\n"
"This option will be ignored if the G-code flavor is set to Klipper."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, eiseofar teorainneacha an mheaisín chuig an gcomhad "
"G-code.\n"
"Déanfar neamhaird den rogha seo má tá blas an G-code socraithe go Klipper."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This G-code will be used as a code for the pause print. Users can insert "
"pause G-code in the G-code viewer."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidfear an G-code seo mar chód chun an phriontáil a chur ar sos. Is féidir "
"le húsáideoirí G-code sosa a chur isteach san amharcóir G-code."

# AI Translated
msgid "This G-code will be used as a custom code."
msgstr "Úsáidfear an G-code seo mar chód saincheaptha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Small area flow compensation (beta)"
msgstr "Cúiteamh sreafa limistéar beag (béite)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable flow compensation for small infill areas."
msgstr "Cumasaigh cúiteamh sreafa do limistéir bheaga líonta."

# AI Translated
msgid "Flow Compensation Model"
msgstr "Múnla Cúitimh Sreafa"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Flow Compensation Model, used to adjust the flow for small infill areas. The "
"model is expressed as a comma separated pair of values for extrusion length "
"and flow correction factor. Each pair is on a separate line, followed by a "
"semicolon, in the following format: \"1.234, 5.678;\""
msgstr ""
"Múnla Cúitimh Sreafa, a úsáidtear chun an sreabhadh a choigeartú do "
"limistéir bheaga líonta. Léirítear an múnla mar phéire luachanna scartha le "
"camóg d'fhad easbhrúite agus fachtóir ceartúcháin sreafa. Tá gach péire ar "
"líne ar leith, agus leathstad ina dhiaidh, san fhormáid seo a leanas: "
"\"1.234, 5.678;\""

