msgstr "Uasturraing ais Z"

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum jerk of the E axis"
msgstr "Uasturraing ais E"

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum Junction Deviation"
msgstr "Uasdiall Acomhail"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Maximum junction deviation (M205 J, only apply if JD > 0 for Marlin "
"Firmware\n"
"If your Marlin 2 printer uses Classic Jerk set this value to 0.)"
msgstr ""
"Uasdiall acomhail (M205 J, ní bhaineann sé ach má tá JD > 0 do Dhochtearraí "
"Marlin\n"
"Má úsáideann do phrintéir Marlin 2 Turraing Chlasaiceach socraigh an luach "
"seo go 0.)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Minimum speed for extruding"
msgstr "Íosluas easbhrúite"

# AI Translated
msgid "Minimum speed for extruding (M205 S)"
msgstr "Íosluas easbhrúite (M205 S)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Minimum travel speed"
msgstr "Íosluas taistil"

# AI Translated
msgid "Minimum travel speed (M205 T)"
msgstr "Íosluas taistil (M205 T)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum force of the Y axis"
msgstr "Uasfhórsa ais Y"

# AI Translated
msgid "The allowed maximum output force of Y axis"
msgstr "An t-uasfhórsa aschuir ceadaithe d'ais Y"

# AI Translated
msgctxt "Newton"
msgid "N"
msgstr "N"

# AI Translated
msgid "Bed mass of the Y axis"
msgstr "Mais leapa ais Y"

# AI Translated
msgid "The machine bed mass load of Y axis"
msgstr "Ualach maise leapa an mheaisín d'ais Y"

# AI Translated
msgctxt "gram"
msgid "g"
msgstr "g"

# AI Translated
msgid "The allowed max printed mass"
msgstr "An t-uasmhais phriontáilte cheadaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "The allowed max printed mass on a plate"
msgstr "An t-uasmhais phriontáilte cheadaithe ar phláta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum acceleration for extruding"
msgstr "Uasluasghéarú easbhrúite"

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum acceleration for extruding (M204 P)"
msgstr "Uasluasghéarú easbhrúite (M204 P)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum acceleration for retracting"
msgstr "Uasluasghéarú aistarraingthe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum acceleration for retracting (M204 R)"
msgstr "Uasluasghéarú aistarraingthe (M204 R)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum acceleration for travel"
msgstr "Uasluasghéarú taistil"

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum acceleration for travel (M204 T), it only applies to Marlin 2."
msgstr "Uasluasghéarú taistil (M204 T), ní bhaineann sé ach le Marlin 2."

# AI Translated
msgid "Resonance avoidance"
msgstr "Seachaint athshondais"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"By reducing the speed of the outer wall to avoid the resonance zone of the "
"printer, ringing on the surface of the model are avoided.\n"
"Please turn this option off when testing ringing."
msgstr ""
"Trí luas an bhalla sheachtraigh a laghdú chun crios athshondais an "
"phrintéara a sheachaint, seachnaítear macalla ar dhromchla na samhla.\n"
"Múch an rogha seo nuair a bhíonn macalla á thástáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Min"
msgstr "Íos"

# AI Translated
msgid "Minimum speed of resonance avoidance."
