msgstr "DAA"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Resonant frequency for the X axis input shaper.\n"
"Zero will use the firmware frequency.\n"
"To disable input shaping, use the Disable type.\n"
"RRF: X and Y values are equal."
msgstr ""
"Minicíocht athshondach do mhúnlóir ionchuir ais X.\n"
"Úsáidfidh nialas minicíocht na ndochtearraí.\n"
"Chun múnlú ionchuir a dhíchumasú, úsáid an cineál Díchumasaigh.\n"
"RRF: Tá luachanna X agus Y cothrom."

# AI Translated
msgid "Hz"
msgstr "Hz"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Resonant frequency for the Y axis input shaper.\n"
"Zero will use the firmware frequency.\n"
"To disable input shaping, use the Disable type."
msgstr ""
"Minicíocht athshondach do mhúnlóir ionchuir ais Y.\n"
"Úsáidfidh nialas minicíocht na ndochtearraí.\n"
"Chun múnlú ionchuir a dhíchumasú, úsáid an cineál Díchumasaigh."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Damping ratio for the X axis input shaper.\n"
"Zero will use the firmware damping ratio.\n"
"To disable input shaping, use the Disable type.\n"
"RRF: X and Y values are equal."
msgstr ""
"Cóimheas maolaithe do mhúnlóir ionchuir ais X.\n"
"Úsáidfidh nialas cóimheas maolaithe na ndochtearraí.\n"
"Chun múnlú ionchuir a dhíchumasú, úsáid an cineál Díchumasaigh.\n"
"RRF: Tá luachanna X agus Y cothrom."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Damping ratio for the Y axis input shaper.\n"
"Zero will use the firmware damping ratio.\n"
"To disable input shaping, use the Disable type."
msgstr ""
"Cóimheas maolaithe do mhúnlóir ionchuir ais Y.\n"
"Úsáidfidh nialas cóimheas maolaithe na ndochtearraí.\n"
"Chun múnlú ionchuir a dhíchumasú, úsáid an cineál Díchumasaigh."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The part cooling fan speed may be increased when auto cooling is enabled. "
"This is the maximum speed for the part cooling fan."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfaí luas an ghaothráin fuaraithe páirte a mhéadú nuair atá uathfhuarú "
"cumasaithe. Seo é an t-uasluas don ghaothrán fuaraithe páirte."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The highest printable layer height for the extruder. Used to limit the "
"maximum layer height when enable adaptive layer height."
msgstr ""
"An airde sraithe inphriontáilte is airde don easbhrúiteoir. Úsáidtear é chun "
"an uasairde sraithe a theorannú nuair atá airde sraithe oiriúnaitheach "
"cumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Extrusion rate smoothing"
msgstr "Mínú ráta easbhrúite"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This parameter smooths out sudden extrusion rate changes that happen when "
"the printer transitions from printing a high flow (high speed/larger width) "
"extrusion to a lower flow (lower speed/smaller width) extrusion and vice "
"versa.\n"
"\n"
"It defines the maximum rate by which the extruded volumetric flow in mm³/s "
"can change over time. Higher values mean higher extrusion rate changes are "
"allowed, resulting in faster speed transitions.\n"
"\n"
"A value of 0 disables the feature.\n"
"\n"
"For a high speed, high flow direct drive printer (like the Bambu lab or "
"Voron) this value is usually not needed. However it can provide some "
"marginal benefit in certain cases where feature speeds vary greatly. For "
"example, when there are aggressive slowdowns due to overhangs. In these "
"cases a high value of around 300-350 mm³/s² is recommended as this allows "
"for just enough smoothing to assist pressure advance achieve a smoother flow "
"transition.\n"
"\n"
"For slower printers without pressure advance, the value should be set much "
"lower. A value of 10-15 mm³/s² is a good starting point for direct drive "
"extruders and 5-10 mm³/s² for Bowden style.\n"
"\n"
"This feature is known as Pressure Equalizer in Prusa slicer.\n"
"\n"
"Note: this parameter disables arc fitting."
msgstr ""
"Míníonn an paraiméadar seo athruithe tobanna ar ráta easbhrúite a tharlaíonn "
"nuair a athraíonn an printéir ó easbhrú ard-sreafa (luas ard/leithead níos "
"mó) a phriontáil go heasbhrú íseal-sreafa (luas níos ísle/leithead níos lú) "
"agus a mhalairt.\n"
"\n"
"Sainmhíníonn sé an t-uasráta ag ar féidir leis an sreabhadh toirtmhéadrach "
"easbhrúite i mm³/s athrú le himeacht ama. Ciallaíonn luachanna níos airde go "
"gceadaítear athruithe níos mó ar ráta easbhrúite, rud a fhágann trasdulta "
"luais níos tapa.\n"
"\n"
"Díchumasaíonn luach 0 an ghné.\n"
"\n"
"I gcás printéir tiomána dírigh ardluais, ard-sreafa (mar Bambu lab nó Voron) "
"ní bhíonn gá leis an luach seo de ghnáth. Mar sin féin is féidir leis leas "
"imeallach a thabhairt i gcásanna áirithe ina n-athraíonn luasanna gnéithe go "
"mór. Mar shampla, nuair a bhíonn moilliú ionsaitheach ann mar gheall ar "
"starráin. Sna cásanna seo moltar luach ard thart ar 300-350 mm³/s² mar go "
"gceadaíonn sé seo díreach go leor mínithe chun cabhrú leis an réamhbhrú "
"trasdul sreafa níos míne a bhaint amach.\n"
"\n"
"I gcás printéirí níos moille gan réamhbhrú, ba cheart an luach a shocrú i "
"bhfad níos ísle. Is pointe tosaigh maith é luach 10-15 mm³/s² "
"d'easbhrúiteoirí tiomána dírigh agus 5-10 mm³/s² do stíl Bowden.\n"
"\n"
"Tugtar Pressure Equalizer ar an ngné seo i slisneoir Prusa.\n"
"\n"
"Nóta: díchumasaíonn an paraiméadar seo feistiú stuanna."

# AI Translated
msgid "mm³/s²"
msgstr "mm³/s²"

# AI Translated
msgid "Smoothing segment length"
msgstr "Fad míre mínithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"A lower value results in smoother extrusion rate transitions. However, this "
"results in a significantly larger G-code file and more instructions for the "
"printer to process.\n"
"\n"
"Default value of 3 works well for most cases. If your printer is stuttering, "
"increase this value to reduce the number of adjustments made.\n"
"\n"
"Allowed values: 0.5-5"
msgstr ""
"Mar thoradh ar luach níos ísle bíonn trasdulta ráta easbhrúite níos míne. "
"Mar sin féin, fágann sé seo comhad G-code i bhfad níos mó agus níos mó "
"treoracha le próiseáil ag an bprintéir.\n"
"\n"
"Oibríonn an luach réamhshocraithe 3 go maith i bhformhór na gcásanna. Má tá "
"do phrintéir ag stadaireacht, méadaigh an luach seo chun líon na "
"gcoigeartuithe a dhéantar a laghdú.\n"
"\n"
"Luachanna ceadaithe: 0.5-5"

# AI Translated
msgid "Apply only on external features"
msgstr "Cuir i bhfeidhm ar ghnéithe seachtracha amháin"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Applies extrusion rate smoothing only on external perimeters and overhangs. "
"This can help reduce artefacts due to sharp speed transitions on externally "
"visible overhangs without impacting the print speed of features that will "
"not be visible to the user."
msgstr ""
"Ní chuireann sé mínú ráta easbhrúite i bhfeidhm ach ar imlínte seachtracha "
"agus ar starráin. Is féidir leis seo cabhrú le déantáin a laghdú de bharr "
"trasdulta géara luais ar starráin atá infheicthe ón taobh amuigh gan dul i "
"bhfeidhm ar luas priontála gnéithe nach mbeidh le feiceáil ag an úsáideoir."

# AI Translated
msgid "Minimum speed for part cooling fan."
msgstr "Íosluas don ghaothrán fuaraithe páirte."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Speed of auxiliary part cooling fan. Auxiliary fan will run at this speed "
"during printing except the first several layers which is defined by no "
"cooling layers.\n"
"Please enable auxiliary_fan in printer settings to use this feature.\n"
"G-code command: M106 P2 S(0-255)"
msgstr ""
"Luas an ghaothráin chúnta fuaraithe páirte. Rithfidh an gaothrán cúnta ag an "
"luas seo le linn priontála seachas na chéad sraitheanna atá sainithe ag "
"sraitheanna gan fuarú.\n"
"Cumasaigh auxiliary_fan i socruithe an phrintéara chun an ghné seo a úsáid.\n"
"Ordú G-code: M106 P2 S(0-255)"

# AI Translated
msgid "For the first"
msgstr "Don chéad"

# AI Translated
msgid "Set special auxiliary cooling fan for the first certain layers."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh gaothrán fuaraithe cúnta speisialta do na chéad sraitheanna áirithe."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Auxiliary fan speed will be ramped up linearly from layer \"For the first\" "
"to maximum at layer \"Full fan speed at layer\".\n"
"\"Full fan speed at layer\" will be ignored if lower than \"For the first\", "
"in which case the fan will run at maximum allowed speed at layer \"For the "
"first\" + 1."
msgstr ""
"Ardófar luas an ghaothráin chúnta go líneach ó shraith \"Don chéad\" go dtí "
"an t-uasmhéid ag sraith \"Luas iomlán an ghaothráin ag sraith\".\n"
"Déanfar neamhaird de \"Luas iomlán an ghaothráin ag sraith\" má tá sé níos "
"ísle ná \"Don chéad\", agus sa chás sin rithfidh an gaothrán ag an uasluas "
"ceadaithe ag sraith \"Don chéad\" + 1."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Special auxiliary cooling fan speed, effective only for the first x layers."
msgstr ""
"Luas speisialta an ghaothráin chúnta fuaraithe, éifeachtach don chéad x "
"sraith amháin."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The lowest printable layer height for the extruder. Used to limit the "
"minimum layer height when enable adaptive layer height."
msgstr ""
"An airde sraithe inphriontáilte is ísle don easbhrúiteoir. Úsáidtear é chun "
"an íosairde sraithe a theorannú nuair atá airde sraithe oiriúnaitheach "
"cumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Min print speed"
msgstr "Íosluas priontála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The minimum print speed to which the printer slows down to maintain the "
"minimum layer time defined above when the slowdown for better layer cooling "
"is enabled."
msgstr ""
"An t-íosluas priontála a mhoillíonn an printéir go dtí é chun an t-íosam "
"sraithe atá sainithe thuas a choinneáil nuair atá moilliú le haghaidh fuarú "
"níos fearr sraithe cumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "The diameter of nozzle."
msgstr "Trastomhas an tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid "Configuration notes"
msgstr "Nótaí cumraíochta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"You can put here your personal notes. This text will be added to the G-code "
"header comments."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat do nótaí pearsanta a chur anseo. Cuirfear an téacs seo le "
"tráchtanna cheanntásc an G-code."

# AI Translated
msgid "Host Type"
msgstr "Cineál Óstaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Orca Slicer can upload G-code files to a printer host. This field must "
"contain the kind of the host."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le Orca Slicer comhaid G-code a uaslódáil chuig óstach printéara. "
"Caithfidh cineál an óstaigh a bheith sa réimse seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Nozzle volume"
msgstr "Toirt an tsoic"

# AI Translated
msgid "Volume of nozzle between the filament cutter and the end of the nozzle"
msgstr "Toirt an tsoic idir gearrthóir an fhiliméid agus deireadh an tsoic"

# AI Translated
msgid "Cooling tube position"
msgstr "Suíomh an fheadáin fhuaraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Distance of the center-point of the cooling tube from the extruder tip."
msgstr "Fad lárphointe an fheadáin fhuaraithe ó bharr an easbhrúiteora."

# AI Translated
msgid "Cooling tube length"
msgstr "Fad an fheadáin fhuaraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Length of the cooling tube to limit space for cooling moves inside it."
msgstr ""
"Fad an fheadáin fhuaraithe chun an spás do ghluaiseachtaí fuaraithe taobh "
"istigh de a theorannú."

# AI Translated
msgid "High extruder current on filament swap"
msgstr "Sruth ard easbhrúiteora le linn malartú filiméid"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"It may be beneficial to increase the extruder motor current during the "
"filament exchange sequence to allow for rapid ramming feed rates and to "
"overcome resistance when loading a filament with an ugly shaped tip."
msgstr ""
"D'fhéadfadh sé a bheith tairbheach sruth mhótar an easbhrúiteora a mhéadú le "
"linn sheicheamh mhalartú an fhiliméid chun rátaí beathaithe ramála tapa a "
"cheadú agus chun friotaíocht a shárú nuair a lódáiltear filiméad le barr "
"droch-chruthaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament parking position"
msgstr "Suíomh páirceála an fhiliméid"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Distance of the extruder tip from the position where the filament is parked "
"when unloaded. This should match the value in printer firmware."
msgstr ""
"Fad bharr an easbhrúiteora ón suíomh ina bpáirceáiltear an filiméad nuair a "
"dhíluchtaítear é. Ba cheart go mbeadh sé seo ag teacht leis an luach i "
"ndochtearraí an phrintéara."

# AI Translated
msgid "Extra loading distance"
msgstr "Fad lódála breise"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When set to zero, the distance the filament is moved from parking position "
"during load is exactly the same as it was moved back during unload. When "
"positive, it is loaded further, if negative, the loading move is shorter "
"than unloading."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a shocraítear go nialas é, is ionann an fad a bhogtar an filiméad ón "
"suíomh páirceála le linn lódála agus an fad a bogadh ar ais é le linn "
"díluchtaithe. Nuair atá sé dearfach, lódáiltear níos faide é; má tá sé "
"diúltach, bíonn an ghluaiseacht lódála níos giorra ná an díluchtú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Start end points"
msgstr "Pointí tosaigh agus deiridh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The start and end points which are from the cutter area to the excess chute."
msgstr ""
"Na pointí tosaigh agus deiridh ó limistéar an ghearrthóra go dtí an cainéal "
"barrachais."

# AI Translated
msgid "Reduce infill retraction"
msgstr "Laghdaigh aistarraingt sa líonadh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Don't retract when the travel is entirely within an infill area. That means "
"the oozing can't been seen. This can reduce times of retraction for complex "
"model and save printing time, but make slicing and G-code generating "
"slower.\n"
"\n"
"Note that Z-hop is also not performed in areas where retraction is skipped."
msgstr ""
"Ná haistarraing nuair atá an taisteal go hiomlán laistigh de limistéar "
"líonta. Ciallaíonn sé sin nach féidir an t-úscadh a fheiceáil. Is féidir "
"leis seo líon na n-aistarraingtí a laghdú do shamhail chasta agus am "
"priontála a shábháil, ach fágann sé an slisniú agus giniúint an G-code níos "
"moille.\n"
"\n"
"Tabhair faoi deara nach ndéantar ardú Z ach an oiread i limistéir ina "
"scipeáiltear aistarraingt."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This option will drop the temperature of the inactive extruders to prevent "
"oozing."
msgstr ""
"Ísleoidh an rogha seo teocht na n-easbhrúiteoirí neamhghníomhacha chun "
"úscadh a chosc."

# AI Translated
msgid "Filename format"
msgstr "Formáid ainm comhaid"

# AI Translated
msgid "Users can decide project file names when exporting."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le húsáideoirí ainmneacha comhad tionscadail a chinneadh le linn "
"easpórtála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Make overhangs printable"
msgstr "Déan starráin inphriontáilte"

# AI Translated
msgid "Modify the geometry to print overhangs without support material."
msgstr "Mionathraigh an chéimseata chun starráin a phriontáil gan ábhar taca."

# AI Translated
msgid "Make overhangs printable - Maximum angle"
msgstr "Déan starráin inphriontáilte - Uasuillinn"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Maximum angle of overhangs to allow after making more steep overhangs "
"printable.90° will not change the model at all and allow any overhang, while "
"0 will replace all overhangs with conical material."
msgstr ""
"Uasuillinn starrán le ceadú tar éis starráin níos géire a dhéanamh "
"inphriontáilte. Ní athróidh 90° an tsamhail ar chor ar bith agus ceadóidh sé "
"aon starrán, agus cuirfidh 0 ábhar cónúil in ionad gach starráin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Make overhangs printable - Hole area"
msgstr "Déan starráin inphriontáilte - Achar poill"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Maximum area of a hole in the base of the model before it's filled by "
"conical material. A value of 0 will fill all the holes in the model base."
msgstr ""
"Uasachar poill i mbonn na samhla sula líontar é le hábhar cónúil. Líonfaidh "
"luach 0 gach poll i mbonn na samhla."

# AI Translated
msgid "Detect overhang walls"
msgstr "Braith ballaí starráin"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"This detects the overhang percentage relative to line width and uses a "
"different speed to print. For 100% overhang, bridging speed is used."
msgstr ""
"Braitheann sé seo céatadán an starráin i gcoibhneas le leithead na líne agus "
"úsáideann sé luas difriúil le priontáil. I gcás starráin 100%, úsáidtear "
"luas an droichid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Print unsupported walls last"
msgstr "Priontáil ballaí gan taca ar deireadh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Wall loops that lie entirely in mid air are printed once something can hold "
"them:\n"
"they are extruded after the other walls of their island, innermost first, "
"whatever the wall order is.\n"
"A loop that only the bridges of this layer can anchor waits until those "
"bridges are printed, while a loop running alongside a supported wall keeps "
"its place before the infill, which needs it as an anchor."
msgstr ""
"Priontáiltear lúba balla atá go hiomlán san aer nuair is féidir le rud éigin "
"iad a choinneáil:\n"
"easbhrúitear iad tar éis bhallaí eile a n-oileáin, an ceann is faide istigh "
"ar dtús, cibé ord na mballaí.\n"
"Fanann lúb nach féidir ach le droichid na sraithe seo a ancaireú go dtí go "
"bpriontáiltear na droichid sin, agus coinníonn lúb a ritheann taobh le balla "
"tacaithe a háit roimh an líonadh, a dteastaíonn sí uaidh mar ancaire."

# AI Translated
msgid "Outer walls"
msgstr "Ballaí seachtracha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Filament to print outer walls.\n"
"\"Default\" uses the active object/part filament."
msgstr ""
"Filiméad chun ballaí seachtracha a phriontáil.\n"
"Úsáideann \"Réamhshocrú\" filiméad gníomhach an réada/na páirte."

# AI Translated
msgid "Inner walls"
msgstr "Ballaí inmheánacha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Filament to print inner walls.\n"
"\"Default\" uses the active object/part filament."
msgstr ""
"Filiméad chun ballaí inmheánacha a phriontáil.\n"
"Úsáideann \"Réamhshocrú\" filiméad gníomhach an réada/na páirte."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Line width of inner wall. If expressed as a %, it will be computed over the "
"nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"Leithead líne an bhalla inmheánaigh. Má léirítear é mar %, ríomhfar é i "
"gcoibhneas le trastomhas an tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the speed for inner walls."
msgstr "Seo é an luas do bhallaí inmheánacha."

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the number of walls per layer."
msgstr "Seo é líon na mballaí in aghaidh na sraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Alternate extra wall"
msgstr "Balla breise ailtéarnach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This setting adds an extra wall to every other layer. This way the infill "
"gets wedged vertically between the walls, resulting in stronger prints.\n"
"\n"
"When this option is enabled, the ensure vertical shell thickness option "
"needs to be disabled.\n"
"\n"
"Using lightning infill together with this option is not recommended as there "
"is limited infill to anchor the extra perimeters to."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann an socrú seo balla breise le gach dara sraith. Ar an mbealach seo "
"bíonn an líonadh dingthe go hingearach idir na ballaí, rud a fhágann "
"priontaí níos láidre.\n"
"\n"
"Nuair atá an rogha seo cumasaithe, ní mór an rogha 'cinntigh tiús na "
"blaoisce ingearaí' a dhíchumasú.\n"
"\n"
"Ní mholtar líonadh tintrí a úsáid in éineacht leis an rogha seo mar nach "
"bhfuil mórán líonta ann chun na himlínte breise a ancaireú dó."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If you want to process the output G-code through custom scripts, just list "
"their absolute paths here. Separate multiple scripts with a semicolon. "
"Scripts will be passed the absolute path to the G-code file as the first "
"argument, and they can access the Orca Slicer config settings by reading "
"environment variables."
msgstr ""
"Más mian leat an G-code aschuir a phróiseáil trí scripteanna saincheaptha, "
"liostaigh a gconairí iomlána anseo. Scar scripteanna iolracha le leathstad. "
"Tabharfar conair iomlán an chomhaid G-code do na scripteanna mar an chéad "
"argóint, agus is féidir leo rochtain a fháil ar shocruithe cumraíochta Orca "
"Slicer trí athróga timpeallachta a léamh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Change extrusion role G-code (process)"
msgstr "G-code athraithe róil easbhrúite (próiseas)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This G-code is inserted when the extrusion role is changed. It runs after "
"the machine and filament extrusion role G-code."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear an G-code seo isteach nuair a athraítear ról an easbhrúite. "
"Ritheann sé tar éis G-code ról easbhrúite an mheaisín agus an fhiliméid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Plugins Used"
msgstr "Breiseáin a Úsáidtear"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Plugin capabilities referenced by this preset, stored as "
"name;uuid;capability."
msgstr ""
"Cumais bhreiseáin a dtagraíonn an réamhshocrú seo dóibh, stóráilte mar "
"name;uuid;capability."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Python plugins invoked at each slicing pipeline step to read and modify "
"intermediate slicing data, including a final G-code post-processing step. "
"Research/experimental."
msgstr ""
"Breiseáin Python a ghlaoitear ag gach céim de phíblíne an tslisnithe chun "
"sonraí slisnithe idirmheánacha a léamh agus a mhionathrú, céim iarphróiseála "
"G-code deiridh san áireamh. Taighde/turgnamhach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Printer type"
msgstr "Cineál printéara"

# AI Translated
msgid "Type of the printer."
msgstr "Cineál an phrintéara."

# AI Translated
msgid "Printer notes"
msgstr "Nótaí an phrintéara"

# AI Translated
msgid "You can put your notes regarding the printer here."
msgstr "Is féidir leat do nótaí faoin bprintéir a chur anseo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Printer variant"
msgstr "Leagan an phrintéara"

# AI Translated
msgid "Raft contact Z distance"
msgstr "Fad Z teagmhála an rafta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Z gap between raft and object. If Support Top Z Distance is 0, this value is "
"ignored and the object is printed in direct contact with the raft (no gap)."
msgstr ""
"Bearna Z idir an rafta agus an réad. Má tá Fad Z Uachtair na dTacaí 0, "
"déantar neamhaird den luach seo agus priontáiltear an réad i dteagmháil "
"dhíreach leis an rafta (gan bhearna)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Raft expansion"
msgstr "Leathnú an rafta"

# AI Translated
msgid "This expands all raft layers in XY plane."
msgstr "Leathnaíonn sé seo gach sraith rafta sa phlána XY."

# AI Translated
msgid "First layer density"
msgstr "Dlús na chéad sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the density of the first raft or support layer."
msgstr "Seo é dlús na chéad sraithe rafta nó taca."

# AI Translated
msgid "First layer expansion"
msgstr "Leathnú na chéad sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "This expands the first raft or support layer to improve bed adhesion."
msgstr ""
"Leathnaíonn sé seo an chéad sraith rafta nó taca chun greamaitheacht leis an "
"leaba a fheabhsú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Raft layers"
msgstr "Sraitheanna rafta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Object will be raised by this number of support layers. Use this function to "
"avoid warping when printing ABS."
msgstr ""
"Ardófar an réad faoin líon seo sraitheanna taca. Úsáid an fheidhm seo chun "
"stangadh a sheachaint agus ABS á phriontáil."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The G-code path is generated after simplifying the contour of models to "
"avoid too many points and G-code lines. Smaller values mean higher "
"resolution and more time required to slice."
msgstr ""
"Gintear conair an G-code tar éis comhrian na samhlacha a shimpliú chun an "
"iomarca pointí agus línte G-code a sheachaint. Ciallaíonn luachanna níos lú "
"taifeach níos airde agus níos mó ama le slisniú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Travel distance threshold"
msgstr "Tairseach fhad an taistil"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Only trigger retraction when the travel distance is longer than this "
"threshold."
msgstr ""
"Ná spreag aistarraingt ach nuair atá fad an taistil níos faide ná an "
"tairseach seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Retract amount before wipe"
msgstr "Méid aistarraingthe roimh ghlanadh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the length of fast retraction before a wipe, relative to retraction "
"length."
msgstr ""
"Seo é fad na haistarraingthe tapa roimh ghlanadh, i gcoibhneas le fad na "
"haistarraingthe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Retract amount after wipe"
msgstr "Méid aistarraingthe tar éis glanta"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"This is the length of fast retraction after wipe, relative to retraction "
"length.\n"
"The value will be clamped by 100% minus the retract amount before the wipe "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Seo é fad na haistarraingthe tapa tar éis glanta, i gcoibhneas le fad na "
"haistarraingthe.\n"
"Teorannófar an luach ag 100% lúide luach an mhéid aistarraingthe roimh "
"ghlanadh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Retract on layer change"
msgstr "Aistarraing ag athrú sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "This forces a retraction on layer changes."
msgstr "Cuireann sé seo iallach aistarraingt a dhéanamh ag athruithe sraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Retraction Length"
msgstr "Fad Aistarraingthe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Some amount of material in extruder is pulled back to avoid ooze during long "
"travel. Set zero to disable retraction."
msgstr ""
"Tarraingítear méid áirithe ábhair san easbhrúiteoir siar chun úscadh a "
"sheachaint le linn taistil fhada. Socraigh go nialas chun aistarraingt a "
"dhíchumasú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Long retraction when cut (beta)"
msgstr "Aistarraingt fhada le linn gearrtha (béite)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Experimental feature: Retracting and cutting off the filament at a longer "
"distance during changes to minimize purge. While this reduces flush "
"significantly, it may also raise the risk of nozzle clogs or other printing "
"problems."
msgstr ""
"Gné thurgnamhach: An filiméad a aistarraingt agus a ghearradh ag fad níos "
"faide le linn athruithe chun an sruthlú a íoslaghdú. Cé go laghdaíonn sé seo "
"an sruthlú go suntasach, d'fhéadfadh sé an baol go gcalcfaidh an soc nó "
"fadhbanna priontála eile a mhéadú freisin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Retraction distance when cut"
msgstr "Fad aistarraingthe le linn gearrtha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Experimental feature: Retraction length before cutting off during filament "
"change."
msgstr ""
"Gné thurgnamhach: Fad aistarraingthe roimh ghearradh le linn athrú filiméid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Long retraction when extruder change"
msgstr "Aistarraingt fhada nuair a athraítear an t-easbhrúiteoir"

# AI Translated
msgid "Retraction distance when extruder change"
msgstr "Fad aistarraingthe nuair a athraítear an t-easbhrúiteoir"

# AI Translated
msgid "Retraction Length (Toolchange)"
msgstr "Fad Aistarraingthe (Athrú uirlise)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When retraction is triggered before changing tool, filament is pulled back "
"by the specified amount (the length is measured on raw filament, before it "
"enters the extruder)."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a spreagtar aistarraingt roimh uirlis a athrú, tarraingítear an "
"filiméad siar faoin méid sonraithe (tomhaistear an fad ar fhiliméad amh, "
"sula dtéann sé isteach san easbhrúiteoir)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Z-hop height"
msgstr "Airde ardaithe Z"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Whenever there is a retraction, the nozzle is lifted a little to create "
"clearance between the nozzle and the print. This prevents the nozzle from "
"hitting the print when traveling more. Using spiral lines to lift Z can "
"prevent stringing."
msgstr ""
"Aon uair a bhíonn aistarraingt ann, ardaítear an soc beagán chun imréiteach "
"a chruthú idir an soc agus an phriontáil. Cuireann sé seo cosc ar an soc an "
"phriontáil a bhualadh nuair a bhíonn sé ag taisteal tuilleadh. Is féidir le "
"línte bíseacha a úsáid chun Z a ardú cosc a chur ar shreangú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Z-hop lower boundary"
msgstr "Teorainn íochtair an ardaithe Z"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Z-hop will only come into effect when Z is above this value and is below the "
"parameter: \"Z-hop upper boundary\"."
msgstr ""
"Ní bheidh éifeacht ag ardú Z ach nuair atá Z os cionn an luacha seo agus "
"faoi bhun an pharaiméadair: \"Teorainn uachtair an ardaithe Z\"."

# AI Translated
msgid "Z-hop upper boundary"
msgstr "Teorainn uachtair an ardaithe Z"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If this value is positive, Z-hop will only come into effect when Z is above "
"the parameter: \"Z-hop lower boundary\" and is below this value."
msgstr ""
"Má tá an luach seo dearfach, ní bheidh éifeacht ag ardú Z ach nuair atá Z os "
"cionn an pharaiméadair: \"Teorainn íochtair an ardaithe Z\" agus faoi bhun "
"an luacha seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Z-hop type"
msgstr "Cineál ardaithe Z"

# AI Translated
msgid "Type of Z-hop."
msgstr "Cineál an ardaithe Z."

# AI Translated
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Gnáth"

# AI Translated
msgid "Slope"
msgstr "Fána"

# AI Translated
msgid "Spiral"
msgstr "Bíseach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Traveling angle"
msgstr "Uillinn taistil"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Traveling angle for Slope and Spiral Z-hop type. Setting it to 90° results "
"in Normal Lift."
msgstr ""
"Uillinn taistil do chineálacha ardaithe Z Fána agus Bíseach. Má shocraítear "
"go 90° é, gheofar Gnáthardú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Only lift Z above"
msgstr "Ná hardaigh Z ach os cionn"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If you set this to a positive value, Z lift will only take place above the "
"specified absolute Z."
msgstr ""
"Má shocraíonn tú é seo go luach dearfach, ní tharlóidh ardú Z ach os cionn "
"an Z iomláin shonraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Only lift Z below"
msgstr "Ná hardaigh Z ach faoi bhun"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If you set this to a positive value, Z lift will only take place below the "
"specified absolute Z."
msgstr ""
"Má shocraíonn tú é seo go luach dearfach, ní tharlóidh ardú Z ach faoi bhun "
"an Z iomláin shonraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "On surfaces"
msgstr "Ar dhromchlaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enforce Z-Hop behavior. This setting is impacted by the above settings (Only "
"lift Z above/below)."
msgstr ""
"Forfheidhmigh iompar an ardaithe Z. Téann na socruithe thuas i bhfeidhm ar "
"an socrú seo (Ná hardaigh Z ach os cionn/faoi bhun)."

# AI Translated
msgid "All Surfaces"
msgstr "Gach Dromchla"

# AI Translated
msgid "Top Only"
msgstr "Barr Amháin"

# AI Translated
msgid "Bottom Only"
msgstr "Bun Amháin"

# AI Translated
msgid "Top and Bottom"
msgstr "Barr agus Bun"

# AI Translated
msgid "Direct Drive"
msgstr "Tiomáint Dhíreach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Bowden"
msgstr "Bowden"

# AI Translated
msgid "Hybrid"
msgstr "Hibrideach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Extra High Flow"
msgstr "Ardsreabhadh Breise"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable filament dynamic map"
msgstr "Cumasaigh mapáil dhinimiciúil filiméid"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable dynamic filament mapping during print."
msgstr "Cumasaigh mapáil dhinimiciúil filiméid le linn priontála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Has filament switcher"
msgstr "Tá lasc filiméid ann"

# AI Translated
msgid "Printer has a filament switcher hardware (e.g., AMS)."
msgstr "Tá crua-earraí lasc filiméid ag an bprintéir (m.sh., AMS)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Extra length on restart"
msgstr "Fad breise ag atosú"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When the retraction is compensated after the travel move, the extruder will "
"push this additional amount of filament. This setting is rarely needed."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a chúitítear an aistarraingt tar éis na gluaiseachta taistil, brúfaidh "
"an t-easbhrúiteoir an méid breise filiméid seo. Is annamh a bhíonn gá leis "
"an socrú seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Extra length on restart (Toolchange)"
msgstr "Fad breise ag atosú (Athrú uirlise)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When the retraction is compensated after changing tool, the extruder will "
"push this additional amount of filament."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a chúitítear an aistarraingt tar éis uirlis a athrú, brúfaidh an "
"t-easbhrúiteoir an méid breise filiméid seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Retraction speed"
msgstr "Luas aistarraingthe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Speed for retracting filament from the nozzle."
msgstr "Luas chun filiméad a aistarraingt ón soc."

# AI Translated
msgid "Deretraction speed"
msgstr "Luas dí-aistarraingthe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Speed for reloading filament into the nozzle. Zero means same speed of "
"retraction."
msgstr ""
"Luas chun filiméad a athlódáil isteach sa soc. Ciallaíonn nialas an luas "
"céanna leis an aistarraingt."

# AI Translated
msgid "Deretraction speed (extruder change)"
msgstr "Luas dí-aistarraingthe (athrú easbhrúiteora)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Speed for reloading filament into the nozzle when switching extruder."
msgstr ""
"Luas chun filiméad a athlódáil isteach sa soc nuair a athraítear "
"easbhrúiteoir."

# AI Translated
msgid "Use firmware retraction"
msgstr "Úsáid aistarraingt dochtearraí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This experimental setting uses G10 and G11 commands to have the firmware "
"handle the retraction. This is only supported in recent Marlin."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann an socrú turgnamhach seo orduithe G10 agus G11 chun go "
"láimhseálfaidh na dochtearraí an aistarraingt. Ní thacaítear leis seo ach i "
"Marlin le déanaí."

# AI Translated
msgid "Show auto-calibration marks"
msgstr "Taispeáin marcanna uathchalabraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Disable set remaining print time"
msgstr "Díchumasaigh socrú an ama priontála atá fágtha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Disable generating of the M73: Set remaining print time in the final G-code."
msgstr ""
"Díchumasaigh giniúint M73: Socraigh an t-am priontála atá fágtha sa G-code "
"deiridh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Seam position"
msgstr "Suíomh na huama"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the starting position for each part of the outer wall."
msgstr "Seo é an suíomh tosaigh do gach cuid den bhalla seachtrach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Nearest"
msgstr "Is gaire"

# AI Translated
msgid "Aligned"
msgstr "Ailínithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Aligned back"
msgstr "Ailínithe ar gcúl"

# AI Translated
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Cúl"

# AI Translated
msgid "Random"
msgstr "Randamach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Staggered inner seams"
msgstr "Uamanna inmheánacha ar sceabha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This option causes the inner seams to be shifted backwards based on their "
"depth, forming a zigzag pattern."
msgstr ""
"Fágann an rogha seo go mbogtar na huamanna inmheánacha siar bunaithe ar a "
"ndoimhneacht, ag cruthú patrún sigsag."

# AI Translated
msgid "Seam gap"
msgstr "Bearna uama"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"In order to reduce the visibility of the seam in a closed loop extrusion, "
"the loop is interrupted and shortened by a specified amount.\n"
"This amount can be specified in millimeters or as a percentage of the nozzle "
"diameter. The default value for this parameter is 10%."
msgstr ""
"Chun infheictheacht na huama in easbhrú lúibe dúnta a laghdú, cuirtear "
"isteach ar an lúb agus giorraítear í faoi mhéid sonraithe.\n"
"Is féidir an méid seo a shonrú i milliméadair nó mar chéatadán de "
"thrastomhas an tsoic. Is é 10% an luach réamhshocraithe don pharaiméadar seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Scarf joint seam (beta)"
msgstr "Uaim scairfe (béite)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Use scarf joint to minimize seam visibility and increase seam strength."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid alt scairfe chun infheictheacht na huama a íoslaghdú agus neart na "
"huama a mhéadú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Conditional scarf joint"
msgstr "Alt scairfe coinníollach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Apply scarf joints only to smooth perimeters where traditional seams do not "
"conceal the seams at sharp corners effectively."
msgstr ""
"Ná cuir ailt scairfe i bhfeidhm ach ar imlínte míne nach gceileann uamanna "
"traidisiúnta na huamanna ag coirnéil ghéara go héifeachtach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Conditional angle threshold"
msgstr "Tairseach uillinne choinníollach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This option sets the threshold angle for applying a conditional scarf joint "
"seam.\n"
"If the maximum angle within the perimeter loop exceeds this value "
"(indicating the absence of sharp corners), a scarf joint seam will be used. "
"The default value is 155°."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn an rogha seo an uillinn tairsí chun uaim alt scairfe choinníollach "
"a chur i bhfeidhm.\n"
"Má sháraíonn an uasuillinn laistigh de lúb na himlíne an luach seo (rud a "
"léiríonn nach bhfuil coirnéil ghéara ann), úsáidfear uaim alt scairfe. Is é "
"155° an luach réamhshocraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Conditional overhang threshold"
msgstr "Tairseach starráin choinníollach"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"This option determines the overhang threshold for the application of scarf "
"joint seams. If the unsupported portion of the perimeter is less than this "
"threshold, scarf joint seams will be applied. The default threshold is set "
"at 40% of the external wall's width. Due to performance considerations, the "
"degree of overhang is estimated."
msgstr ""
"Cinneann an rogha seo tairseach an starráin chun uamanna alt scairfe a chur "
"i bhfeidhm. Má tá an chuid gan taca den imlíne níos lú ná an tairseach seo, "
"cuirfear uamanna alt scairfe i bhfeidhm. Tá an tairseach réamhshocraithe "
"socraithe ag 40% de leithead an bhalla sheachtraigh. Ar chúiseanna "
"feidhmíochta, meastar céim an starráin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Scarf joint speed"
msgstr "Luas an ailt scairfe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This option sets the printing speed for scarf joints. It is recommended to "
"print scarf joints at a slow speed (less than 100 mm/s). It's also advisable "
"to enable 'Extrusion rate smoothing' if the set speed varies significantly "
"from the speed of the outer or inner walls.\n"
"\n"
"If the speed specified here is higher than the speed of the outer or inner "
"walls, the printer will default to the slower of the two speeds. When "
"specified as a percentage (e.g., 80%), the speed is calculated based on the "
"respective outer or inner wall speed. The default value is set to 100%."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn an rogha seo luas priontála na n-alt scairfe. Moltar ailt scairfe "
"a phriontáil ag luas mall (níos lú ná 100 mm/s). Moltar freisin 'Mínú ráta "
"easbhrúite' a chumasú má athraíonn an luas socraithe go suntasach ó luas na "
"mballaí seachtracha nó inmheánacha.\n"
"\n"
"Má tá an luas a shonraítear anseo níos airde ná luas na mballaí seachtracha "
"nó inmheánacha, úsáidfidh an printéir an ceann is moille den dá luas. Nuair "
"a shonraítear é mar chéatadán (m.sh., 80%), ríomhtar an luas bunaithe ar "
"luas an bhalla sheachtraigh nó inmheánaigh faoi seach. Tá an luach "
"réamhshocraithe socraithe go 100%."

# AI Translated
msgid "Scarf joint flow ratio"
msgstr "Cóimheas sreafa an ailt scairfe"

# AI Translated
msgid "This factor affects the amount of material for scarf joints."
msgstr "Téann an fachtóir seo i bhfeidhm ar mhéid an ábhair d'ailt scairfe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Scarf start height"
msgstr "Airde tosaigh na scairfe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Start height of the scarf.\n"
"This amount can be specified in millimeters or as a percentage of the "
"current layer height. The default value for this parameter is 0."
msgstr ""
"Airde tosaigh na scairfe.\n"
"Is féidir an méid seo a shonrú i milliméadair nó mar chéatadán d'airde na "
"sraithe reatha. Is é 0 an luach réamhshocraithe don pharaiméadar seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Scarf around entire wall"
msgstr "Scairf timpeall an bhalla ar fad"

# AI Translated
msgid "The scarf extends to the entire length of the wall."
msgstr "Síneann an scairf thar fhad iomlán an bhalla."

# AI Translated
msgid "Scarf length"
msgstr "Fad na scairfe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Length of the scarf. Setting this parameter to zero effectively disables the "
"scarf."
msgstr ""
"Fad na scairfe. Má shocraítear an paraiméadar seo go nialas, díchumasaítear "
"an scairf go héifeachtach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Scarf steps"
msgstr "Céimeanna na scairfe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Minimum number of segments of each scarf."
msgstr "Íoslíon na míreanna i ngach scairf."

# AI Translated
msgid "Scarf joint for inner walls"
msgstr "Alt scairfe do bhallaí inmheánacha"

# AI Translated
msgid "Use scarf joint for inner walls as well."
msgstr "Úsáid alt scairfe do bhallaí inmheánacha freisin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Role based wipe speed"
msgstr "Luas glanta bunaithe ar ról"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The wipe speed is determined by the speed of the current extrusion role. "
"e.g. if a wipe action is executed immediately following an outer wall "
"extrusion, the speed of the outer wall extrusion will be utilized for the "
"wipe action."
msgstr ""
"Cinntear an luas glanta de réir luas an róil easbhrúite reatha. m.sh. má "
"dhéantar gníomh glanta díreach tar éis easbhrú balla sheachtraigh, úsáidfear "
"luas easbhrú an bhalla sheachtraigh don ghníomh glanta."

# AI Translated
msgid "Wipe on loops"
msgstr "Glan ar lúba"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"To minimize the visibility of the seam in a closed loop extrusion, a small "
"inward movement is executed before the extruder leaves the loop."
msgstr ""
"Chun infheictheacht na huama in easbhrú lúibe dúnta a íoslaghdú, déantar "
"gluaiseacht bheag isteach sula bhfágann an t-easbhrúiteoir an lúb."

# AI Translated
msgid "Wipe inward"
msgstr "Glan isteach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Applies only to external walls, including hole boundaries. Moves the hot "
"nozzle toward the inner walls during wiping to reduce reheating of freshly "
"printed plastic and seam marks.\n"
"\n"
"Especially useful at layer heights below 0.1 mm, where wipe marks are more "
"visible.\n"
"\n"
"Uses the regular wipe where the outer wall has no adjacent inner wall, such "
"as in single-wall areas, or if no supported inward path can be found, for "
"example at tight corners or seam gaps."
msgstr ""
"Ní bhaineann sé ach le ballaí seachtracha, teorainneacha poll san áireamh. "
"Bogann sé an soc te i dtreo na mballaí inmheánacha le linn glanta chun "
"aththéamh plaisteach nuaphriontáilte agus marcanna uama a laghdú.\n"
"\n"
"Úsáideach go háirithe ag airdí sraithe faoi bhun 0.1 mm, áit a bhfuil "
"marcanna glanta níos infheicthe.\n"
"\n"
"Úsáideann sé an gnáthghlanadh san áit nach bhfuil aon bhalla inmheánach in "
"aice leis an mballa seachtrach, mar i limistéir aon bhalla, nó mura féidir "
"conair isteach thacaithe a aimsiú, mar shampla ag coirnéil dhiana nó ag "
"bearnaí uama."

# AI Translated
msgid "Wipe inward distance"
msgstr "Fad an ghlanta isteach"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"The distance the wipe path is shifted away from the external perimeter, "
"specified in millimeters or as a percentage of the actual outer-wall "
"extrusion width.\n"
"\n"
"For example, 50% shifts the path by half of the outer-wall width. The "
"effective offset is limited by both the actual outer-wall width and the "
"available spacing to the adjacent wall, so values above 100% or an "
"equivalent absolute distance have no additional effect. Set to 0 to disable "
"the offset.\n"
"\n"
"With Outer/Inner or Inner/Outer/Inner wall order, the offset is limited to "
"50% of the actual outer-wall width because the adjacent inner wall is "
"printed after the outer wall. This also applies to equivalent distances "
"specified in millimeters."
msgstr ""
"An fad a bhogtar conair an ghlanta ón imlíne sheachtrach, sonraithe i "
"milliméadair nó mar chéatadán de leithead easbhrúite iarbhír an bhalla "
"sheachtraigh.\n"
"\n"
"Mar shampla, bogann 50% an chonair leath de leithead an bhalla sheachtraigh. "
"Teorannaítear an fritháireamh éifeachtach ag leithead iarbhír an bhalla "
"sheachtraigh agus ag an spásáil atá ar fáil go dtí an balla cóngarach, mar "
"sin ní bhíonn aon éifeacht bhreise ag luachanna os cionn 100% ná ag fad "
"iomlán coibhéiseach. Socraigh go 0 chun an fritháireamh a dhíchumasú.\n"
"\n"
"Le hord balla Seachtrach/Inmheánach nó Inmheánach/Seachtrach/Inmheánach, "
"teorannaítear an fritháireamh go 50% de leithead iarbhír an bhalla "
"sheachtraigh mar go bpriontáiltear an balla inmheánach cóngarach tar éis an "
"bhalla sheachtraigh. Baineann sé seo freisin le faid choibhéiseacha a "
"shonraítear i milliméadair."

# AI Translated
msgid "Wipe before external loop"
msgstr "Glan roimh lúb sheachtrach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"To minimize visibility of potential overextrusion at the start of an "
"external perimeter when printing with Outer/Inner or Inner/Outer/Inner wall "
"print order, the de-retraction is performed slightly on the inside from the "
"start of the external perimeter. That way any potential over extrusion is "
"hidden from the outside surface.\n"
"\n"
"This is useful when printing with Outer/Inner or Inner/Outer/Inner wall "
"print order as in these modes it is more likely an external perimeter is "
"printed immediately after a de-retraction move."
msgstr ""
"Chun infheictheacht ró-easbhrú féideartha ag tús imlíne sheachtraigh a "
"íoslaghdú agus priontáil le hord priontála balla Seachtrach/Inmheánach nó "
"Inmheánach/Seachtrach/Inmheánach, déantar an dí-aistarraingt beagán ar an "
"taobh istigh ó thús na himlíne seachtraí. Ar an mbealach sin, ceiltear aon "
"ró-easbhrú féideartha ón dromchla seachtrach.\n"
"\n"
"Tá sé seo úsáideach agus priontáil le hord priontála balla "
"Seachtrach/Inmheánach nó Inmheánach/Seachtrach/Inmheánach mar sna móid seo "
"is dóichí go bpriontáiltear imlíne sheachtrach díreach tar éis gluaiseacht "
"dí-aistarraingthe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Wipe speed"
msgstr "Luas glanta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The wipe speed is determined by the speed setting specified in this "
"configuration. If the value is expressed as a percentage (e.g. 80%), it will "
"be calculated based on the travel speed setting above. The default value for "
"this parameter is 80%."
msgstr ""
"Cinntear an luas glanta de réir an tsocraithe luais a shonraítear sa "
"chumraíocht seo. Má léirítear an luach mar chéatadán (m.sh. 80%), ríomhfar é "
"bunaithe ar shocrú luas an taistil thuas. Is é 80% an luach réamhshocraithe "
"don pharaiméadar seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Skirt distance"
msgstr "Fad an sciorta"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the distance from the skirt to the brim or the object."
msgstr "Seo é an fad ón sciorta go dtí an t-imeall nó an réad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Skirt start point"
msgstr "Pointe tosaigh an sciorta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Angle from the object center to skirt start point. Zero is the most right "
"position, counter clockwise is positive angle."
msgstr ""
"Uillinn ó lár an réada go dtí pointe tosaigh an sciorta. Is é nialas an "
"suíomh is faide ar dheis, is uillinn dhearfach é tuathal."

# AI Translated
msgid "Skirt height"
msgstr "Airde an sciorta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Number of skirt layers: usually only one"
msgstr "Líon na sraitheanna sciorta: ceann amháin de ghnáth"

# AI Translated
msgid "Single loop after first layer"
msgstr "Lúb aonair tar éis na chéad sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Limits the skirt/draft shield loops to one wall after the first layer. This "
"is useful, on occasion, to conserve filament but may cause the draft "
"shield/skirt to warp / crack."
msgstr ""
"Teorannaíonn sé lúba an sciorta/na scéithe dréachta go balla amháin tar éis "
"na chéad sraithe. Tá sé seo úsáideach, uaireanta, chun filiméad a chaomhnú "
"ach d'fhéadfadh sé an sciath dréachta/an sciorta a stangadh / a scoilteadh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Draft shield"
msgstr "Sciath dréachta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"A draft shield is useful to protect an ABS or ASA print from warping and "
"detaching from print bed due to wind draft. It is usually needed only with "
"open frame printers, i.e. without an enclosure.\n"
"\n"
"Enabled = skirt is as tall as the highest printed object. Otherwise 'Skirt "
"height' is used."
msgstr ""
"Tá sciath dréachta úsáideach chun priontáil ABS nó ASA a chosaint ar "
"stangadh agus ar scaradh ó leaba an phrintéara de bharr séideán gaoithe. De "
"ghnáth ní bhíonn sé de dhíth ach le printéirí fráma oscailte, i.e. gan "
"imfhálú.\n"
"\n"
"Cumasaithe = tá an sciorta chomh hard leis an réad priontáilte is airde. "
"Seachas sin úsáidtear 'Airde an sciorta'."

# AI Translated
msgid "Skirt type"
msgstr "Cineál sciorta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Combined - single skirt for all objects, Per object - individual object "
"skirt."
msgstr ""
"Comhcheangailte - sciorta aonair do gach réad, In aghaidh an réada - sciorta "
"aonair do gach réad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Per object"
msgstr "In aghaidh an réada"

# AI Translated
msgid "Skirt loops"
msgstr "Lúba sciorta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the number of loops for the skirt. 0 means the skirt is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Seo é líon na lúb don sciorta. Ciallaíonn 0 go bhfuil an sciorta "
"díchumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Skirt speed"
msgstr "Luas an sciorta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Speed of skirt, in mm/s. Zero means use default layer extrusion speed."
msgstr ""
"Luas an sciorta, i mm/s. Ciallaíonn nialas luas easbhrúite réamhshocraithe "
"na sraithe a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Skirt minimum extrusion length"
msgstr "Íosfhad easbhrúite an sciorta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Minimum filament extrusion length in mm when printing the skirt. Zero means "
"this feature is disabled.\n"
"\n"
"Using a non-zero value is useful if the printer is set up to print without a "
"prime line.\n"
"Final number of loops is not taking into account while arranging or "
"validating objects distance. Increase loop number in such case."
msgstr ""
"Íosfhad easbhrúite filiméid i mm agus an sciorta á phriontáil. Ciallaíonn "
"nialas go bhfuil an ghné seo díchumasaithe.\n"
"\n"
"Tá luach neamhnialasach úsáideach má tá an printéir socraithe le priontáil "
"gan líne phríomhála.\n"
"Ní chuirtear an líon deiridh lúb san áireamh agus fad na réad á shocrú nó á "
"bhailíochtú. Méadaigh líon na lúb sa chás sin."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The printing speed in exported G-code will be slowed down when the estimated "
"layer time is shorter than this value in order to get better cooling for "
"these layers."
msgstr ""
"Moilleofar luas na priontála sa G-code easpórtáilte nuair a bhíonn am measta "
"na sraithe níos giorra ná an luach seo chun fuarú níos fearr a fháil do na "
"sraitheanna seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Minimum sparse infill threshold"
msgstr "Tairseach íosta an líonta thanaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Sparse infill areas which are smaller than this threshold value are replaced "
"by internal solid infill."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear líonadh soladach inmheánach in ionad limistéar líonta thanaí atá "
"níos lú ná an luach tairsí seo."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Filament to print internal solid infill.\n"
"\"Default\" uses the active object/part filament."
msgstr ""
"Filiméad chun an líonadh soladach inmheánach a phriontáil.\n"
"Úsáideann \"Réamhshocrú\" filiméad gníomhach an réada/na páirte."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Filament to print top surface.\n"
"\"Default\" uses the active object/part filament."
msgstr ""
"Filiméad chun an dromchla uachtair a phriontáil.\n"
"Úsáideann \"Réamhshocrú\" filiméad gníomhach an réada/na páirte."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Filament to print bottom surface.\n"
"\"Default\" uses the active object/part filament."
msgstr ""
"Filiméad chun an dromchla íochtair a phriontáil.\n"
"Úsáideann \"Réamhshocrú\" filiméad gníomhach an réada/na páirte."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Line width of internal solid infill. If expressed as a %, it will be "
"computed over the nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"Leithead líne an líonta sholadaigh inmheánaigh. Má léirítear é mar %, "
"ríomhfar é i gcoibhneas le trastomhas an tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the speed for internal solid infill, not including the top or bottom "
"surface."
msgstr ""
"Seo é an luas don líonadh soladach inmheánach, gan an dromchla uachtair ná "
"íochtair san áireamh."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This enables spiraling, which smooths out the Z moves of the outer contour "
"and turns a solid model into a single walled print with solid bottom layers. "
"The final generated model has no seam."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaíonn sé seo bísiú, a mhíníonn gluaiseachtaí Z an chomhrian "
"sheachtraigh agus a dhéanann priontáil balla aonair le sraitheanna íochtair "
"soladacha de shamhail sholadach. Níl aon uaim ag an tsamhail ghinte deiridh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Smooth Spiral"
msgstr "Bís Mhín"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Smooth Spiral smooths out X and Y moves as well, resulting in no visible "
"seam at all, even in the XY directions on walls that are not vertical."
msgstr ""
"Míníonn Bís Mhín gluaiseachtaí X agus Y freisin, rud a fhágann nach mbíonn "
"aon uaim infheicthe ar chor ar bith, fiú sna treonna XY ar bhallaí nach "
"bhfuil ingearach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Max XY Smoothing"
msgstr "Uasmhínú XY"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"Maximum distance to move points in XY to try to achieve a smooth spiral. If "
"expressed as a %, it will be computed over nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"An t-uasfhad chun pointí a bhogadh in XY chun iarracht a dhéanamh bís mhín a "
"bhaint amach. Má léirítear é mar %, ríomhfar é i gcoibhneas le trastomhas an "
"tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid "Spiral starting flow ratio"
msgstr "Cóimheas sreafa tosaigh na bíse"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"Sets the starting flow ratio while transitioning from the last bottom layer "
"to the spiral. Normally the spiral transition scales the flow ratio from 0% "
"to 100% during the first loop which can in some cases lead to under "
"extrusion at the start of the spiral."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn sé an cóimheas sreafa tosaigh le linn an trasdula ón tsraith "
"íochtair dheireanach go dtí an bhís. De ghnáth scálaíonn trasdul na bíse an "
"cóimheas sreafa ó 0% go 100% le linn na chéad lúibe, rud a d'fhéadfadh "
"tearc-easbhrú ag tús na bíse a chruthú i gcásanna áirithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Spiral finishing flow ratio"
msgstr "Cóimheas sreafa deiridh na bíse"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"Sets the finishing flow ratio while ending the spiral. Normally the spiral "
"transition scales the flow ratio from 100% to 0% during the last loop which "
"can in some cases lead to under extrusion at the end of the spiral."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn sé an cóimheas sreafa deiridh agus an bhís á críochnú. De ghnáth "
"scálaíonn trasdul na bíse an cóimheas sreafa ó 100% go 0% le linn na lúibe "
"deireanaí, rud a d'fhéadfadh tearc-easbhrú ag deireadh na bíse a chruthú i "
"gcásanna áirithe."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If smooth or traditional mode is selected, a timelapse video will be "
"generated for each print. After each layer is printed, a snapshot is taken "
"with the chamber camera. All of these snapshots are composed into a "
"timelapse video when printing completes.\n"
"\n"
"If smooth mode is selected, the toolhead will move to the excess chute after "
"each layer is printed and then take a snapshot. Since the melt filament may "
"leak from the nozzle during the process of taking a snapshot, a prime tower "
"is required for smooth mode to wipe the nozzle."
msgstr ""
"Má roghnaítear mód mín nó traidisiúnta, ginfear físeán am-mhoille do gach "
"priontáil. Tar éis gach sraith a phriontáil, glactar grianghraf le ceamara "
"an tseomra. Cuirtear na grianghraif seo go léir le chéile ina bhfíseán "
"am-mhoille nuair a chríochnaíonn an phriontáil.\n"
"\n"
"Má roghnaítear mód mín, bogfaidh an ceann uirlise go dtí an cainéal "
"barrachais tar éis gach sraith a phriontáil agus glacfaidh sé grianghraf "
"ansin. Ós rud é go bhféadfadh an filiméad leáite sceitheadh ón soc le linn "
"an phróisis grianghraf a ghlacadh, teastaíonn túr príomhála do mhód mín chun "
"an soc a ghlanadh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Traditional"
msgstr "Traidisiúnta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Smooth"
msgstr "Mín"

# AI Translated
msgid "Farthest point timelapse"
msgstr "Am-mhoill ag an bpointe is faide"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When enabled, the timelapse snapshot is taken at the farthest point from "
"camera instead of traveling to the wipe tower or excess chute. Only "
"effective in traditional timelapse mode on non-I3 printers."
msgstr ""
"Nuair atá sé cumasaithe, glactar grianghraf na am-mhoille ag an bpointe is "
"faide ón gceamara in ionad taisteal go dtí an túr glanta nó go dtí an "
"cainéal barrachais. Níl éifeacht leis ach i mód am-mhoille traidisiúnta ar "
"phrintéirí nach I3 iad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Temperature variation"
msgstr "Athrú teochta"

# AI Translated
#. TRN PrintSettings : "Ooze prevention" > "Temperature variation"
msgid ""
"Temperature difference to be applied when an extruder is not active. The "
"value is not used when 'idle_temperature' in filament settings is set to "
"non-zero value."
msgstr ""
"Difríocht teochta le cur i bhfeidhm nuair nach bhfuil easbhrúiteoir "
"gníomhach. Ní úsáidtear an luach nuair atá 'idle_temperature' i socruithe an "
"fhiliméid socraithe go luach neamhnialasach."

# AI Translated
msgid "∆℃"
msgstr "∆℃"

# AI Translated
msgid "Preheat time"
msgstr "Am réamhthéimh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"To reduce the waiting time after tool change, Orca can preheat the next tool "
"while the current tool is still in use. This setting specifies the time in "
"seconds to preheat the next tool. Orca will insert a M104 command to preheat "
"the tool in advance."
msgstr ""
"Chun an t-am feithimh tar éis athrú uirlise a laghdú, is féidir le Orca an "
"chéad uirlis eile a réamhthéamh fad atá an uirlis reatha fós in úsáid. "
"Sonraíonn an socrú seo an t-am i soicindí chun an chéad uirlis eile a "
"réamhthéamh. Cuirfidh Orca ordú M104 isteach chun an uirlis a réamhthéamh "
"roimh ré."

# AI Translated
msgid "Preheat steps"
msgstr "Céimeanna réamhthéimh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Insert multiple preheat commands (e.g. M104.1). Only useful for Prusa XL. "
"For other printers, please set it to 1."
msgstr ""
"Cuir orduithe réamhthéimh iolracha isteach (m.sh. M104.1). Úsáideach do "
"Prusa XL amháin. Do phrintéirí eile, socraigh go 1 é."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"G-code written at the very top of the output file, before any other content. "
"Useful for adding metadata that printer firmware reads from the first lines "
"of the file (e.g. estimated print time, filament usage). Supports "
"placeholders like {print_time_total_sec}, {print_time_day}, "
"{print_time_hour}, {print_time_minute}, {print_time_sec} and "
"{used_filament_length}."
msgstr ""
"G-code a scríobhtar ag barr an chomhaid aschuir, roimh aon ábhar eile. "
"Úsáideach chun meiteashonraí a chur leis a léann dochtearraí an phrintéara ó "
"chéad línte an chomhaid (m.sh. am priontála measta, úsáid filiméid). "
"Tacaíonn sé le háitchoimeádaithe mar {print_time_total_sec}, "
"{print_time_day}, {print_time_hour}, {print_time_minute}, {print_time_sec} "
"agus {used_filament_length}."

# AI Translated
msgid "Start G-code"
msgstr "G-code tosaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "G-code added when starting a print."
msgstr "G-code a chuirtear leis nuair a thosaítear priontáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "G-code added when the printer starts using this filament"
msgstr ""
"G-code a chuirtear leis nuair a thosaíonn an printéir ag úsáid an fhiliméid "
"seo"

# AI Translated
msgid "Single Extruder Multi Material"
msgstr "Ilábhar Aon Easbhrúiteora"

# AI Translated
msgid "Use single nozzle to print multi filament."
msgstr "Úsáid soc aonair chun filiméid iolracha a phriontáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "IDEX/IQEX Printer"
msgstr "Printéir IDEX/IQEX"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable parallel printing for printers with multiple independent carriages "
"(IDEX, IQEX, and similar)."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh priontáil chomhthreomhar do phrintéirí le carráistí neamhspleácha "
"iolracha (IDEX, IQEX, agus a leithéid)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Firmware-managed zones"
msgstr "Criosanna arna mbainistiú ag na dochtearraí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When enabled, the slicer emits G-code with the primary zone's contents "
"centered on bed origin (0,0). The printer firmware is responsible for "
"placing copies/mirrors at each physical zone position. Enable only on "
"printers whose firmware applies its own zone offsets in copy/mirror mode "
"(e.g. RepRapFirmware IDEX duplication mode). Has no effect in Primary mode."
msgstr ""
"Nuair atá sé cumasaithe, eisíonn an slisneoir G-code le hábhar an "
"phríomhchreasa láraithe ar bhunphointe na leapa (0,0). Is iad dochtearraí an "
"phrintéara atá freagrach as cóipeanna/scátháin a chur ag gach suíomh creasa "
"fisiceach. Ná cumasaigh é ach ar phrintéirí a gcuireann a ndochtearraí a "
"bhfritháirimh chreasa féin i bhfeidhm i mód cóipe/scátháin (m.sh. mód "
"dúblaithe IDEX RepRapFirmware). Gan éifeacht i mód Príomha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Gantry Count"
msgstr "Líon na nGantraí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Number of independent Y-axis gantries. 1 for IDEX/single-rail IQEX. 2 for "
"dual-gantry systems (divides bed into rows)."
msgstr ""
"Líon na ngantraí neamhspleácha ais Y. 1 do IDEX/IQEX aon ráille. 2 do "
"chórais dhéghantra (roinneann sé an leaba ina sraitheanna)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Tools per Gantry"
msgstr "Uirlisí in aghaidh an Ghantra"

# AI Translated
msgid "Number of independent toolheads per gantry along X. 2 for IDEX-style."
msgstr ""
"Líon na gceann uirlise neamhspleách in aghaidh an ghantra feadh X. 2 do stíl "
"IDEX."

# AI Translated
msgid "Tool 0 Position"
msgstr "Suíomh Uirlis 0"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Physical position on the bed where tool T0 (index 0) is located. Determines "
"how tool indices map to bed zones. For single-gantry setups (IDEX) only "
"left/right matters; for dual-gantry setups (IQEX) all four corners are "
"selectable (front = lower Y / near the operator, rear = higher Y / back of "
"machine)."
msgstr ""
"Suíomh fisiceach ar an leaba ina bhfuil uirlis T0 (innéacs 0). Cinneann sé "
"conas a mhapálann innéacsanna uirlise go criosanna leapa. Do shocruithe aon "
"ghantra (IDEX) ní bhaineann ach clé/deas leis; do shocruithe déghantra "
"(IQEX) is féidir na ceithre chúinne go léir a roghnú (tosach = Y níos ísle / "
"in aice leis an oibreoir, cúl = Y níos airde / cúl an mheaisín)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Nozzle Clearance X"
msgstr "Imréiteach Soic X"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Distance (mm) from the nozzle to the collision-side carriage edge in X. Used "
"to calculate the width of the collision exclusion strip at each X boundary."
msgstr ""
"Fad (mm) ón soc go dtí imeall an charráiste ar thaobh an imbhuailte in X. "
"Úsáidtear é chun leithead stiall eisiaimh an imbhuailte ag gach teorainn X a "
"ríomh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Nozzle Clearance Y"
msgstr "Imréiteach Soic Y"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Distance (mm) from the nozzle to the collision-side carriage edge in Y. Used "
"to calculate the width of the collision exclusion strip at each Y boundary."
msgstr ""
"Fad (mm) ón soc go dtí imeall an charráiste ar thaobh an imbhuailte in Y. "
"Úsáidtear é chun leithead stiall eisiaimh an imbhuailte ag gach teorainn Y a "
"ríomh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Safety Margin"
msgstr "Corrlach Sábháilteachta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Non-blocking advisory clearance strip (mm) drawn inside the primary zone at "
"each carriage boundary. Parts placed within this strip will still slice; it "
"is a visual reminder to leave extra clearance near the zone edge."
msgstr ""
"Stiall imréitigh chomhairleach neamhbhacach (mm) a tharraingítear laistigh "
"den phríomhchrios ag gach teorainn charráiste. Slisneofar páirteanna a "
"chuirtear laistigh den stiall seo fós; is meabhrúchán amhairc é chun "
"imréiteach breise a fhágáil in aice le himeall an chreasa."

# AI Translated
msgid "Visualization Theme"
msgstr "Téama Léirshamhlaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Color theme for IDEX/IQEX bed zone visualization. Choose a "
"colorblind-friendly theme if needed."
msgstr ""
"Téama datha do léirshamhlú chriosanna leapa IDEX/IQEX. Roghnaigh téama atá "
"oiriúnach do dhaill dathanna más gá."

# AI Translated
msgid "Deuteranopia / Protanopia (red-green)"
msgstr "Deotranóipe / Prótanóipe (dearg-glas)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Tritanopia (blue-yellow)"
msgstr "Tritanóipe (gorm-buí)"

# AI Translated
msgid "High Contrast"
msgstr "Ardchodarsnacht"

# AI Translated
msgid "IDEX/IQEX Print Mode"
msgstr "Mód Priontála IDEX/IQEX"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Name of the active IDEX/IQEX parallel print mode, or \"primary\" for "
"single-carriage printing. Requires IDEX/IQEX Printer enabled in the Printer "
"preset (Printer → Multimaterial → IDEX/IQEX Configuration)."
msgstr ""
"Ainm an mhóid phriontála chomhthreomhair IDEX/IQEX ghníomhaigh, nó "
"\"primary\" do phriontáil aon charráiste. Teastaíonn Printéir IDEX/IQEX "
"cumasaithe i réamhshocrú an Phrintéara (Printéir → Ilábhar → Cumraíocht "
"IDEX/IQEX)."

# AI Translated
msgid "IDEX/IQEX head filament map"
msgstr "Mapa filiméid cinn IDEX/IQEX"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Per-plate override mapping physical heads to filament slots (1-based). Empty "
"means each head uses the first filament that the printer's physical extruder "
"map routes to it."
msgstr ""
"Sárú in aghaidh an phláta a mhapálann cinn fhisiceacha go sliotáin fhiliméid "
"(1-bhunaithe). Ciallaíonn folamh go n-úsáideann gach ceann an chéad "
"fhiliméad a ródaíonn mapa easbhrúiteoirí fisiceacha an phrintéara chuige."

# AI Translated
msgid "IDEX/IQEX Mode Names"
msgstr "Ainmneacha Móid IDEX/IQEX"

# AI Translated
msgid "Display names for each user-defined IDEX/IQEX parallel print mode."
msgstr ""
"Ainmneacha taispeána do gach mód priontála comhthreomhar IDEX/IQEX a "
"shainmhínigh an t-úsáideoir."

# AI Translated
msgid "IDEX/IQEX Mode Active Tools"
msgstr "Uirlisí Gníomhacha Móid IDEX/IQEX"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Tool role assignments for each mode. Format: \"idx:P,idx:C,idx:M\" where "
"P=Primary, C=Copy, M=Mirror (e.g. \"0:P,1:C,2:M,3:M\"). Managed by the "
"IDEX/IQEX Modes editor in the Printer preset."
msgstr ""
"Sannadh ról uirlise do gach mód. Formáid: \"idx:P,idx:C,idx:M\" ina bhfuil "
"P=Príomha, C=Cóip, M=Scáthán (m.sh. \"0:P,1:C,2:M,3:M\"). Bainistithe ag "
"eagarthóir Móid IDEX/IQEX i réamhshocrú an Phrintéara."

# AI Translated
msgid "IDEX/IQEX Mode G-codes"
msgstr "G-codes Móid IDEX/IQEX"

# AI Translated
msgid "G-code or macro call to inject at print start for each mode."
msgstr "G-code nó glao macra le hinstealladh ag tús na priontála do gach mód."

# AI Translated
msgid "Manual Filament Change"
msgstr "Athrú Filiméid de Láimh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable this option to omit the custom Change filament G-code only at the "
"beginning of the print. The tool change command (e.g., T0) will be skipped "
"throughout the entire print. This is useful for manual multi-material "
"printing, where we use M600/PAUSE to trigger the manual filament change "
"action."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh an rogha seo chun an G-code saincheaptha Athrú filiméid a fhágáil "
"ar lár ag tús na priontála amháin. Scipeálfar an t-ordú athraithe uirlise "
"(m.sh., T0) ar feadh na priontála ar fad. Tá sé seo úsáideach do phriontáil "
"ilábhair láimhe, ina n-úsáidimid M600/PAUSE chun an gníomh athraithe "
"filiméid láimhe a spreagadh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Wipe tower type"
msgstr "Cineál an túir ghlanta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Choose the wipe tower implementation for multi-material prints. Type 1 is "
"recommended for Bambu and Qidi printers with a filament cutter. Type 2 "
"offers better compatibility with multi-tool and MMU printers and provide "
"overall better compatibility."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh cur i bhfeidhm an túir ghlanta do phriontaí ilábhair. Moltar "
"Cineál 1 do phrintéirí Bambu agus Qidi le gearrthóir filiméid. Tugann Cineál "
"2 comhoiriúnacht níos fearr le printéirí iluirlise agus MMU agus "
"comhoiriúnacht fhoriomlán níos fearr."

# AI Translated
msgid "Type 1"
msgstr "Cineál 1"

# AI Translated
msgid "Type 2"
msgstr "Cineál 2"

# AI Translated
msgid "Purge in prime tower"
msgstr "Sruthlaigh sa túr príomhála"

# AI Translated
msgid "Purge remaining filament into prime tower."
msgstr "Sruthlaigh an filiméad atá fágtha isteach sa túr príomhála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable filament ramming"
msgstr "Cumasaigh ramáil filiméid"

# AI Translated
msgid "Tool change on wipe tower"
msgstr "Athrú uirlise ar an túr glanta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Force the toolhead to travel to the wipe tower before issuing the tool "
"change command (Tx).\n"
"\n"
"Only relevant for multi-extruder (multi-toolhead) printers using a Type 2 "
"wipe tower. By default Orca skips the travel on multi-toolhead machines "
"because the firmware handles the head swap, which can result in the Tx "
"command being issued above the printed part. Enable this option if you want "
"the tool change to always be issued above the wipe tower instead."
msgstr ""
"Cuir iallach ar an gceann uirlise taisteal go dtí an túr glanta sula "
"n-eisítear an t-ordú athraithe uirlise (Tx).\n"
"\n"
"Ní bhaineann sé ach le printéirí ilsheasbhrúiteora (ilchinn uirlise) a "
"úsáideann túr glanta Cineál 2. De réir réamhshocraithe scipeálann Orca an "
"taisteal ar mheaisíní ilchinn uirlise mar go láimhseálann na dochtearraí "
"malartú an chinn, rud a d'fhéadfadh an t-ordú Tx a eisiúint os cionn na "
"páirte priontáilte. Cumasaigh an rogha seo más mian leat an t-athrú uirlise "
"a eisiúint os cionn an túir ghlanta i gcónaí ina ionad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Wait for temperature on wipe tower"
msgstr "Fan leis an teocht ar an túr glanta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Pick up the new tool without waiting for it to reach printing temperature, "
"travel to the wipe tower, and wait for the temperature there, right before "
"purging. Ooze from the heat-up lands on the tower instead of the model, and "
"the travel overlaps with the heating.\n"
"\n"
"Only relevant for multi-extruder (multi-toolhead) printers using a Type 2 "
"wipe tower. The firmware or tool change macro must not wait for the "
"temperature itself. When disabled, the temperature wait is issued right "
"after the tool change command."
msgstr ""
"Pioc suas an uirlis nua gan fanacht go sroichfidh sí teocht phriontála, "
"taisteal go dtí an túr glanta, agus fan leis an teocht ansin, díreach roimh "
"shruthlú. Tuirlingíonn an t-úscadh ón téamh ar an túr in ionad na samhla, "
"agus forluíonn an taisteal leis an téamh.\n"
"\n"
"Ní bhaineann sé ach le printéirí ilsheasbhrúiteora (ilchinn uirlise) a "
"úsáideann túr glanta Cineál 2. Níor cheart do na dochtearraí ná don mhacra "
"athraithe uirlise fanacht leis an teocht iad féin. Nuair atá sé "
"díchumasaithe, eisítear an fanacht teochta díreach tar éis an ordaithe "
"athraithe uirlise."

# AI Translated
msgid "No sparse layers (beta)"
msgstr "Gan sraitheanna tanaí (béite)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, the wipe tower will not be printed on layers with no tool "
"changes. On layers with a tool change, extruder will travel downward to "
"print the wipe tower, so the tower ends up below the model and the toolhead "
"has to reach down to it. Layouts where that would collide with an already "
"printed object are rejected. Has no effect with smooth timelapse or clumping "
"detection, which need a tower on every layer."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, ní phriontálfar an túr glanta ar shraitheanna gan "
"athruithe uirlise. Ar shraitheanna le hathrú uirlise, taistealóidh an "
"t-easbhrúiteoir anuas chun an túr glanta a phriontáil, mar sin bíonn an túr "
"faoin tsamhail agus caithfidh an ceann uirlise síneadh anuas chuige. "
"Diúltaítear leaganacha amach ina mbuailfeadh sé sin le réad atá priontáilte "
"cheana. Gan éifeacht le am-mhoill mhín ná le brath cnapánaithe, a "
"dteastaíonn túr ar gach sraith uathu."

# AI Translated
msgid "Combine sparse layers"
msgstr "Comhcheangail sraitheanna tanaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, consecutive layers on which the prime tower has no filament "
"change are printed as a single thicker tower layer instead of one thin layer "
"each, the same way infill combination merges sparse infill. The merged layer "
"is printed at the top of the run, at the height of everything it covers.\n"
"\n"
"Only whole layers are merged, and never past the maximum layer height of the "
"nozzle printing the tower (three quarters of the nozzle diameter when that "
"is left at 0). Two or more layers therefore have to fit under that limit "
"before anything changes at all: at a 0.2 mm layer height under a 0.3 mm "
"maximum nothing is merged, while at 0.1 mm three layers become one.\n"
"\n"
"Unlike \"No sparse layers\" the tower keeps following the model, so the "
"toolhead never has to reach down to it. Has no effect with \"No sparse "
"layers\", smooth timelapse or clumping detection, which need a tower on "
"every layer."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, priontáiltear sraitheanna i ndiaidh a chéile nach "
"bhfuil athrú filiméid ag an túr príomhála orthu mar shraith túir amháin níos "
"tiubha in ionad sraith thanaí amháin an ceann, ar an mbealach céanna a "
"gcumascann comhcheangal líonta an líonadh tanaí. Priontáiltear an tsraith "
"chumaiscthe ag barr an rith, ag airde gach rud a chlúdaíonn sí.\n"
"\n"
"Ní chumasctar ach sraitheanna iomlána, agus riamh thar uasairde sraithe an "
"tsoic a phriontálann an túr (trí cheathrú de thrastomhas an tsoic nuair a "
"fhágtar é sin ag 0). Mar sin caithfidh dhá shraith nó níos mó teacht faoin "
"teorainn sin sula n-athraíonn aon rud ar chor ar bith: ag airde sraithe 0.2 "
"mm faoi uasmhéid 0.3 mm ní chumasctar aon rud, agus ag 0.1 mm éiríonn trí "
"shraith ina gceann amháin.\n"
"\n"
"Murab ionann agus \"Gan sraitheanna tanaí\" leanann an túr ag leanúint na "
"samhla, mar sin ní bhíonn ar an gceann uirlise síneadh anuas chuige riamh. "
"Gan éifeacht le \"Gan sraitheanna tanaí\", le am-mhoill mhín ná le brath "
"cnapánaithe, a dteastaíonn túr ar gach sraith uathu."

# AI Translated
msgid "Prime all printing extruders"
msgstr "Príomhaigh gach easbhrúiteoir priontála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, all printing extruders will be primed at the front edge of the "
"print bed at the start of the print."
msgstr ""
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, príomhálfar gach easbhrúiteoir priontála ag imeall "
"tosaigh leaba an phrintéara ag tús na priontála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Toolchange ordering"
msgstr "Ord athraithe uirlise"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Determines the order of tool changes on each layer.\n"
"- Default: Starts with the last used extruder to minimize tool changes.\n"
"- Cyclic: Uses a fixed tool sequence each layer. This sacrifices speed for "
"better surface quality, as the extra toolchanges allow layers more time to "
"cool."
msgstr ""
"Cinneann sé ord na n-athruithe uirlise ar gach sraith.\n"
"- Réamhshocrú: Tosaíonn sé leis an easbhrúiteoir a úsáideadh go deireanach "
"chun athruithe uirlise a íoslaghdú.\n"
"- Timthriallach: Úsáideann sé seicheamh uirlise seasta gach sraith. "
"Íobairtear luas ar son cáilíocht dromchla níos fearr, mar go dtugann na "
"hathruithe uirlise breise níos mó ama do shraitheanna fuarú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Cyclic"
msgstr "Timthriallach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Cyclic order"
msgstr "Ord timthriallach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Custom filament sequence used by the cyclic toolchange ordering, as filament "
"numbers separated by commas (e.g. \"3,2,1,4\").\n"
"Each layer prints its filaments following this sequence; filaments not "
"listed are printed last, in ascending order.\n"
"Leave empty to cycle through the filaments in ascending order."
msgstr ""
"Seicheamh filiméad saincheaptha a úsáideann ord timthriallach na n-athruithe "
"uirlise, mar uimhreacha filiméid scartha le camóga (m.sh. \"3,2,1,4\").\n"
"Priontálann gach sraith a filiméid de réir an tseichimh seo; priontáiltear "
"filiméid nach bhfuil liostaithe ar deireadh, in ord ardaitheach.\n"
"Fág folamh chun timthriall a dhéanamh trí na filiméid in ord ardaitheach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Apply cyclic order to first layer"
msgstr "Cuir an t-ord timthriallach i bhfeidhm ar an gcéad sraith"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Applies the cyclic toolchange order to the first layer as well.\n"
"By default this is disabled, because the first layer is instead ordered for "
"the best bed adhesion: filaments that print small, fragile first-layer "
"features are printed last, so the following tool changes and travel moves "
"are less likely to knock those weakly anchored parts loose. This first-layer "
"order also honors a custom first layer filament sequence when one is set. "
"The cyclic order's benefit (extra tool changes give each layer more time to "
"cool) does not apply to the first layer, which is printed slowly and hot for "
"adhesion.\n"
"Enable this only if you need the exact same tool sequence on every layer, "
"including the first, at the cost of that adhesion optimization."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann sé ord timthriallach na n-athruithe uirlise i bhfeidhm ar an gcéad "
"sraith freisin.\n"
"De réir réamhshocraithe tá sé seo díchumasaithe, mar go n-ordaítear an chéad "
"sraith ina ionad don ghreamaitheacht leapa is fearr: priontáiltear ar "
"deireadh filiméid a phriontálann gnéithe beaga leochaileacha sa chéad "
"sraith, ionas gur lú an seans go mbainfidh na hathruithe uirlise agus na "
"gluaiseachtaí taistil ina dhiaidh na páirteanna lag-ancairithe sin as a "
"n-áit. Comhlíonann an t-ord seo don chéad sraith seicheamh filiméad "
"saincheaptha don chéad sraith freisin nuair a bhíonn ceann socraithe. Ní "
"bhaineann buntáiste an oird thimthriallaigh (tugann athruithe uirlise breise "
"níos mó ama do gach sraith fuarú) leis an gcéad sraith, a phriontáiltear go "
"mall agus go te ar mhaithe le greamaitheacht.\n"
"Ná cumasaigh é seo ach má theastaíonn an seicheamh uirlise céanna go díreach "
"uait ar gach sraith, an chéad cheann san áireamh, ar chostas an optamaithe "
"greamaitheachta sin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Slice gap closing radius"
msgstr "Ga dúnta bearnaí an tslisnithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Cracks smaller than 2x gap closing radius are being filled during the "
"triangle mesh slicing. The gap closing operation may reduce the final print "
"resolution, therefore it is advisable to keep the value reasonably low."
msgstr ""
"Líontar scoilteanna níos lú ná 2x ga dúnta na mbearnaí le linn slisniú an "
"mhogalra triantán. D'fhéadfadh an oibríocht dúnta bearnaí taifeach deiridh "
"na priontála a laghdú, mar sin moltar an luach a choinneáil sách íseal."

# AI Translated
msgid "Slicing Mode"
msgstr "Mód Slisnithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Use \"Even-odd\" for 3DLabPrint airplane models. Use \"Close holes\" to "
"close all holes in the model."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid \"Corr-réidh\" do shamhlacha eitleáin 3DLabPrint. Úsáid \"Dún poill\" "
"chun gach poll sa tsamhail a dhúnadh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Regular"
msgstr "Rialta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Even-odd"
msgstr "Corr-réidh"

# AI Translated
msgid "Close holes"
msgstr "Dún poill"

# AI Translated
msgid "Z offset"
msgstr "Fritháireamh Z"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This value will be added (or subtracted) from all the Z coordinates in the "
"output G-code. It is used to compensate for bad Z endstop position: for "
"example, if your endstop zero actually leaves the nozzle 0.3mm far from the "
"print bed, set this to -0.3 (or fix your endstop)."
msgstr ""
"Cuirfear an luach seo le (nó bainfear é ó) gach comhordanáid Z sa G-code "
"aschuir. Úsáidtear é chun droch-shuíomh stad deiridh Z a chúiteamh: mar "
"shampla, má fhágann nialas do stad deiridh an soc 0.3mm ó leaba an "
"phrintéara i ndáiríre, socraigh é seo go -0.3 (nó deisigh do stad deiridh)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable support"
msgstr "Cumasaigh tacaí"

# AI Translated
msgid "This enables support generation."
msgstr "Cumasaíonn sé seo giniúint tacaí."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Normal (auto) and Tree (auto) are used to generate support automatically. If "
"Normal (manual) or Tree (manual) is selected, only support enforcers are "
"generated."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear Gnáth (uath) agus Crann (uath) chun tacaí a ghiniúint go "
"huathoibríoch. Má roghnaítear Gnáth (de láimh) nó Crann (de láimh), ní "
"ghintear ach forfheidhmitheoirí taca."

# AI Translated
msgid "Normal (auto)"
msgstr "Gnáth (uath)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Tree (auto)"
msgstr "Crann (uath)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Normal (manual)"
msgstr "Gnáth (de láimh)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Tree (manual)"
msgstr "Crann (de láimh)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Support/object XY distance"
msgstr "Fad XY taca/réada"

# AI Translated
msgid "This controls the XY separation between an object and its support."
msgstr "Rialaíonn sé seo an scaradh XY idir réad agus a thacaí."

# AI Translated
msgid "Support/object first layer gap"
msgstr "Bearna chéad sraithe taca/réada"

# AI Translated
msgid "XY separation between an object and its support at the first layer."
msgstr "Scaradh XY idir réad agus a thacaí ag an gcéad sraith."

# AI Translated
msgid "Pattern angle"
msgstr "Uillinn an phatrúin"

# AI Translated
msgid "Use this setting to rotate the support pattern on the horizontal plane."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid an socrú seo chun patrún na dtacaí a rothlú ar an bplána cothrománach."

# AI Translated
msgid "On build plate only"
msgstr "Ar an bpláta tógála amháin"

# AI Translated
msgid "This setting only generates supports that begin on the build plate."
msgstr "Ní ghineann an socrú seo ach tacaí a thosaíonn ar an bpláta tógála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Support critical regions only"
msgstr "Tacaí do réigiúin chriticiúla amháin"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Only create support for critical regions including sharp tail, cantilever, "
"etc."
msgstr ""
"Ná cruthaigh tacaí ach do réigiúin chriticiúla lena n-áirítear eireaball "
"géar, starrbhíoma, srl."

# AI Translated
msgid "Ignore small overhangs"
msgstr "Déan neamhaird de starráin bheaga"

# AI Translated
msgid "Ignore small overhangs that possibly don't require support."
msgstr ""
"Déan neamhaird de starráin bheaga nach dteastaíonn tacaí uathu b'fhéidir."

# AI Translated
msgid "Top Z distance"
msgstr "Fad Z uachtair"

# AI Translated
msgid "Z gap between the support's top and object."
msgstr "Bearna Z idir barr na dtacaí agus an réad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bottom Z distance"
msgstr "Fad Z íochtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Z gap between the object and the support bottom. If Support Top Z Distance "
"is 0 and the bottom has interface layers, this value is ignored and the "
"support is printed in direct contact with the object (no gap)."
msgstr ""
"Bearna Z idir an réad agus bun na dtacaí. Má tá Fad Z Uachtair na dTacaí 0 "
"agus má tá sraitheanna comhéadain ag an mbun, déantar neamhaird den luach "
"seo agus priontáiltear na tacaí i dteagmháil dhíreach leis an réad (gan "
"bhearna)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Support/raft base"
msgstr "Bonn taca/rafta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Filament to print support base and raft.\n"
"\"Default\" means no specific filament for support and current filament is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Filiméad chun bonn na dtacaí agus an rafta a phriontáil.\n"
"Ciallaíonn \"Réamhshocrú\" nach bhfuil filiméad sonrach do thacaí agus "
"úsáidtear an filiméad reatha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Avoid interface filament for base"
msgstr "Seachain filiméad comhéadain don bhonn"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Avoid using support interface filament to print support base if possible."
msgstr ""
"Seachain filiméad chomhéadan na dtacaí a úsáid chun bonn na dtacaí a "
"phriontáil más féidir."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Line width of support. If expressed as a %, it will be computed over the "
"nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"Leithead líne na dtacaí. Má léirítear é mar %, ríomhfar é i gcoibhneas le "
"trastomhas an tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid "Loop pattern interface"
msgstr "Comhéadan patrún lúibe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This covers the top contact layer of the supports with loops. It is disabled "
"by default."
msgstr ""
"Clúdaíonn sé seo sraith teagmhála uachtair na dtacaí le lúba. Tá sé "
"díchumasaithe de réir réamhshocraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Support/raft interface"
msgstr "Comhéadan taca/rafta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Filament to print support interface.\n"
"\"Default\" means no specific filament for support interface and current "
"filament is used."
msgstr ""
"Filiméad chun comhéadan na dtacaí a phriontáil.\n"
"Ciallaíonn \"Réamhshocrú\" nach bhfuil filiméad sonrach do chomhéadan na "
"dtacaí agus úsáidtear an filiméad reatha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Top interface layers"
msgstr "Sraitheanna comhéadain uachtair"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the number of top interface layers."
msgstr "Seo é líon na sraitheanna comhéadain uachtair."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bottom interface layers"
msgstr "Sraitheanna comhéadain íochtair"

# AI Translated
msgid "Number of bottom interface layers."
msgstr "Líon na sraitheanna comhéadain íochtair."

# AI Translated
msgid "Same as top"
msgstr "Mar an gcéanna leis an mbarr"

# AI Translated
msgid "Top interface spacing"
msgstr "Spásáil an chomhéadain uachtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Spacing of interface lines. Zero means solid interface.\n"
"Force using solid interface when support ironing is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Spásáil línte an chomhéadain. Ciallaíonn nialas comhéadan soladach.\n"
"Cuir iallach comhéadan soladach a úsáid nuair atá iarnáil tacaí cumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bottom interface spacing"
msgstr "Spásáil an chomhéadain íochtair"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the spacing of bottom interface lines. 0 means solid interface."
msgstr ""
"Seo í spásáil línte an chomhéadain íochtair. Ciallaíonn 0 comhéadan soladach."

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the speed for support interfaces."
msgstr "Seo é an luas do chomhéadain tacaí."

# AI Translated
msgid "Base pattern"
msgstr "Patrún an bhoinn"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Line pattern of support.\n"
"\n"
"The Default option for Tree supports is Hollow, which means no base pattern. "
"For other support types, the Default option is the Rectilinear pattern.\n"
"\n"
"NOTE: For Organic supports, the two walls are supported only with the "
"Hollow/Default base pattern. The Lightning base pattern is supported only by "
"Tree Slim/Strong/Hybrid supports. For the other support types, the "
"Rectilinear will be used instead of Lightning."
msgstr ""
"Patrún líne na dtacaí.\n"
"\n"
"Is é Cuasach an rogha Réamhshocraithe do thacaí Crainn, rud a chiallaíonn "
"gan patrún boinn. Do chineálacha eile tacaí, is é an patrún Dronlíneach an "
"rogha Réamhshocraithe.\n"
"\n"
"NÓTA: Do thacaí Orgánacha, ní thacaítear leis an dá bhalla ach leis an "
"bpatrún boinn Cuasach/Réamhshocraithe. Ní thacaíonn ach tacaí Crainn "
"Caol/Láidir/Hibrideach leis an bpatrún boinn Tintreach. Do na cineálacha "
"eile tacaí, úsáidfear Dronlíneach in ionad Tintrí."

# AI Translated
msgid "Rectilinear grid"
msgstr "Greille dhronlíneach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Hollow"
msgstr "Cuasach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Interface pattern"
msgstr "Patrún an chomhéadain"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the line pattern for support interfaces. The default pattern for "
"non-soluble support interfaces is Rectilinear while the default pattern for "
"soluble support interfaces is Concentric."
msgstr ""
"Seo é patrún líne chomhéadain na dtacaí. Is é Dronlíneach an patrún "
"réamhshocraithe do chomhéadain tacaí neamh-intuaslagtha agus is é "
"Comhlárnach an patrún réamhshocraithe do chomhéadain tacaí intuaslagtha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Rectilinear Interlaced"
msgstr "Dronlíneach Idirfhite"

# AI Translated
msgid "Base pattern spacing"
msgstr "Spásáil phatrún an bhoinn"

# AI Translated
msgid "This determines the spacing between support lines."
msgstr "Cinneann sé seo an spásáil idir línte na dtacaí."

# AI Translated
msgid "Normal support expansion"
msgstr "Leathnú gnáth-thacaí"

# AI Translated
msgid "Expand (+) or shrink (-) the horizontal span of normal support."
msgstr "Leathnaigh (+) nó crap (-) réise chothrománach na ngnáth-thacaí."

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the speed for support."
msgstr "Seo é an luas do thacaí."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Style and shape of the support.\n"
"\n"
"For normal support, projecting the supports into a regular grid will create "
"more stable supports (default), while snug support towers will save material "
"and reduce object scarring.\n"
"\n"
"For tree support, slim and organic style will merge branches more "
"aggressively and save a lot of material (default organic), while hybrid "
"style will create similar structure to normal support under large flat "
"overhangs."
msgstr ""
"Stíl agus cruth na dtacaí.\n"
"\n"
"I gcás gnáth-thacaí, cruthóidh teilgean na dtacaí isteach i ngreille rialta "
"tacaí níos cobhsaí (réamhshocrú), agus sábhálfaidh túir taca dhlútha ábhar "
"agus laghdóidh siad marcanna ar an réad.\n"
"\n"
"I gcás tacaí crainn, cumascfaidh an stíl chaol agus an stíl orgánach "
"craobhacha níos ionsaithí agus sábhálfaidh siad go leor ábhair (orgánach "
"réamhshocraithe), agus cruthóidh an stíl hibrideach struchtúr cosúil le "
"gnáth-thacaí faoi starráin mhóra chothroma."

# AI Translated
msgid "Default (Grid/Organic)"
msgstr "Réamhshocrú (Greille/Orgánach)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Snug"
msgstr "Dlúth"

# AI Translated
msgid "Organic"
msgstr "Orgánach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Tree Slim"
msgstr "Crann Caol"

# AI Translated
msgid "Tree Strong"
msgstr "Crann Láidir"

# AI Translated
msgid "Tree Hybrid"
msgstr "Crann Hibrideach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Independent support layer height"
msgstr "Airde neamhspleách sraithe taca"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Support layer uses layer height independent with object layer. This is to "
"support customizing Z-gap and save print time. This option will be invalid "
"when the prime tower is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann sraith na dtacaí airde sraithe neamhspleách ar shraith an réada. "
"Is é seo chun tacú le saincheapadh bearna Z agus am priontála a shábháil. "
"Beidh an rogha seo neamhbhailí nuair atá an túr príomhála cumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Threshold angle"
msgstr "Uillinn tairsí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Support will be generated for overhangs whose slope angle is below the "
"threshold. The smaller this value is, the steeper the overhang that can be "
"printed without support.\n"
"\n"
"Note: If set to 0, normal supports use the Threshold overlap instead, while "
"tree supports fall back to a default value of 30."
msgstr ""
"Ginfear tacaí do starráin a bhfuil a n-uillinn fhána faoi bhun na tairsí. Dá "
"lú an luach seo, is ea is géire an starrán is féidir a phriontáil gan "
"tacaí.\n"
"\n"
"Nóta: Má shocraítear go 0 é, úsáideann gnáth-thacaí an Forluí tairsí ina "
"ionad, agus filleann tacaí crainn ar luach réamhshocraithe 30."

# AI Translated
msgid "Threshold overlap"
msgstr "Forluí tairsí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If threshold angle is zero, support will be generated for overhangs whose "
"overlap is below the threshold. The smaller this value is, the steeper the "
"overhang that can be printed without support."
msgstr ""
"Más nialas é uillinn na tairsí, ginfear tacaí do starráin a bhfuil a "
"bhforluí faoi bhun na tairsí. Dá lú an luach seo, is ea is géire an starrán "
"is féidir a phriontáil gan tacaí."

# AI Translated
msgid "Build plate tilt X"
msgstr "Claonadh an phláta tógála X"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Tilt angle of the build plate along the X axis. A positive value tilts the "
"plate so the +X side is higher, shifting gravity toward -X and increasing "
"overhangs on the +X side. A negative value tilts the -X side higher. Set to "
"0 for no X-axis tilt. In belt printer mode, this is automatically synced to "
"the belt angle."
msgstr ""
"Uillinn chlaonta an phláta tógála feadh ais X. Claonann luach dearfach an "
"pláta ionas go bhfuil an taobh +X níos airde, ag bogadh domhantarraingthe i "
"dtreo -X agus ag méadú starrán ar an taobh +X. Claonann luach diúltach an "
"taobh -X níos airde. Socraigh go 0 gan claonadh ais X. I mód printéara "
"crios, sioncronaítear é seo le huillinn an chreasa go huathoibríoch."

# AI Translated
msgid "Build plate tilt Y"
msgstr "Claonadh an phláta tógála Y"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Tilt angle of the build plate along the Y axis. A positive value tilts the "
"plate so the +Y side is higher, shifting gravity toward -Y and increasing "
"overhangs on the +Y side. A negative value tilts the -Y side higher. Set to "
"0 for no Y-axis tilt."
msgstr ""
"Uillinn chlaonta an phláta tógála feadh ais Y. Claonann luach dearfach an "
"pláta ionas go bhfuil an taobh +Y níos airde, ag bogadh domhantarraingthe i "
"dtreo -Y agus ag méadú starrán ar an taobh +Y. Claonann luach diúltach an "
"taobh -Y níos airde. Socraigh go 0 gan claonadh ais Y."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable belt printing"
msgstr "Cumasaigh priontáil chreasa"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable belt printer mode. Belt printers use a conveyor belt as the build "
"surface, tilted at an angle (typically 45 degrees). The slicer will rotate "
"the slicing plane and transform G-code coordinates for the tilted build "
"surface."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh mód printéara crios. Úsáideann printéirí crios crios iompair mar "
"dhromchla tógála, claonta ag uillinn (45 céim de ghnáth). Rothlóidh an "
"slisneoir an plána slisnithe agus trasfhoirmeoidh sé comhordanáidí G-code "
"don dromchla tógála claonta."

# AI Translated
msgid "Infinite Y axis"
msgstr "Ais Y gan teorainn"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable infinite Y axis for belt printers. When enabled, the Y axis build "
"volume limit is effectively removed, allowing objects of any length to be "
"printed along the belt direction."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh ais Y gan teorainn do phrintéirí crios. Nuair atá sé cumasaithe, "
"baintear teorainn thoirt na tógála ais Y go héifeachtach, rud a cheadaíonn "
"réada d'aon fhad a phriontáil feadh threo an chreasa."

# AI Translated
msgid "Belt tilt axis"
msgstr "Ais chlaonta an chreasa"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Axis the mesh is rotated about before slicing. This is the belt printer's "
"tilt: an isometric (no distortion) rotation that also drives bed rendering "
"and support gravity tilt, and that the G-code back-transform inverts before "
"the machine-frame shear/scale and remap. X is the typical gantry tilt (belt "
"travels along Y)."
msgstr ""
"An ais a rothlaítear an mogalra timpeall uirthi roimh shlisniú. Is é seo "
"claonadh an phrintéara crios: rothlú isiméadrach (gan saobhadh) a "
"thiomáineann rindreáil na leapa agus claonadh domhantarraingthe na dtacaí "
"freisin, agus a inbhéartaíonn aisthrasfhoirmiú an G-code roimh lomadh/scálú "
"fhráma an mheaisín agus an athmhapáil. Is é X an gnáthchlaonadh gantra "
"(taistealaíonn an crios feadh Y)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Belt tilt angle"
msgstr "Uillinn chlaonta an chreasa"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Tilt angle of the belt surface, in degrees. Most belt printers use 45°. "
"Positive values rotate counter-clockwise looking down the positive tilt "
"axis; the magnitude is also the physical belt tilt used for bed rendering "
"and support gravity."
msgstr ""
"Uillinn chlaonta dhromchla an chreasa, i gcéimeanna. Úsáideann formhór na "
"bprintéirí crios 45°. Rothlaíonn luachanna dearfacha tuathal ag féachaint "
"anuas ar an ais chlaonta dhearfach; is é an méid an claonadh fisiceach "
"creasa a úsáidtear do rindreáil na leapa agus domhantarraingt na dtacaí "
"freisin."

# AI Translated
msgid "°"
msgstr "°"

# AI Translated
msgid "Decouple machine-frame tilt"
msgstr "Dícheangail claonadh fhráma an mheaisín"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Expert override: set the machine-frame (G-code shear/scale) tilt angle "
"independently of the pre-slice rotation angle. When disabled, the "
"machine-frame transform is derived from the belt tilt angle, so a single "
"angle drives both stages. Enable only to compensate for a machine whose "
"physical gantry tilt differs from the slicing rotation."
msgstr ""
"Sárú saineolaí: socraigh uillinn chlaonta fhráma an mheaisín (lomadh/scálú "
"G-code) go neamhspleách ar uillinn an rothlaithe roimh shlisniú. Nuair atá "
"sé díchumasaithe, díorthaítear trasfhoirmiú fhráma an mheaisín ó uillinn "
"chlaonta an chreasa, mar sin tiomáineann uillinn amháin an dá chéim. Ná "
"cumasaigh é ach chun meaisín a chúiteamh a bhfuil a chlaonadh gantra "
"fisiceach difriúil ón rothlú slisnithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Machine-frame tilt angle"
msgstr "Uillinn chlaonta fhráma an mheaisín"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Tilt angle (degrees) used to derive the machine-frame shear (cot) and scale "
"(1/|sin|) applied to G-code. Only used when 'Decouple machine-frame tilt' is "
"enabled; otherwise the belt tilt angle is used."
msgstr ""
"Uillinn chlaonta (céimeanna) a úsáidtear chun lomadh (cot) agus scála "
"(1/|sin|) fhráma an mheaisín a chuirtear i bhfeidhm ar G-code a dhíorthú. Ní "
"úsáidtear é ach nuair atá 'Dícheangail claonadh fhráma an mheaisín' "
"cumasaithe; seachas sin úsáidtear uillinn chlaonta an chreasa."

# AI Translated
msgid "+X"
msgstr "+X"

# AI Translated
msgid "+Y"
msgstr "+Y"

# AI Translated
msgid "+Z"
msgstr "+Z"

# AI Translated
msgid "-X"
msgstr "-X"

# AI Translated
msgid "-Y"
msgstr "-Y"

# AI Translated
msgid "-Z"
msgstr "-Z"

# AI Translated
msgid "Rev X"
msgstr "Aisiompú X"

# AI Translated
msgid "Rev Y"
msgstr "Aisiompú Y"

# AI Translated
msgid "Rev Z"
msgstr "Aisiompú Z"

# AI Translated
msgid "G-code remap X"
msgstr "Athmhapáil G-code X"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Which slicing axis maps to machine X in G-code output. Applied AFTER "
"slicing, during G-code generation."
msgstr ""
"Cén ais slisnithe a mhapálann go X an mheaisín in aschur G-code. Cuirtear i "
"bhfeidhm é TAR ÉIS slisnithe, le linn ghiniúint an G-code."

# AI Translated
msgid "G-code remap Y"
msgstr "Athmhapáil G-code Y"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Which slicing axis maps to machine Y in G-code output. Applied AFTER "
"slicing, during G-code generation."
msgstr ""
"Cén ais slisnithe a mhapálann go Y an mheaisín in aschur G-code. Cuirtear i "
"bhfeidhm é TAR ÉIS slisnithe, le linn ghiniúint an G-code."

# AI Translated
msgid "G-code remap Z"
msgstr "Athmhapáil G-code Z"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Which slicing axis maps to machine Z in G-code output. Applied AFTER "
"slicing, during G-code generation."
msgstr ""
"Cén ais slisnithe a mhapálann go Z an mheaisín in aschur G-code. Cuirtear i "
"bhfeidhm é TAR ÉIS slisnithe, le linn ghiniúint an G-code."

# AI Translated
msgid "Support Floor Z offset"
msgstr "Fritháireamh Z Urlár na dTacaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Shifts the computed belt floor up or down (mm). Negative values lower the "
"floor, allowing more supports to survive. Use this to diagnose belt floor "
"formula issues."
msgstr ""
"Bogann sé urlár ríofa an chreasa suas nó síos (mm). Íslíonn luachanna "
"diúltacha an t-urlár, rud a ligeann do níos mó tacaí maireachtáil. Úsáid é "
"seo chun fadhbanna le foirmle urlár an chreasa a dhiagnóisiú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable belt purge tower"
msgstr "Cumasaigh túr sruthlaithe an chreasa"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Belt-printer replacement for the wipe/prime tower. When enabled on a belt "
"printer, a purge prism is automatically generated next to the printed parts "
"and filament-change purging is routed into it (the classic wipe tower cannot "
"be used on belt printers because its G-code bypasses the belt transform). "
"Only available on belt printers."
msgstr ""
"Ionadaí printéara crios don túr glanta/príomhála. Nuair a chumasaítear é ar "
"phrintéir crios, gintear priosma sruthlaithe go huathoibríoch in aice leis "
"na páirteanna priontáilte agus ródaítear sruthlú athraithe filiméid isteach "
"ann (ní féidir an túr glanta clasaiceach a úsáid ar phrintéirí crios mar go "
"seachnaíonn a G-code trasfhoirmiú an chreasa). Níl sé ar fáil ach ar "
"phrintéirí crios."

# AI Translated
msgid "Belt purge tower width"
msgstr "Leithead thúr sruthlaithe an chreasa"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Width (machine X, across the belt) of the purge prism that is automatically "
"generated on belt printers when the belt purge tower is enabled and multiple "
"filaments are used. Filament-change purging is routed into this prism's "
"extrusions instead of a classic wipe tower. Its height is computed "
"automatically from the worst-case purge volume per layer: a wider prism "
"results in a shorter one."
msgstr ""
"Leithead (X an mheaisín, trasna an chreasa) an phriosma sruthlaithe a "
"ghintear go huathoibríoch ar phrintéirí crios nuair atá túr sruthlaithe an "
"chreasa cumasaithe agus filiméid iolracha in úsáid. Ródaítear sruthlú "
"athraithe filiméid isteach in easbhruthanna an phriosma seo in ionad túr "
"glanta clasaiceach. Ríomhtar a airde go huathoibríoch ón toirt sruthlaithe "
"is measa in aghaidh na sraithe: bíonn priosma níos leithne níos giorra."

# AI Translated
msgid "Tree support branch angle"
msgstr "Uillinn chraoibhe na dtacaí crainn"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This setting determines the maximum overhang angle that the branches of tree "
"support are allowed to make. If the angle is increased, the branches can be "
"printed more horizontally, allowing them to reach farther."
msgstr ""
"Cinneann an socrú seo an uasuillinn starráin a cheadaítear do chraobhacha na "
"dtacaí crainn. Má mhéadaítear an uillinn, is féidir na craobhacha a "
"phriontáil níos cothrománaí, rud a ligeann dóibh síneadh níos faide."

# AI Translated
msgid "Preferred Branch Angle"
msgstr "Uillinn Chraoibhe is Fearr"

# AI Translated
#. TRN PrintSettings: "Organic supports" > "Preferred Branch Angle"
msgid ""
"The preferred angle of the branches, when they do not have to avoid the "
"model. Use a lower angle to make them more vertical and more stable. Use a "
"higher angle for branches to merge faster."
msgstr ""
"An uillinn is fearr do na craobhacha, nuair nach gá dóibh an tsamhail a "
"sheachaint. Úsáid uillinn níos ísle chun iad a dhéanamh níos ingearaí agus "
"níos cobhsaí. Úsáid uillinn níos airde chun go gcumascfaidh craobhacha níos "
"tapa."

# AI Translated
msgid "Tree support branch distance"
msgstr "Fad craoibhe na dtacaí crainn"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This setting determines the distance between neighboring tree support nodes."
msgstr ""
"Cinneann an socrú seo an fad idir nóid chomharsanacha na dtacaí crainn."

# AI Translated
msgid "Branch Density"
msgstr "Dlús na gCraobhacha"

# AI Translated
#. TRN PrintSettings: "Organic supports" > "Branch Density"
msgid ""
"Adjusts the density of the support structure used to generate the tips of "
"the branches. A higher value results in better overhangs but the supports "
"are harder to remove, thus it is recommended to enable top support "
"interfaces instead of a high branch density value if dense interfaces are "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Coigeartaíonn sé dlús an struchtúir taca a úsáidtear chun bairr na "
"gcraobhacha a ghiniúint. Bíonn starráin níos fearr mar thoradh ar luach níos "
"airde ach bíonn na tacaí níos deacra le baint, mar sin moltar comhéadain "
"tacaí uachtair a chumasú in ionad luach ard do dhlús na gcraobhacha má "
"theastaíonn comhéadain dhlútha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Auto brim width"
msgstr "Leithead uathoibríoch an imill"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enabling this option means the width of the brim for tree support will be "
"automatically calculated."
msgstr ""
"Má chumasaítear an rogha seo, ríomhfar leithead an imill do thacaí crainn go "
"huathoibríoch."

# AI Translated
msgid "Tree support brim width"
msgstr "Leithead imill na dtacaí crainn"

# AI Translated
msgid "Distance from tree branch to the outermost brim line."
msgstr "Fad ón gcraobh crainn go dtí an líne imill is faide amach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Tip Diameter"
msgstr "Trastomhas an Bhairr"

# AI Translated
#. TRN PrintSettings: "Organic supports" > "Tip Diameter"
msgid "Branch tip diameter for organic supports."
msgstr "Trastomhas bharr na craoibhe do thacaí orgánacha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Tree support branch diameter"
msgstr "Trastomhas craoibhe na dtacaí crainn"

# AI Translated
msgid "This setting determines the initial diameter of support nodes."
msgstr "Cinneann an socrú seo trastomhas tosaigh nóid na dtacaí."

# AI Translated
#. TRN PrintSettings: #lmFIXME
msgid "Branch Diameter Angle"
msgstr "Uillinn Thrastomhas na Craoibhe"

# AI Translated
#. TRN PrintSettings: "Organic supports" > "Branch Diameter Angle"
msgid ""
"The angle of the branches' diameter as they gradually become thicker towards "
"the bottom. An angle of 0 will cause the branches to have uniform thickness "
"over their length. A bit of an angle can increase stability of the organic "
"support."
msgstr ""
"Uillinn thrastomhas na gcraobhacha agus iad ag éirí níos tiubha de réir a "
"chéile i dtreo an bhun. Fágfaidh uillinn 0 go mbeidh tiús aonfhoirmeach ag "
"na craobhacha ar feadh a bhfaid. Is féidir le beagán uillinne cobhsaíocht na "
"dtacaí orgánacha a mhéadú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Support wall loops"
msgstr "Lúba balla na dtacaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This setting specifies the count of support walls in the range of [0,2]. 0 "
"means auto."
msgstr ""
"Sonraíonn an socrú seo líon na mballaí taca sa raon [0,2]. Ciallaíonn 0 "
"uathoibríoch."

# AI Translated
msgid "Tree support with infill"
msgstr "Tacaí crainn le líonadh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This setting specifies whether to add infill inside large hollows of tree "
"support."
msgstr ""
"Sonraíonn an socrú seo cé acu ar cheart líonadh a chur taobh istigh de "
"chuasanna móra na dtacaí crainn."

# AI Translated
msgid "Ironing Support Interface"
msgstr "Comhéadan Taca a Iarnáil"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Ironing is using small flow to print on same height of support interface "
"again to make it more smooth. This setting controls whether support "
"interface being ironed. When enabled, support interface will be extruded as "
"solid too."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann iarnáil sreabhadh beag chun priontáil arís ar an airde chéanna le "
"comhéadan na dtacaí chun é a dhéanamh níos míne. Rialaíonn an socrú seo cé "
"acu a iarnáiltear comhéadan na dtacaí. Nuair atá sé cumasaithe, easbhrúfar "
"comhéadan na dtacaí mar sholadach freisin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Support Ironing Pattern"
msgstr "Patrún Iarnála na dTacaí"

# AI Translated
msgid "Support Ironing flow"
msgstr "Sreabhadh Iarnála na dTacaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The amount of material to extrude during ironing. Relative to flow of normal "
"support interface layer height. Too high value results in overextrusion on "
"the surface."
msgstr ""
"Méid an ábhair le heasbhrú le linn iarnála. Coibhneasta le sreabhadh "
"ghnáth-airde shraith chomhéadan na dtacaí. Má bhíonn an luach ró-ard, beidh "
"ró-easbhrú ar an dromchla."

# AI Translated
msgid "Support Ironing line spacing"
msgstr "Spásáil línte iarnála na dTacaí"

# AI Translated
msgid "Activate temperature control"
msgstr "Gníomhachtaigh rialú teochta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable this option for automated chamber temperature control. This option "
"activates the emitting of an M191 command before the \"machine_start_gcode\" "
"which sets the chamber temperature and waits until it is reached. In "
"addition, it emits an M141 command at the end of the print to turn off the "
"chamber heater, if present.\n"
"\n"
"This option relies on the firmware supporting the M191 and M141 commands "
"either via macros or natively and is usually used when an active chamber "
"heater is installed."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh an rogha seo le haghaidh rialú uathoibríoch ar theocht an tseomra. "
"Gníomhachtaíonn an rogha seo eisiúint ordú M191 roimh an "
"\"machine_start_gcode\" a shocraíonn teocht an tseomra agus a fhanann go "
"sroichtear í. Ina theannta sin, eisíonn sé ordú M141 ag deireadh na "
"priontála chun téitheoir an tseomra a mhúchadh, má tá ceann ann.\n"
"\n"
"Braitheann an rogha seo ar na dochtearraí a thacaíonn leis na horduithe M191 "
"agus M141 trí mhacraí nó go dúchasach agus úsáidtear í de ghnáth nuair atá "
"téitheoir seomra gníomhach suiteáilte."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"For high-temperature materials like ABS, ASA, PC, and PA, a higher chamber "
"temperature can help suppress or reduce warping and potentially lead to "
"higher interlayer bonding strength. However, at the same time, a higher "
"chamber temperature will reduce the efficiency of air filtration for ABS and "
"ASA.\n"
"\n"
"For PLA, PETG, TPU, PVA, and other low-temperature materials, this option "
"should be disabled (set to 0) as the chamber temperature should be low to "
"avoid extruder clogging caused by material softening at the heat break.\n"
"\n"
"If enabled, this parameter also sets a G-code variable named "
"chamber_temperature, which can be used to pass the desired chamber "
"temperature to your print start macro, or a heat soak macro like this:\n"
"PRINT_START (other variables) CHAMBER_TEMP=[chamber_temperature]\n"
"This may be useful if your printer does not support M141/M191 commands, or "
"if you desire to handle heat soaking in the print start macro if no active "
"chamber heater is installed."
msgstr ""
"Maidir le hábhair ardteochta mar ABS, ASA, PC, agus PA, is féidir le teocht "
"seomra níos airde cabhrú le stangadh a chur faoi chois nó a laghdú agus "
"d'fhéadfadh neart nasctha idir sraitheanna níos airde a bheith mar thoradh "
"air. Mar sin féin, ag an am céanna, laghdóidh teocht seomra níos airde "
"éifeachtúlacht an scagtha aeir do ABS agus ASA.\n"
"\n"
"Maidir le PLA, PETG, TPU, PVA, agus ábhair ísealteochta eile, ba cheart an "
"rogha seo a dhíchumasú (socrú go 0) mar gur cheart do theocht an tseomra a "
"bheith íseal chun calcadh an easbhrúiteora a sheachaint de bharr bogadh an "
"ábhair ag an mbriste teasa.\n"
"\n"
"Má tá sé cumasaithe, socraíonn an paraiméadar seo athróg G-code darb ainm "
"chamber_temperature freisin, ar féidir í a úsáid chun an teocht seomra atá "
"uait a chur chuig do mhacra tosaithe priontála, nó chuig macra maothaithe "
"teasa mar seo:\n"
"PRINT_START (athróga eile) CHAMBER_TEMP=[chamber_temperature]\n"
"D'fhéadfadh sé seo a bheith úsáideach mura dtacaíonn do phrintéir le "
"horduithe M141/M191, nó más mian leat maothú teasa a láimhseáil sa mhacra "
"tosaithe priontála mura bhfuil téitheoir seomra gníomhach suiteáilte."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the chamber temperature at which printing should start, while the "
"chamber continues heating toward the \"Target\" chamber temperature. For "
"example, set the Target to 60 and the Minimal to 50 to begin printing once "
"the chamber reaches 50℃, without waiting for the full 60℃.\n"
"\n"
"It sets a G-code variable named chamber_minimal_temperature, which can be "
"passed to your print start macro or a heat soak macro, like this:\n"
"PRINT_START (other variables) "
"CHAMBER_MIN_TEMP=[chamber_minimal_temperature]\n"
"\n"
"Unlike the \"Target\" chamber temperature, this option does not emit any "
"M141/M191 commands; it only exposes the value to your custom G-code. It "
"should not exceed the \"Target\" chamber temperature."
msgstr ""
"Seo í teocht an tseomra ar cheart don phriontáil tosú aici, fad a leanann an "
"seomra ag téamh i dtreo shprioctheocht an tseomra. Mar shampla, socraigh an "
"Sprioc go 60 agus an tÍosmhéid go 50 chun tosú ag priontáil nuair a "
"shroicheann an seomra 50℃, gan fanacht leis an 60℃ iomlán.\n"
"\n"
"Socraíonn sé athróg G-code darb ainm chamber_minimal_temperature, ar féidir "
"í a chur chuig do mhacra tosaithe priontála nó chuig macra maothaithe teasa, "
"mar seo:\n"
"PRINT_START (athróga eile) CHAMBER_MIN_TEMP=[chamber_minimal_temperature]\n"
"\n"
"Murab ionann agus sprioctheocht an tseomra, ní eisíonn an rogha seo aon "
"orduithe M141/M191; ní nochtann sí an luach ach do do G-code saincheaptha. "
"Níor cheart di sprioctheocht an tseomra a shárú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Chamber minimal temperature"
msgstr "Íosteocht an tseomra"

# AI Translated
msgid "Nozzle temperature after the first layer"
msgstr "Teocht an tsoic tar éis na chéad sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Detect thin walls"
msgstr "Braith ballaí tanaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This detects thin walls which can’t contain two lines and uses a single line "
"to print. It may not print as well because it’s not a closed loop."
msgstr ""
"Braitheann sé seo ballaí tanaí nach féidir dhá líne a choinneáil iontu agus "
"úsáideann sé líne aonair le priontáil. D'fhéadfadh sé gan priontáil chomh "
"maith mar nach lúb dhúnta í."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This G-code is inserted when filament is changed, including T commands to "
"trigger tool change."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear an G-code seo isteach nuair a athraítear filiméad, orduithe T san "
"áireamh chun athrú uirlise a spreagadh."

# AI Translated
msgid "This G-code is inserted when the extrusion role is changed."
msgstr "Cuirtear an G-code seo isteach nuair a athraítear ról an easbhrúite."

# AI Translated
msgid "Change extrusion role G-code (filament)"
msgstr "G-code athraithe róil easbhrúite (filiméad)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This G-code is inserted when the extrusion role is changed for the active "
"filament."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear an G-code seo isteach nuair a athraítear ról an easbhrúite don "
"fhiliméad gníomhach."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Line width for top surfaces. If expressed as a %, it will be computed over "
"the nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"Leithead líne do dhromchlaí uachtair. Má léirítear é mar %, ríomhfar é i "
"gcoibhneas le trastomhas an tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the speed for solid top surface infill."
msgstr "Seo é an luas do líonadh soladach an dromchla uachtair."

# AI Translated
msgid "Top shell layers"
msgstr "Sraitheanna blaoisce uachtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This is the number of solid layers of top shell, including the top surface "
"layer. When the thickness calculated by this value is thinner than the top "
"shell thickness, the top shell layers will be increased"
msgstr ""
"Seo é líon na sraitheanna soladacha sa bhlaosc uachtair, an tsraith dromchla "
"uachtair san áireamh. Nuair a bhíonn an tiús a ríomhtar ón luach seo níos "
"tanaí ná tiús na blaoisce uachtair, méadófar sraitheanna na blaoisce uachtair"

# AI Translated
msgid "Top shell thickness"
msgstr "Tiús na blaoisce uachtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The number of top solid layers is increased when slicing if the thickness "
"calculated by top shell layers is thinner than this value. This can avoid "
"having too thin a shell when layer height is small. 0 means that this "
"setting is disabled and thickness of top shell is determined simply by the "
"number of top shell layers."
msgstr ""
"Méadaítear líon na sraitheanna soladacha uachtair le linn slisnithe má "
"bhíonn an tiús a ríomhtar ó shraitheanna na blaoisce uachtair níos tanaí ná "
"an luach seo. Is féidir leis seo blaosc ró-thanaí a sheachaint nuair a "
"bhíonn airde na sraithe beag. Ciallaíonn 0 go bhfuil an socrú seo "
"díchumasaithe agus nach gcinntear tiús na blaoisce uachtair ach le líon "
"shraitheanna na blaoisce uachtair."

# AI Translated
msgid "Top paint penetration layers"
msgstr "Sraitheanna treá péinte uachtair"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The number of layers, including the top surface layer, that take the color "
"painted on a top surface. Set to 0 to use the top shell layers. A value "
"larger than the top shell also colors the sparse infill below the painted "
"area."
msgstr ""
"Líon na sraitheanna, an tsraith dromchla uachtair san áireamh, a ghlacann an "
"dath a péinteáladh ar dhromchla uachtair. Socraigh go 0 chun sraitheanna na "
"blaoisce uachtair a úsáid. Datháil luach níos mó ná an bhlaosc uachtair an "
"líonadh tanaí faoin limistéar péinteáilte freisin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Separated infills"
msgstr "Líonta scartha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Centers the internal infill of each part on itself, as if it were sliced on "
"its own, instead of on the whole assembly. Parts that touch or overlap are "
"treated as one body and share a center; separate parts (or distinct 3D "
"objects) each get their own.\n"
"Useful when an assembly groups several objects that should each keep a "
"consistent, self-centered infill.\n"
"Adaptive Cubic and Support Cubic always center each part on itself, and "
"Lightning infill is generated for the whole object and is unaffected."
msgstr ""
"Láraíonn sé líonadh inmheánach gach páirte uirthi féin, amhail is dá "
"slisneofaí í léi féin, in ionad ar an gcóimeáil ar fad. Caitear le "
"páirteanna a théann i dteagmháil lena chéile nó a fhorluíonn mar chorp "
"amháin agus roinneann siad lár; faigheann páirteanna ar leith (nó réada 3T "
"ar leith) a lár féin an ceann.\n"
"Úsáideach nuair a ghrúpálann cóimeáil roinnt réad ar cheart do gach ceann "
"acu líonadh comhsheasmhach féinláraithe a choinneáil.\n"
"Láraíonn Ciúbach Oiriúnaitheach agus Ciúbach Taca gach páirt uirthi féin i "
"gcónaí, agus gintear líonadh Tintrí don réad ar fad agus ní théann sé seo i "
"bhfeidhm air."

# AI Translated
msgid "Center surface pattern on"
msgstr "Láraigh patrún an dromchla ar"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Chooses where the centering point of centered top/bottom surface patterns "
"(Archimedean Chords, Octagram Spiral) is placed.\n"
" - Each Surface: centers the pattern on every individual surface region, so "
"each island is symmetric on its own.\n"
" - Each Model: centers the pattern on each connected body. Parts that touch "
"or overlap share one center; parts detached from the rest each get their "
"own.\n"
" - Each Assembly: uses a single shared center for the whole object or "
"assembly."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaíonn sé cá gcuirtear pointe láraithe na bpatrún dromchla "
"uachtair/íochtair láraithe (Corda Airciméideacha, Bís Ochtagraim).\n"
" - Gach Dromchla: láraíonn sé an patrún ar gach réigiún dromchla aonair, mar "
"sin bíonn gach oileán siméadrach leis féin.\n"
" - Gach Samhail: láraíonn sé an patrún ar gach corp ceangailte. Roinneann "
"páirteanna a théann i dteagmháil lena chéile nó a fhorluíonn lár amháin; "
"faigheann páirteanna atá scartha ón gcuid eile a lár féin an ceann.\n"
" - Gach Cóimeáil: úsáideann sé lár comhroinnte amháin don réad nó don "
"chóimeáil ar fad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Each Surface"
msgstr "Gach Dromchla"

# AI Translated
msgid "Each Model"
msgstr "Gach Samhail"

# AI Translated
msgid "Each Assembly"
msgstr "Gach Cóimeáil"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the speed at which traveling is done."
msgstr "Seo é an luas a dhéantar taisteal air."

# AI Translated
msgid "Wipe while retracting"
msgstr "Glan agus é ag aistarraingt"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This moves the nozzle along the last extrusion path when retracting to clean "
"any leaked material on the nozzle. This can minimize blobs when printing a "
"new part after traveling."
msgstr ""
"Bogann sé seo an soc feadh na conaire easbhrúite deireanaí agus é ag "
"aistarraingt chun aon ábhar sceite ar an soc a ghlanadh. Is féidir leis seo "
"dabanna a íoslaghdú nuair a phriontáiltear páirt nua tar éis taistil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Wipe distance"
msgstr "Fad an ghlanta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Describe how long the nozzle will move along the last path when retracting.\n"
"\n"
"Depending on how long the wipe operation lasts, how fast and long the "
"extruder/filament retraction settings are, a retraction move may be needed "
"to retract the remaining filament.\n"
"\n"
"Setting a value in the retract amount before wipe setting below will perform "
"any excess retraction before the wipe, else it will be performed after."
msgstr ""
"Déan cur síos ar cé chomh fada a bhogfaidh an soc feadh na conaire deireanaí "
"agus é ag aistarraingt.\n"
"\n"
"Ag brath ar cé chomh fada a mhaireann an oibríocht ghlanta, agus cé chomh "
"tapa agus cé chomh fada atá socruithe aistarraingthe an easbhrúiteora/an "
"fhiliméid, d'fhéadfadh go mbeadh gluaiseacht aistarraingthe de dhíth chun an "
"filiméad atá fágtha a aistarraingt.\n"
"\n"
"Má shocraítear luach sa socrú 'méid aistarraingthe roimh ghlanadh' thíos, "
"déanfar aon aistarraingt bhreise roimh an nglanadh, nó déanfar ina dhiaidh é."

# AI Translated
msgid "Mixed color sublayer"
msgstr "Fo-shraith dathanna measctha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable mixed color sublayer splitting. When enabled, layers containing mixed "
"color filaments will be split into sub-layers to achieve color mixing "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh scoilteadh fo-shraitheanna dathanna measctha. Nuair atá sé "
"cumasaithe, scoiltfear sraitheanna ina bhfuil filiméid dathanna measctha ina "
"bhfo-shraitheanna chun éifeachtaí meascadh dathanna a bhaint amach."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The wiping tower can be used to clean up residue on the nozzle and stabilize "
"the chamber pressure inside the nozzle in order to avoid appearance defects "
"when printing objects."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an túr glanta a úsáid chun iarmhar ar an soc a ghlanadh agus an "
"brú taobh istigh den soc a chobhsú chun lochtanna cuma a sheachaint agus "
"réada á bpriontáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Internal ribs"
msgstr "Easnacha inmheánacha"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable internal ribs to increase the stability of the prime tower."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh easnacha inmheánacha chun cobhsaíocht an túir phríomhála a mhéadú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Purging volumes"
msgstr "Toirteanna sruthlaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Flush multiplier"
msgstr "Iolraitheoir sruthlaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The actual flushing volumes is equal to the flush multiplier value "
"multiplied by the flushing volumes in the table."
msgstr ""
"Is ionann na toirteanna sruthlaithe iarbhír agus luach an iolraitheora "
"sruthlaithe iolraithe faoi na toirteanna sruthlaithe sa tábla."

# AI Translated
msgid "Flush multiplier (Fast mode)"
msgstr "Iolraitheoir sruthlaithe (Mód tapa)"

# AI Translated
msgid "The flush multiplier used in fast purge mode."
msgstr "An t-iolraitheoir sruthlaithe a úsáidtear i mód sruthlaithe tapa."

# AI Translated
msgid "Prime volume"
msgstr "Toirt phríomhála"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the volume of material to prime the extruder with on the tower."
msgstr ""
"Seo é toirt an ábhair chun an t-easbhrúiteoir a phríomháil leis ar an túr."

# AI Translated
msgid "Prime volume mode"
msgstr "Mód toirte príomhála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Selects how the wipe-tower prime and flush volumes are computed on "
"multi-extruder printers."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaíonn sé conas a ríomhtar toirteanna príomhála agus sruthlaithe an túir "
"ghlanta ar phrintéirí ilsheasbhrúiteora."

# AI Translated
msgid "Saving"
msgstr "Spárálach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Tapa"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the width of prime towers."
msgstr "Seo é leithead na dtúr príomhála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Wipe tower rotation angle"
msgstr "Uillinn rothlaithe an túir ghlanta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Wipe tower rotation angle with respect to X axis."
msgstr "Uillinn rothlaithe an túir ghlanta i gcoibhneas le hais X."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Brim width of prime tower, negative number means auto calculated width based "
"on the height of prime tower."
msgstr ""
"Leithead imill an túir phríomhála; ciallaíonn uimhir dhiúltach leithead a "
"ríomhtar go huathoibríoch bunaithe ar airde an túir phríomhála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Stabilization cone apex angle"
msgstr "Uillinn rinn an chóin chobhsaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Angle at the apex of the cone that is used to stabilize the wipe tower. "
"Larger angle means wider base."
msgstr ""
"Uillinn ag rinn an chóin a úsáidtear chun an túr glanta a chobhsú. "
"Ciallaíonn uillinn níos mó bonn níos leithne."

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum wipe tower print speed"
msgstr "Uasluas priontála an túir ghlanta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The maximum print speed when purging in the wipe tower and printing the wipe "
"tower sparse layers. When purging, if the sparse infill speed or calculated "
"speed from the filament max volumetric speed is lower, the lowest will be "
"used instead.\n"
"\n"
"When printing the sparse layers, if the sparse infill speed or calculated "
"speed from the filament max volumetric speed is lower, the lowest will be "
"used instead.\n"
"\n"
"Increasing this speed may affect the tower's stability as well as increase "
"the force with which the nozzle collides with any blobs that may have formed "
"on the wipe tower.\n"
"\n"
"Before increasing this parameter beyond the default of 90 mm/s, make sure "
"your printer can reliably bridge at the increased speeds and that ooze when "
"tool changing is well controlled.\n"
"\n"
"For the wipe tower external perimeters the internal perimeter speed is used, "
"also limited by this setting."
msgstr ""
"An t-uasluas priontála agus sruthlú á dhéanamh sa túr glanta agus "
"sraitheanna tanaí an túir ghlanta á bpriontáil. Le linn sruthlaithe, má tá "
"luas an líonta thanaí nó an luas a ríomhtar ó uasluas toirtmhéadrach an "
"fhiliméid níos ísle, úsáidfear an ceann is ísle ina ionad.\n"
"\n"
"Agus na sraitheanna tanaí á bpriontáil, má tá luas an líonta thanaí nó an "
"luas a ríomhtar ó uasluas toirtmhéadrach an fhiliméid níos ísle, úsáidfear "
"an ceann is ísle ina ionad.\n"
"\n"
"D'fhéadfadh méadú an luais seo dul i bhfeidhm ar chobhsaíocht an túir agus "
"an fórsa lena mbuaileann an soc in aghaidh aon dabanna a d'fhéadfadh a "
"bheith cruthaithe ar an túr glanta a mhéadú.\n"
"\n"
"Sula méadaítear an paraiméadar seo thar an réamhshocrú 90 mm/s, déan cinnte "
"gur féidir le do phrintéir droichid a dhéanamh go hiontaofa ag na luasanna "
"méadaithe agus go bhfuil an t-úscadh le linn athrú uirlise faoi smacht "
"maith.\n"
"\n"
"Do imlínte seachtracha an túir ghlanta úsáidtear luas na himlíne inmheánaí, "
"teorannaithe ag an socrú seo freisin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Wall type"
msgstr "Cineál balla"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Wipe tower outer wall type.\n"
"1. Rectangle: A rectangle with fixed width and height.\n"
"2. Cone: A cone with a fillet at the bottom to help stabilize the wipe "
"tower.\n"
"3. Rib: The default wall type, which adds four ribs to the tower wall for "
"enhanced stability."
msgstr ""
"Cineál bhalla seachtrach an túir ghlanta.\n"
"1. Dronuilleog: Dronuilleog le leithead agus airde seasta.\n"
"2. Cón: Cón le filléad ag an mbun chun cabhrú leis an túr glanta a chobhsú.\n"
"3. Easna: An cineál balla réamhshocraithe, a chuireann ceithre easna le "
"balla an túir le haghaidh cobhsaíocht fheabhsaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Rectangle"
msgstr "Dronuilleog"

# AI Translated
msgid "Rib"
msgstr "Easna"

# AI Translated
msgid "Extra rib length"
msgstr "Fad easna breise"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Positive values can increase the size of the rib wall, while negative values "
"can reduce the size. However, the size of the rib wall can not be smaller "
"than that determined by the cleaning volume."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le luachanna dearfacha méid bhalla na n-easnacha a mhéadú, agus is "
"féidir le luachanna diúltacha an méid a laghdú. Mar sin féin, ní féidir le "
"méid bhalla na n-easnacha a bheith níos lú ná an méid a chinneann an toirt "
"ghlantacháin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Rib width"
msgstr "Leithead easna"

# AI Translated
msgid "Rib width is always less than half the prime tower side length."
msgstr ""
"Bíonn leithead na hEasna níos lú ná leath d'fhad taoibh an túir phríomhála i "
"gcónaí."

# AI Translated
msgid "Fillet wall"
msgstr "Balla filléid"

# AI Translated
msgid "The wall of prime tower will fillet."
msgstr "Beidh filléad ar bhalla an túir phríomhála."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The extruder to use when printing perimeter of the wipe tower. Set to 0 to "
"use the one that is available (non-soluble would be preferred)."
msgstr ""
"An t-easbhrúiteoir le húsáid agus imlíne an túir ghlanta á priontáil. "
"Socraigh go 0 chun an ceann atá ar fáil a úsáid (b'fhearr "
"neamh-intuaslagtha)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Purging volumes - load/unload volumes"
msgstr "Toirteanna sruthlaithe - toirteanna lódála/díluchtaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This vector saves required volumes to change from/to each tool used on the "
"wipe tower. These values are used to simplify creation of the full purging "
"volumes below."
msgstr ""
"Sábhálann an veicteoir seo na toirteanna riachtanacha chun athrú ó/go gach "
"uirlis a úsáidtear ar an túr glanta. Úsáidtear na luachanna seo chun cruthú "
"na dtoirteanna sruthlaithe iomlána thíos a shimpliú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Skip points"
msgstr "Scipeáil pointí"

# AI Translated
msgid "The wall of prime tower will skip the start points of wipe path."
msgstr ""
"Scipeálfaidh balla an túir phríomhála pointí tosaigh na conaire glanta."

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable tower interface features"
msgstr "Cumasaigh gnéithe chomhéadan an túir"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable optimized prime tower interface behavior when different materials "
"meet."
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh iompar optamaithe chomhéadan an túir phríomhála nuair a thagann "
"ábhair éagsúla le chéile."

# AI Translated
msgid "Cool down from interface boost during prime tower"
msgstr "Fuaraigh ó threisiú an chomhéadain le linn an túir phríomhála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When interface-layer temperature boost is active, set the nozzle back to "
"print temperature at the start of the prime tower so it cools down during "
"the tower."
msgstr ""
"Nuair atá treisiú teochta shraith an chomhéadain gníomhach, socraigh an soc "
"ar ais go teocht phriontála ag tús an túir phríomhála ionas go bhfuaraíonn "
"sé le linn an túir."

# AI Translated
msgid "Infill gap"
msgstr "Bearna líonta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Infill gap."
msgstr "Bearna líonta."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Purging after filament change will be done inside objects' infills. This may "
"lower the amount of waste and decrease the print time. If the walls are "
"printed with transparent filament, the mixed color infill will be visible. "
"It will not take effect unless the prime tower is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Déanfar sruthlú tar éis athrú filiméid taobh istigh de líonta na réad. "
"D'fhéadfadh sé seo méid na dramhaíola agus an t-am priontála a laghdú. Má "
"phriontáiltear na ballaí le filiméad trédhearcach, beidh an líonadh dathanna "
"measctha le feiceáil. Ní bheidh éifeacht leis mura bhfuil an túr príomhála "
"cumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Purging after filament change will be done inside objects' support. This may "
"lower the amount of waste and decrease the print time. It will not take "
"effect unless a prime tower is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Déanfar sruthlú tar éis athrú filiméid taobh istigh de thacaí na réad. "
"D'fhéadfadh sé seo méid na dramhaíola agus an t-am priontála a laghdú. Ní "
"bheidh éifeacht leis mura bhfuil túr príomhála cumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This object will be used to purge the nozzle after a filament change to save "
"filament and decrease the print time. Colors of the objects will be mixed as "
"a result. It will not take effect unless the prime tower is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidfear an réad seo chun an soc a shruthlú tar éis athrú filiméid chun "
"filiméad a shábháil agus an t-am priontála a laghdú. Measfar dathanna na "
"réad dá bharr. Ní bheidh éifeacht leis mura bhfuil an túr príomhála "
"cumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Belt purge tower object"
msgstr "Réad thúr sruthlaithe an chreasa"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Marks the auto-generated belt purge prism. Managed automatically; do not set "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"Marcálann sé priosma sruthlaithe an chreasa a ghintear go huathoibríoch. "
"Bainistithe go huathoibríoch; ná socraigh de láimh é."

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximal bridging distance"
msgstr "Uasfhad droichid"

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximal distance between supports on sparse infill sections."
msgstr "Uasfhad idir tacaí ar chodanna líonta thanaí."

# AI Translated
msgid "Wipe tower purge lines spacing"
msgstr "Spásáil línte sruthlaithe an túir ghlanta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Spacing of purge lines on the wipe tower."
msgstr "Spásáil na línte sruthlaithe ar an túr glanta."

# AI Translated
msgid "Extra flow for purging"
msgstr "Sreabhadh breise le haghaidh sruthlaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Extra flow used for the purging lines on the wipe tower. This makes the "
"purging lines thicker than they normally would be. The spacing is adjusted "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Sreabhadh breise a úsáidtear do na línte sruthlaithe ar an túr glanta. "
"Déanann sé seo na línte sruthlaithe níos tiubha ná mar a bheidís de ghnáth. "
"Coigeartaítear an spásáil go huathoibríoch."

# AI Translated
msgid "Idle temperature"
msgstr "Teocht dhíomhaoin"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Nozzle temperature when the tool is currently not used in multi-tool setups. "
"This is only used when 'Ooze prevention' is active in Print Settings. Set to "
"0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Teocht an tsoic nuair nach bhfuil an uirlis in úsáid faoi láthair i "
"socruithe iluirlise. Ní úsáidtear é seo ach nuair atá 'Cosc úscadh' "
"gníomhach i Socruithe Priontála. Socraigh go 0 chun é a dhíchumasú."

# AI Translated
msgid "X-Y hole compensation"
msgstr "Cúiteamh poll X-Y"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Holes in objects will expand or contract in the XY plane by the set value. "
"Positive values make holes bigger and negative values make holes smaller. "
"This function is used to adjust sizes slightly when objects have assembly "
"issues."
msgstr ""
"Leathnóidh nó crapfaidh poill i réada sa phlána XY de réir an luacha "
"shocraithe. Déanann luachanna dearfacha poill níos mó agus déanann luachanna "
"diúltacha poill níos lú. Úsáidtear an fheidhm seo chun méideanna a "
"choigeartú beagán nuair a bhíonn fadhbanna cóimeála ag réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "X-Y contour compensation"
msgstr "Cúiteamh comhrian X-Y"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Contours of objects will expand or contract in the XY plane by the set "
"value. Positive values make contours bigger and negative values make "
"contours smaller. This function is used to adjust sizes slightly when "
"objects have assembly issues."
msgstr ""
"Leathnóidh nó crapfaidh comhrianta réad sa phlána XY de réir an luacha "
"shocraithe. Déanann luachanna dearfacha comhrianta níos mó agus déanann "
"luachanna diúltacha comhrianta níos lú. Úsáidtear an fheidhm seo chun "
"méideanna a choigeartú beagán nuair a bhíonn fadhbanna cóimeála ag réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Convert holes to polyholes"
msgstr "Tiontaigh poill go polapholl"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Search for almost-circular holes that span more than one layer and convert "
"the geometry to polyholes. Use the nozzle size and the (biggest) diameter to "
"compute the polyhole.\n"
"See http://hydraraptor.blogspot.com/2011/02/polyholes.html"
msgstr ""
"Cuardaigh poill atá beagnach ciorclach a réisíonn níos mó ná sraith amháin "
"agus tiontaigh an chéimseata go polapholl. Úsáid méid an tsoic agus an "
"trastomhas (is mó) chun an polapholl a ríomh.\n"
"Féach http://hydraraptor.blogspot.com/2011/02/polyholes.html"

# AI Translated
msgid "Polyhole detection margin"
msgstr "Corrlach braite polaphoill"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"Maximum defection of a point to the estimated radius of the circle.\n"
"As cylinders are often exported as triangles of varying size, points may not "
"be on the circle circumference. This setting allows you some leeway to "
"broaden the detection.\n"
"In mm or in % of the radius."
msgstr ""
"Uasdiall pointe ó gha measta an chiorcail.\n"
"Ós rud é go n-easpórtáiltear sorcóirí go minic mar thriantáin de mhéideanna "
"éagsúla, b'fhéidir nach mbeidh pointí ar imlíne an chiorcail. Tugann an "
"socrú seo roinnt saoirse duit chun an brath a leathnú.\n"
"I mm nó i % den gha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Polyhole twist"
msgstr "Casadh polaphoill"

# AI Translated
msgid "Rotate the polyhole every layer."
msgstr "Rothlaigh an polapholl gach sraith."

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum Polyhole edge count"
msgstr "Uaslíon imill polaphoill"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Maximum number of polyhole edges\n"
"This setting limits the amount of edges a polyhole can have"
msgstr ""
"Uaslíon imill polaphoill\n"
"Teorannaíonn an socrú seo líon na n-imill is féidir a bheith ag polapholl"

# AI Translated
msgid "G-code thumbnails"
msgstr "Mionsamhlacha G-code"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Picture sizes to be stored into a .gcode and .sl1 / .sl1s files, in the "
"following format: \"XxY, XxY, ...\""
msgstr ""
"Méideanna pictiúr le stóráil i gcomhaid .gcode agus .sl1 / .sl1s, san "
"fhormáid seo a leanas: \"XxY, XxY, ...\""

# AI Translated
msgid "Format of G-code thumbnails"
msgstr "Formáid mionsamhlacha G-code"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Format of G-code thumbnails: PNG for best quality, JPG for smallest size, "
"QOI for low memory firmware."
msgstr ""
"Formáid mionsamhlacha G-code: PNG don cháilíocht is fearr, JPG don mhéid is "
"lú, QOI do dhochtearraí le cuimhne íseal."

# AI Translated
msgid "Use relative E distances"
msgstr "Úsáid faid choibhneasta E"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Relative extrusion is recommended when using \"label_objects\" option. Some "
"extruders work better with this option unchecked (absolute extrusion mode). "
"Wipe tower is only compatible with relative mode. It is recommended on most "
"printers. Default is checked."
msgstr ""
"Moltar easbhrú coibhneasta nuair a úsáidtear an rogha \"label_objects\". "
"Oibríonn roinnt easbhrúiteoirí níos fearr gan an rogha seo roghnaithe (mód "
"easbhrúite iomlán). Níl an túr glanta comhoiriúnach ach le mód coibhneasta. "
"Moltar é ar fhormhór na bprintéirí. Tá sé roghnaithe de réir réamhshocraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The classic wall generator produces walls with constant extrusion width and "
"for very thin areas, gap-fill is used. The Arachne engine produces walls "
"with variable extrusion width."
msgstr ""
"Táirgeann an gineadóir ballaí clasaiceach ballaí le leithead easbhrúite "
"tairiseach agus i gcás limistéar an-tanaí, úsáidtear líonadh bearnaí. "
"Táirgeann inneall Arachne ballaí le leithead easbhrúite athraitheach."

# AI Translated
msgid "Arachne"
msgstr "Arachne"

# AI Translated
msgid "Wall transition length"
msgstr "Fad trasdula balla"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When transitioning between different numbers of walls as the part becomes "
"thinner, a certain amount of space is allotted to split or join the wall "
"segments. It's expressed as a percentage over nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"Agus trasdul á dhéanamh idir líon éagsúil ballaí de réir mar a éiríonn an "
"pháirt níos tanaí, leithdháiltear méid áirithe spáis chun míreanna balla a "
"scoilteadh nó a cheangal. Léirítear é mar chéatadán de thrastomhas an tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid "Wall transitioning filter margin"
msgstr "Corrlach scagaire trasdula balla"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Prevent transitioning back and forth between one extra wall and one less. "
"This margin extends the range of extrusion widths which follow to [Minimum "
"wall width - margin, 2 * Minimum wall width + margin].\n"
"\n"
"Increasing this margin reduces the number of transitions, which reduces the "
"number of extrusion starts/stops and travel time. However, large extrusion "
"width variation can lead to under- or overextrusion problems.\n"
"\n"
"It's expressed as a percentage over nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"Cuir cosc ar thrasdul anonn is anall idir balla breise amháin agus balla "
"amháin níos lú. Leathnaíonn an corrlach seo raon na leithead easbhrúite a "
"leanann go [Íosleithead balla - corrlach, 2 * Íosleithead balla + "
"corrlach].\n"
"\n"
"Má mhéadaítear an corrlach seo laghdaítear líon na dtrasdulta, rud a "
"laghdaíonn líon na dtosaithe/stoptha easbhrúite agus an t-am taistil. Mar "
"sin féin, d'fhéadfadh athrú mór ar leithead easbhrúite fadhbanna tearc- nó "
"ró-easbhrú a chruthú.\n"
"\n"
"Léirítear é mar chéatadán de thrastomhas an tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid "Wall transitioning threshold angle"
msgstr "Uillinn tairsí trasdula balla"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When to create transitions between even and odd numbers of walls. A wedge "
"shape with an angle greater than this setting will not have transitions and "
"no walls will be printed in the center to fill the remaining space. Reducing "
"this setting reduces the number and length of these center walls, but may "
"leave gaps or overextrude."
msgstr ""
"Cathain is ceart trasdulta a chruthú idir líon corr agus réidh ballaí. Ní "
"bheidh trasdulta ag cruth dinge le huillinn níos mó ná an socrú seo agus ní "
"phriontálfar aon bhallaí sa lár chun an spás atá fágtha a líonadh. "
"Laghdaíonn laghdú an tsocraithe seo líon agus fad na mballaí láir seo, ach "
"d'fhéadfadh sé bearnaí a fhágáil nó ró-easbhrú a dhéanamh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Wall distribution count"
msgstr "Líon dáileacháin balla"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The number of walls, counted from the center, over which the variation needs "
"to be spread. Lower values mean that the outer walls don't change in width."
msgstr ""
"Líon na mballaí, comhairthe ón lár, ar a gcaithfear an t-athrú a leathadh. "
"Ciallaíonn luachanna níos ísle nach n-athraíonn leithead na mballaí "
"seachtracha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Minimum feature size"
msgstr "Íosmhéid gné"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Minimum thickness of thin features. Model features that are thinner than "
"this value will not be printed, while features thicker than than this value "
"will be widened to the minimum wall width. It's expressed as a percentage "
"over nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"Íostiús gnéithe tanaí. Ní phriontálfar gnéithe samhla atá níos tanaí ná an "
"luach seo, agus leathnófar gnéithe atá níos tiubha ná an luach seo go dtí an "
"t-íosleithead balla. Léirítear é mar chéatadán de thrastomhas an tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid "Minimum wall length"
msgstr "Íosfhad balla"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Adjust this value to prevent short, unclosed walls from being printed, which "
"could increase print time. The value is a multiple of the wall width. Higher "
"values remove more and longer walls.\n"
"\n"
"NOTE: Bottom and top surfaces will not be affected by this value to prevent "
"visual gaps on the outside of the model. Adjust 'One wall threshold' in the "
"'Walls and surfaces' settings below to adjust the sensitivity of what is "
"considered a top-surface. 'One wall threshold' is only visible if this "
"setting is set above the default value of 0.5, or if single-wall top "
"surfaces is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Coigeartaigh an luach seo chun cosc a chur ar bhallaí gearra neamhdhúnta a "
"phriontáil, rud a d'fhéadfadh an t-am priontála a mhéadú. Is iolraí de "
"leithead an bhalla an luach. Baineann luachanna níos airde níos mó ballaí "
"agus ballaí níos faide.\n"
"\n"
"NÓTA: Ní rachaidh an luach seo i bhfeidhm ar dhromchlaí íochtair agus "
"uachtair chun bearnaí infheicthe ar an taobh amuigh den tsamhail a chosc. "
"Coigeartaigh 'Tairseach balla amháin' sna socruithe 'Ballaí agus dromchlaí' "
"thíos chun íogaireacht an ruda a mheastar mar dhromchla uachtair a "
"choigeartú. Ní bhíonn 'Tairseach balla amháin' le feiceáil ach má "
"shocraítear an socrú seo os cionn an luacha réamhshocraithe 0.5, nó má tá "
"dromchlaí uachtair aon bhalla cumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum wall resolution"
msgstr "Uastaifeach balla"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This value determines the smallest wall line segment length in mm. The "
"smaller you set this value, the more accurate and precise the walls will be."
msgstr ""
"Cinneann an luach seo an fad míre líne balla is lú i mm. Dá lú a shocraíonn "
"tú an luach seo, is ea is cruinne agus is beaichte a bheidh na ballaí."

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum wall deviation"
msgstr "Uasdiall balla"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The maximum deviation allowed when reducing the resolution for the 'Maximum "
"wall resolution' setting. If you increase this, the print will be less "
"accurate, but the G-code will be smaller. 'Maximum wall deviation' limits "
"'Maximum wall resolution', so if the two conflict, 'Maximum wall deviation' "
"takes precedence."
msgstr ""
"An t-uasdiall a cheadaítear agus an taifeach á laghdú don socrú 'Uastaifeach "
"balla'. Má mhéadaíonn tú é seo, beidh an phriontáil níos lú cruinn, ach "
"beidh an G-code níos lú. Teorannaíonn 'Uasdiall balla' 'Uastaifeach balla', "
"mar sin má bhíonn coimhlint idir an dá cheann, tá tosaíocht ag 'Uasdiall "
"balla'."

# AI Translated
msgid "First layer minimum wall width"
msgstr "Íosleithead balla na chéad sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The minimum wall width that should be used for the first layer is "
"recommended to be set to the same size as the nozzle. This adjustment is "
"expected to enhance adhesion."
msgstr ""
"Moltar an t-íosleithead balla ba cheart a úsáid don chéad sraith a shocrú go "
"dtí an méid céanna leis an soc. Táthar ag súil go bhfeabhsóidh an coigeartú "
"seo an ghreamaitheacht."

# AI Translated
msgid "Minimum wall width"
msgstr "Íosleithead balla"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Width of the wall that will replace thin features (according to the Minimum "
"feature size) of the model. If the Minimum wall width is thinner than the "
"thickness of the feature, the wall will become as thick as the feature "
"itself. It's expressed as a percentage over nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"Leithead an bhalla a chuirfear in ionad gnéithe tanaí (de réir an Íosmhéid "
"gné) den tsamhail. Má tá an tÍosleithead balla níos tanaí ná tiús na gné, "
"beidh an balla chomh tiubh leis an ngné féin. Léirítear é mar chéatadán de "
"thrastomhas an tsoic."

# AI Translated
msgid "Hotend change time"
msgstr "Am athraithe an chinn te"

# AI Translated
msgid "Time to change hotend."
msgstr "Am chun an ceann te a athrú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Hotend change"
msgstr "Athrú cinn te"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When changing the hotend, it is recommended to extrude a certain length of "
"filament from the original nozzle. This helps minimize nozzle oozing."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a athraítear an ceann te, moltar fad áirithe filiméid a easbhrú ón soc "
"bunaidh. Cabhraíonn sé seo le húscadh an tsoic a íoslaghdú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Extruder change"
msgstr "Athrú easbhrúiteora"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"To prevent oozing, the nozzle will perform a reverse travel movement for a "
"certain period after the ramming is complete. The setting define the travel "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Chun úscadh a chosc, déanfaidh an soc gluaiseacht taistil droim ar ais ar "
"feadh tréimhse áirithe tar éis don ramáil a bheith críochnaithe. "
"Sainmhíníonn an socrú an t-am taistil."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"To prevent oozing, the nozzle temperature will be cooled during ramming. "
"Therefore, the ramming time must be greater than the cooldown time. 0 means "
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"Chun úscadh a chosc, fuarófar teocht an tsoic le linn ramála. Dá bhrí sin, "
"caithfidh am na ramála a bheith níos mó ná an t-am fuaraithe. Ciallaíonn 0 "
"díchumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The maximum volumetric speed for ramming before extruder change, where -1 "
"means using the maximum volumetric speed."
msgstr ""
"An t-uasluas toirtmhéadrach do ramáil roimh athrú easbhrúiteora, ina "
"gciallaíonn -1 an t-uasluas toirtmhéadrach a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"To prevent oozing, the nozzle temperature will be cooled during ramming. 0 "
"means disabled.\n"
"\n"
"Note: only a cooldown command and fan activation are triggered, reaching the "
"target temperature is not guaranteed."
msgstr ""
"Chun úscadh a chosc, fuarófar teocht an tsoic le linn ramála. Ciallaíonn 0 "
"díchumasaithe.\n"
"\n"
"Nóta: ní spreagtar ach ordú fuaraithe agus gníomhachtú gaothráin, ní "
"ráthaítear go sroichfear an sprioctheocht."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The maximum volumetric speed for ramming before a hotend change, where -1 "
"means using the maximum volumetric speed."
msgstr ""
"An t-uasluas toirtmhéadrach do ramáil roimh athrú cinn te, ina gciallaíonn "
"-1 an t-uasluas toirtmhéadrach a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "length when change hotend"
msgstr "fad nuair a athraítear an ceann te"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"When this retraction value is modified, it will be used as the amount of "
"filament retracted inside the hotend before changing hotends."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a mhionathraítear an luach aistarraingthe seo, úsáidfear é mar mhéid "
"an fhiliméid a aistarraingítear taobh istigh den cheann te sula n-athraítear "
"cinn te."

# AI Translated
