"The volume of material required to prime the extruder for a hotend change on "
"the tower."
msgstr ""
"Toirt an ábhair a theastaíonn chun an t-easbhrúiteoir a phríomháil le "
"haghaidh athrú cinn te ar an túr."

# AI Translated
