# AI Translated
msgid "Strict mode"
msgstr "Mód dian"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Exit non-zero when slicing raises a non-critical warning that is otherwise "
"only logged, such as a model that needs support while support is disabled. "
"Use this in CI or scripted pipelines that should never ship a subtly broken "
"slice. Each such warning is also listed with a stable class in the "
"`warnings` array of result.json, which is written on Linux only. Cannot be "
"combined with --no-check, which skips the support check."
msgstr ""
"Scoir le cód neamhnialasach nuair a thugann an slisniú rabhadh "
"neamhchriticiúil nach ndéantar ach é a logáil de ghnáth, mar shamhail a "
"dteastaíonn tacaí uaithi agus tacaí díchumasaithe. Úsáid é seo i bpíblínte "
"CI nó scripteáilte nár cheart dóibh slisniú atá briste go caolchúiseach a "
"sheachadadh riamh. Liostaítear gach rabhadh den sórt sin le haicme chobhsaí "
"freisin san eagar `warnings` de result.json, nach scríobhtar ach ar Linux. "
"Ní féidir é a chomhcheangal le --no-check, a scipeálann seiceáil na dtacaí."

# AI Translated
msgid "Normative check"
msgstr "Seiceáil normatach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Check the normative items."
msgstr "Seiceáil na míreanna normatacha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Output Model Info"
msgstr "Aschuir Faisnéis na Samhla"

# AI Translated
msgid "This outputs the model’s information."
msgstr "Aschuireann sé seo faisnéis na samhla."

# AI Translated
msgid "Inspect mesh (JSON to stdout)"
msgstr "Iniúch an mogalra (JSON chuig stdout)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Print a JSON summary of each loaded object to stdout, then exit: its "
"bounding boxes and the convex hull faces it can be laid on, with their "
"normals, areas and centers. These are the faces the --ground-* options "
"choose from. Machine-readable alternative to --info."
msgstr ""
"Priontáil achoimre JSON de gach réad lódáilte chuig stdout, ansin scoir: a "
"bhoscaí teorann agus aghaidheanna an chabhail dhronnaigh ar féidir é a "
"leagan orthu, lena normail, a n-achair agus a láir. Is iad seo na "
"haghaidheanna as a roghnaíonn na roghanna --ground-*. Rogha inléite ag "
"meaisín in ionad --info."

# AI Translated
msgid "Inspect paint (JSON to stdout)"
msgstr "Iniúch an phéint (JSON chuig stdout)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Print a structured JSON summary of every painted layer (supports, seam, MMU "
"color, fuzzy-skin) already stored on the loaded model — per-state facet "
"count, surface area, and mesh-local bounding box — then exit. "
"Machine-readable alternative to opening the paint gizmos in the GUI."
msgstr ""
"Priontáil achoimre struchtúrtha JSON de gach sraith phéinteáilte (tacaí, "
"uaim, dath MMU, craiceann clúmhach) atá stóráilte cheana ar an tsamhail "
"lódáilte — líon gnéithe, achar dromchla, agus bosca teorann áitiúil an "
"mhogalra in aghaidh na staide — ansin scoir. Rogha inléite ag meaisín in "
"ionad na ngiuirléidí péinteála a oscailt sa GUI."

# AI Translated
msgid "Export Settings"
msgstr "Easpórtáil Socruithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "This exports settings to a file. Use - to write them to stdout."
msgstr ""
"Easpórtálann sé seo socruithe chuig comhad. Úsáid - chun iad a scríobh chuig "
"stdout."

# AI Translated
