msgstr "Líon athdhéanta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Repetition count of the whole model."
msgstr "Líon athdhéanta na samhla ar fad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Ensure on bed"
msgstr "Cinntigh ar an leaba"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Lift the object above the bed when it is partially below. Disabled by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Ardaigh an réad os cionn na leapa nuair atá sé faoina bun go páirteach. "
"Díchumasaithe de réir réamhshocraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Arrange the supplied models in a plate and merge them in a single model in "
"order to perform actions once."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh na samhlacha a tugadh ar phláta agus cumaisc iad i samhail aonair "
"chun gníomhartha a dhéanamh uair amháin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Convert Unit"
msgstr "Tiontaigh an tAonad"

# AI Translated
msgid "Convert the units of model."
msgstr "Tiontaigh aonaid na samhla."

# AI Translated
msgid "Orient Options"
msgstr "Roghanna Treoshuímh"

# AI Translated
msgid "Orient options: 0-disable, 1-enable, others-auto"
msgstr "Roghanna treoshuímh: 0-díchumasaigh, 1-cumasaigh, eile-uath"

# AI Translated
msgid "Repair"
msgstr "Deisigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Repair the meshes of the models as Fix Model does: close holes and cracks, "
"orient them outward and remove self-intersections."
msgstr ""
"Deisigh mogalraí na samhlacha mar a dhéanann Deisigh an tSamhail: dún poill "
"agus scoilteanna, treoshuigh amach iad agus bain féintrasnuithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Rotation angle around the Z axis in degrees."
msgstr "Uillinn rothlaithe timpeall ais Z i gcéimeanna."

# AI Translated
msgid "Rotate around X"
msgstr "Rothlaigh timpeall X"

# AI Translated
msgid "Rotation angle around the X axis in degrees."
msgstr "Uillinn rothlaithe timpeall ais X i gcéimeanna."

# AI Translated
msgid "Rotate around Y"
msgstr "Rothlaigh timpeall Y"

# AI Translated
msgid "Rotation angle around the Y axis in degrees."
msgstr "Uillinn rothlaithe timpeall ais Y i gcéimeanna."

# AI Translated
msgid "Ground largest face"
msgstr "Leag ar an aghaidh is mó"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Lay each object on the largest face of its convex hull and drop it onto the "
"bed. Of equally large faces, the one already facing down is kept. Objects "
"without a face large enough to rest on are left as they are. Transforms run "
"in command-line order, so rotations given before this option are respected. "
"--orient 1 runs after all transforms and replaces the orientation."
msgstr ""
"Leag gach réad ar an aghaidh is mó dá chabhail dhronnach agus ísligh go dtí "
"an leaba é. As aghaidheanna atá chomh mór céanna, coinnítear an ceann atá ag "
"féachaint síos cheana. Fágtar réada gan aghaidh mór go leor le luí uirthi "
"mar atá siad. Ritheann trasfhoirmithe in ord na líne ordaithe, mar sin "
"urramaítear rothluithe a thugtar roimh an rogha seo. Ritheann --orient 1 tar "
"éis gach trasfhoirmithe agus cuireann sé treoshuíomh eile in ionad an chinn "
"reatha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Ground face by normal"
msgstr "Leag ar aghaidh de réir normail"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Lay each object on the convex hull face whose outward normal is closest to "
"the direction NX,NY,NZ and drop it onto the bed. The direction is in object "
"coordinates, which include the rotations given before this option and match "
"the plate axes unless the input file rotates the object. For example, 1,0,0 "
"stands the object on its +X side. --orient 1 runs after all transforms and "
"replaces the orientation."
msgstr ""
"Leag gach réad ar an aghaidh den chabhail dhronnach a bhfuil a normal amach "
"is gaire don treo NX,NY,NZ agus ísligh go dtí an leaba é. Tá an treo i "
"gcomhordanáidí an réada, a chuimsíonn na rothluithe a thugtar roimh an rogha "
"seo agus a mheaitseálann aiseanna an phláta mura rothlaíonn an comhad "
"ionchuir an réad. Mar shampla, seasann 1,0,0 an réad ar a thaobh +X. "
"Ritheann --orient 1 tar éis gach trasfhoirmithe agus cuireann sé treoshuíomh "
"eile in ionad an chinn reatha."

# AI Translated
msgid "Ground face at point"
msgstr "Leag ar aghaidh ag pointe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Lay each object on the convex hull face that contains the point X,Y,Z and "
"drop it onto the bed. The point is in object coordinates, which include the "
"rotations given before this option; --inspect-mesh reports face centers in "
"them. Objects without such a face are left as they are, and the run fails if "
"no object has one. --orient 1 runs after all transforms and replaces the "
"orientation."
msgstr ""
"Leag gach réad ar an aghaidh den chabhail dhronnach ina bhfuil an pointe "
"X,Y,Z agus ísligh go dtí an leaba é. Tá an pointe i gcomhordanáidí an réada, "
"a chuimsíonn na rothluithe a thugtar roimh an rogha seo; tuairiscíonn "
"--inspect-mesh láir na n-aghaidheanna iontu. Fágtar réada gan aghaidh den "
"sórt sin mar atá siad, agus teipeann ar an rith mura bhfuil ceann ag aon "
"réad. Ritheann --orient 1 tar éis gach trasfhoirmithe agus cuireann sé "
"treoshuíomh eile in ionad an chinn reatha."

# AI Translated
