msgstr "Ceadaigh 3MF le leagan níos nuaí a shlisniú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Current Z-hop"
msgstr "Ardú Z reatha"

# AI Translated
msgid "Contains Z-hop present at the beginning of the custom G-code block."
msgstr "Tá an t-ardú Z atá i láthair ag tús an bhloic G-code saincheaptha ann."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Position of the extruder at the beginning of the custom G-code block. If the "
"custom G-code travels somewhere else, it should write to this variable so "
"OrcaSlicer knows where it travels from when it gets control back."
msgstr ""
"Suíomh an easbhrúiteora ag tús an bhloic G-code saincheaptha. Má "
"thaistealaíonn an G-code saincheaptha áit éigin eile, ba cheart dó scríobh "
"chuig an athróg seo ionas go mbeidh a fhios ag OrcaSlicer cá as a "
"dtaistealaíonn sé nuair a fhaigheann sé smacht ar ais."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Retraction state at the beginning of the custom G-code block. If the custom "
"G-code moves the extruder axis, it should write to this variable so "
"OrcaSlicer de-retracts correctly when it gets control back."
msgstr ""
"Staid na haistarraingthe ag tús an bhloic G-code saincheaptha. Má bhogann an "
"G-code saincheaptha ais an easbhrúiteora, ba cheart dó scríobh chuig an "
"athróg seo ionas go ndéanfaidh OrcaSlicer dí-aistarraingt i gceart nuair a "
"fhaigheann sé smacht ar ais."

# AI Translated
msgid "Extra de-retraction"
msgstr "Dí-aistarraingt bhreise"

# AI Translated
msgid "Currently planned extra extruder priming after de-retraction."
msgstr ""
"Príomháil bhreise easbhrúiteora atá beartaithe faoi láthair tar éis "
"dí-aistarraingthe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Absolute E position"
msgstr "Suíomh iomlán E"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Current position of the extruder axis. Only used with absolute extruder "
"addressing."
msgstr ""
"Suíomh reatha ais an easbhrúiteora. Ní úsáidtear é ach le seoladh iomlán an "
"easbhrúiteora."

# AI Translated
msgid "Current extruder"
msgstr "Easbhrúiteoir reatha"

# AI Translated
msgid "Zero-based index of currently used extruder."
msgstr "Innéacs nialas-bhunaithe an easbhrúiteora atá in úsáid faoi láthair."

# AI Translated
msgid "Current object index"
msgstr "Innéacs an réada reatha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Specific for sequential printing. Zero-based index of currently printed "
"object."
msgstr ""
"Sonrach do phriontáil sheicheamhach. Innéacs nialas-bhunaithe an réada atá á "
"phriontáil faoi láthair."

# AI Translated
msgid "Has wipe tower"
msgstr "Tá túr glanta ann"

# AI Translated
msgid "Whether or not wipe tower is being generated in the print."
msgstr "Cé acu a bhfuil túr glanta á ghiniúint sa phriontáil nó nach bhfuil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Initial extruder"
msgstr "Easbhrúiteoir tosaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Zero-based index of the first extruder used in the print. Same as "
"initial_tool."
msgstr ""
"Innéacs nialas-bhunaithe an chéad easbhrúiteora a úsáidtear sa phriontáil. "
"Mar an gcéanna le initial_tool."

# AI Translated
msgid "Initial tool"
msgstr "Uirlis tosaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Zero-based index of the first extruder used in the print. Same as "
"initial_extruder."
msgstr ""
"Innéacs nialas-bhunaithe an chéad easbhrúiteora a úsáidtear sa phriontáil. "
"Mar an gcéanna le initial_extruder."

# AI Translated
msgid "Is extruder used?"
msgstr "An bhfuil an t-easbhrúiteoir in úsáid?"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Vector of booleans stating whether a given extruder is used in the print."
msgstr ""
"Veicteoir Boole a deir cé acu a úsáidtear easbhrúiteoir ar leith sa "
"phriontáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Number of extruders"
msgstr "Líon na n-easbhrúiteoirí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Total number of extruders, regardless of whether they are used in the "
"current print."
msgstr ""
"Líon iomlán na n-easbhrúiteoirí, is cuma an úsáidtear iad sa phriontáil "
"reatha nó nach n-úsáidtear."

# AI Translated
msgid "Has single extruder MM priming"
msgstr "Tá príomháil MM aon easbhrúiteora ann"

# AI Translated
msgid "Are the extra multi-material priming regions used in this print?"
msgstr ""
"An úsáidtear na réigiúin phríomhála ilábhair bhreise sa phriontáil seo?"

# AI Translated
msgid "Initial no support extruder"
msgstr "Easbhrúiteoir tosaigh gan taca"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Zero-based index of the first extruder used for printing without support. "
"Same as initial_no_support_tool."
msgstr ""
"Innéacs nialas-bhunaithe an chéad easbhrúiteora a úsáidtear le priontáil gan "
"tacaí. Mar an gcéanna le initial_no_support_tool."

# AI Translated
msgid "In head wrap detect zone"
msgstr "I gcrios braite fillte an chinn"

# AI Translated
msgid "Indicates if the first layer overlaps with the head wrap zone."
msgstr "Léiríonn sé an bhforluíonn an chéad sraith le crios fillte an chinn."

# AI Translated
msgid "Current bed type"
msgstr "Cineál leapa reatha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Name of the currently selected bed plate type (e.g. 'Textured PEI Plate', "
"'Smooth High Temp Plate')."
msgstr ""
"Ainm chineál pláta na leapa atá roghnaithe faoi láthair (m.sh. 'Textured PEI "
"Plate', 'Smooth High Temp Plate')."

# AI Translated
msgid "IDEX/IQEX active mode"
msgstr "Mód gníomhach IDEX/IQEX"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Name of the active IDEX/IQEX parallel print mode for this plate (e.g. "
"'primary', 'mirror', 'copy'). Empty string if IDEX/IQEX is not enabled."
msgstr ""
"Ainm an mhóid phriontála chomhthreomhair IDEX/IQEX ghníomhaigh don phláta "
"seo (m.sh. 'primary', 'mirror', 'copy'). Teaghrán folamh mura bhfuil "
"IDEX/IQEX cumasaithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "IDEX/IQEX active mode index"
msgstr "Innéacs an mhóid ghníomhaigh IDEX/IQEX"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Zero-based index of the active IDEX/IQEX parallel print mode within "
"imex_mode_names."
msgstr ""
"Innéacs nialas-bhunaithe an mhóid phriontála chomhthreomhair IDEX/IQEX "
"ghníomhaigh laistigh de imex_mode_names."

# AI Translated
msgid "IDEX/IQEX active mode G-code"
msgstr "G-code an mhóid ghníomhaigh IDEX/IQEX"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The raw mode G-code template for the active IDEX/IQEX parallel print mode, "
"after placeholder evaluation. Globals defined here flow into "
"machine_start_gcode."
msgstr ""
"Teimpléad amh G-code an mhóid don mhód priontála comhthreomhar IDEX/IQEX "
"gníomhach, tar éis luacháil na n-áitchoimeádaithe. Sreabhann athróga "
"comhchoiteanna a shainmhínítear anseo isteach i machine_start_gcode."

# AI Translated
msgid "Volume per extruder"
msgstr "Toirt in aghaidh an easbhrúiteora"

# AI Translated
msgid "Total filament volume extruded per extruder during the entire print."
msgstr ""
"Toirt iomlán an fhiliméid a easbhrúitear in aghaidh an easbhrúiteora le linn "
"na priontála ar fad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Total tool changes"
msgstr "Athruithe uirlise iomlána"

# AI Translated
msgid "Number of tool changes during the print."
msgstr "Líon na n-athruithe uirlise le linn na priontála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Total volume"
msgstr "Toirt iomlán"

# AI Translated
msgid "Total volume of filament used during the entire print."
msgstr "Toirt iomlán an fhiliméid a úsáidtear le linn na priontála ar fad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Weight per extruder"
msgstr "Meáchan in aghaidh an easbhrúiteora"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Weight per extruder extruded during the entire print. Calculated from "
"filament_density value in Filament Settings."
msgstr ""
"Meáchan easbhrúite in aghaidh an easbhrúiteora le linn na priontála ar fad. "
"Ríomhtha ó luach filament_density i Socruithe Filiméid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Total weight"
msgstr "Meáchan iomlán"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Total weight of the print. Calculated from filament_density value in "
"Filament Settings."
msgstr ""
"Meáchan iomlán na priontála. Ríomhtha ó luach filament_density i Socruithe "
"Filiméid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Total layer count"
msgstr "Líon iomlán sraitheanna"

# AI Translated
msgid "Number of layers in the entire print."
msgstr "Líon na sraitheanna sa phriontáil ar fad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Print time (normal mode)"
msgstr "Am priontála (gnáthmhód)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Estimated print time when printed in normal mode (i.e. not in silent mode). "
"Same as print_time."
msgstr ""
"Am priontála measta nuair a phriontáiltear i ngnáthmhód (i.e. ní i mód "
"ciúin). Mar an gcéanna le print_time."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Estimated print time when printed in normal mode (i.e. not in silent mode). "
"Same as normal_print_time."
msgstr ""
"Am priontála measta nuair a phriontáiltear i ngnáthmhód (i.e. ní i mód "
"ciúin). Mar an gcéanna le normal_print_time."

# AI Translated
msgid "Used filament types"
msgstr "Cineálacha filiméid a úsáideadh"

# AI Translated
msgid "Underscore-separated list of all filament types used during the print."
msgstr ""
"Liosta, scartha le fostríocanna, de na cineálacha filiméid go léir a "
"úsáideadh le linn na priontála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Print time (silent mode)"
msgstr "Am priontála (mód ciúin)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Estimated print time when printed in silent mode."
msgstr "Am priontála measta nuair a phriontáiltear i mód ciúin."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Total cost of all material used in the print. Calculated from filament_cost "
"value in Filament Settings."
msgstr ""
"Costas iomlán an ábhair go léir a úsáideadh sa phriontáil. Ríomhtha ó luach "
"filament_cost i Socruithe Filiméid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Total wipe tower cost"
msgstr "Costas iomlán an túir ghlanta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Total cost of the material wasted on the wipe tower. Calculated from "
"filament_cost value in Filament Settings."
msgstr ""
"Costas iomlán an ábhair a cuireadh amú ar an túr glanta. Ríomhtha ó luach "
"filament_cost i Socruithe Filiméid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Total wipe tower filament"
msgstr "Filiméad iomlán an túir ghlanta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Total length of filament used on the wipe tower, in mm."
msgstr "Fad iomlán an fhiliméid a úsáideadh ar an túr glanta, i mm."

# AI Translated
msgid "Used filament"
msgstr "Filiméad úsáidte"

# AI Translated
msgid "Total length of filament used in the print."
msgstr "Fad iomlán an fhiliméid a úsáideadh sa phriontáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Print time (total seconds)"
msgstr "Am priontála (soicindí iomlána)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Total estimated print time in seconds. Replaced with actual value during "
"post-processing."
msgstr ""
"Am priontála measta iomlán i soicindí. Cuirtear an luach iarbhír ina ionad "
"le linn iarphróiseála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Print time (days component)"
msgstr "Am priontála (comhpháirt laethanta)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Estimated print time day component (normal mode). Replaced with actual value "
"during post-processing."
msgstr ""
"Comhpháirt laethanta an ama priontála measta (gnáthmhód). Cuirtear an luach "
"iarbhír ina ionad le linn iarphróiseála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Print time (hours component)"
msgstr "Am priontála (comhpháirt uaireanta)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Estimated print time hour component (normal mode). Replaced with actual "
"value during post-processing."
msgstr ""
"Comhpháirt uaireanta an ama priontála measta (gnáthmhód). Cuirtear an luach "
"iarbhír ina ionad le linn iarphróiseála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Print time (minutes component)"
msgstr "Am priontála (comhpháirt nóiméad)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Estimated print time minute component (normal mode). Replaced with actual "
"value during post-processing."
msgstr ""
"Comhpháirt nóiméad an ama priontála measta (gnáthmhód). Cuirtear an luach "
"iarbhír ina ionad le linn iarphróiseála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Print time (seconds component)"
msgstr "Am priontála (comhpháirt soicindí)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Estimated print time second component (normal mode). Replaced with actual "
"value during post-processing."
msgstr ""
"Comhpháirt soicindí an ama priontála measta (gnáthmhód). Cuirtear an luach "
"iarbhír ina ionad le linn iarphróiseála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament length (meters)"
msgstr "Fad an fhiliméid (méadair)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Total filament length used in meters. Replaced with actual value during "
"post-processing."
msgstr ""
"Fad iomlán an fhiliméid a úsáideadh i méadair. Cuirtear an luach iarbhír ina "
"ionad le linn iarphróiseála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Number of objects"
msgstr "Líon na réad"

# AI Translated
msgid "Total number of objects in the print."
msgstr "Líon iomlán na réad sa phriontáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Number of instances"
msgstr "Líon na gcásanna"

# AI Translated
msgid "Total number of object instances in the print, summed over all objects."
msgstr "Líon iomlán chásanna na réad sa phriontáil, suimithe thar gach réad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Scale per object"
msgstr "Scála in aghaidh an réada"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Contains a string with the information about what scaling was applied to the "
"individual objects. Indexing of the objects is zero-based (first object has "
"index 0).\n"
"Example: 'x:100% y:50% z:100%'."
msgstr ""
"Tá teaghrán ann leis an bhfaisnéis faoin scálú a cuireadh i bhfeidhm ar na "
"réada aonair. Tá innéacsú na réad nialas-bhunaithe (tá innéacs 0 ag an gcéad "
"réad).\n"
"Sampla: 'x:100% y:50% z:100%'."

# AI Translated
msgid "Input filename without extension"
msgstr "Ainm comhaid ionchuir gan iarmhír"

# AI Translated
msgid "Source filename of the first object, without extension."
msgstr "Ainm comhaid foinse an chéad réada, gan iarmhír."

# AI Translated
msgid "Full input filename"
msgstr "Ainm comhaid ionchuir iomlán"

# AI Translated
msgid "Source filename of the first object."
msgstr "Ainm comhaid foinse an chéad réada."

# AI Translated
msgid "Name of the plate sliced."
msgstr "Ainm an phláta a slisníodh."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The vector has two elements: X and Y coordinate of the point. Values in mm."
msgstr ""
"Tá dhá eilimint sa veicteoir: comhordanáid X agus Y an phointe. Luachanna i "
"mm."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The vector has two elements: X and Y dimension of the bounding box. Values "
"in mm."
msgstr ""
"Tá dhá eilimint sa veicteoir: toise X agus Y an bhosca teorann. Luachanna i "
"mm."

# AI Translated
msgid "First layer convex hull"
msgstr "Cabhail dhronnach na chéad sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Vector of points of the first layer convex hull. Each element has the "
"following format:'[x, y]' (x and y are floating-point numbers in mm)."
msgstr ""
"Veicteoir pointí de chabhail dhronnach na chéad sraithe. Tá an fhormáid seo "
"a leanas ag gach eilimint:'[x, y]' (is uimhreacha snámhphointe i mm iad x "
"agus y)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bottom-left corner of the first layer bounding box"
msgstr "Cúinne íochtair ar chlé de bhosca teorann na chéad sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Top-right corner of the first layer bounding box"
msgstr "Cúinne uachtair ar dheis de bhosca teorann na chéad sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Size of the first layer bounding box"
msgstr "Méid bhosca teorann na chéad sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Bottom-left corner of print bed bounding box"
msgstr "Cúinne íochtair ar chlé de bhosca teorann leaba an phrintéara"

# AI Translated
msgid "Top-right corner of print bed bounding box"
msgstr "Cúinne uachtair ar dheis de bhosca teorann leaba an phrintéara"

# AI Translated
msgid "Size of the print bed bounding box"
msgstr "Méid bhosca teorann leaba an phrintéara"

# AI Translated
msgid "First layer center without wipe tower"
msgstr "Lár na chéad sraithe gan an túr glanta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Height of the first layer."
msgstr "Airde na chéad sraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Vector of bed temperatures for each extruder/filament."
msgstr "Veicteoir teochtaí leapa do gach easbhrúiteoir/filiméad."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Vector of first layer bed temperatures for each extruder/filament. Provides "
"the same value as first_layer_bed_temperature."
msgstr ""
"Veicteoir teochtaí leapa na chéad sraithe do gach easbhrúiteoir/filiméad. "
"Tugann sé an luach céanna le first_layer_bed_temperature."

# AI Translated
msgid "First layer bed temperature (initial extruder)"
msgstr "Teocht leapa na chéad sraithe (easbhrúiteoir tosaigh)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"First layer bed temperature for the initial extruder. Same as "
"bed_temperature_initial_layer[initial_extruder]"
msgstr ""
"Teocht leapa na chéad sraithe don easbhrúiteoir tosaigh. Mar an gcéanna le "
"bed_temperature_initial_layer[initial_extruder]"

# AI Translated
msgid "Vector of chamber temperatures for each extruder/filament."
msgstr "Veicteoir teochtaí seomra do gach easbhrúiteoir/filiméad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Vector of minimal chamber temperatures for each extruder/filament."
msgstr "Veicteoir íosteochtaí seomra do gach easbhrúiteoir/filiméad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Overall chamber temperature"
msgstr "Teocht fhoriomlán an tseomra"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Overall chamber temperature. This value is the maximum chamber temperature "
"of any extruder/filament used."
msgstr ""
"Teocht fhoriomlán an tseomra. Is é an luach seo uasteocht seomra aon "
"easbhrúiteora/filiméid a úsáidtear."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Vector of first layer bed temperatures for each extruder/filament. Provides "
"the same value as bed_temperature_initial_layer."
msgstr ""
"Veicteoir teochtaí leapa na chéad sraithe do gach easbhrúiteoir/filiméad. "
"Tugann sé an luach céanna le bed_temperature_initial_layer."

# AI Translated
msgid "First layer temperature"
msgstr "Teocht na chéad sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Vector of first layer temperatures for each extruder/filament."
msgstr "Veicteoir teochtaí na chéad sraithe do gach easbhrúiteoir/filiméad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Timestamp"
msgstr "Stampa ama"

# AI Translated
msgid "String containing current time in yyyyMMdd-hhmmss format."
msgstr "Teaghrán ina bhfuil an t-am reatha i bhformáid yyyyMMdd-hhmmss."

# AI Translated
msgid "Day"
msgstr "Lá"

# AI Translated
msgid "Hour"
msgstr "Uair"

# AI Translated
msgid "Minute"
msgstr "Nóiméad"

# AI Translated
msgid "Second"
msgstr "Soicind"

# AI Translated
msgid "Print preset name"
msgstr "Ainm réamhshocrú na priontála"

# AI Translated
msgid "Name of the print preset used for slicing."
msgstr "Ainm réamhshocrú na priontála a úsáideadh don slisniú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament preset name"
msgstr "Ainm réamhshocrú an fhiliméid"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Names of the filament presets used for slicing. The variable is a vector "
"containing one name for each extruder."
msgstr ""
"Ainmneacha réamhshocruithe na bhfiliméad a úsáideadh don slisniú. Is "
"veicteoir í an athróg ina bhfuil ainm amháin do gach easbhrúiteoir."

# AI Translated
msgid "Printer preset name"
msgstr "Ainm réamhshocrú an phrintéara"

# AI Translated
msgid "Name of the printer preset used for slicing."
msgstr "Ainm réamhshocrú an phrintéara a úsáideadh don slisniú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Physical printer name"
msgstr "Ainm an phrintéara fhisiciúil"

# AI Translated
msgid "Name of the physical printer used for slicing."
msgstr "Ainm an phrintéara fhisiciúil a úsáideadh don slisniú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Layer number"
msgstr "Uimhir na sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Index of the current layer. The index is zero-based (first layer has index "
"0). Before the first layer starts, it is -1. In extrusion role change "
"G-code, the index is one-based (first layer has index 1)."
msgstr ""
"Innéacs na sraithe reatha. Tá an t-innéacs nialas-bhunaithe (tá innéacs 0 ag "
"an gcéad sraith). Sula dtosaíonn an chéad sraith, is é -1 é. I G-code "
"athraithe róil easbhrúite, tá an t-innéacs aon-bhunaithe (tá innéacs 1 ag an "
"gcéad sraith)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Layer Z"
msgstr "Z na sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Height of the current layer above the print bed, measured to the top of the "
"layer."
msgstr ""
"Airde na sraithe reatha os cionn leaba an phrintéara, tomhaiste go barr na "
"sraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximal layer Z"
msgstr "Uas-Z sraithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Height of the last layer above the print bed."
msgstr "Airde na sraithe deireanaí os cionn leaba an phrintéara."

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament extruder ID"
msgstr "Aitheantas easbhrúiteora an fhiliméid"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"In filament start G-code, the index of the filament that is being loaded. In "
"filament end G-code, the index of the filament that is being unloaded. The "
"index is zero-based (first filament has index 0). At a tool change, filament "
"end G-code gets the extruder index instead, unless the Type 1 wipe tower "
"does the tool change. Machine end G-code gets the value from the last "
"filament end G-code at the end of the print."
msgstr ""
"I G-code tosaithe an fhiliméid, innéacs an fhiliméid atá á lódáil. I G-code "
"deiridh an fhiliméid, innéacs an fhiliméid atá á dhíluchtú. Tá an t-innéacs "
"nialas-bhunaithe (tá innéacs 0 ag an gcéad fhiliméad). Ag athrú uirlise, "
"faigheann G-code deiridh an fhiliméid innéacs an easbhrúiteora ina ionad, "
"mura ndéanann an túr glanta Cineál 1 an t-athrú uirlise. Faigheann G-code "
"deiridh an mheaisín an luach ón G-code deiridh filiméid deireanach ag "
"deireadh na priontála."

# AI Translated
msgid "Current filament ID"
msgstr "Aitheantas an fhiliméid reatha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Index of the currently active filament. The index is zero-based (first "
"filament has index 0)."
msgstr ""
