# AI Translated
msgid "Opens OrcaCloud in the Home page to browse for plugins."
msgstr ""
"Osclaíonn sé OrcaCloud sa leathanach Baile chun breiseáin a bhrabhsáil."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Import your own image as a height map. It is converted to the format the "
"slicer bakes from and saved to your personal texture folder, kept separate "
"from the textures shipped with OrcaSlicer."
msgstr ""
"Iompórtáil d'íomhá féin mar léarscáil airde. Tiontaítear í go dtí an "
"fhormáid óna mbácálann an slisneoir agus sábháiltear í i d'fhillteán "
"uigeachtaí pearsanta, ar leithligh ó na huigeachtaí a sheoltar le OrcaSlicer."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"PNG, JPG or BMP - converted to a height map on import. Hover one of yours to "
"remove it."
msgstr ""
"PNG, JPG nó BMP - tiontaithe go léarscáil airde ar iompórtáil. Cuir an luch "
"ar cheann de do chuid féin chun é a bhaint."

# AI Translated
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"Remove \"%s\" from My textures?\n"
"\n"
"The image file is deleted from your texture folder. Layers already using it "
"keep it."
msgstr ""
"An mbainfear \"%s\" ó Mo uigeachtaí?\n"
"\n"
"Scriostar an comhad íomhá ó d'fhillteán uigeachtaí. Coinníonn sraitheanna "
"atá á úsáid cheana é."

# AI Translated
msgid "Remove texture"
msgstr "Bain an uigeacht"

# AI Translated
msgid "Adjust image"
msgstr "Coigeartaigh an íomhá"

# AI Translated
msgid "Brightness"
msgstr "Gile"

# AI Translated
msgid "Contrast"
msgstr "Codarsnacht"

# AI Translated
msgid "Sharpness"
msgstr "Géire"

# AI Translated
msgid "Blur"
msgstr "Doiléiriú"

# AI Translated
msgid "Hue"
msgstr "Lí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Brings out the finest detail in the image. Applied after Blur, so the two "
"can be used together: blur away the speckle, then sharpen the edges that "
"remain."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé amach na mionsonraí is míne san íomhá. Cuirtear i bhfeidhm é tar "
"éis Doiléiriú, mar sin is féidir an dá cheann a úsáid le chéile: doiléirigh "
"an brachán, ansin géaraigh na himill atá fágtha."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Blurs the image itself. The layer's own Smoothing slider softens the relief "
"without altering the image, and is the one to reach for first."
msgstr ""
"Doiléiríonn sé an íomhá féin. Maolaíonn sleamhnán Mínithe na sraithe féin an "
"faoiseamh gan an íomhá a athrú, agus is é sin an ceann le húsáid ar dtús."

# AI Translated
msgid "This texture is grayscale, so it has no hue to shift."
msgstr "Is uigeacht liathscála í seo, mar sin níl aon lí aici le bogadh."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The model updates when you release a slider. Save as copy writes the "
"adjusted image to your texture library and points this layer at it."
msgstr ""
"Nuashonraítear an tsamhail nuair a scaoileann tú sleamhnán. Scríobhann "
"Sábháil mar chóip an íomhá choigeartaithe chuig do leabharlann uigeachtaí "
"agus díríonn sé an tsraith seo uirthi."

# AI Translated
msgid "Save as copy"
msgstr "Sábháil mar chóip"

# AI Translated
msgid "Remove texture displacement layer"
msgstr "Bain sraith díláithrithe uigeachta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Reorder texture displacement layers"
msgstr "Athordaigh sraitheanna díláithrithe uigeachta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Select visible faces for texture displacement"
msgstr "Roghnaigh aghaidheanna infheicthe le haghaidh díláithriú uigeachta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Select whole model for texture displacement"
msgstr "Roghnaigh an tsamhail ar fad le haghaidh díláithriú uigeachta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Subdivide model for texture displacement"
msgstr "Foroinn an tsamhail le haghaidh díláithriú uigeachta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Paint the area you want to subdivide first - adaptive subdivision only "
"refines where you have painted."
msgstr ""
"Péinteáil an limistéar is mian leat a fhoroinnt ar dtús - ní "
"mhionchoigeartaíonn foroinnt oiriúnaitheach ach san áit ar phéinteáil tú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Adaptive subdivide for texture displacement"
msgstr "Foroinnt oiriúnaitheach le haghaidh díláithriú uigeachta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Nothing to subdivide - the painted area already meets the target edge length "
"and detail tolerance, or the triangle budget is already used up."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon rud le foroinnt - comhlíonann an limistéar péinteáilte fad an imill "
"sprice agus lamháltas na mionsonraí cheana, nó tá buiséad na dtriantán "
"úsáidte cheana."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Paint the area you want to smooth first - smoothing only touches the painted "
"part of the model."
msgstr ""
"Péinteáil an limistéar is mian leat a mhíniú ar dtús - ní théann mínú ach i "
"bhfeidhm ar an gcuid phéinteáilte den tsamhail."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Nothing to smooth - the painted area is only one triangle deep, so with "
"\"Ignore outer ring\" on there are no interior vertices to relax."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon rud le míniú - níl an limistéar péinteáilte ach triantán amháin ar "
"doimhneacht, mar sin le \"Déan neamhaird den fháinne seachtrach\" ar siúl "
"níl aon rinn inmheánacha le scaoileadh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Smooth texture displacement"
msgstr "Mínigh an díláithriú uigeachta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Remesh model for texture displacement"
msgstr "Athmhogalraigh an tsamhail le haghaidh díláithriú uigeachta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Remeshing did not change the model. It may be non-manifold (open edges or "
"edges shared by more than two triangles), or the target edge length may "
"already be met."
msgstr ""
"Níor athraigh an t-athmhogalrú an tsamhail. D'fhéadfadh sí a bheith "
"neamhiomadúil (imill oscailte nó imill roinnte ag níos mó ná dhá thriantán), "
"nó d'fhéadfadh fad an imill sprice a bheith comhlíonta cheana."

# AI Translated
msgid "Nothing is painted, there is nothing to bake."
msgstr "Níl aon rud péinteáilte, níl aon rud le bácáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bake texture displacement"
msgstr "Bácáil an díláithriú uigeachta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Nothing is painted, so there are no bake stages to capture."
msgstr "Níl aon rud péinteáilte, mar sin níl aon chéimeanna bácála le gabháil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Bake stages (debug)"
msgstr "Céimeanna bácála (dífhabhtú)"

# AI Translated
msgid "Capturing..."
msgstr "Á ghabháil..."

# AI Translated
msgid "Capture stages"
msgstr "Gabh céimeanna"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Run the same bake the Bake button runs, keeping the mesh after every stage, "
"and step through them here. Nothing is committed to the model - this is for "
"finding which stage a bad result came from."
msgstr ""
"Rith an bácáil chéanna a ritheann an cnaipe Bácáil, ag coinneáil an mhogalra "
"tar éis gach céime, agus céimnigh tríothu anseo. Ní thiomnaítear aon rud don "
"tsamhail - is chun a fháil amach cén chéim ar tháinig droch-thoradh aisti é "
"seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Check topology"
msgstr "Seiceáil an topeolaíocht"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Count open and non-manifold edges after each stage, which is how a stage "
"that tore the mesh is spotted. It scans every edge, so it adds noticeably to "
"the capture on a fine bake."
msgstr ""
"Comhair imill oscailte agus neamhiomadúla tar éis gach céime, rud a léiríonn "
"céim a stróic an mogalra. Scanann sé gach imeall, mar sin cuireann sé go "
"suntasach leis an ngabháil ar bhácáil mhín."

