msgstr "Imill oscailte"

# AI Translated
msgid "Non-manifold"
msgstr "Neamhiomadúil"

# AI Translated
msgid "Degenerate"
msgstr "Díghinte"

# AI Translated
msgid "Write stage meshes"
msgstr "Scríobh mogalraí na gcéimeanna"

# AI Translated
msgid "Wrote the stage meshes as OBJ files to:"
msgstr "Scríobhadh mogalraí na gcéimeanna mar chomhaid OBJ chuig:"

# AI Translated
msgid "Could not write the stage meshes."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir mogalraí na gcéimeanna a scríobh."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Write every captured stage out as an OBJ file, so they can be opened side by "
"side in a mesh viewer."
msgstr ""
"Scríobh gach céim a gabhadh amach mar chomhad OBJ, ionas gur féidir iad a "
"oscailt taobh le taobh in amharcóir mogalra."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The painted area could not be carried onto the remeshed model, so nothing "
"was changed. Switch to Pro mode and remesh before painting."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir an limistéar péinteáilte a iompar ar an tsamhail "
"athmhogalraithe, mar sin níor athraíodh aon rud. Athraigh go mód Pro agus "
"athmhogalraigh roimh phéinteáil."

# AI Translated
#, possible-boost-format
msgid "Range: %1% to %2%"
msgstr "Raon: %1% go %2%"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Type a value instead of dragging. Ctrl+click on the slider does the same."
msgstr ""
"Clóscríobh luach in ionad tarraingthe. Déanann Ctrl+cliceáil ar an sleamhnán "
"an rud céanna."

# AI Translated
msgid "Pro"
msgstr "Pro"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Standard - pick a texture, paint where it goes, press Bake. Everything the "
"mesh needs is done for you in that one step."
msgstr ""
"Caighdeánach - pioc uigeacht, péinteáil an áit a dtéann sí, brúigh Bácáil. "
"Déantar gach rud a theastaíonn ón mogalra duit sa chéim aonair sin."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Pro - the mesh preparation is yours to run: Remesh, Subdivide and Bake as "
"separate steps, with every setting on show. For when Standard's result is "
"not what you wanted and you know why."
msgstr ""
"Pro - is fútsa ullmhúchán an mhogalra a rith: Athmhogalraigh, Foroinn agus "
"Bácáil mar chéimeanna ar leith, le gach socrú le feiceáil. Le haghaidh nuair "
"nach é toradh an Chaighdeánaigh an rud a bhí uait agus go bhfuil a fhios "
"agat cén fáth."

# AI Translated
msgid "Dock panel"
msgstr "Duigeáil an painéal"

# AI Translated
msgid "Undock panel"
msgstr "Díduigeáil an painéal"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Detach this panel so it can be dragged anywhere over the 3D view, or dock it "
"back beside the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Scar an painéal seo ionas gur féidir é a tharraingt áit ar bith thar an "
"amharc 3T, nó duigeáil ar ais é in aice leis an mbarra uirlisí."

# AI Translated
#, possible-boost-format
msgid "into %1%"
msgstr "isteach i %1%"

# AI Translated
msgid "add a layer to paint"
msgstr "cuir sraith leis le péinteáil"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Paint - add the active layer where you click or drag. The right button "
"erases, and so does holding Shift."
msgstr ""
"Péinteáil - cuir an tsraith ghníomhach leis san áit a gcliceálann nó a "
"dtarraingíonn tú. Glanann an cnaipe deas, agus mar an gcéanna Shift a "
"choinneáil síos."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Erase - remove the active layer where you click or drag. The right button "
"paints."
msgstr ""
"Glan - bain an tsraith ghníomhach san áit a gcliceálann nó a dtarraingíonn "
"tú. Péinteálann an cnaipe deas."

# AI Translated
msgid "Brush - paint over the surface by dragging"
msgstr "Scuab - péinteáil thar an dromchla trí tharraingt"

# AI Translated
msgid "Face - click individual triangles"
msgstr "Aghaidh - cliceáil ar thriantáin aonair"

# AI Translated
msgid "Connected area"
msgstr "Limistéar ceangailte"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Connected area - flood-fill the region reachable without crossing an edge "
"sharper than the angle threshold"
msgstr ""
"Limistéar ceangailte - tuilelíon an réigiún is féidir a bhaint amach gan "
"imeall níos géire ná tairseach na huillinne a thrasnú"

# AI Translated
msgid "Wait for the bake to finish."
msgstr "Fan go gcríochnóidh an bácáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Add a layer first."
msgstr "Cuir sraith leis ar dtús."

# AI Translated
msgid "The active layer has no paint yet."
msgstr "Níl aon phéint ar an tsraith ghníomhach fós."

# AI Translated
msgid "Select whole model"
msgstr "Roghnaigh an tsamhail ar fad"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Select whole model - paint every face of the model with the active layer"
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh an tsamhail ar fad - péinteáil gach aghaidh den tsamhail leis an "
"tsraith ghníomhach"

# AI Translated
msgid "Erase whole model"
msgstr "Glan an tsamhail ar fad"

# AI Translated
msgid "Erase whole model - clear the active layer's paint from every face"
msgstr ""
"Glan an tsamhail ar fad - glan péint na sraithe gníomhaí ó gach aghaidh"

# AI Translated
msgid "Reset texture displacement selection"
msgstr "Athshocraigh roghnú an díláithrithe uigeachta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Circle - paints everything under the brush as seen from the camera"
msgstr ""
"Ciorcal - péinteálann sé gach rud faoin scuab mar a fheictear ón gceamara"

# AI Translated
msgid "Sphere - paints only within a ball around the point under the cursor"
msgstr ""
"Sféar - ní phéinteálann sé ach laistigh de liathróid timpeall an phointe "
"faoin gcúrsóir"

# AI Translated
msgid "Angle threshold - the fill stops at edges sharper than this"
msgstr "Tairseach uillinne - stopann an líonadh ag imill níos géire ná seo"

# AI Translated
msgid "Click a triangle to paint it"
msgstr "Cliceáil ar thriantán chun é a phéinteáil"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Only for a layer mapped with Unwrap (LSCM) - set the active layer's Mapping "
"to Unwrap to use this view."
msgstr ""
"Do shraith mapáilte le Unwrap (LSCM) amháin - socraigh Mapáil na sraithe "
"gníomhaí go Unwrap chun an t-amharc seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Normal - the real geometry, exactly what Bake will produce. Slower to update"
msgstr ""
"Gnáth - an fhíorchéimseata, díreach an rud a tháirgfidh Bácáil. Níos moille "
"le nuashonrú"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Fast - the relief is only shaded on, not built, and only for the layer you "
"are editing. Updates instantly while you paint"
msgstr ""
"Tapa - ní dhéantar ach an faoiseamh a scáthú air, ní thógtar é, agus don "
"tsraith atá á cur in eagar agat amháin. Nuashonraíonn sé láithreach agus tú "
"ag péinteáil"

# AI Translated
msgid "Checker"
msgstr "Seiceálaí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Checker - a test grid instead of the texture. Where the squares stay square "
"the texture is undistorted; where they stretch, it will too. Opens the UV "
"editor if it is closed"
msgstr ""
"Seiceálaí - greille tástála in ionad na huigeachta. San áit a bhfanann na "
"cearnóga cearnach níl an uigeacht saofa; san áit a síneann siad, sínfidh sí "
"freisin. Osclaíonn sé an t-eagarthóir UV má tá sé dúnta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Distortion"
msgstr "Saobhadh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Distortion - blue-to-red stretch heatmap over the unwrap. Opens the UV "
"editor if it is closed"
msgstr ""
"Saobhadh - léarscáil teasa síneadh ó ghorm go dearg thar an dífhilleadh. "
"Osclaíonn sé an t-eagarthóir UV má tá sé dúnta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Wireframe - overlay the mesh edges; independent of the view above"
msgstr ""
"Sreangfhráma - forleag imill an mhogalra; neamhspleách ar an amharc thuas"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Rebuilds the preview as soon as anything changes. Turn it off on a heavy "
"model if painting or dragging a slider starts to stutter - the preview then "
"waits until you let go."
msgstr ""
"Atógann sé an réamhamharc a luaithe a athraíonn aon rud. Múch é ar shamhail "
"throm má thosaíonn péinteáil nó tarraingt sleamhnáin ag stadaireacht - "
"fanann an réamhamharc ansin go scaoileann tú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Texture layers"
msgstr "Sraitheanna uigeachta"

# AI Translated
msgid "Add layer"
msgstr "Cuir sraith leis"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Drag onto another layer to reorder. The first layer sits on the bare "
"surface; each one after it adds its relief on top of the ones before."
msgstr ""
"Tarraing ar shraith eile chun athordú. Suíonn an chéad sraith ar an dromchla "
"lom; cuireann gach ceann ina dhiaidh a faoiseamh ar bharr na gceann roimhe."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Pick a different image for this layer. The paint, depth and tiling stay as "
"they are."
msgstr ""
"Pioc íomhá eile don tsraith seo. Fanann an phéint, an doimhneacht agus an "
"tíleáil mar atá siad."

# AI Translated
msgid "not painted"
msgstr "gan phéinteáil"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Brightness, contrast, sharpness, blur and hue, shown on the image and on the "
"model as you set them. Save as copy writes the result to your texture "
"library and points this layer at it."
msgstr ""
"Gile, codarsnacht, géire, doiléiriú agus lí, taispeánta ar an íomhá agus ar "
"an tsamhail de réir mar a shocraíonn tú iad. Scríobhann Sábháil mar chóip an "
"toradh chuig do leabharlann uigeachtaí agus díríonn sé an tsraith seo air."

# AI Translated
msgid "Move up - applied earlier"
msgstr "Bog suas - curtha i bhfeidhm níos luaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Move down - applied later"
msgstr "Bog síos - curtha i bhfeidhm níos déanaí"

# AI Translated
msgid "Remove this layer"
msgstr "Bain an tsraith seo"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Height of the relief: how far white in the texture lifts the surface, in "
"millimetres. Black does not move it at all, unless Midlevel says otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Airde an fhaoisimh: cé chomh fada a ardaíonn bán san uigeacht an dromchla, i "
"milliméadair. Ní bhogann dubh é ar chor ar bith, mura deir Meánleibhéal a "
"mhalairt."

# AI Translated
msgid "Tile size"
msgstr "Méid na tíle"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Mapped by the model's own UV layout, which is already the placement - one "
"copy of the texture covers it exactly, so there is no tile size to set."
msgstr ""
"Mapáilte de réir leagan amach UV na samhla féin, arb é an suíomhú cheana - "
"clúdaíonn cóip amháin den uigeacht go díreach é, mar sin níl aon mhéid tíle "
"le socrú."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"How wide one copy of the texture is on the model. Smaller repeats the "
"pattern more often and makes its detail finer; with Tile off, this is the "
"size of the single copy."
msgstr ""
"Cé chomh leathan is atá cóip amháin den uigeacht ar an tsamhail. Athdhéanann "
"níos lú an patrún níos minice agus déanann sé a mhionsonraí níos míne; le "
"Tíl as, is é seo méid na cóipe aonair."

# AI Translated
msgid "Larger"
msgstr "Níos mó"

# AI Translated
msgid "Smaller"
msgstr "Níos lú"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Turns the texture on the surface, in degrees - for lining a pattern up with "
"an edge of the model."
msgstr ""
"Casann sé an uigeacht ar an dromchla, i gcéimeanna - chun patrún a ailíniú "
"le himeall den tsamhail."

# AI Translated
msgid "Midlevel"
msgstr "Meánleibhéal"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Which gray stays where the surface already is. At 0 the texture only pushes "
"outwards; at 0.5 mid-gray stays put, so darker grays cut in and lighter ones "
"still push out - one image both embosses and engraves.\n"
"\n"
"What cuts in has to fit: inside a sharp corner or through a thin wall, a "
"deep cut can pass through the other side."
msgstr ""
"Cén liath a fhanann san áit a bhfuil an dromchla cheana. Ag 0 ní bhrúnn an "
"uigeacht ach amach; ag 0.5 fanann meánliath ina áit, mar sin gearrann liatha "
"níos dorcha isteach agus brúnn cinn níos éadroime amach fós - déanann íomhá "
"amháin cabhrú agus greanadh araon.\n"
"\n"
"Caithfidh an rud a ghearrann isteach a bheith in ann teacht: taobh istigh de "
"choirnéal géar nó trí bhalla tanaí, d'fhéadfadh gearradh domhain dul tríd an "
"taobh eile."

# AI Translated
msgid "Deep inward displacement may self-intersect."
msgstr "D'fhéadfadh díláithriú domhain isteach féintrasnú."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Blurs the image before it is used, which rounds off hard steps and removes "
"speckle from a noisy photo. Raise it if the relief looks harsh or grainy; it "
"costs fine detail."
msgstr ""
"Doiléiríonn sé an íomhá sula n-úsáidtear í, rud a chruinníonn céimeanna crua "
"agus a bhaineann brachán ó ghrianghraf callánach. Ardaigh é má tá cuma "
"gharbh nó ghráinneach ar an bhfaoiseamh; cailltear mionsonraí míne dá bharr."

# AI Translated
msgid "Edge fade"
msgstr "Céimniú imill"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Flattens the relief as it approaches the edge of the painted area, so it "
"blends into the bare surface instead of stopping at a step."
msgstr ""
"Leacaíonn sé an faoiseamh de réir mar a dhruideann sé le himeall an "
"limistéir phéinteáilte, ionas go gcumascann sé isteach sa dromchla lom in "
"ionad stopadh ag céim."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"How far in the fade reaches, as a share of the painted area. Small values "
"soften a narrow band at the edge; 1 flattens almost all of it."
msgstr ""
"Cé chomh fada isteach a shroicheann an céimniú, mar chuid den limistéar "
"péinteáilte. Maolaíonn luachanna beaga banda cúng ag an imeall; leacaíonn 1 "
"beagnach é ar fad."

# AI Translated
msgid "Invert"
msgstr "Inbhéartaigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Turns the relief inside out: what stood out is cut in, and the other way "
"round. The same as using a negative of the image."
msgstr ""
"Iompaíonn sé an faoiseamh taobh istigh amach: gearrtar isteach an rud a bhí "
"amach, agus a mhalairt. Mar an gcéanna le claonchló den íomhá a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Colors"
msgstr "Dathanna"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Prints the painted area in the texture's colors as well as its relief. Each "
"color is matched to the nearest of your loaded filaments; anything you did "
"not paint keeps the object's own."
msgstr ""
"Priontálann sé an limistéar péinteáilte i ndathanna na huigeachta chomh "
"maith lena faoiseamh. Meaitseáiltear gach dath leis an gceann is gaire de do "
"chuid filiméad lódáilte; coinníonn aon rud nár phéinteáil tú dath an réada "
"féin."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This texture is a grayscale height map, so it has no colors to apply. Import "
"a color image to use this."
msgstr ""
"Is léarscáil airde liathscála í an uigeacht seo, mar sin níl aon dathanna "
"aici le cur i bhfeidhm. Iompórtáil íomhá dhaite chun é seo a úsáid."

# AI Translated
msgid "Mix filaments"
msgstr "Measc filiméid"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Interleaves two filaments to fake the colors in between, so a handful of "
"filaments can cover a photo or a gradient. An image of flat colors prints "
"the same either way. Off uses one filament per area."
msgstr ""
"Idirfhíonn sé dhá fhiliméad chun na dathanna eatarthu a bhréagadh, ionas gur "
"féidir le dornán filiméad grianghraf nó grádán a chlúdach. Priontálann íomhá "
"de dhathanna cothroma mar an gcéanna ar aon bhealach. Úsáideann As filiméad "
"amháin in aghaidh an limistéir."

# AI Translated
msgid "Mixed colors"
msgstr "Dathanna measctha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The most mixed filaments a bake may add. They are picked from the texture's "
"colors, and only the ones the bake actually uses are created."
msgstr ""
"An líon is mó filiméad measctha is féidir le bácáil a chur leis. Roghnaítear "
"iad ó dhathanna na huigeachta, agus ní chruthaítear ach na cinn a úsáideann "
"an bhácáil i ndáiríre."

# AI Translated
msgid "Few"
msgstr "Beagán"

# AI Translated
msgid "Many"
msgstr "Go leor"

# AI Translated
#. TRN The %2% part of "%1% printable colors %2%"; %1% is the number of filaments.
#, possible-boost-format
msgid "from %1% filament"
msgid_plural "from %1% filaments"
msgstr[0] "ó %1% fhiliméad"
msgstr[1] "ó %1% fhiliméad"
msgstr[2] "ó %1% fhiliméad"
msgstr[3] "ó %1% bhfiliméad"
msgstr[4] "ó %1% filiméad"

# AI Translated
#. TRN %1% is the number of printable colors, %2% is "from N filaments".
#, possible-boost-format
msgid "%1% printable color %2%"
msgid_plural "%1% printable colors %2%"
msgstr[0] "%1% dath inphriontáilte %2%"
msgstr[1] "%1% dhath inphriontáilte %2%"
msgstr[2] "%1% dhath inphriontáilte %2%"
msgstr[3] "%1% ndath inphriontáilte %2%"
msgstr[4] "%1% dath inphriontáilte %2%"

# AI Translated
msgid "Denoise"
msgstr "Dí-thorann"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Cleans up single stray triangles of the wrong color, which detail finer than "
"the mesh leaves behind. Raise it if the result looks speckled, lower it if "
"small features are being swallowed."
msgstr ""
"Glanann sé triantáin aonair seachránacha den dath mícheart, a fhágann "
"mionsonraí níos míne ná an mogalra ina ndiaidh. Ardaigh é má tá cuma bhreac "
"ar an toradh, ísligh é má tá gnéithe beaga á slogadh."

# AI Translated
msgctxt "Texture Displacement"
msgid "Mapping"
msgstr "Mapáil"

# AI Translated
msgid "Triplanar (blended)"
msgstr "Tríphlánach (cumaiscthe)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Triplanar - projects the texture from all three axes at once and blends "
"between them, so a patch wrapping around a sharp edge has no seam."
msgstr ""
"Tríphlánach - teilgeann sé an uigeacht ó na trí ais ag an am céanna agus "
"cumascann sé eatarthu, mar sin níl aon uaim ag paiste a fhilleann timpeall "
"imill ghéir."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Cylindrical - wraps the texture around the painted area's own center, for "
"round shapes."
msgstr ""
"Sorcóireach - filleann sé an uigeacht timpeall lár an limistéir phéinteáilte "
"féin, do chruthanna cruinne."

# AI Translated
msgid "Spherical"
msgstr "Sféarúil"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Spherical - wraps the texture around the painted area's own center in both "
"directions."
msgstr ""
"Sféarúil - filleann sé an uigeacht timpeall lár an limistéir phéinteáilte "
"féin sa dá threo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Unwrap (LSCM)"
msgstr "Unwrap (LSCM)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Unwrap - flattens the painted area and maps the texture onto it with as "
"little stretching as possible. The area is cut into pieces at its sharp "
"edges first (see Seam angle), so each piece can lie flat on its own."
msgstr ""
"Unwrap - leacaíonn sé an limistéar péinteáilte agus mapálann sé an uigeacht "
"air leis an síneadh is lú is féidir. Gearrtar an limistéar ina phíosaí ag a "
"imill ghéara ar dtús (féach Uillinn uama), ionas gur féidir le gach píosa "
"luí cothrom leis féin."

# AI Translated
msgid "From view"
msgstr "Ón amharc"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"From view - projects straight onto the painted area from where you are "
"looking, like a slide projector."
msgstr ""
"Ón amharc - teilgeann sé go díreach ar an limistéar péinteáilte ón áit a "
"bhfuil tú ag féachaint, cosúil le teilgeoir sleamhnán."

# AI Translated
msgid "Model UV"
msgstr "UV na Samhla"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Model UV - uses the texture coordinates the model itself came with, so a "
"texture made for that model lands exactly where it was painted. Nothing is "
"unwrapped, and Tile size does not apply: the model's own layout is the "
"placement."
msgstr ""
"UV na Samhla - úsáideann sé na comhordanáidí uigeachta a tháinig leis an "
"tsamhail féin, mar sin tuirlingíonn uigeacht a rinneadh don tsamhail sin "
"díreach san áit ar péinteáladh í. Ní dhífhilltear aon rud, agus ní bhaineann "
"Méid na tíle leis: is é leagan amach na samhla féin an suíomhú."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This model carries no texture coordinates of its own. Only a model imported "
"with a UV channel - a textured OBJ, say - can be mapped by them."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon chomhordanáidí uigeachta dá cuid féin ag an tsamhail seo. Ní féidir "
"ach samhail a iompórtáladh le cainéal UV - OBJ le huigeacht, abair - a "
"mhapáil leo."

# AI Translated
msgid "Open UV editor"
msgstr "Oscail an t-eagarthóir UV"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Opens the UV editor, where you can see how the texture is laid out over the "
"painted area, cut seams and move the pieces around."
msgstr ""
"Osclaíonn sé an t-eagarthóir UV, inar féidir leat a fheiceáil conas atá an "
"uigeacht leagtha amach thar an limistéar péinteáilte, uamanna a ghearradh "
"agus na píosaí a bhogadh timpeall."

# AI Translated
msgid "Not unwrapped yet"
msgstr "Gan dífhilleadh fós"

# AI Translated
#, possible-boost-format
msgid "%1% island"
msgid_plural "%1% islands"
msgstr[0] "%1% oileán"
msgstr[1] "%1% oileán"
msgstr[2] "%1% oileán"
msgstr[3] "%1% n-oileán"
msgstr[4] "%1% oileán"

# AI Translated
msgid "Capture current view"
msgstr "Gabh an t-amharc reatha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Nothing is visible from this angle - turn the model to face the part you "
"want to project onto."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon rud infheicthe ón uillinn seo - cas an tsamhail chun aghaidh a "
"thabhairt ar an gcuid is mian leat teilgean uirthi."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Projects the texture onto the painted area from where you are looking now, "
"like a slide projector. Faces turned away from you stretch, so line the view "
"up with the surface you care about first."
msgstr ""
"Teilgeann sé an uigeacht ar an limistéar péinteáilte ón áit a bhfuil tú ag "
"féachaint anois, cosúil le teilgeoir sleamhnán. Síneann aghaidheanna atá "
"casta uait, mar sin ailínigh an t-amharc leis an dromchla a bhfuil suim agat "
"ann ar dtús."

# AI Translated
msgid "Project only on visible"
msgstr "Teilg ar na cinn infheicthe amháin"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Paints only the faces you can actually see right now - facing you and not "
"hidden behind anything - and projects onto those. Replaces what the layer "
"had painted."
msgstr ""
"Ní phéinteálann sé ach na haghaidheanna is féidir leat a fheiceáil i "
"ndáiríre anois - ag féachaint ort agus gan iad a bheith i bhfolach taobh "
"thiar d'aon rud - agus teilgeann sé orthu sin. Cuireann sé in ionad a raibh "
"péinteáilte ag an tsraith."

# AI Translated
msgid "Projection frame"
msgstr "Fráma teilgin"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Opens a window you drag over the model. Whatever you can see through it is "
"what gets the texture, and its border becomes the edge of the projection."
msgstr ""
"Osclaíonn sé fuinneog a tharraingíonn tú thar an tsamhail. Faigheann cibé "
"rud is féidir leat a fheiceáil tríthi an uigeacht, agus éiríonn a himeall "
"ina himeall don teilgean."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"How solid the frame window looks while you place it. Lower to see the model "
"through it; it does not affect the result."
msgstr ""
"Cé chomh soladach a bhreathnaíonn fuinneog an fhráma agus tú á cur. Ísligh é "
"chun an tsamhail a fheiceáil tríd; ní théann sé i bhfeidhm ar an toradh."

# AI Translated
msgid "Apply projection frame"
msgstr "Cuir an fráma teilgin i bhfeidhm"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Nothing of the model is inside the frame - move it over the part you want to "
"project onto."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon chuid den tsamhail laistigh den fhráma - bog é thar an gcuid is mian "
"leat teilgean uirthi."

# AI Translated
msgid "The frame could not be applied. Make sure it overlaps the 3D view."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir an fráma a chur i bhfeidhm. Déan cinnte go bhforluíonn sé an "
"t-amharc 3T."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Projects the texture through the frame from where you are looking now and "
"paints the faces inside it. Replaces what the layer had painted; the result "
"sticks to the model, so you can orbit afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Teilgeann sé an uigeacht tríd an bhfráma ón áit a bhfuil tú ag féachaint "
"anois agus péinteálann sé na haghaidheanna taobh istigh de. Cuireann sé in "
"ionad a raibh péinteáilte ag an tsraith; greamaíonn an toradh don tsamhail, "
"mar sin is féidir leat fithisiú ina dhiaidh sin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Placed by projection frame."
msgstr "Curtha ag an bhfráma teilgin."

# AI Translated
msgid "Tile"
msgstr "Tíl"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Repeats the texture across the painted area. Off places one copy, like a "
"decal, at the size set by Tile size."
msgstr ""
"Athdhéanann sé an uigeacht thar an limistéar péinteáilte. Cuireann As cóip "
"amháin, cosúil le greamán, ag an méid atá socraithe ag Méid na tíle."

# AI Translated
msgid "Turn Tile on to choose how the texture repeats."
msgstr "Cas Tíl air chun a roghnú conas a athdhéanann an uigeacht."

# AI Translated
msgid "Repeat"
msgstr "Athdhéan"

# AI Translated
msgid "Mirrored repeat"
msgstr "Athdhéanamh scáthánaithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Mirrored repeat - every other tile is flipped, so edges meet seamlessly"
msgstr ""
"Athdhéanamh scáthánaithe - iompaítear gach dara tíl, mar sin tagann imill le "
"chéile gan uaim"

# AI Translated
msgid "Blend"
msgstr "Cumasc"

# AI Translated
msgctxt "Texture Displacement"
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Cuir leis"

# AI Translated
msgctxt "Texture Displacement"
msgid "Override"
msgstr "Sáraigh"

# AI Translated
msgctxt "Texture Displacement"
msgid "Subtract"
msgstr "Dealaigh"

# AI Translated
msgctxt "Texture Displacement"
msgid "Multiply"
msgstr "Iolraigh"

# AI Translated
msgid "Divide"
msgstr "Roinn"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The base layer has nothing beneath it to combine with, so it always adds."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon rud faoin mbunsraith le comhcheangal léi, mar sin cuireann sí leis i "
"gcónaí."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"What this layer does where it overlaps the ones below. Add and Subtract pile "
"relief on or carve it away. Override replaces them, so only this layer's "
"relief is left where it is painted. Multiply and Divide scale what is "
"underneath, which turns this layer into a mask over it - there, Depth acts "
"as a strength, and 1 mm leaves white areas untouched."
msgstr ""
"Cad a dhéanann an tsraith seo san áit a bhforluíonn sí na cinn thíos. "
"Carnann Cuir leis agus Dealaigh faoiseamh air nó snoíonn siad é. Cuireann "
"Sáraigh in ionad iad, mar sin ní fhágtar ach faoiseamh na sraithe seo san "
"áit a bhfuil sí péinteáilte. Scálaíonn Iolraigh agus Roinn a bhfuil faoi, "
"rud a dhéanann masc den tsraith seo os a chionn - ansin, feidhmíonn "
"Doimhneacht mar neart, agus fágann 1 mm limistéir bhána gan athrú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Adjust placement"
msgstr "Coigeartaigh an suíomhú"

# AI Translated
msgid "Adjust placement - drag the handle on the model to move the texture"
msgstr ""
"Coigeartaigh an suíomhú - tarraing an hanla ar an tsamhail chun an uigeacht "
"a bhogadh"

# AI Translated
msgid "Paint something with this layer first."
msgstr "Péinteáil rud éigin leis an tsraith seo ar dtús."

# AI Translated
msgid "Fewer settings"
msgstr "Níos lú socruithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "More settings"
msgstr "Tuilleadh socruithe"

# AI Translated
msgid "Subdivision"
msgstr "Foroinnt"

# AI Translated
msgid "Only painted area (adaptive)"
msgstr "An limistéar péinteáilte amháin (oiriúnaitheach)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Adds triangles only where you painted, instead of everywhere. On a large "
"part with a small decal that is the difference between thousands of "
"triangles and millions, and your paint survives the refinement."
msgstr ""
"Ní chuireann sé triantáin leis ach san áit ar phéinteáil tú, in ionad gach "
"áit. Ar pháirt mhór le greamán beag is é sin an difríocht idir na mílte "
"triantán agus na milliúin, agus maireann do phéint an mionchoigeartú."

# AI Translated
msgid "Follow texture detail"
msgstr "Lean mionsonraí na huigeachta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Spends the triangles where the texture actually bends - packed along ridges "
"and edges, sparse over flat ground - instead of spreading them evenly. The "
"same detail for fewer triangles on most textures."
msgstr ""
"Caitheann sé na triantáin san áit a lúbann an uigeacht i ndáiríre - pacáilte "
"feadh iomairí agus imill, tanaí thar thalamh cothrom - in ionad iad a "
"leathadh go cothrom. Na mionsonraí céanna do níos lú triantán ar fhormhór na "
"n-uigeachtaí."

# AI Translated
msgid "Max edge"
msgstr "Uasimeall"

# AI Translated
msgid "Target edge"
msgstr "Imeall sprice"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"No triangle in the painted area stays larger than this, even where the "
"texture is flat. Keep it near the size of the smallest feature you want to "
"come out."
msgstr ""
"Ní fhanann aon triantán sa limistéar péinteáilte níos mó ná seo, fiú san áit "
"a bhfuil an uigeacht cothrom. Coinnigh é gar do mhéid na gné is lú is mian "
"leat a theacht amach."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Triangles in the painted area are split until none is larger than this. "
"Smaller means finer detail and, fast, a lot more triangles."
msgstr ""
"Scoilttear triantáin sa limistéar péinteáilte go dtí nach bhfuil aon cheann "
"níos mó ná seo. Ciallaíonn níos lú mionsonraí níos míne agus, go tapa, i "
"bhfad níos mó triantán."

# AI Translated
msgid "Detail"
msgstr "Mionsonraí"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"How far the mesh may sit from the shape the texture describes, in "
"millimetres. Smaller follows fine detail and costs triangles; larger only "
"chases the big features."
msgstr ""
"Cé chomh fada is féidir leis an mogalra a bheith ón gcruth a chuireann an "
"uigeacht síos air, i milliméadair. Leanann níos lú mionsonraí míne agus "
"cosnaíonn sé triantáin; ní leanann níos mó ach na gnéithe móra."

# AI Translated
msgid "Min edge"
msgstr "Íosimeall"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"A floor on triangle size, so a sharp step in the texture cannot be chased "
"forever. Lower it for finer relief, raise it if the count runs away at hard "
"edges."
msgstr ""
"Urlár ar mhéid na dtriantán, ionas nach féidir céim ghéar san uigeacht a "
"leanúint go deo. Ísligh é le haghaidh faoiseamh níos míne, ardaigh é má "
"éalaíonn an líon ag imill chrua."

# AI Translated
msgid "Edge detail"
msgstr "Mionsonraí imill"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Triangle size along the outline of the painted area, where the relief drops "
"back to the bare surface. Lower it if that rim looks jagged; it only costs "
"triangles along the outline. 0 turns it off."
msgstr ""
"Méid na dtriantán feadh imlíne an limistéir phéinteáilte, áit a dtiteann an "
"faoiseamh ar ais go dtí an dromchla lom. Ísligh é má tá cuma mhantach ar an "
"imeall sin; ní chosnaíonn sé ach triantáin feadh na himlíne. Múchann 0 é."

# AI Translated
msgid "Color detail"
msgstr "Mionsonraí datha"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Triangle size where two colors meet. Each triangle prints in one filament, "
"so a color edge can only be as sharp as the triangles along it - and nothing "
"else refines there, since the surface is flat across a change of color. 0 "
"turns it off."
msgstr ""
"Méid na dtriantán san áit a dtagann dhá dhath le chéile. Priontálann gach "
"triantán in aon fhiliméad amháin, mar sin ní féidir le himeall datha a "
"bheith níos géire ná na triantáin feadh air - agus ní mhionchoigeartaíonn "
"aon rud eile ansin, ós rud é go bhfuil an dromchla cothrom trasna athrú "
"datha. Múchann 0 é."

# AI Translated
msgid "Triangle budget: set with Triangles, below."
msgstr "Buiséad triantán: socraithe le Triantáin, thíos."

# AI Translated
#, possible-boost-format
msgid "Preview: %1% triangle"
msgid_plural "Preview: %1% triangles"
msgstr[0] "Réamhamharc: %1% triantán"
msgstr[1] "Réamhamharc: %1% thriantán"
msgstr[2] "Réamhamharc: %1% thriantán"
msgstr[3] "Réamhamharc: %1% dtriantán"
msgstr[4] "Réamhamharc: %1% triantán"

# AI Translated
msgid "Steps"
msgstr "Céimeanna"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Splits every triangle of the model into four, this many times over. Each "
"step quadruples the count - 3 turns 100 k triangles into 6.4 M - so prefer "
"refining only the painted area unless you need the whole model finer."
msgstr ""
"Scoilteann sé gach triantán den tsamhail ina cheithre cinn, an oiread seo "
"uaireanta. Ceathairíonn gach céim an líon - déanann 3 6.4 M de 100 k "
"triantán - mar sin is fearr an limistéar péinteáilte amháin a "
"mhionchoigeartú mura dteastaíonn an tsamhail ar fad níos míne uait."

# AI Translated
msgid "Hide preview"
msgstr "Folaigh an réamhamharc"

# AI Translated
msgid "Preview subdivision"
msgstr "Réamhamharc na foroinnte"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Shows what the refinement would produce as a wireframe, without touching the "
"model."
msgstr ""
"Taispeánann sé a tháirgfeadh an mionchoigeartú mar shreangfhráma, gan "
"teagmháil leis an tsamhail."

# AI Translated
msgid "Subdivide"
msgstr "Foroinn"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Refines the painted area to the target edge length and carries your paint "
"onto the finer mesh. The rest of the model is left as it is."
msgstr ""
"Mionchoigeartaíonn sé an limistéar péinteáilte go fad an imill sprice agus "
"iompraíonn sé do phéint ar an mogalra níos míne. Fágtar an chuid eile den "
"tsamhail mar atá."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Replaces the model's geometry with the subdivided mesh and clears any "
"not-yet-baked paint on it (already-baked relief is unaffected)."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann sé an mogalra foroinnte in ionad chéimseata na samhla agus glanann "
"sé aon phéint nár bácáladh fós air (ní théann sé i bhfeidhm ar fhaoiseamh "
"atá bácáilte cheana)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Remeshing"
msgstr "Athmhogalrú"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Triangle size the whole model is rebuilt with, in millimetres. Displacement "
"works best on an even mesh; this is what makes one out of an uneven import."
msgstr ""
"Méid na dtriantán a atógtar an tsamhail ar fad leis, i milliméadair. "
"Oibríonn díláithriú is fearr ar mhogalra cothrom; is é seo a dhéanann ceann "
"as iompórtáil mhíchothrom."

# AI Translated
msgid "Before"
msgstr "Roimh"

# AI Translated
msgid "After"
msgstr "Tar éis"

# AI Translated
msgid "Keep sharp edges"
msgstr "Coinnigh imill ghéara"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Holds hard edges and open borders in place while the rest is remeshed. "
"Without it the remesher slides vertices along the surface and rounds every "
"crisp edge off - a cube comes back with wobbly edges."
msgstr ""
"Coinníonn sé imill chrua agus teorainneacha oscailte ina n-áit fad a "
"athmhogalraítear an chuid eile. Gan é sleamhnaíonn an t-athmhogalróir rinn "
"feadh an dromchla agus cruinníonn sé gach imeall briosc - tagann ciúb ar ais "
"le himill luascacha."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"How sharp a fold has to be, in degrees, before the remesher treats it as an "
"edge worth keeping. Lower protects more of the model's shape; higher "
"rebuilds more of it evenly."
msgstr ""
"Cé chomh géar a chaithfidh filleadh a bheith, i gcéimeanna, sula gcaitheann "
"an t-athmhogalróir leis mar imeall is fiú a choinneáil. Cosnaíonn níos ísle "
"níos mó de chruth na samhla; atógann níos airde níos mó de go cothrom."

# AI Translated
msgid "Remesh"
msgstr "Athmhogalraigh"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Rebuilds the whole model with triangles close to this edge length - "
"splitting the big ones and merging the small ones - so displacement has an "
"even density to work with. Replaces the geometry; your paint is carried onto "
"the new triangles spatially, so it survives (already-baked relief is kept "
"too)."
msgstr ""
"Atógann sé an tsamhail ar fad le triantáin gar don fhad imill seo - ag "
"scoilteadh na gcinn mhóra agus ag cumasc na gcinn bheaga - ionas go bhfuil "
"dlús cothrom ag an díláithriú le hoibriú leis. Cuireann sé in ionad na "
"céimseata; iompraítear do phéint ar na triantáin nua go spásúil, mar sin "
"maireann sí (coinnítear faoiseamh atá bácáilte cheana freisin)."

# AI Translated
msgid "Displace up to the border"
msgstr "Díláithrigh suas go dtí an teorainn"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Lets the relief run right to the edge of the painted area. Turn it off to "
"hold that outer ring flat, which keeps the displacement strictly inside your "
"paint but flattens the pattern at the border."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann sé don fhaoiseamh rith díreach go dtí imeall an limistéir "
"phéinteáilte. Múch é chun an fáinne seachtrach sin a choinneáil cothrom, rud "
"a choinníonn an díláithriú go docht taobh istigh de do phéint ach a "
"leacaíonn an patrún ag an teorainn."

# AI Translated
msgid "Smooth result"
msgstr "Toradh mín"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Smooths the geometry after the texture has been applied, to take the hard "
"steps out of a low-resolution image. Only what the displacement moved is "
"touched. The Smoothing slider on a layer is a different thing: it blurs the "
"image before it is used."
msgstr ""
"Míníonn sé an chéimseata tar éis an uigeacht a chur i bhfeidhm, chun na "
"céimeanna crua a bhaint as íomhá ísealtaifigh. Ní théitear i dteagmháil ach "
"leis an méid a bhog an díláithriú. Rud eile is ea sleamhnán Mínithe ar "
"shraith: doiléiríonn sé an íomhá sula n-úsáidtear í."

# AI Translated
msgctxt "Texture Displacement"
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "Neart"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"How far each pass pulls a vertex towards its neighbours. High values round "
"the relief off quickly; low values need more passes but keep more of the "
"detail."
msgstr ""
"Cé chomh fada a tharraingíonn gach pas rinn i dtreo a chomharsana. "
"Cruinníonn luachanna arda an faoiseamh go tapa; teastaíonn níos mó pasanna ó "
"luachanna ísle ach coinníonn siad níos mó de na mionsonraí."

# AI Translated
msgid "Passes"
msgstr "Pasanna"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"How many smoothing passes to run. More passes spread the smoothing further "
"across the surface; Strength decides how much each one moves."
msgstr ""
"Cé mhéad pas mínithe le rith. Leathann níos mó pasanna an mínú níos faide "
"trasna an dromchla; cinneann Neart cé mhéad a bhogann gach ceann acu."

# AI Translated
msgid "Ignore outer ring"
msgstr "Déan neamhaird den fháinne seachtrach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Keeps the outer ring of the painted area out of the smoothing. Its "
"neighbours outside the paint never move, so smoothing it drags the relief "
"down and leaves the pattern half-melted at the border."
msgstr ""
"Coinníonn sé fáinne seachtrach an limistéir phéinteáilte amach ón mínú. Ní "
"bhogann a chomharsana lasmuigh den phéint riamh, mar sin má mhínítear é "
"tarraingíonn sé an faoiseamh síos agus fágann sé an patrún leathleáite ag an "
"teorainn."

# AI Translated
msgid "Smooth baked mesh now"
msgstr "Mínigh an mogalra bácáilte anois"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Applies the smoothing above to the model itself, right now, within the "
"painted area. For relief that is already baked in - anything not yet baked "
"is smoothed by Bake."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann sé an mínú thuas i bhfeidhm ar an tsamhail féin, anois díreach, "
"laistigh den limistéar péinteáilte. Le haghaidh faoiseamh atá bácáilte "
"cheana - mínítear aon rud nach bhfuil bácáilte fós le Bácáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Experimental: classic bake pipeline"
msgstr "Turgnamhach: píblíne bhácála chlasaiceach"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Bake by moving the vertices the mesh already has, after preparing it "
"(remesh, adaptive subdivision, and a cut along sharp steps in the texture). "
"Keeps the topology, which is what colors need. The default pipeline instead "
"refines, cleans up sliver triangles, displaces and simplifies in one run; "
"nothing needs preparing first, but it does not produce colors yet."
msgstr ""
"Bácáil trí na rinn atá ag an mogalra cheana a bhogadh, tar éis é a ullmhú "
"(athmhogalrú, foroinnt oiriúnaitheach, agus gearradh feadh céimeanna géara "
"san uigeacht). Coinníonn sé an topeolaíocht, rud a theastaíonn ó dhathanna. "
"Ina ionad sin mionchoigeartaíonn an phíblíne réamhshocraithe, glanann sí "
"triantáin shlisneacha, díláithríonn agus simplíonn sí in aon rith amháin; ní "
"gá aon rud a ullmhú ar dtús, ach ní tháirgeann sí dathanna fós."

# AI Translated
msgid "Align mesh to texture edges"
msgstr "Ailínigh an mogalra le himill na huigeachta"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Slide vertices sideways onto the edges in the texture before displacing "
"them. Displacement can only move vertices up and down, so without this a "
"sharp step in the image lands wherever the triangles happen to be and comes "
"out as a staircase. Moving the vertices onto the step first gives a straight "
"wall at the same triangle count."
msgstr ""
"Sleamhnaigh rinn i leataobh ar imill na huigeachta sula ndíláithrítear iad. "
"Ní féidir le díláithriú rinn a bhogadh ach suas agus síos, mar sin gan é seo "
"tuirlingíonn céim ghéar san íomhá cibé áit a bhfuil na triantáin agus tagann "
"sí amach mar staighre. Má bhogtar na rinn ar an gcéim ar dtús gheofar balla "
"díreach leis an líon céanna triantán."

# AI Translated
msgid "Clean up slivers"
msgstr "Glan suas sliseanna"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Collapse the thin triangles refinement inherits from the model's own "
"tessellation, before displacement samples them. A sliver's three corners "
"land on three unrelated parts of the texture, which is what makes the relief "
"look jagged."
msgstr ""
"Lagaigh na triantáin thanaí a fhaigheann an mionchoigeartú mar oidhreacht ó "
"theasallú na samhla féin, sula samplaíonn an díláithriú iad. Tuirlingíonn "
"trí chúinne slise ar thrí chuid neamhghaolmhara den uigeacht, rud a fhágann "
"cuma mhantach ar an bhfaoiseamh."

# AI Translated
#. TRN Slider value: %d is the triangle budget in thousands
msgid "Budget"
msgstr "Buiséad"

# AI Translated
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid "%d k (auto)"
msgstr "%d k (uath)"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"How many thousand triangles this bake may spend on the area you painted. "
"Relief already baked into the rest of the model is kept on top of it, so a "
"second bake somewhere else gets the same budget as the first. Raise it if "
"the warning below Resolution says the detail will not fit; 0 keeps every "
"triangle the refinement produced, however many that is."
msgstr ""
"Cé mhéad míle triantán is féidir leis an mbácáil seo a chaitheamh ar an "
"limistéar a phéinteáil tú. Coinnítear faoiseamh atá bácáilte cheana sa chuid "
"eile den tsamhail ar a bharr, mar sin faigheann an dara bácáil áit éigin "
"eile an buiséad céanna leis an gcéad cheann. Ardaigh é má deir an rabhadh "
"faoi Thaifeach nach n-oirfidh na mionsonraí; coinníonn 0 gach triantán a "
"tháirg an mionchoigeartú, cibé méid é sin."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"On: the resolution follows the size of the model and the budget is left at "
"its default. Untick to set both yourself - worth doing for a texture much "
"finer or much coarser than the part it sits on."
msgstr ""
"Ar siúl: leanann an taifeach méid na samhla agus fágtar an buiséad ag a "
"réamhshocrú. Díthiceáil chun an dá cheann a shocrú tú féin - is fiú é a "
"dhéanamh d'uigeacht i bhfad níos míne nó i bhfad níos gairbhe ná an pháirt a "
"shuíonn sí uirthi."

# AI Translated
