msgid "%.2f mm (auto)"
msgstr "%.2f mm (uath)"

# AI Translated
#, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"Chosen from the size of the model: %1$.2f mm triangles, budget %2% k. Untick "
"Auto to set them yourself."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaithe ó mhéid na samhla: triantáin %1$.2f mm, buiséad %2% k. Díthiceáil "
"Uath chun iad a shocrú tú féin."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"How fine the mesh is made under the paint, in millimetres. It has to be "
"smaller than the detail you want out of the texture - a 0.5 mm groove needs "
"triangles well under 0.5 mm. Smaller costs triangles fast: halving it needs "
"four times as many, and once they no longer fit the budget the bake "
"simplifies back down and the detail goes with it."
msgstr ""
"Cé chomh mín is a dhéantar an mogalra faoin bpéint, i milliméadair. "
"Caithfidh sé a bheith níos lú ná na mionsonraí is mian leat as an uigeacht - "
"teastaíonn triantáin i bhfad faoi 0.5 mm ó eitre 0.5 mm. Cosnaíonn níos lú "
"triantáin go tapa: má laghdaítear go leath é teastaíonn ceithre oiread, agus "
"nuair nach n-oireann siad don bhuiséad a thuilleadh simplíonn an bhácáil "
"síos arís agus imíonn na mionsonraí leis."

# AI Translated
#, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"Needs about %1% triangles, budget %2% - the bake will simplify back down and "
"lose detail."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn thart ar %1% triantán, buiséad %2% - simpleoidh an bhácáil síos "
"arís agus caillfidh sí mionsonraí."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"How many thousand triangles the refinement may add to the model. The "
"triangle that fits worst is always split first, so even a run that spends "
"the lot has spent it where it shows most. Raise it if the relief still looks "
"coarse."
msgstr ""
"Cé mhéad míle triantán is féidir leis an mionchoigeartú a chur leis an "
"tsamhail. Scoilttear an triantán is measa a oireann ar dtús i gcónaí, mar "
"sin fiú rith a chaitheann an t-iomlán, chaith sé é san áit is mó a fheictear "
"é. Ardaigh é má tá cuma gharbh ar an bhfaoiseamh fós."

