"model mark seams instead of painting - turn it off in the pane to paint."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon rud péinteáilte fós. Tá uirlis uama an eagarthóra UV ar siúl, mar "
"sin marcálann stríoca ar an tsamhail uamanna in ionad péinteála - múch é sa "
"phána chun péinteáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Nothing is painted yet."
msgstr "Níl aon rud péinteáilte fós."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Turn the painted height maps into real geometry, by moving the vertices that "
"are already there. Use Subdivide first if the mesh is too coarse to show the "
"detail."
msgstr ""
"Déan fíorchéimseata de na léarscáileanna airde péinteáilte, trí na rinn atá "
"ann cheana a bhogadh. Úsáid Foroinn ar dtús má tá an mogalra ró-gharbh chun "
"na mionsonraí a thaispeáint."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Turn the painted height maps into real geometry. The mesh is remeshed to an "
"even density and refined where the texture bends first, so the detail has "
"vertices to land on - all in one step."
msgstr ""
"Déan fíorchéimseata de na léarscáileanna airde péinteáilte. Athmhogalraítear "
"an mogalra go dlús cothrom agus mionchoigeartaítear é san áit a lúbann an "
"uigeacht ar dtús, ionas go bhfuil rinn ag na mionsonraí le tuirlingt orthu - "
"go léir in aon chéim amháin."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
