# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enter an absolute path on this computer. Add /* at the end to include the "
"folder and everything below it; no other wildcard is accepted. A read/write "
"grant can create files through open(), but it does not cover create or "
"delete events such as os.mkdir and os.remove. Without Full access, each such "
"event outside allowed folders needs its own approval, which is never saved. "
"When a plugin runs in the background, these events are denied without asking."
msgstr ""
"Cuir isteach conair iomlán ar an ríomhaire seo. Cuir /* ag an deireadh chun "
"an fillteán agus gach rud faoi a chuimsiú; ní ghlactar le haon saoróg eile. "
"Is féidir le deontas léite/scríofa comhaid a chruthú trí open(), ach ní "
"chlúdaíonn sé imeachtaí cruthaithe ná scriosta ar nós os.mkdir agus "
"os.remove. Gan Rochtain iomlán, teastaíonn a cheadú féin ó gach imeacht den "
"sórt sin lasmuigh d'fhillteáin cheadaithe, rud nach sábháiltear riamh. Nuair "
"a ritheann breiseán sa chúlra, diúltaítear do na himeachtaí seo gan fiafraí."

# AI Translated
msgid "C:\\path\\to\\directory\\*"
msgstr "C:\\path\\to\\directory\\*"

# AI Translated
msgid "/path/to/directory/*"
msgstr "/path/to/directory/*"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enter a full http:// or https:// URL; only its scheme and host are saved, so "
"the grant covers every port, path, and query on that host. A network socket "
"grant also accepts a bare host name or IP address, with or without a port, "
"and covers every port on that host. Other schemes are not accepted. Grants "
"in either list are checked for HTTP and socket access."
msgstr ""
"Cuir isteach URL iomlán http:// nó https://; ní shábháiltear ach a scéim "
"agus a óstach, mar sin clúdaíonn an deontas gach port, conair agus "
"fiosrúchán ar an óstach sin. Glacann deontas soicéid líonra le hóstainm lom "
"nó seoladh IP freisin, le port nó gan é, agus clúdaíonn sé gach port ar an "
"óstach sin. Ní ghlactar le scéimeanna eile. Seiceáiltear deontais sa dá "
"liosta le haghaidh rochtain HTTP agus soicéid."

