# AI Translated
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid ""
"Enable full access for \"%s\"?\n"
"\n"
"Full access turns off permission auditing for this plugin: its file system, "
"network, process, thread and event permissions are no longer checked. The "
"plugin can read and write most files your user account can access, including "
"startup scripts, SSH keys and a writable OrcaSlicer installation. Modifying "
"startup or application files can let code run outside these checks. Direct "
"Python access to OrcaSlicer's configuration, secret, certificate and "
"install-state paths stays blocked, but subprocesses are not restricted. Full "
"access is not a sandbox.\n"
"\n"
"Only enable this for a plugin you trust."
msgstr ""
"An gcumasófar rochtain iomlán do \"%s\"?\n"
"\n"
"Múchann rochtain iomlán iniúchadh ceadanna don bhreiseán seo: ní dhéantar a "
"cheadanna córais chomhad, líonra, próisis, snáithe agus imeachta a sheiceáil "
"a thuilleadh. Is féidir leis an mbreiseán formhór na gcomhad a bhfuil "
"rochtain ag do chuntas úsáideora orthu a léamh agus a scríobh, scripteanna "
"tosaithe, eochracha SSH agus suiteáil inscríofa OrcaSlicer san áireamh. "
"D'fhéadfadh mionathrú comhad tosaithe nó feidhmchláir ligean do chód rith "
"lasmuigh de na seiceálacha seo. Fanann rochtain dhíreach Python ar chonairí "
"cumraíochta, rúin, teastas agus staid suiteála OrcaSlicer bactha, ach níl "
"fophróisis srianta. Ní bosca gainimh é rochtain iomlán.\n"
"\n"
"Ná cumasaigh é seo ach do bhreiseán a bhfuil muinín agat as."

