# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The active layer's tile size: how much of the model one repeat of the "
"texture covers. The canvas is measured in tiles, so one grid cell is one "
"repeat. Change it with Tile size in the layer's settings."
msgstr ""
"Méid tíle na sraithe gníomhaí: cé mhéad den tsamhail a chlúdaíonn "
"athdhéanamh amháin den uigeacht. Tomhaistear an canbhás i dtíleanna, mar sin "
"is athdhéanamh amháin é cill ghreille amháin. Athraigh é le Méid na tíle i "
"socruithe na sraithe."

# AI Translated
msgid "Height map - show the layer's texture under the islands"
msgstr "Léarscáil airde - taispeáin uigeacht na sraithe faoi na hoileáin"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Checker - a test grid; squares stay square where the unwrap does not stretch"
msgstr ""
"Seiceálaí - greille tástála; fanann cearnóga cearnach san áit nach síneann "
"an dífhilleadh"

# AI Translated
msgid "Distortion - color each island by how much the unwrap stretches it"
msgstr ""
"Saobhadh - datháil gach oileán de réir an mhéid a shíneann an dífhilleadh é"

# AI Translated
msgid "Unwrap"
msgstr "Unwrap"

# AI Translated
msgid "Seam angle"
msgstr "Uillinn uama"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Edges sharper than this are cut, and the pieces either side of them are "
"flattened separately. Lower it to cut more: each piece then lies flat with "
"less stretching, at the cost of the texture not running continuously across "
"the cut. Takes effect at the next Unwrap."
msgstr ""
"Gearrtar imill atá níos géire ná seo, agus leacaítear na píosaí ar gach "
"taobh díobh ar leithligh. Ísligh é chun níos mó a ghearradh: luíonn gach "
"píosa cothrom ansin le níos lú sínte, ar chostas nach ritheann an uigeacht "
"go leanúnach trasna an ghearrtha. Bíonn éifeacht leis ag an gcéad Unwrap "
"eile."

# AI Translated
msgid "Connect islands"
msgstr "Ceangail oileáin"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Lay the unwrap out as a connected net: pieces that share an edge are "
"unfolded next to each other (a cube becomes a joined net rather than six "
"loose squares). They stay separate islands, so you can still move any of "
"them by hand afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Leag amach an dífhilleadh mar líon ceangailte: osclaítear píosaí a roinneann "
"imeall in aice a chéile (éiríonn ciúb ina líon ceangailte seachas sé "
"chearnóg scaoilte). Fanann siad ina n-oileáin ar leith, mar sin is féidir "
"leat aon cheann acu a bhogadh de láimh ina dhiaidh sin fós."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Island - work on whole islands. Click one to select it, then drag to move "
"it, right-drag to rotate it, or press R to rotate and S to scale with the "
"mouse (click or Enter to confirm, Esc to cancel)."
msgstr ""
"Oileán - oibrigh ar oileáin iomlána. Cliceáil ar cheann chun é a roghnú, "
"ansin tarraing chun é a bhogadh, deas-tarraing chun é a rothlú, nó brúigh R "
"chun rothlú agus S chun scálú leis an luch (cliceáil nó Enter chun deimhniú, "
"Esc chun cealú)."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Vertex - drag vertices to reshape an island by hand; Shift adds to the "
"selection, Ctrl toggles one in or out of it."
msgstr ""
"Rinn - tarraing rinn chun oileán a athchruthú de láimh; cuireann Shift leis "
"an roghnú, scoránaíonn Ctrl ceann isteach nó amach as."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Edge - drag edges to reshape an island by hand; Shift adds to the selection, "
"Ctrl toggles one in or out of it."
msgstr ""
"Imeall - tarraing imill chun oileán a athchruthú de láimh; cuireann Shift "
"leis an roghnú, scoránaíonn Ctrl ceann isteach nó amach as."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Mark seams - click edges on the model to cut the unwrap along them. The edge "
"under the cursor is highlighted yellow; click to mark it red, click a red "
"edge again to unmark it. Painting is paused while this is on."
msgstr ""
"Marcáil uamanna - cliceáil ar imill ar an tsamhail chun an dífhilleadh a "
"ghearradh feadh orthu. Aibhsítear an t-imeall faoin gcúrsóir i mbuí; "
"cliceáil chun é a mharcáil dearg, cliceáil ar imeall dearg arís chun an marc "
"a bhaint. Tá péinteáil curtha ar sos fad atá sé seo ar siúl."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Path - instead of clicking every edge, click a start point and then an end "
"point: the whole shortest path between them is seamed at once. Available "
"while marking seams."
msgstr ""
"Conair - in ionad cliceáil ar gach imeall, cliceáil ar phointe tosaigh agus "
"ansin ar phointe deiridh: cuirtear uaim ar an gconair is giorra eatarthu ar "
"fad ag an am céanna. Ar fáil agus uamanna á marcáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "Clear seams - remove every seam marked on this layer"
msgstr "Glan uamanna - bain gach uaim atá marcáilte ar an tsraith seo"

# AI Translated
msgid "Average scale - give every island the same texel density"
msgstr "Meánscála - tabhair an dlús teicsil céanna do gach oileán"

# AI Translated
msgid "Cut - split the selected island across its long axis"
msgstr "Gearr - scoilt an t-oileán roghnaithe trasna a aise fada"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Join - unfold the selected island onto its nearest neighbour along their "
"shared edge"
msgstr ""
"Ceangail - oscail an t-oileán roghnaithe ar a chomharsa is gaire feadh a "
"n-imill chomhroinnte"

# AI Translated
msgid "Unjoin - send the selected island back to its own packed position"
msgstr ""
"Díceangail - seol an t-oileán roghnaithe ar ais go dtí a shuíomh pacáilte "
"féin"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Clear UV edits - discard all manual vertex/edge moves and return the unwrap "
"to its automatic shape"
msgstr ""
"Glan eagarthóireachtaí UV - caith uait gach bogadh láimhe rinne/imill agus "
"fill an dífhilleadh ar a chruth uathoibríoch"

# AI Translated
msgid "Snap - stick islands together when dragging one against another"
msgstr ""
"Snapáil - greamaigh oileáin le chéile nuair a tharraingítear ceann i gcoinne "
"ceann eile"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Frame all islands, fitting every one of them in view (Home or F).\n"
"Elsewhere on the canvas: scroll to zoom around the cursor, and middle-drag - "
"or drag empty space - to pan."
msgstr ""
"Cuir gach oileán i bhfráma, ag oiriúnú gach ceann acu san amharc (Home nó "
"F).\n"
"Áit eile ar an gcanbhás: scrollaigh chun zúmáil timpeall an chúrsóra, agus "
"tarraingt lár - nó tarraing spás folamh - chun panú."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"What is selected, and the exact figures of the move, rotation or scale while "
"you drag one."
msgstr ""
"Cad atá roghnaithe, agus figiúirí cruinne an bhogtha, an rothlaithe nó an "
"scálaithe agus tú ag tarraingt ceann."

# AI Translated
msgid "No layer mapped with Unwrap"
msgstr "Níl aon sraith mapáilte le Unwrap"

# AI Translated
#, possible-c-format, possible-boost-format
msgid "%.1f mm tile"
msgstr "Tíl %.1f mm"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The pane follows the active texture layer, and that layer has to be mapped "
"with Unwrap (LSCM). Add a layer and set its Mapping to Unwrap."
msgstr ""
"Leanann an pána an tsraith uigeachta ghníomhach, agus caithfidh an tsraith "
"sin a bheith mapáilte le Unwrap (LSCM). Cuir sraith leis agus socraigh a "
"Mapáil go Unwrap."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Out of date - the paint, the seams or the seam angle changed since this "
"unwrap was made. Press to unwrap again."
msgstr ""
"As dáta - athraíodh an phéint, na huamanna nó uillinn na huama ó rinneadh an "
"dífhilleadh seo. Brúigh chun dífhilleadh arís."

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Flatten the painted area into UV islands. It is computed only when you press "
"this, not on every edit - so paint, change the seam angle or mark seams "
"first, then press Unwrap."
msgstr ""
"Leacaigh an limistéar péinteáilte ina oileáin UV. Ní ríomhtar é ach nuair a "
"bhrúnn tú é seo, ní ar gach eagarthóireacht - mar sin péinteáil, athraigh "
"uillinn na huama nó marcáil uamanna ar dtús, ansin brúigh Unwrap."

# AI Translated
msgid "Turn Mark seams on first - Path is a quicker way of marking them."
msgstr ""
"Cas Marcáil uamanna air ar dtús - is bealach níos tapa í Conair chun iad a "
"mharcáil."

# AI Translated
msgid "No seams are marked on this layer."
msgstr "Níl aon uamanna marcáilte ar an tsraith seo."

# AI Translated
msgid "No islands have been reshaped by hand, so there is nothing to discard."
msgstr ""
"Níor athchruthaíodh aon oileáin de láimh, mar sin níl aon rud le caitheamh "
