msgstr "Am fágtha:"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Precise wall]
msgid ""
"Precise wall\n"
"Did you know that turning on precise wall can improve precision and layer "
"consistency?"
msgstr ""
"Balla beacht\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir le balla beacht a chasadh air beachtas agus "
"comhsheasmhacht na sraitheanna a fheabhsú?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Sandwich mode]
msgid ""
"Sandwich mode\n"
"Did you know that you can use sandwich mode (inner-outer-inner) to improve "
"precision and layer consistency if your model doesn't have very steep "
"overhangs?"
msgstr ""
"Mód ceapaire\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat mód ceapaire "
"(inmheánach-seachtrach-inmheánach) a úsáid chun beachtas agus "
"comhsheasmhacht na sraitheanna a fheabhsú mura bhfuil starráin an-ghéara ag "
"do shamhail?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Chamber temperature]
msgid ""
"Chamber temperature\n"
"Did you know that OrcaSlicer supports chamber temperature?"
msgstr ""
"Teocht an tseomra\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat go dtacaíonn OrcaSlicer le teocht an tseomra?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Calibration]
msgid ""
"Calibration\n"
"Did you know that calibrating your printer can do wonders? Check out our "
"beloved calibration solution in OrcaSlicer."
msgstr ""
"Calabrú\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir le calabrú do phrintéara iontais a "
"dhéanamh? Féach ar an réiteach calabraithe is ansa linn in OrcaSlicer."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Auxiliary fan]
msgid ""
"Auxiliary fan\n"
"Did you know that OrcaSlicer supports Auxiliary part cooling fan?"
msgstr ""
"Gaothrán cúnta\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat go dtacaíonn OrcaSlicer le gaothrán cúnta fuaraithe "
"páirte?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Air filtration]
msgid ""
"Air filtration/Exhaust Fan\n"
"Did you know that OrcaSlicer can support Air filtration/Exhaust Fan?"
msgstr ""
"Scagadh aeir/Gaothrán sceite\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir le OrcaSlicer tacú le Scagadh aeir/Gaothrán "
"sceite?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:G-code window]
msgid ""
"G-code window\n"
"You can turn on/off the G-code window by pressing the <b>C</b> key."
msgstr ""
"Fuinneog an G-code\n"
"Is féidir leat fuinneog an G-code a chasadh air/a mhúchadh tríd an eochair "
"<b>C</b> a bhrú."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Switch workspaces]
msgid ""
"Switch workspaces\n"
"You can switch between <b>Prepare</b> and <b>Preview</b> workspaces by "
"pressing the <b>Tab</b> key."
msgstr ""
"Athraigh spásanna oibre\n"
"Is féidir leat athrú idir na spásanna oibre <b>Ullmhaigh</b> agus "
"<b>Réamhamharc</b> tríd an eochair <b>Tab</b> a bhrú."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:How to use keyboard shortcuts]
msgid ""
"How to use keyboard shortcuts\n"
"Did you know that Orca Slicer offers a wide range of keyboard shortcuts and "
"3D scene operations?"
msgstr ""
"Conas aicearraí méarchláir a úsáid\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat go dtairgeann Orca Slicer réimse leathan aicearraí "
"méarchláir agus oibríochtaí radhairc 3T?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Reverse on even]
msgid ""
"Reverse on even\n"
"Did you know that <b>Reverse on even</b> feature can significantly improve "
"the surface quality of your overhangs? However, it can cause wall "
"inconsistencies so use carefully!"
msgstr ""
"Aisiompaigh ar shraitheanna réidhe\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leis an ngné <b>Aisiompaigh ar shraitheanna "
"réidhe</b> cáilíocht dromchla do starrán a fheabhsú go suntasach? Mar sin "
"féin, d'fhéadfadh sé neamhréireachtaí balla a chruthú mar sin úsáid go "
"cúramach é!"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Cut Tool]
msgid ""
"Cut Tool\n"
"Did you know that you can cut a model at any angle and position with the "
"cutting tool?"
msgstr ""
"Uirlis Ghearrtha\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat samhail a ghearradh ag aon uillinn "
"agus suíomh leis an uirlis ghearrtha?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Fix Model]
msgid ""
"Fix Model\n"
"Did you know that you can fix a corrupted 3D model to avoid a lot of slicing "
"problems on the Windows system?"
msgstr ""
"Deisigh an tSamhail\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat samhail 3T truaillithe a dheisiú chun "
"go leor fadhbanna slisnithe a sheachaint ar chóras Windows?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Timelapse]
msgid ""
"Timelapse\n"
"Did you know that you can generate a timelapse video during each print?"
msgstr ""
"Am-mhoill\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat físeán am-mhoille a ghiniúint le linn "
"gach priontála?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Auto-Arrange]
msgid ""
"Auto-Arrange\n"
"Did you know that you can auto-arrange all the objects in your project?"
msgstr ""
"Socrú Uathoibríoch\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat gach réad i do thionscadal a shocrú go "
"huathoibríoch?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Auto-Orient]
msgid ""
"Auto-Orient\n"
"Did you know that you can rotate objects to an optimal orientation for "
"printing with a simple click?"
msgstr ""
"Treoshuíomh Uathoibríoch\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat réada a rothlú go dtí treoshuíomh "
"barrmhaith le haghaidh priontála le cliceáil shimplí?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Lay on Face]
msgid ""
"Lay on Face\n"
"Did you know that you can quickly orient a model so that one of its faces "
"sits on the print bed? Select the \"Place on face\" function or press the "
"<b>F</b> key."
msgstr ""
"Leag ar Aghaidh\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat samhail a threoshuí go tapa ionas go "
"suíonn ceann dá haghaidheanna ar leaba an phrintéara? Roghnaigh an fheidhm "
"\"Cuir ar aghaidh\" nó brúigh an eochair <b>F</b>."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Object List]
msgid ""
"Object List\n"
"Did you know that you can view all objects/parts in a list and change "
"settings for each object/part?"
msgstr ""
"Liosta na Réad\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat gach réad/páirt a fheiceáil i liosta "
"agus socruithe a athrú do gach réad/páirt?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Search Functionality]
msgid ""
"Search Functionality\n"
"Did you know that you use the Search tool to quickly find a specific Orca "
"Slicer setting?"
msgstr ""
"Feidhmiúlacht Chuardaigh\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat an uirlis Chuardaigh a úsáid chun "
"socrú ar leith de chuid Orca Slicer a aimsiú go tapa?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Simplify Model]
msgid ""
"Simplify Model\n"
"Did you know that you can reduce the number of triangles in a mesh using the "
"Simplify mesh feature? Right-click the model and select Simplify model."
msgstr ""
"Simpligh an tSamhail\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat líon na dtriantán i mogalra a laghdú "
"leis an ngné Simpligh an mogalra? Deaschliceáil ar an tsamhail agus "
"roghnaigh Simpligh an tsamhail."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Slicing Parameter Table]
msgid ""
"Slicing Parameter Table\n"
"Did you know that you can view all objects/parts on a table and change "
"settings for each object/part?"
msgstr ""
"Tábla Paraiméadar Slisnithe\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat gach réad/páirt a fheiceáil ar thábla "
"agus socruithe a athrú do gach réad/páirt?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Split to Objects/Parts]
msgid ""
"Split to Objects/Parts\n"
"Did you know that you can split a big object into small ones for easy "
"colorizing or printing?"
msgstr ""
"Scoilt ina Réada/Páirteanna\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat réad mór a scoilteadh ina réada beaga "
"le go mbeidh sé éasca iad a dhathú nó a phriontáil?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Subtract a Part]
msgid ""
"Subtract a Part\n"
"Did you know that you can subtract one mesh from another using the Negative "
"part modifier? That way you can, for example, create easily resizable holes "
"directly in Orca Slicer."
msgstr ""
"Dealaigh Páirt\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat mogalra amháin a dhealú ó cheann eile "
"ag úsáid an mhionathraitheora Páirt dhiúltach? Ar an mbealach sin is féidir "
"leat, mar shampla, poill ar féidir a méid a athrú go héasca a chruthú go "
"díreach in Orca Slicer."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:STEP]
msgid ""
"STEP\n"
"Did you know that you can improve your print quality by slicing a STEP file "
"instead of an STL?\n"
"Orca Slicer supports slicing STEP files, providing smoother results than a "
"lower resolution STL. Give it a try!"
msgstr ""
"STEP\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat cáilíocht do phriontála a fheabhsú trí "
"chomhad STEP a shlisniú in ionad STL?\n"
"Tacaíonn Orca Slicer le comhaid STEP a shlisniú, rud a thugann torthaí níos "
"míne ná STL ísealtaifigh. Bain triail as!"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Z seam location]
msgid ""
"Z seam location\n"
"Did you know that you can customize the location of the Z seam, and even "
"paint it on your print, to have it in a less visible location? This improves "
"the overall look of your model. Check it out!"
msgstr ""
"Suíomh uaim Z\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat suíomh na huama Z a shaincheapadh, "
"agus fiú é a phéinteáil ar do phriontáil, chun é a bheith in áit nach bhfuil "
"chomh feiceálach? Feabhsaíonn sé seo cuma fhoriomlán do shamhla. Féach air!"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Fine-tuning for flow rate]
msgid ""
"Fine-tuning for flow rate\n"
"Did you know that flow rate can be fine-tuned for even better-looking "
"prints? Depending on the material, you can improve the overall finish of the "
"printed model by doing some fine-tuning."
msgstr ""
"Mionchoigeartú an ráta sreafa\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir an ráta sreafa a mhionchoigeartú le "
"haghaidh priontaí a bhreathnaíonn níos fearr fós? Ag brath ar an ábhar, is "
"féidir leat bailchríoch fhoriomlán na samhla priontáilte a fheabhsú trí "
"mhionchoigeartú a dhéanamh."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Split your prints into plates]
msgid ""
"Split your prints into plates\n"
"Did you know that you can split a model that has a lot of parts into "
"individual plates ready to print? This will simplify the process of keeping "
"track of all the parts."
msgstr ""
"Scoilt do phriontaí ina bplátaí\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat samhail a bhfuil go leor páirteanna "
"aici a scoilteadh ina plátaí aonair réidh le priontáil? Simpleoidh sé seo an "
"próiseas rianaithe na bpáirteanna go léir."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Speed up your print with Adaptive Layer Height]
msgid ""
"Speed up your print with Adaptive Layer Height\n"
"Did you know that you can print a model even faster by using the Adaptive "
"Layer Height option? Check it out!"
msgstr ""
"Brostaigh do phriontáil le hAirde Sraithe Oiriúnaitheach\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat samhail a phriontáil níos tapa fós "
"tríd an rogha Airde Sraithe Oiriúnaitheach a úsáid? Féach air!"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Support painting]
msgid ""
"Support painting\n"
"Did you know that you can paint the location of your supports? This feature "
"makes it easy to place the support material only on the sections of the "
"model that actually need it."
msgstr ""
"Péinteáil tacaí\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat suíomh do thacaí a phéinteáil? Fágann "
"an ghné seo go bhfuil sé éasca an t-ábhar taca a chur ach ar na codanna den "
"tsamhail a dteastaíonn sé uathu i ndáiríre."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Different types of supports]
msgid ""
"Different types of supports\n"
"Did you know that you can choose from multiple types of supports? Tree "
"supports work great for organic models while saving filament and improving "
"print speed. Check them out!"
msgstr ""
"Cineálacha éagsúla tacaí\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat roghnú as cineálacha iolracha tacaí? "
"Oibríonn tacaí crainn go hiontach do shamhlacha orgánacha agus sábhálann "
"siad filiméad agus feabhsaíonn siad luas na priontála. Féach orthu!"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Printing Silk Filament]
msgid ""
"Printing Silk Filament\n"
"Did you know that Silk filament needs special consideration to print "
"successfully? A higher temperature and lower speed are always recommended "
"for the best results."
msgstr ""
"Filiméad Síoda a Phriontáil\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat go dteastaíonn aird speisialta ó fhiliméad Síoda chun "
"é a phriontáil go rathúil? Moltar teocht níos airde agus luas níos ísle i "
"gcónaí le haghaidh na dtorthaí is fearr."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Brim for better adhesion]
msgid ""
"Brim for better adhesion\n"
"Did you know that when printed models have a small contact interface with "
"the printing surface, it's recommended to use a brim?"
msgstr ""
"Imeall le haghaidh greamaitheacht níos fearr\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat, nuair a bhíonn comhéadan teagmhála beag ag samhlacha "
"priontáilte leis an dromchla priontála, go moltar imeall a úsáid?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Set parameters for multiple objects]
msgid ""
"Set parameters for multiple objects\n"
"Did you know that you can set slicing parameters for all selected objects at "
"once?"
msgstr ""
"Socraigh paraiméadair do réada iolracha\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat paraiméadair slisnithe a shocrú do "
"gach réad roghnaithe ag an am céanna?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Stack objects]
msgid ""
"Stack objects\n"
"Did you know that you can stack objects as a whole one?"
msgstr ""
"Cruachadh réad\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat réada a chruachadh mar réad iomlán "
"amháin?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Flush into support/objects/infill]
msgid ""
"Flush into support/objects/infill\n"
"Did you know that you can reduce wasted filament by flushing it into "
"support/objects/infill during filament changes?"
msgstr ""
"Sruthlaigh isteach i dtacaí/réada/líonadh\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat filiméad curtha amú a laghdú trína "
"shruthlú isteach i dtacaí/réada/líonadh le linn athruithe filiméid?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Improve strength]
msgid ""
"Improve strength\n"
"Did you know that you can use more wall loops and higher sparse infill "
"density to improve the strength of the model?"
msgstr ""
"Feabhsaigh an neart\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir leat níos mó lúb balla agus dlús líonta "
"thanaí níos airde a úsáid chun neart na samhla a fheabhsú?"

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:When do you need to print with the printer door opened]
msgid ""
"When do you need to print with the printer door opened?\n"
"Did you know that opening the printer door can reduce the probability of "
"extruder/hotend clogging when printing lower temperature filament with a "
"higher enclosure temperature? There is more info about this in the Wiki."
msgstr ""
"Cathain is gá priontáil le doras an phrintéara oscailte?\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat gur féidir le doras an phrintéara a oscailt an "
"dóchúlacht go gcalcfaidh an t-easbhrúiteoir/an ceann te a laghdú agus "
"filiméad ísealteochta á phriontáil le teocht imfhálaithe níos airde? Tá "
"tuilleadh faisnéise faoi seo sa Vicí."

# AI Translated
#: resources/data/hints.ini: [hint:Avoid warping]
msgid ""
"Avoid warping\n"
"Did you know that when printing materials that are prone to warping such as "
"ABS, appropriately increasing the heatbed temperature can reduce the "
"probability of warping?"
msgstr ""
"Seachain stangadh\n"
"An raibh a fhios agat, agus ábhair atá tugtha do stangadh mar ABS á "
"bpriontáil, gur féidir le méadú cuí ar theocht na leapa téite an dóchúlacht "
"stangtha a laghdú?"
